hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"272, 273","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) janabat ka ghusl kartey to pahley apne hathon ko dhotey aur Namaz ki tarah wuzu kartey. phir ghusl kartey. phir apne hathon se baalon ka khilaal kartey aur jab yaqin kar letey ke jism tar ho gaya hai. to teen martaba is par pani bahaatey , phir tamam badan ka ghusl kartey. aur Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke main aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik bartan mein ghusl kartey they. ham donon us se chullu bhar-bhar kar pani letey they."
"299, 300, 301","unhon-ne farmaya main aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik hi bartan mein ghusl kartey they, halanke donon junbi (hambistari k baad ki napaki ki haalat me) hotey . aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey hukm farmatey, isliye main izaar baandh leti , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere sath hambistari kartey, us waqt main haaiza hoti. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar Mubarak meri taraf kar detey. us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aetikaf mein baithey huey hotey aur main haiz ki haalat mein honey ke bawajud Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sar Mubarak dho deti."
"329, 330","haaiza ke liye (jab ke usne tawaaf ifaaza kar liya ho) rukhsat hai ke wo ghar jaey (aur tawaaf wadaa' ke liye na ruki rahe). usey (baghair tawaafe-wadaa' ke) jana nahi chahiye phir maine unhein kehtey huey suna ke chali jaey kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko uski rukhsat di hai."
"395, 396","aik aisey shakhs ke barey mein puchha jisne Baitullah ka tawaaf umre ke liye kya lekin Safa aur Marwa ki saee nahi ki, kya aisa shakhs (baitullaah ke tawaaf ke baad) apni biwi se sohbat kar sakta hai? aap ne jawab diya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aap ne saat (7) martaba Baitullah ka tawaaf kya aur maqaame-Ibraaheem ke paas 2 rakaat Namaz padhi, phir Safa aur Marwa ki saee ki aur tumharey liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi behtreen namoona hai.'' (Ahzaab : 21) bhi ye masla puchha to aap ne bhi yahi farmaya ke wo biwi ke qareeb bhi us waqt tak na jaey jab tak Safa aur Marwa ki saee na kar ley."
"408, 409","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid ki diwar par balgham dekha, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kankari li aur usey saaf kar diya. phir farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs thookey to usey apne munh ke samney ya daain taraf nahi thookna chahiye, albatta baain taraf ya apne paon ke nichey thook ley. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid ki diwar par balgham dekha, phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kankari li aur usey saaf kar diya. phir farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi shakhs thookey to usey apne munh ke samney ya daain taraf nahi thookna chaahiye, albatta baain taraf ya apne paon ke nichey thook ley."
"410, 411","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kankari se usey khurch daala aur farmaya agar tum mein se kisi ko thookna ho to usey apne chehrey ke samney ya apne daain taraf na thooka karo, albatta apne baain taraf ya apne baain qadam ke nichey thook saktey ho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kankari se usey khurch daala aur farmaya agar tum mein se kisi ko thookna ho to usey apne chehrey ke samney ya apne daain taraf na thooka karo, albatta apne baain taraf ya apne baain qadam ke nichey thook saktey ho."
"435, 436","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maut ke marz mein mubtala huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar ko baar-baar chehrey par daaltey. jab kuchh fayda hota to apne Mubarak chehrey se chadar hata detey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi iztiraab w pareshani ki haalat mein farmaya, yahood w nasara par Allah ki phitkar ho ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko masjid bana liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye farma kar ummat ko aisey kaamon se daraatey they. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maut ke marz mein mubtala huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar ko baar-baar chehrey par daaltey. jab kuchh fayda hota to apne Mubarak chehrey se chadar hata detey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne isi bechaini w pareshani ki haalat mein farmaya, yahood w nasara par Allah ki phitkar ho ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko masjid bana liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye farma kar ummat ko aisey kaamon se daraatey they."
"454, 455","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aik din apne hujre ke darwazey par dekha. us waqt Habsha ke kuchh log masjid mein (nezon se) khel rahe they ( hathiyar chalaney ki mashq kar rahe they) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apni chadar mein chipa liya taake main unka khel dekh sakun . maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jabke Habsha ke log chhotey nezon (bhaalon) se masjid mein khel rahe they."
"478, 479","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni ungliyon ko aik doosrey mein dakhil kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni ungliyon ko aik doosrey mein dakhil kya."
"521, 522","Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne aik din (asr ki) Namaz mein der ki, to Urwa-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tashrif le gaey, aur unhon-ne bataya ke (usi tarah) Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik din ( Iraq ke mulk mein) Namaz mein der ki thi jab wo Iraq main ( Hakim ( they. to Abu-Masood Ansari ( Aqba bin umr ( unki khidmat mein gaey aur farmaya, Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ! aakhir ye kya baat hai, kya aapko malum nahi ke jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) tashrif laey to unhon-ne Namaz padhi aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi Namaz padhi, phir Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne Namaz padhi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi Namaz padhi, phir Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne Namaz padhi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi Namaz padhi, phir Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne kaha ke main isi tarah hukm diya gaya hun. is par Umar-bin Abdul-Azeez (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne Urwa se kaha, malum bhi hai aap kya bayan kar rahe hain? kya Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz ke oqaat (amal karke ) bataaey they. Urwa ne kaha, ke yahan isi tarah Basheer-bin-abii- Masood (Raziallahu anhu) apne walid ke waaste se bayan kartey they. Urwa (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke mujh se Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Asr ki Namaz us waqt padh letey they jab abhi dhoop unke hujre mein maujood hoti thi us se bhi pahley ke wo diwar par chadhey."
"533, 534","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab garmi tez ho jaey to Namaz ko thandey waqt mein padho, kyonke garmi ki tezi jahannam ki aag ki bhap se hoti hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jab garmi tez ho jaey to Namaz ko thandey waqt mein padho, kyonke garmi ki tezi jahannam ki aag ki bhap se hoti hai."
"536, 537","jab garmi tez ho jaey to Namaz ko thandey waqt mein padha karo, kyonke garmi ki tezi dozakh ki aag ki bhap ki wjah se hoti hai. dozakh ne apne rab se shikayat ki ke aey mere rab! ( aag ki shiddat ki wjah se) mere kuchh hisse ne kuchh hisse ko kha liya hai is par Allah Taala ne usey 2 saans leney ki ijazat di, aik saans jaadey main aur aik saans garmi mein. ab intihai sakht garmi aur sakht sardi jo tum log mehsus kartey ho wo usi se paida hoti hai."
"570, 571","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik raat kisi kaam mein mashghool ho gaey aur bahut der ki. ham (namaz ke intizar mein baithey huey) masjid hi mein so gaey, phir ham bedaar huey, phir ham so gaey, phir ham bedaar huey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar se bahar tashrif laey aur farmaya ke duniya ka koi shakhs bhi tumharey siwa us Namaz ka intizar nahi karta. agar neend ka ghalba na hota to ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) isha ko pahley padhney ya baad mein padhney ko koi ahmiyat nahi detey they. kabhi Namaz isha se pahley aap so bhi letey they. ibn-Juraij ne kaha maine Ata se malum kya. maine Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik raat isha ki Namaz mein der ki jiske nateeja mein log (masjid hi mein) so gaey. phir bedaar huey phir so gaey, phir bedaar huey. aakhir mein umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) uthey aur pukara '' Namaz '' Ata ne kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar se tashrif laey. wo manzar meri nigahon ke samney hai jabke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar Mubarak se pani ke qatrey tapak rahe they aur aap hath sar par rakhey huey they. aap ne farmaya ke agar meri ummat ke liye mushkil na ho jaatii, to main unhein hukm deta ke isha ki Namaz ko usi waqt padhein. maine Ata se mazeed tahqeeq chahi ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath sar par rakhney ki kaifiyat kya thi? Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein is silsiley mein kis tarah khabar di thi. is par Ata ne apne hath ki ungliyan thodi si khol dein aur unhein sar ke aik kinarey par rakha phir unhein mila kar yun sar par pherney lagey ke unka angoothaa kaan ke us kinarey se jo chehrey se qareeb hai aur dadhi se ja laga. na sustii ki aur na jaldii, balke is tarah kya aur kaha ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar meri ummat par mushkil na guzarti to main hukm deta ke us Namaz ko usi waqt padha karein."
"582, 583","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Namaz padhney ke liye suraj ke tuloo aur ghurub honey ke intizar mein na baithey raho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab suraj ka uper ka kinara tuloo honey lagey to Namaz na padho yahan tak ke wo buland ho jaey. aur jab suraj doobney lagey us waqt bhi Namaz na padho, yahan tak ke ghurub ho jaey. us hadis ko Yahya-bin-Saeed qattaan ke sath Abda bin Sulaiman ne bhi riwayat kya hai."
"622, 623","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (Bilaal raat rahe mein azan detey hain. Abdullah ibne-umme-Maktoom ki azan tak tum (sehrii) kha pi saktey ho). Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Bilal raat rahe mein azan detey hain. Abdullaah-ibne-umme-Maktoom ki azan tak tum ( sehrii ( kha pi saktey ho."
"652, 653, 654","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aik shakhs kahin ja raha tha. rastey mein usne kaanton ki bhari hui aik tahnii dekhi, to usey rastey se door kar diya. Allah Taala ( sirf isi baat par) razi ho gaya aur uski bakhshish kar dii.` shohdaa panch qism ke hotey hain. taaoon mein marney waale, pet ki beemaari (haizey wghaira) mein marney waley aur doob kar marney waley aur jo diwar wghaira kisi bhi cheez se dab kar mar jaey aur Allah ke rastey mein (jihad kartey huey) Shahid hone-waale aur aap ne farmaya ke agar logon ko malum ho jaey ke azan dene aur pehli saf mein Sharik honey ka sawab kitna hai aur phir iske siwa koi chaara kaar na ho ke Qura daala jaey to log unke liye Qura hi daala karein. aur agar logon ko ye malum ho jaey ke Zohar ki Namaz ke liye sawerey janey mein kya sawab hai to uske liye aik doosrey par pahal karne ki koshish karein aur agar ye jaan jayen ke isha aur subah ki Namaz ke fazaail kitney hain, to ghutnon ke bal ghisattey huey unke liye aaein."
"655, 656","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey banu- Salma waalo! kya tum apne qadmon ka sawab nahi chaahtey? mujhey Yahya bin Ayub ne khabar di, kaha ke mujh se Humaid lamba ne bayan kya, kaha ke mujh se Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke banu-Salma walon ne ye irada kya ke apne makan (jo masjid se door they) chhod dein aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb aa rahen. (taake ba-jamaat ke liye masjide-Nabawi ka sawab hasil ho) lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Madina ka ujaad dena bura malum hua. aap ne farmaya ke tum log apne qadmon ka sawab nahi chaahtey? Mujahid ne kaha ( sura Yasin mein) ("
"720, 721","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke doobney waale, pet ki bimari mein marney waale, taaoon mein marney waley aur dab kar marney waley Shahid hain. agar log jaan lein jo sawab Namaz ke liye jaldi aaney mein hai to aik doosrey se aagey badhiin aur agar isha aur subah ki Namaz ke sawab ko jaan lein to uske liye zaroor aaein . chahe peeth ke bal aana padey aur agar pehli saf ke sawab ko jaan lein to uske liye Qura andazi karein."
"818, 819","main tumhen Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz kyon na sikhaa dun. abu-Qilaba ne kaha ye Namaz ka waqt nahi tha ( magar aap hamein sikhaney ke liye) khadey huey. phir rukoo kya aur takbeer kahi phir sar uthaya aur thodi der khadey rahe. phir sajda kya aur thodi der ke liye sajde se sar uthaya aur phir sajda kya aur sajde se thodi der ke liye sar uthaayaa. unhon-ne hamarey Shekh Amr-bin-Salma ki tarah Namaz padhi Ayub sakhtiyan ne kaha ke wo Amr bin Salma Namaz mein aik aisi cheez kya kartey they ke doosrey logon ko is tarah kartey maine nahi dekha. aap teesri ya chothi rakaat par) sajde se farigh ho kar khadey honey se pahley) baithtey they. (yani jalsaae-istiraahat kartey they). ( phir Namaz sikhlaaney ke baad Malik bin Huweris ne bayan kya ke) ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan thahrey rahe Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (behtar hai) tum apne gharon ko wapas jao. dekho ye Namaz falan waqt aur ye Namaz falan waqt padhnaa. jab Namaz ka waqt ho jaey to aik shakhs tum mein se azan de aur jo tum mein bada ho wo Namaz padhaaey ."
"832, 833","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Namaz mein ye dua padhtey theyاللهم إني أعوذ بك من عذاب القبر وأعوذ بك من فتنة المسيح الدجال ، Mina وأعوذ بك من فتنة المحيا وفتنة الممات ، Mina اللهم إني أعوذ بك من المأثم والمغرم aey Allah qabr ke azab se main teri panah mangta hun. zindagi ke aur maut ke fitnon se teri panah mangta hun. dajjal ke fitne se teri panah mangta hun aur aey Allah main teri panah mangta hun gunahon se aur qarz se. kisi (yani Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ( ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) to qarz se bahut hi zyada panah maangtey hain ! is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab koi maqrooz ho jaey to wo jhoot boltaa hai aur wada khilaf ho jata hai. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Namaz mein dajjal ke fitney se panah maangtey suna."
"839, 840","mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) poori tarah yad hain aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka mere ghar ke dol se kulli karna bhi yad hai (jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere munh mein dali thi). main apni qaum bani Salim ki imamat kya karta tha. main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! meri aankh kharaab ho gaee hai aur (barsaat mein) pani se bharey huey naley mere aur meri qaum ki masjid ke beech mein rukawat bin jatey hain. main chahta hun ke aap mere makan par tashrif la kar kisi aik jagah Namaz ada farmaein taake main usey apni Namaz ke liye muqarrar kar loon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke insha-Allah taala mein tumhari khahish poori karunga subah ko jab din chadh gaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (andar aaney ki) ijazat chahi aur maine de di. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey nahi balke puchha ke ghar ke kis hisse mein Namaz padhwaanaa chahtey ho. aik jagah ki taraf jisey maine Namaz padhney ke liye pasand kya tha. ishara kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (namaz ke liye) khadey huey aur ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey saf banai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam phera aur jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam phera to ham ne bhi pheraa."
"849, 850","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab salam phertey to kuchh der apni jagah par baithey rehtey. ibne-Shahab ne kaha Allah behtar janey ham to ye samajhtey hain ke ye aap isliye kartey they taake auratein pahley chali jaaein. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) salam phertey to auratein lot kar janey lagtiin aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke uthney se pahley apne gharon mein dakhil ho chuki hotiin."
"896, 897","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ham ( duniya mein) to baad mein aaey lekin qiyamat ke din sabse aagey hongey, farq sirf ye hai ke yahood w nasara ko kitab ham se pahley di gaee aur hamein baad mein. to ye din ( Juma ( wo hai jiske barey mein ahle-kitab ne ikhtilaf kya, Allah Taala ne hamein ye din batla diya (iske baad) doosra din ( hafta ( yahood ka din hai aur tesraa din ( itwaar ( nasara kaa. aap phir khamosh ho gaey. iske baad farmaya ke har musalman par haq hai) Allah Taala ka (har saat (7) din mein aik din Juma mein ghusl karey jis main apne sar aur badan ko dhoey."
"949, 950","aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere ghar tashrif laey us waqt mere paas (ansaar ki) 2 ladkiyan jange-Bua'aas ke qisson ki nazmein padh rahi thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bistar par let gaey aur apna chehra dusri taraf pher liya. iske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur mujhey daantaa aur farmaya ke ye shaitaanii baajaa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maujoodgii mein? aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ke janey do khamosh raho phir jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) doosrey kaam mein lag gaey to maine unhein ishara kya aur wo chali gaiin. aur ye eid ka din tha. Habsha ke kuchh log dhaalon aur barchhiyon se khel rahe they. ab khud maine kaha ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tum ye khel dekho gii ? maine kaha ji haan. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apne peechhey khada kar liya. mera rukhsar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke rukhsar par tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they khelo-khelo aey bani arfada ye Habsha ke logon ka laqab tha phir jab main thak gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' bas!'' maine kaha ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jao ."
"958, 959, 960, 961","aapko maine ye kehtey huey suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) eidul-fitr ke din eidgaah tashrif le gaey to pahley Namaz padhi phir khutba sunaya. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aik shakhs ko us zamane mein bheja jab (unki khilafat ki shuruaat ka zamana tha aap ne kahlaayaa ke) eidul-fitr ki Namaz ke liye azan nahi di jati thi aur khutba Namaz ke baad hota tha. eidul-fitr aur eidul-Azha ki Namaz ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Khulafae-Rashedeen ke ahad mein azan nahi di jati thi. (eid ke din) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey, pahley Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhi phir khutba diya, us se farigh ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aurton ki taraf gaey aur unhein nasihat ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath ka sahara liye huey they aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna kapda phaila rakha tha, auratein usmein khairat daal rahi thin. maine is par Ata se puchha ke kya us zamane mein bhi aap imam par ye haq samajhtey hain ke Namaz se farigh honey ke baad wo aurton ke paas aa kar unhein nasihat kare. unhon-ne farmaya ke beshak ye un par haq hai aur sabab kya jo wo aisa na karein."
"987, 988","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) unke yahan (Minaa ke dinon mein) tashrif laey us waqt ghar mein 2 ladkiyan daf bajaa rahi thin aur Buaas ki ladai ki nazmein ga rahi thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chehra Mubarak par kapda daley huey tashrif farma they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne un donon ko daantaa. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chehra Mubarak se kapda hata kar farmaya ke Abu-Bakar jaane bhi do ye eid ke din hain (aur wo bhi Mina mein) . maine (eik baar ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey chipa rakha tha aur main Habsha ke logon ko dekh rahi thi jo masjid mein teeron se khel rahe they. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein daantaa lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke janey do aur unse farmaya aey banu-Arfada! tum be-fikr ho kar khel dikhaao."
"1008, 1009","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko abu-Taalib ka ye sher padhtey suna tha ( tarjama ( goraa unka rang unke munh ke waaste se barish ki (Allah se) dua ki jati hai. yatimon ki panah aur bewaon ke sahaarey.'' aksar mujhey shaair ( abu-Taalib (ka sher yad aa jata hai. main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke munh ko dekh raha tha ke aap dua istisqaa (baarish k barasney ki dua) (baarish ki dua member par) kar rahe they aur abhi (dua'a se farigh ho kar) utrey bhi nahi they ke tamam naley bhar gaey. ( وأبيض يستسقى الغمام بوجهه ثمال اليتامى عصمة"
"1049, 1050","aik Yahudi aurat unke paas maangney ke liye aai aur us ne dua di ke Allah aapko qabr ke azab se bachaaey. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kya logon ko qabr mein azab hoga? is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Allah Taala ki us se panah mangta hun. phir aik martaba subah ko (kahiin janey ke liye) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sawar huey iske baad suraj girahan laga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) din chadhey wapas huey aur apni beeviyon ke hujron se guzartey huey (masjid mein) Namaz ke liye khadey ho gaey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki pairvi mein niyat baandh li. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bahut hi lamba qiyam kya phir rukoo bhi bahut lamba kya, iske baad khadey huey aur ab ki baar qiyam phir lamba kya lekin pahley se kuchh kam, phir rukoo kya aur us baar bhi der tak rukoo mein rahe lekin pahley rukoo se kuchh kam, phir rukoo se sar uthaya aur sajde mein gaey. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phir dobara khadey huey aur bahut der tak qiyam kya lekin pahley qiyam se kuchh kam, phir aik lamba rukoo kya lekin pahley rukoo se kuchh kam, phir rukoo se sar uthaya aur qiyam mein ab ki baar bhi bahut der tak rahe lekin pahley se kam der tak (chauthi martaba) phir rukoo kya aur bahut der tak rukoo mein rahe lekin pahley se mukhtasar. rukoo se sar uthaya to sajde mein chaley gaey aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is tarah Namaz poori kar li. iske baad Allah Taala ne jo chaha Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya usi khutbe mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko hidayat farmai ke azaabe-qabr se Allah ki panah maangein."
"1055, 1056","aik Yahudi aurat unke paas kuchh maangney aai. usne kaha ke aapko Allah Taala qabr ke azab se bachaaey, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kya qabr mein bhi azab hoga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (ye sun kar) farmaya ke main Allah ki us se panah mangta hun. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din subah ke waqt sawar huey (kahiin janey ke liye) idhar suraj girahan lag gaya isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas aa gaey, abhi chasht ka waqt tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni beeviyon ke hujron se guzrey aur (masjid mein) khadey ho kar Namaz shuru kar di sahaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki iqtida (pairvi) mein saf baandh kar khadey ho gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qiyam bahut lamba kya, rukoo bhi bahut lamba kya phir rukoo se sar uthane ke baad dobara lamba qiyam kya lekin pahley se kam, iske baad rukoo bahut lamba kya lekin pahley rukoo se kuchh kam. phir rukoo se sar utha kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sajde mein gaey aur lamba sajda kya. phir lamba qiyam kya aur ye qiyam bhi pahley se kam tha. phir lamba rukoo kya agarche ye rukoo bhi pahley ke muqaabley mein kam tha phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukoo se khadey ho gaey aur lamba qiyam kya lekin ye qiyam phir pahley se kam tha ab (chauthaa) rukoo kya, agarche ye rukoo bhi pahley rukoo ke muqaabley mein kam tha. phir sajda kya bahut lamba lekin pahley sajde ke muqaabley mein kam. Namaz se farigh honey ke baad jo kuchh Allah Taala ne chaha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya, phir logon ko samjhaayaa ke qabr ke azab se Allah ki panah maangein."
"1065, 1066","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne girahan ki Namaz mein qirat buland awaz se ki, qirat se farigh ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) takbeer keh kar rukoo mein chaley gaey jab rukoo se sar uthaya to ( سمع الله لمن حمده , Mina padhi. ربنا ولك الحمد ( kaha phir dobara qirat shuru ki. gharaz girahan ki 2 rakaton mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne char rukoo aur char sajdey kiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein suraj girahan laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik aadmi se elaan kara diya ke Namaz honey wali hai phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 rakatein char rukoo aur char sajdon ke sath padhin. Waleed-bin-muslim ne bayan kya ke mujhey Abdur-Rehman bin namr ne khabar di aur unhon-ne ibne-Shahab se suna, usi hadis ki tarah Zohri (ibne-Shahaab) ne bayan kya ke is par maine (Urwa se) puchha ke phir tumharey bhai Abdullah-bin-Zubair ne jab Madina mein (kusoof) ki Namaz padhai to kyon aisa kya ke jis tarah subah ki Namaz padhi jati hai. isi tarah ye Namaz ( kusoof ( bhi unhon-ne padhai. unhon-ne jawab diya ke yahan unhon-ne sunnat ke khilaf kya. Abdur-Rehman bin namr ke sath us hadis ko Sulaimaan-bin-Kaseer aur Sufiyaan-bin-Husain ne bhi Zohri se riwayat kya, usmein bhi qirat awaz k sath karne ka bayan hai."
"1091, 1092","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha jab safar mein chalney ki jaldi hoti to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maghrib ki Namaz der se padhtey yahan tak ke maghrib aur isha aik sath mila kar padhtey. Salim ne kaha ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhi jab safar mein jaldi hoti to is tarah kartey. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne maghrib ki Namaz us din der mein padhi thi jab unhein unki biwi Safiya-binte-abii Ubaid ki sakht bimari ki itlaa mili thi (chaltey huey) maine kaha ke namaaz! (yani waqt khatm hua chahta hai) lekin aap ne farmaya ke chaley chalo phir dobara maine kaha ke Namaz ! aap ne phir farmaya ke chaley chalo is tarah jab ham 2 ya teen meel nikal gaey to aap utrey aur Namaz padhi phir farmaya ke maine khud dekha hai ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar mein tezi ke sath chalnaa chahtey to isi tarah kartey they Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi farmaya ke maine khud dekha ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (manzile-maqsood tak) jaldi pahunchnaa chahtey to pahley maghrib ki takbeer kahalwaatey aur aap uski teen rakaat padha kar salam phertey. phir thodi der thahar kar isha padhatey aur uski 2 hi rakaat par salam phertey. isha ke farz ke baad aap sunnatein wghaira nahi padhtey they aadhi raat ke baad khadey ho kar Namaz padhtey."
"1121, 1122","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi mein jab koi khuwab dekhta to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan karta (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tabeer detey) mere bhi dil mein ye khahish paida hui ke main bhi koi khuwab dekhta aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan karta, main abhi naujawaan tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein masjid mein sota tha. chunanche maine khuwab mein dekha ke 2 Farishtey mujhey pakad kar dozakh ki taraf ley gaey. maine dekha ke dozakh par kuwein ki tarah bandish hai (yani is par kuwein ki si munder bani hui hai) iske 2 rastey they. dozakh mein bahut se aisey logon ko dekha jinhein main pehchanta tha. main kehney laga dozakh se Allah ki panaah! unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir ham ko aik farishta mila aur us ne mujh se kaha daro nahi. ye khuwab maine (apni behan ( Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ko sunaya aur unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko . tabeer mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abdullah bahut khub ladka hai. kash! raat mein Namaz padha karta. ( rawi ne kaha ke aap ke us farman ke baad) Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) raat mein bahut kam sotey they ( zyada ibadat hi kartey rahtey ( ."
"1156, 1157, 1158","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ye khuwab dekha ke maano aik gaadhey reshamii kapdey ka aik tukda mere hath hai. jaisey mein jannat mein jis jagah ka bhi irada karta hun to ye idhar uda ke mujh ko ley jata hai aur maine dekha ke jaisey-jaisey Farishtey mere paas aaey aur unhon-ne mujhey dozakh ki taraf ley janey ka irada kya hi tha ke aik farishta unse aa kar mila aur (mujh se) kaha ke daro nahi (aur unse kaha ke) usey chhod do. to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abdullah bada hi achchha aadmi hai kash! raat ko bhi Namaz padha karta. Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) iske baad hamesha raat ko Namaz padha kartey they. bahut se sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apne khuwab bayan kiye ke shabe-qadr (ramazaan ki) sattaiswin raat hai. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main dekh raha hun ke tum sab ke khuwab Ramazan ke aakhiri ashrey mein (shabe-qadr ke honey par) muttafiq ho gaey hain. isliye jisey shabe-qadr ki talash ho wo Ramazan ke aakhiri ashrey mein dhoondey."
"1172, 1173","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Zohar se pahley 2 rakaat sunnat, Zohar ke baad 2 rakaat sunnat, maghrib ke baad 2 rakaat sunnat, isha ke baad 2 rakaat sunnat aur Juma ke baad 2 rakaat sunnat padhi hain aur maghrib aur isha ki sunnatein aap ghar mein padhtey they. abu-Zinaad ne Musa-bin-Aqba ke waaste se bayan kya aur unse Naafe ne ke isha ke baad apne ghar mein (sunnat padhtey they) unki riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Kaseer-bin-Farqad aur Ayub ne Naafe ke waaste se ki hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) fajr honey ke baad 2 halki rakatein ( sunnate-fajr ( padhtey aur ye aisa waqt hota ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas nahi jati thi. Ubaidullah ke sath us hadis ko kaseer-bin-Farqad aur Ayub ne bhi Naafe se riwayat kya aur ibne- abii-Zinaad ne us hadis ko Musa-bin-Aqba se, unhon-ne Naafe se riwayat kya. usmein ( في بيته (ke badal ( في أهله ( hai."
"1180, 1181","mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se das rakaat sunnatein yad hain. 2 rakaat sunnat Zohar se pahley, 2 rakaat sunnat Zohar ke ba'd, 2 rakaat sunnat maghrib ke baad apne ghar mein, 2 rakaat sunnat isha ke baad apne ghar main aur 2 rakaat sunnat subah ki Namaz se pahley aur ye wo waqt hota tha jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas koi nahi jata tha. muazzan jab azan deta aur fajr ho jati to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 rakatein padhtey."
"1185, 1186","unhein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) yad hain aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wo kulli bhi yad hai jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke ghar ke kuwein se pani lekar unke munh mein ki thi. jo badr ki ladai main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sharik they, wo kehtey they ke main apni qaum banii-Saalim ko Namaz padhaayaa karta tha mere ( ghar (aur qaum ki masjid ke beech mein aik naala tha, aur jab barish hoti to usey paar karke masjid tak pahunchnaa mere liye mushkil ho jata tha. chunanche main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maine kaha ke meri aankhen kharaab ho gaee hain aur aik naala hai jo mere aur meri qaum ke darmyan padta hai, wo barish ke dinon mein bahney lag jata hai aur mere liye iska paar karna mushkil ho jata hai. meri ye khahish hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif la kar mere ghar kisi jagah Namaz padh dein taake main usey apne liye Namaz padhney ki jagah muqarrar kar loon. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumhari ye khahish jald hi poori karunga. phir doosrey hi din Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko sath lekar subah tashrif ley aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat chahi aur maine ijazat de di. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif la kar baithey bhi nahi balke puchha ke tum apne ghar mein kis jagah mere liye Namaz padhna pasand karogey. mein jis jagah ko Namaz padhney ke liye pasand kar chuka tha uski taraf maine ishara kar diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahan khadey ho kar takbeere-tahreema kahi aur ham sab ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey saf baandh li. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein 2 rakaat Namaz padhai phir salam pheraa. ham ne bhi aap ke sath salam pheraa. maine haleem khaney ke liye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko rok liya jo taiyaar ho raha tha. mohalle walon ne jo suna ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere ghar tashrif farma hain to log jaldi jaldii jama honey shuru ho gaey aur ghar mein aik khaasaa majma' ho gaya. unmein se aik shakhs bola. Malik ko kya ho gaya hai ! yahan dikhai nahi detaa. is par doosra bola wo to munafiq hai. usey Allah aur rasool se mohabbat nahi hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya, aisa mat kaho, dekhtey nahi ke wo ( لا إله إلا الله ( padhta hai aur us se uska maqsad Allah Taala ki khushnoodii hai. tab wo kehney laga ke (asl haal) to Allah aur rasool ko malum hai. lekin Allah ki qasam! ham to unki baat cheet aur mel-jol zahir mein munaafiqon hi se dekhtey hain. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin Allah Taala ne har us aadmi par dozakh haram kar di hai jisne ( لا إله إلا الله ( Allah ki raza aur khushnoodii ke liye keh liyaa. Mehmood-bin Rabe ne bayan kya ke maine ye hadis aik aisi jagah mein bayan ki jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mashhoor sahabi Abu-Ayub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) bhi maujood they. ye Rome (mojooda Itly) ke us jihad ka zikr hai jis mein aap ki maut ho gaee thi. fauj ke sardaar Yazeed-bin-Muaawiya they. Abu-Ayub (Raziallahu anhu) ne us hadis se inkar kya aur farmaya ke Allah ki qism ! main nahi samajhta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisi baat kabhi bhi kahi ho. aap ki ye guftgu mujh ko bahut na-gawar guzri aur maine Allah Taala ki mannat maana ke agar main us jihad se salamati ke sath lota to waapsii par us hadis ke barey mein Utbaan-bin-Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se zaroor poochhoonga. agar maine unhein unki qaum ki masjid mein zinda paya. aakhir mein jihad se wapas hua. pahley to maine Haj aur Umre ka ehram baandha phir jab Madina waapsii hui to main qabila bano Salim mein aaya. Utban (Raziallahu anhu) jo boodhey aur naa-beenaa ho gaey they, apni qaum ko Namaz padhatey huey miley. salam pherney ke baad maine hazir ho kar aapko salam kya aur batlaya ke main falan hun. phir maine us hadis ke mutaalliq malum kya to aap ne mujh se us martaba bhi is tarah ye hadis bayan ki jis tarah pahley bayan ki thi."
"1191, 1192","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) chasht ki Namaz sirf 2 din padhtey they. jab Makka aatey, kyonke aap Makka mein chasht hi ke waqt aatey they us waqt pahley aap tawaaf kartey aur phir maqaame-Ibraaheem ke peechhey 2 rakaat padhtey. doosrey jis din aap masjide-qubaa mein tashrif latey aap ka yahan har hafte aaney ka mamool (routine) tha. jab aap masjid ke andar aatey to Namaz padhey baghair bahar nikalnaa bura jaantey. aap bayan kartey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) yahan sawar aur paidal donon tarah aaya kartey they. mein isi tarah karta hun jaisey maine apne sathiyon (sahaaba (Raziallahu anhu)) ko kartey dekha hai. lekin tumhen raat ya din ke kisi hissey mein Namaz padhney se nahi roktaa. sirf itni baat hai ke irada karke tum suraj nikaltey ya doobtey waqt na padho."
"1241, 1242","(jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gai) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) apne ghar se jo Sunh mein tha ghodey par Sawar ho kar aaey aur utartey hi masjid mein tashrif ley gaey. phir aap kisi se guftgu kiye baghair Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre mein aaey ( jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laash Mubarak rakhi hui thi) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko burde-Hibra ( Yaman ki bani hui dhaarii daar chadar ( se dhaank diya gaya tha. phir aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra Mubarak khola aur jhuk kar iska bosa liya aur roney lagey. aap ne kaha mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan hon aey Allah ke Nabi ! Allah Taala 2 mautein aap par kabhi jama nahi karega . siwa aik maut ke jo aap ke muqaddar mein thi, so aap wafat pa chukey. abu-Salma ne kaha ke mujhey Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jab bahar tashrif laey to umr (Raziallahu anhu) us waqt logon se kuchh baatein kar rahe they. siddeeq akbar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke baith jao. lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) nahi maaney. phir dobara aapne baithney ke liye kaha, lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) nahi maaney. aakhir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kalima shahadat padha to tamam majma' aap ki taraf mutwajjeh ho gaya aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko chhod diya. aap ne farmaya ammaa ba'd! agar koi shakhs tum mein se Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ibadat karta tha to usey malum hona chahiye ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho chuki aur agar koi Allah Taala ki ibadat karta hai to Allah Taala baqi rehney wala hai. kabhi wo marney wala nahi. Allah paak ne farmaya hai ''aur Muhammad sirf Allah ke rasool hain aur bahut se rasool us se pahley bhi guzar chukey hain'' ( الشاكرين ( tak (aap ne aayat tilawat ki). qasam Allah ki aisa malum hua ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke aayat ki tilawat se pahley jaisey logon ko malum hi na tha ke ye aayat bhi Allah paak ne Quran Majeed mein utari hai. ab tamam sahaba ne ye aayat aap se seekh li phir to har shakhs ki zaban par yahi aayat thi. (jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gai) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) apne ghar se jo Sunh mein tha ghodey par Sawar ho kar aaey aur utartey hi masjid mein tashrif ley gaey. phir aap kisi se guftgu kiye baghair Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre mein aaey ( jahan Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki laash Mubarak rakhi hui thi) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf gaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko burde-Hibra ( Yaman ki bani hui dhaarii daar chadar ( se dhaank diya gaya tha. phir aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka chehra Mubarak khola aur jhuk kar iska bosa liya aur roney lagey. aap ne kaha mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan hon aey Allah ke Nabi ! Allah Taala 2 mautein aap par kabhi jama nahi karega . siwa aik maut ke jo aap ke muqaddar mein thi, so aap wafat pa chukey. abu-Salma ne kaha ke mujhey Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jab bahar tashrif laey to umr (Raziallahu anhu) us waqt logon se kuchh baatein kar rahe they. siddeeq akbar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke baith jao. lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) nahi maaney. phir dobara aapne baithney ke liye kaha, lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) nahi maaney. aakhir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kalima shahadat padha to tamam majma' aap ki taraf mutwajjeh ho gaya aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko chhod diya. aap ne farmaya ammaa ba'd! agar koi shakhs tum mein se Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ibadat karta tha to usey malum hona chahiye ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho chuki aur agar koi Allah Taala ki ibadat karta hai to Allah Taala baqi rehney wala hai. kabhi wo marney wala nahi. Allah paak ne farmaya hai ''aur Muhammad sirf Allah ke rasool hain aur bahut se rasool us se pahley bhi guzar chukey hain'' ("
"1249, 1250","aurton ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se darkhaast ki ke hamein bhi nasihat karne ke liye aap aik din khas farma dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (unki darkhaast manzoor farmatey huey aik khas din mein) unko waz (nasihat) farmaya aur batlaya ke jis aurat ke teen bachchey mar jayen to wo uske liye jahannam se panah bin jatey hain. is par aik aurat ne puchha : ya Rasulullah ! agar kisi ke 2 hi bachchey marein? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke 2 bachchon par bhii. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye bhi kaha ke wo bachchey murad hain jo abhi bulooghat ko na pahunchey hun."
"1258, 1259","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik beti ka intiqal ho gaya tha. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur farmaya ke usey teen ya panch martaba ghusl de do aur agar tum munasib samjho to us se bhi zyada pani aur berii ke patton se nehlaao aur aakhir mein kaafoor ya (ye kaha ke) kuchh kaafoor ka bhi istemal karna. phir farigh ho kar mujhey khabar dena. umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke jab ham farigh huey to ham ne kelha bhijwaayaa . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna tehband hamein diya aur farmaya ke usey andar jism par lapet do. Ayub ne Hafsa binte- Sirin se riwayat ki, unse umme-Atiya ne isi tarah hadis bayan ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke teen ya panch ya saat (7) martaba ya agar tum munasib samjho to us se bhi zyada ghusl de sakti ho. Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke ham ne unke sar ke baal teen latun mein taqseem kar diye they."
"1281, 1282","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaee to unhon-ne farmaya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai ke koi bhi aurat jo Allah aur yaum aakhirat par eman rakhti ho uske liye shauhar ke siwa kisi murdey par bhi teen din se zyada sog manaanaa jaaiz nahi hai. haan shauhar par char mahiney das din tak sog manaaey. phir main Zainab-bint-Jahash (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaee jabke unke bhai ka intiqal hua, unhon-ne khushbu mangwai aur usey lagaayaa, phir farmaya ke mujhey khushbu ki koi zarurat na thi lekin maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko member par ye kehtey huey suna hai ke kisi bhi aurat ko jo Allah aur yaume-aakhirat par eman rakhti ho, jaaiz nahi hai ke kisi maiyat par teen din se zyada sog kare. lekin shauhar ka sog (iddat) char mahiney das din tak kare."
"1286, 1287, 1288","Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki aik sahibzadi (umme-Abaan) ka Makka mein intiqal ho gaya tha. ham bhi unke janazey mein hazir huey. Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) bhi tashrif laey. mein un donon hazraat ke darmyan mein betha hua tha ya ye kaha ke main aik buzurg ke qareeb baith gaya aur doosrey buzurg baad mein aaey aur mere bazu mein baith gaey. Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Amr-bin-Usmaan se kaha (jo umme-Abaan ke bhai they) roney se kyon nahi roktey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to farmaya hai ke maiyat par ghar walon ke roney se azab hota hai. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi aisa hi farmaya tha. phir aap bayan karne lagey ke main umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Makka se chala jab ham beda tak pahunchey to samney aik babool ke darakht ke nichey chand sawar nazar padey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ja kar dekho to sahii ye kon log hain. unka bayan hai ke maine dekha to Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) they. phir jab uski itlaa di to aap ne farmaya ke unhein bula laao. main Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas dobara aaya aur kaha ke chaliye ameerul-momineen bulatey hain. chunanche wo khidmat mein hazir huey. (khair ye qissa to ho chukaa) phir jab umr (Raziallahu anhu) zakhmi kiye gaey to Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) rotey huey andar dakhil huey. wo keh rahe they haaye mere bhai! haaye mere saahib! is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Suheb (rz)! tum mujh par rotey ho, tum nahi jantey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke maiyat par uske ghar walon ke roney se azab hota hai. jab umr (Raziallahu anhu) ka intiqal ho gaya to maine us hadis ka zikr Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se kya. unhon-ne farmaya ke rehmat umr (Raziallahu anhu) par ho. b-khudaa Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye nahi farmaya hai ke Allah momin par iske ghar walon ke roney ki wjah se azab karega balke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun farmaya ke Allah Taala kaafir ka azab iske ghar walon ke roney ki wjah se aur zyada kar deta hai. iske baad kehney lagiin ke Quran ki ye aayat tum ko bas karti hai ke ''koii kisi ke gunah ka zimme daar aur iska bojh uthaney wala nahi.'' is par Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne us waqt (yani umme-Abaan ke janazey mein) sura Najm ki ye aayat padhii'' aur Allah hi hansaataa hai aur wahi rulaataa hai.'' ibne-abi-Mulaika ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye taqreer sun kar ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kuchh jawab nahi diya."
"1312, 1313","Sahal-bin-Haneef aur Qais-bin-Sad (Raziallahu anhu) qaadsiya mein kisi jagah baithey huey they. itney mein kuchh log idhar se aik janaaza lekar guzrey to ye donon buzurg khadey ho gaey. arz kya gaya ke janaaza to zimmiyon ka hai (jo kaafir hain) is par unhon-ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se isi tarah se aik janaaza guzra tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uske liye khadey ho gaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha gaya ke ye to Yahudi ka janaaza tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya Yahudi ki jaan nahi hai? ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they. aur Zakariya ne kaha unse Shabi ne aur unse ibn-abii-Lailaa ne ke Abu-Masood aur Qais (Raziallahu anhu) janaaze ke liye khadey ho jatey they."
"1323, 1324","jo dafn tak janaaze ke sath rahe usey aik qirat ka sawab milega. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Abu-Hurera hadison bahut zyada bayan kartey hain. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye irshad khud suna hai. is par ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir to ham ne bahut se qeeraaton ka nuqsan uthaayaa. (sura Zumar mein jo lafz) ("
"1327, 1328","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Habsha ke Najashi ki wafat ki khabar di, isi din jis din unka intiqal hua tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne bhai ke liye Allah se maghfirat chaaho. aur ibne-Shahab se yun bhi riwayat hai unhon-ne kaha ke mujh se Saeed-bin-Musaiyab ne bayan kya ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne eidgaah mein saf bandi karaai phir ( namaaze-janaaza ki) char takbeerein kahin ."
"1347, 1348","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Uhud ke 2-2 Shahid mardon ko aik hi kapdey mein kafan detey aur poochhtey ke unmein Quran kis ne zyada yad kya hai, phir jab kisi aik taraf ishara kar diya jata to lahad mein usi ko aagey badhaatey aur farmatey jatey ke main un par gawah hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khoon samet unhein dafn karne ka hukm diya, na unki namaaze-janaaza padhi aur na unhein ghusl diya. unmein Quran zyada kis ne hasil kya hai? jiski taraf ishara kar diya jata Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) lahad mein usi ko doosrey se aagey badhaatey . Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke mere walid aur chacha ko aik hi kambal mein kafan diya gaya tha."
"1354, 1355","umr (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath kuchh doosrey ashaab ke sath ibne-Sayyaad ke paas gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko wo banu-Maghaala ke makaanon ke paas bachchon ke sath khelta hua mila. un dinon ibne-Sayyaad jawaanii ke qareeb tha. usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aaney ki koi khabar hi nahi hui. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par apna hath rakha to usey malum hua. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aey ibne-Sayyaad ! kya tum gawahi detey ho ke main Allah ka rasool hun. ibne-Sayyaad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf dekh kar bola haan mein gawahi deta hun ke aap an-padhon ke rasool hain. phir usne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se malum kya. kya aap uski gawahi detey hain ke main bhi Allah ka rasool hoon? ye baat sun kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey chhod diya aur farmaya main Allah aur uske paighambaron par eman laya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usse puchha ke tujhey kya dikhai deta hai? ibne-Sayyaad bola ke mere paas sachchii aur jhooti donon khabrein aati hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya phir to tera sab kaam gadmad ho gaya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usse farmaya achchha maine aik baat dil mein rakhi hai wo batlaa. (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sura Dukhaan ki aayat ka tasawwur kya ( فارتقب يوم تاتی السماء بدخان مبين ( ibne-Sayyaad ne kaha wo ( دخ ( hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya chal door ho to apni bisaat se aagey kabhi na badh sakega. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ya Rasulullah ! mujh ko chhod dijiye mein uski gardan mar deta hun. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar ye dajjal hai to, to is par ghalib na hoga aur agar dajjal nahi hai to uska mar daalnaa terey liye behtar na hoga. phir aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) donon mil kar un khajoor ke darakhton mein gaey. jahan ibne-Sayyaad tha (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chahtey they ke ibne-Sayyaad aapko na dekhey aur) us se pahley ke wo aapko dekhey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghafalat mein us se kuchh baatein sun lein. aakhir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko dekh liya. wo aik chadar odhey padaa tha. kuchh gin-gin ya phan-phan kar raha tha. lekin mushkil ye hui ke ibne-Sayyaad ki maan ne door hi se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khajoor ke tanon mein chhup chhup kar ja rahe they. us ne pukar kar ibne-Sayyaad se keh diyaa: Saaf! ye naam ibne-Sayyaad ka tha. dekho Muhammad aan pahunchey . ye suntey hi wo uth khada hua. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kash! uski maan ibne-Sayyaad ko baatein karne deti to wo apna haal kholtaa . Shuaib ne apni riwayat main ( رمرمة فرفصه (aur Aqeel ne ( رمرمة ( naql kya hai aur Mamar ne ( رمزة ( kaha hai."
"1363, 1364","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs Islam ke siwa kisi aur Deen par honey ki jhooti qism qasdan khaaey to wo waisaa hi ho jaeyga jaisa ke usne apne liye kaha hai aur jo shakhs apne ko dhaar daar cheez se zabah kar ley usey jahannam mein usi hathiyar se azab hota rahega. isi (Basra ki) masjid mein hadis bayan ki thi, na ham us hadis ko bhooley hain aur na ye dar hai ke Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jhoot baandha hoga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik shakhs ko zakhm laga, usne ( zakhm ki takleef ki wjah se) khud ko mar dala. is par Allah Taala ne farmaya ke mere bandey ne jaan nikalney mein mujh par jaldi ki. uski saza mein, main is par jannat haram karta hun."
"1399, 1400","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) faut ho gaey aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) khaleefa huey to Arab ke kuchh qabaayel kaafir ho gaey (aur kuchh ne zakat se inkar kar diya aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse ladna chaahaa) to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us farman ki maujoodgii mein kyonkar jang kar saktey hain'' mujhey hukm hai logon se us waqt tak jang karun jab tak ke wo ( لا إله إلا الله ( ki shahadat na de dein aur jo shakhs uski shahadat de-dey to meri taraf se iska maal aur jaan mehfooz ho jaeyga siwaay usi ke haq ke (yani qisaas wghaira ki Suraton ke) aur iska hisab Allah Taala ke zimme hoga. qism Allah ki main har us shakhs se jang karunga jo zakat aur Namaz mein tafreeq karega. (yani Namaz to padhey magar zakat ke liye inkar kar de) kyonke zakat maal ka haq hai. Allah ki qasam! agar unhon-ne zakat mein char mahiney ki (bakrii ke) bachchey ko dene se bhi inkar kya jisey wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko detey they, to main unse ladunga. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke ba-khuda ye baat iska nateeja thi ke Allah Taala ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka Sina Islam ke liye khol diya tha aur baad mein, main bhi us nateeje par pahuncha ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) hi haq par they."
"1407, 1408","main betha tha (doosri sanad) aur imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne farmaya ke mujh se Ishaq-bin-Mansur ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Abdus-Samad-bin-abdul-waaris ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke mujh se mere bap ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha mujh se Saeed Jurairi ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham se Abul-Alaa-bin-shikhkhiir ne bayan kya, unse ahnaf-bin-Qais ne bayan kya ke main Quraish ki aik majlis mein betha hua tha. itney mein sakht baal, motey kapdey aur motii-jhotii haalat mein aik shakhs aaya aur khadey ho kar salam kya aur kaha ke khazaana jama karne walon ko us patthar ki bashaarat ho jo jahannam ki aag mein tapaayaa jaeyga aur uski chhaatii ki bhatni par rakh diya jaeyga jo mundhey ki taraf se paar ho jaeyga is tarah wo patthar barabar dhalaktaa rahega. ye keh kar wo sahib chaley gaey aur aik sutoon ke paas tak laga kar baith gaey. mein bhi unke sath chala aur unke qareeb baith gaya. ab tak mujhey ye malum na tha ke ye kon sahib hain. maine unse kaha ke mera khayal hai ke aap ki baat qaum ne pasand nahi ki. unhon-ne kaha ye sab to bewaqoof hain. us waqt maine suraj ki taraf nazar utha kar dekha ke kitna din abhi baqi hai. kyonke mujhey (aap ki baat se) ye khayal guzra ke aap apne kisi kaam ke liye mujhey bhejengey. maine jawab diya ke ji haan (Uhud pahaad maine dekha hai) aap ne farmaya ke agar mere paas Uhud pahaad ke barabar sona ho mein iske siwa dost nahi rakhta ke sirf teen Dinar bacha kar baqi tamam ka tamam ( Allah ke rastey mein) de daalun (abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) ne phir farmaya ke) un logon ko kuchh malum nahi ye duniya jama karne ki fikr kartey hain. hargiz nahi Allah ki qism na main unki duniya unse mangta hun aur na Deen ka koi masla unse poochhta hun yahan tak ke main Allah Taala se ja miloon."
"1427, 1428","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya uper wala hath nichey waley hath se behtar hai aur pahley unhein do jo tumharey baal bachchey aur azeez hain aur behtreen sadqa wo hai jisey de kar aadmi maaldaar rahe aur jo koi sawal se bachna chaahega usey Allah Taala bhi mehfooz rakhta hai aur jo dusron (ke maal) se be-niyaaz rehta hai, usey Allah Taala be-niyaaz hi bana deta hai. aur Wuhaib ne bayan kya ke ham se Hisham ne apne walid se bayan kya, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aisa hi bayan farmaayaa."
"1456, 1457","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke fauran baad zakat deney se inkar karne walon ke mutaalliq farmaya tha) qism Allah ki agar ye mujhey bakri ke aik bachche ko bhi deney se inkar karengey jisey ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko diya kartey they, to main unke us inkar par unse jihad karunga. iske siwa aur koi baat nahi thi jaisa ke main samajhta hun ke Allah Taala ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko jihad ke liye Sina khol diya tha aur phir maine bhi yahi samjha ke faisla unhiin ka haq tha."
"1474, 1475","aadmi hamesha logon ke samney hath phailaataa rehta hai yahan tak ke wo qiyamat ke din is tarah uthega ke iske chehrey par zara bhi gosht na hoga. qiyamat ke din suraj itna qareeb ho jaeyga ke paseena aadhey kaan tak pahunch jaeyga log usi haal main apni mukhlisii ke liye Adam (Alaihissalam) se faryaad karengey. phir Musa (Alaihissalam) se. aur phir Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se. Abdullah ne apni riwayat mein ye zyadti ki hai ke mujh se Leis ne bayan kya, kaha ke mujh se ibn-abii-Ja'far ne bayan kya, ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) shafaat karengey ke makhlooq ka faisla kya jaey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) badhengey aur jannat ke darwazey ka halqa thaam lengey aur isi din Allah Taala aapko ''maqaame-mahmood'' ata farmaeyga. jiski tamam ahale-mahshar tareef karengey aur muallaa-bin-Asad ne kaha ke ham se Wuhaib ne Naumaan-bin-Raashid se bayan kya, unse Zohri ke bhai Abdullaah-bin-Muslim ne, unse Hamza bin-Abdullah ne, aur unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir itni hi hadis bayan ki jo sawal ke baab mein hai."
"1481, 1482","ham ghazwae-tabook ke liye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ja rahe they. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wadi Quraa (Madina Munawra aur Sham (Syria) ke darmyan aik qadeem aabadi) se guzrey to hamari nazar aik aurat par padi jo apne baagh mein khadi hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke iske phalon ka andaza lagaao (ke usmein kitni khajoor niklegii) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne das wasq ka andaza lagaya. phir us aurat se farmaya ke yad rakhna usmein se jitni khajoor nikley. jab ham Tabook pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aaj raat badey zor ki aandhii chalegii isliye koi shakhs khada na rahe aur jiske paas oont hon to wo usey baandh dein. chunanche ham ne oont baandh liye aur aandhii badey zor ki aai. aik shakhs khada hua tha. to hawa ne usey ''Jabale-tay'' par ja phainkaa aur iila ke Hakim (Yuhanna-bin-Rooba) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko safaid khachchar aur aik chadar ka tohfa bhejaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tahreerii taur par usey uski hukumat par bar-qaraar rakha phir jab waadiie-Quraa (waapsii mein) pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi aurat se puchha ke tumharey baagh mein kitna phal aaya tha usne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke andaaze ke mutabiq das wasq aaya tha. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main Madina jald jana chahta hun. isliye jo koi mere sath jaldi chalnaa chahey wo mere sath jald rawaana ho phir jab ( ibne-bakkaar imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ke Shekh ne aik aisa jumla kaha jiske matlab ye they) ke Madina dikhai dene laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye hai taaba ! phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uhud pahaad dekha to farmaya ke ye pahaad ham se mohabbat rakhta hai aur ham bhi us se mohabbat rakhtey hain. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya main Ansar ke sabse achchhey khandan ki nishaandehi na karun? sahaba ne kaha ke zaroor keejiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke banu-Najjaar ka khaandaan. phir bano abdul-Ash'hal ka khaandaan, phir banu-Saaida ka ya (ye farmaya ke) bani Haaris-bin-Khazraj ka khandan aur farmaya ke Ansar ke tamam hi khandanon mein khair hai, abu-Adbullah (qaasim-bin-Salaam) ne kaha ke jis baagh ki chaar diwari ho usey hadeeqa kahengey aur jiski chaar diwari na ho usey hadeeqa nahi kahengey. Uhud wo pahaad hai jo ham se mohabbat rakhta hai aur ham us se mohabbat rakhtey hain."
"1537, 1538","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) saada tel istemal kartey they (ehraam ke baawajood) maine iska zikr Ibrahim Nakhai se kya to unhon-ne farmaya ke tum ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat naql kartey ho. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) hain aur maano mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maang mein khushbu ki chamak dekh rahi hun."
"1543, 1544","Arafaat se Muzdalfa tak Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par peechhey baithey huey they. phir Muzdalfa se Mina tak Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) peechhey baith gaey they, donon hazraat ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jamarae-aqba ki rami tak barabar talbiya kehtey rahe. Arafaat se Muzdalfa tak Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par peechhey baithey huey they. phir Muzdalfa se Mina tak Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) peechhey baith gaey they, donon hazraat ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jamara Aqba ki rami tak barabar talbiya kehtey rahe."
"1614, 1615","maine Urwa se ( Haj ka masla ( puchha to unhon-ne farmaya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne mujhey khabar di thi ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab (Makka) tashrif laey to sabse pahlaa kaam Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye kya ke wuzu kya phir tawaaf kya aur tawaaf karne se Umra nahi hua. iske baad Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi isi tarah Haj kya. phir Urwa ne kaha ke maine apne walid Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Haj kya, unhon-ne bhi sabse pahley tawaaf kya. muhajireen aur Ansar ko bhi maine isi tarah kartey dekha tha. meri walida ( Asma binte- abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne bhi mujhey bataya ke unhon-ne apni behan ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) (aur Zuber aur falan-falan ke sath Umre ka ehram baandha tha. jab un logon ne hajre-Aswad ko bosa de liya to ehram khol daala tha. maine Urwa se ( Haj ka masla ( puchha to unhon-ne farmaya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne mujhey khabar di thi ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab (Makka) tashrif laey to sabse pahlaa kaam Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye kya ke wuzu kya phir tawaaf kya aur tawaaf karne se Umra nahi hua. iske baad Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi isi tarah Haj kya. phir Urwa ne kaha ke maine apne walid Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Haj kya, unhon-ne bhi sabse pahley tawaaf kya. muhajireen aur Ansar ko bhi maine isi tarah kartey dekha tha. meri walida ( Asma binte- abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu)) ne bhi mujhey bataya ke unhon-ne apni behan ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) (aur Zuber aur falan-falan ke sath Umre ka ehram baandha tha. jab un logon ne hajre-Aswad ko bosa de liya to ehram khol daala tha."
"1623, 1624","ham se Qutaiba-bin-Saeed ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya, unse Amr ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke kya koi Umra mein Safa-Marwa ki saee se pahle apni bevi se ham-bistar ho sakta hai? unhone kaha ki Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur Kaba ka tawaaf saat chakkaron se pura kiya. phir maqaame-Ibraaheem ke peechhey do rakaat Namaz padhi phir Safa-Marwa ki saee kii. phir Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Farmaya ke tumhaare liye Rasulullah k tareeqe mein behtreen namoona hai.\"\" Safa Marwa ki saee se pahley apni biwi ke qareeb bhi na jaey."
"1630, 1631","aap fajr ki Namaz ke baad tawaaf kar rahe they aur phir aap ne 2 rakaat (tawaaf ki) Namaz padhi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab bhi unke ghar aatey (asr ke baad) to ye 2 rakaat zaroor padhtey they."
"1641, 1642","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jaisa ke malum hai Haj kya tha. mujhey Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne iske mutaalliq khabar di ke jab aap Makka muazzama aaey to sabse pahlaa kaam ye kya ke aap ne wuzu kya, phir Kaba ka tawaaf kya. ye aap ka Umra nahi tha. iske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Haj kya aur aap ne bhi sabse pahley Kaba ka tawaaf kya jabke ye aap ka bhi Umra nahi tha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi isi tarah kya. phir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ne Haj kya maine dekha ke sabse pahley aap ne bhi Kaba ka tawaaf kya. aap ka bhi ye Umra nahi tha. phir Muawiya aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ka zamana aaya. phir maine apne walid Zubair-bin-Awaam (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath bhi Haj kya. ye (sarey akaabir) pahley Kaba hi ke tawaaf se shuru kartey they jabke ye Umra nahi hota tha. iske baad muhajireen w Ansar ko bhi maine dekha ke wo bhi isi tarah kartey rahe aur unka bhi ye Umra nahi hota tha. aakhiri zaat jisey maine is tarah kartey dekha, wo Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki thi. unhon-ne bhi Umra nahi kya tha. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) abhi maujood hain lekin unse log iske mutaalliq poochhtey nahi. isi tarah jo hazraat guzar gaey, unka bhi Makka mein dakhil hotey hi sabse pahlaa qadam tawaaf ke ley uthtaa tha. phir ye bhi ehram nahi kholtey they. maine apni walida ( Asma binte- abi-Bakr (Raziallahu anhu) (aur khala (Aaisha siddiiqa (Raziallahu anhu)) ko bhi dekha ke jab wo aatiin to sabse pahley tawaaf kartin aur ye iske baad ehram nahi kholtii thin. unhon-ne apni behan aur Zuber aur falan-falan (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Umra kya hai ye sab log hajre-Aswad ka bosa ley letey to Umre ka ehram khol detey."
"1645, 1646","ham ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aisey shakhs ke mutaalliq puchha jo Umre mein Baitullah ka tawaaf to kar ley lekin Safa aur Marwa ki saee nahi karta, kya wo apni biwi se sohbat kar sakta hai. unhon-ne jawab diya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka) tashrif laey to aap ne Baitullah ka saat (7) chakkaron ke sath tawaaf kya aur maqaame-Ibraaheem ke peechhey 2 rakaat Namaz padhi. phir Safa aur Marwa ki saat (7) martaba saee ki aur tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi behtreen namoona hai. Safa aur Marwa ki saee se pahley biwi ke qareeb bhi na jaey."
"1669, 1670","main Arafaat se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey betha hua tha. Muzdalfa ke qareeb baain taraf jo ghaati padtii hai jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wahan pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne oont ko bithaya phir peshab kya aur tashrif laey to maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wuzu ka pani dala. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne halka sa wuzu kya. maine kaha ya Rasulullah! aur namaaz? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ''namaaz tumharey aagey hai.'' (yani Muzdalfa mein padhi jaeygi) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sawar ho gaey jab Muzdalfa mein aaey to (maghrib aur isha ki) Namaz ( mila kar) padhi. phir Muzdalfa ki subah (yani dasween taareekh) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari ke peechhey Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) sawar huey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) barabar labbaik kehtey rahe yahan tak ke jamara Aqba par pahunch gaey (aur wahan Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kankariyaan maarein)."
"1686, 1687","Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) Arafaat se Muzdalfa tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey baithey huey they, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzdalfa se Mina jatey waqt Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) ko apne peechhey bitha liya tha. unhon-ne kaha ke un donon hazraat ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jamara Aqba ki rami tak musalsal labbaik kehtey rahe. Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) Arafaat se Muzdalfa tak Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari par aap ke peechhey baithey huey they, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzdalfa se Mina jatey waqt Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) ko apne peechhey bitha liya tha. unhon-ne kaha ke un donon hazraat ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jamara Aqba ki rami tak musalsal labbaik kehtey rahe."
"1694, 1695","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina se taqriban apne aik hazaar sathiyon ke sath (Haj ke liye nikley) jab zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qurbani ka janwar ko haar pahnaayaa aur ashaar kya phir Umre ka ehram baandhaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina se taqriban apne aik hazaar sathiyon ke sath ( Haj ke liye nikley ( jab zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qurbani ka janwar ko haar pahnaayaa aur ashaar kya phir Umre ka ehram baandhaa."
"1758, 1759","Madina ke logon ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aurat ke mutaalliq puchha ke jo tawaaf karne ke baad haaiza ho gaee thin, aap ne unhein bataya ke (unhein thaharney ki zarurat nahi balke) chali jaaein. lekin poochhney walon ne kaha ham aisa nahi karengey ke aap ki baat par amal to karein aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat chhod dein, Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke jab tum Madina pahunch jao to ye masla wahan (badey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se) poochhna . chunanche jab ye log Madina aaey to poochha, jin akaabir se puchha gaya tha unmein Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) bhi thin aur unhon-ne (unke jawab mein wahi ( Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis bayan ki. us hadis ko Khalid aur Qatada ne bhi Ikrima se riwayat kya hai. Madeena ke logon ne Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aurat ke mutaalliq puchha ke jo tawaaf karne ke baad haaiza ho gaee thin, aap ne unhein bataya ke (unhein thaharney ki zarurat nahi balke) chali jaaein. lekin poochhney walon ne kaha ham aisa nahi karengey ke aap ki baat par amal to karein aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) ki baat chhod dein, Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke jab tum Madina pahunch jao to ye masla wahan (badey sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se) poochhna . chunanche jab ye log Madina aaey to poochha, jin akaabir se puchha gaya tha unmein Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) bhi thin aur unhon-ne (unke jawab mein wahi ( Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis bayan ki. us hadis ko Khalid aur Qatada ne bhi Ikrima se riwayat kya hai."
"1760, 1761","aurat ko uski ijazat hai ke agar wo tawaafe-ifaaza ( tawaaf ziyaarat ( kar chuki ho aur phir ( tawaaf wadaa' se pahley) haiz aa jaey to (apne ghar ( wapas chali jaey. us aurat ke liye waapsii nahi. iske baad maine unse suna aap farmatey they ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aurton ko uski ijazat di hai."
"1771, 1772","Makka se rawaangii ki raat Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) haaiza thin, unhon-ne kaha ke aisa malum hota hai main un logon ke rokney ka baais bin jaaungii , phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( عقرى حلقى ( kya tu ney qurbani ke din tawaafe-ziyaara kya tha? usne kaha ke ji haan kar liya tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir chalo. ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (hijjatul-wadaa ( mein Madina se nikley to hamari zabanon par sirf Haj ka zikr tha. jab ham Makka pahunch gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein ehram khol dene ka hukm diya ( Umra ada karney ke baad jinke sath qurbani nahi thi) rawaangii ki raat Safiya-bint-Huyi (Raziallahu anhu) haaiza ho gain , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ( عقرى حلقى ( aisa malum hota ke tum hamein rokney ka baais banogii, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya qurbani ke din tum ne tawaafe-ziyaara kar liya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir chali chalo! (Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne mutaalliq kaha ke) maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! maine ehram nahi khola hai aap ne farmaya ke tum taneem se Umre ka ehram baandh lo (aur Umra kar lo ( chunanche Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke sath unke bhai gaey ( Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne) farmaya ke ham raat ke aakhir mein wapas lot rahe they ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mulaqat hui, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke ham tumhara intizar falan jagah karengey."
"1775, 1776","main aur Urwa-bin-Zubair masjide-Nabawi mein dakhil huey, wahan Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre ke paas baithey huey they, kuchh log masjide-Nabawi mein ishraaq ki Namaz padh rahe they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke ham ne Abdullah-bin-Umar se un logon ki us Namaz ke mutaalliq puchha to aap ne farmaya ke bidat hai, phir unse puchha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kitney Umerey kiye they? unhon-ne kaha ke chaar, aik unmein se rajab mein kya tha, lekin ham ne pasand nahi kya ke unki is baat ki tardeed karein. ham ne Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre se unke miswak karne ki awaz suni to Urwa ne puchha aey meri maan ! aey Ummul-Momenin ! abu-Abdur-Rehman ki baat aap sun rahi hain? Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne puchha wo kya keh rahe hain? unhon-ne kaha keh rahe hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne char Umerey kiye they jin mein se aik rajab mein kya tha, unhon-ne farmaya ke Allah abu-Abdur-Rehman par raham karey ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to koi Umra aisa nahi kya jis mein wo khud maujood na rahi hon, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne rajab main to kabhi Umra hi nahi kya."
"1791, 1792","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umra bhi kya aur ham ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Umra kya, chunanche jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein dakhil huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pahley (Baitullaah ka ( tawaaf kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ham ne bhi tawaaf kya, phir Safa aur Marwa aaey aur ham bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aaey. ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Makka walon se hifazat kar rahe they ke kahin koi kaafir teer na chala de, mere aik sathi ne ibn-abii-Aufii se puchha kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Kaba mein andar dakhil huey they? unhon-ne farmaya ke nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ke mutaalliq kya kuchh farmaya tha? unhon-ne kaha ke aap ne farmaya tha '' Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ko jannat mein aik mautaa ke ghar ki bashaarat ho, jis mein na kisi qism ka shor w ghul hoga na koi takleef hogii.''"
"1793, 1794","ham ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aik aisey shakhs ke barey mein malum kya jo Umre ke liye Baitullah ka tawaaf to karta hai lekin Safa aur Marwa ki saee nahi karta, kya wo (sirf Baitullah ke tawaaf ke baad) apni biwi se ham-bistar ho sakta hai? unhon-ne iska jawab ye diya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (Makka) tashrif laey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Baitullah ka saat (7) chakkaron ke sath tawaaf kya, phir maqaame-Ibraaheem (Alaihissalam) ke qareeb 2 rakaat Namaz padhi, iske baad Safa aur Marwa ki saat (7) martaba saee ki ''aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi tumharey liye behtreen namoona hai.'' ham ne Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se bhi iske mutaalliq sawal kya to aap ne farmaya Safa aur Marwa ki saee se pahley apni biwi ke qareeb bhi na jana chahiye"
"1918, 1919","Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) kuchh raat rahe se azan de diya kartey they isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tak ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) azan na dein tum khaatey peetey raho kyonke wo subah sadiq ke tuloo se pahley azan nahi detey. Qasim ne bayan kya ke donon ( Bilal aur Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu)) ki azan ke darmyan sirf itna fasla hota tha ke aik chadhtey to doosrey utartey. Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) kuchh raat rahe se azan de diya kartey they isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tak ibn-Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu) azan na dein tum khaatey peetey raho kyonke wo subah sadiq ke tuloo se pahley azan nahi detey. Qasim ne bayan kya ke donon (Bilaal aur Umme-Maktoom (Raziallahu anhu)) ki azan ke darmyan sirf itna fasla hota tha ke aik chadhtey to doosrey utartey."
"1925, 1926","main apne bap ke sath Aaisha aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua (doosri sanad imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke) aur ham se abul-Yamaan ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham ko Shuaib ne khabar di, unhein Zohri ne, unhon-ne bayan kya ke mujhey Abu-Bakar bin Abdur-Rehman bin Haris-bin-Hisham ne khabar di, unhein unke walid Abdur-Rehman ne khabar di, unhein Marwan ne khabar di aur unhein Aaisha aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne khabar di ke) kuchh martaba ( fajr hoti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ahal ke sath junbi (hambistari k baad ki napaki ki haalat me) hotey they, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghusl kartey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rozey se hotey they, aur Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Haris se kaha, main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko tum ye hadis saaf-saaf suna do. (kyonke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ka fatwa iske khilaf tha) un dinon Marwan , ameer Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se Madina ka Hakim tha, Abu-Bakar ne kaha ke Abdur-Rehman ne is baat ko pasand nahi kya. ittifaq se ham sab aik martaba zul-Hulaifa mein jama ho gaey. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki wahan koi zameen thi, Abdur-Rehman ne unse kaha ke aap se aik baat kahunga aur agar Marwan ne uski mujhey qism na di hoti to main kabhi aap ke samney usey na chhedtaa . phir unhon-ne Aaisha aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki hadis zikr ki. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ( main kya karun ( kaha ke Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye hadis bayan ki thi (aur wo zyada jaanney waley hain) ke hamein Hammam aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sahibzadey ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisey shakhs ko jo subah ke waqt junbi honey ki haalat mein utha ho iftaar ka hukm detey they lekin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki ye riwayat zyada moa'tabar hai. main apne bap ke sath Aaisha aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua (doosri sanad imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke) aur ham se abul-Yamaan ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham ko Shuaib ne khabar di, unhein Zohri ne, unhon-ne bayan kya ke mujhey Abu-Bakar bin Abdur-Rehman bin Haris-bin-Hisham ne khabar di, unhein unke walid Abdur-Rehman ne khabar di, unhein Marwan ne khabar di aur unhein Aaisha aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne khabar di ke) kuchh martaba ( fajr hoti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ahal ke sath junbi (hambistari k baad ki napaki ki haalat me) hotey they, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghusl kartey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rozey se hotey they, aur Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne Abdur-Rehman-bin-Haris se kaha, main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko tum ye hadis saaf-saaf suna do. (kyonke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ka fatwa iske khilaf tha) un dinon Marwan , ameer Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se Madina ka Hakim tha, Abu-Bakar ne kaha ke Abdur-Rehman ne is baat ko pasand nahi kya. ittifaq se ham sab aik martaba zul-Hulaifa mein jama ho gaey. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki wahan koi zameen thi, Abdur-Rehman ne unse kaha ke aap se aik baat kahunga aur agar Marwan ne uski mujhey qism na di hoti to main kabhi aap ke samney usey na chhedtaa . phir unhon-ne Aaisha aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki hadis zikr ki. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ( main kya karun ( kaha ke Fazal-bin-Abbaas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye hadis bayan ki thi (aur wo zyada jaanney waley hain) ke hamein Hammam aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sahibzadey ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aisey shakhs ko jo subah ke waqt junbi honey ki haalat mein utha ho iftaar ka hukm detey they lekin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki ye riwayat zyada moa'tabar hai."
"1931, 1932","mere bap Abdur-Rehman mujhey sath lekar Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir huey, Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah junbi (hambistari k baad ki napaki ki haalat me) honey ki haalat mein kartey ehtilam ki wjah se nahi balke hambistari ki wjah se ! phir aap rozey se rahtey (yani ghusl fajr ki Namaz se pahley sehrii ka waqt nikal janey ke baad kartey ( . iske baad ham Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir huey to aap ne isi tarah hadis bayan ki."
"1991, 1992","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne eidul-fitr aur qurbani ke dinon ke rozon ki manaahii ki thi aur aik kapda sarey badan par lapet leney se aur aik kapdey mein gote mar kar baithney se. aur subah aur Asr ke baad Namaz padhney se (mana farmaya ( ."
"1997, 1998","kisi ko ayyaame-tashreeq mein roza rakhney ki ijazat nahi magar uske liye jisey qurbani karne ki taqat na ho. kisi ko ayyaame-tashreeq mein roza rakhney ki ijazat nahi magar uske liye jisey qurbani karne ki taqat na ho."
"2030, 2031","main haaiza hoti phir bhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey apne badan se laga letey. aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) motakif hotey aur main haaiza hoti. iske bawajud aap sar Mubarak (masjid se) bahar kar detey aur main usey dhoti thi."
"2060, 2061","main soney-chaandii ki tijarat kya karta tha. isliye maine Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur mujh se Fazal-bin-Ya'qoob ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham se hujjaaj-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya ke ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya ke mujhey Amr-bin-Dinar aur aamir-bin-Mus'ab ne khabar di, un donon hazraat ne Abul-Minhaal se suna. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Bara-bin-Aazib aur Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se soney chandi ki tijarat ke mutaalliq poochha, to un donon buzurgon ne farmaya ke ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daur mein taajir they, isliye ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se soney chandi ke mutaalliq puchha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab ye diya tha ke (lein-dein) hathon hath ho to koi harj nahi lekin udhaar ki sura mein jaaiz nahi hai. main soney-chaandii ki tijarat kya karta tha. isliye maine Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur mujh se Fazal-bin-Ya'qoob ne bayan kya, kaha ke ham se hujjaaj-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya ke ibne-Juraij ne bayan kya ke mujhey Amr-bin-Dinar aur aamir-bin-Mus'ab ne khabar di, un donon hazraat ne Abul-Minhaal se suna. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Bara-bin-Aazib aur Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se soney chandi ki tijarat ke mutaalliq poochha, to un donon buzurgon ne farmaya ke ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke daur mein taajir they, isliye ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se soney chandi ke mutaalliq puchha tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab ye diya tha ke (lein-dein) hathon hath ho to koi harj nahi lekin udhaar ki sura mein jaaiz nahi hai."
"2123, 2124","sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein ghalla qaaflon se khareedtey they, to aap unke paas koi aadmi bhej kar wahin par jahan unhon-ne ghalla khareedaa hota. us ghalley ko bechney se mana farma detey aur usey wahan se la kar bechney ka hukm hota jahan aam taur par ghalla biktaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne poori tarah apne qabze mein karne se pahley usey bechney se mana farmaya,"
"2153, 2154","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya ke agar koi ghair shadi shuda baandi zina karey (to iska kya hukm hai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey kode lagaao . agar phir zina karey to phir kode lagaao . phir bhi agar zina karey to usey bech do, agarche aik rassii hi ke badley mein wo bikey. ibne-Shahab ne kaha ke mujhey ye malum nahi ke (bechney ke liye) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teesri martaba farmaya tha ya chothi martaba. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya ke agar koi ghair shadi shuda baandi zina karey (to iska kya hukm hai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey kode lagaao. agar phir zina karey to phir kode lagaao. phir bhi agar zina karey to usey bech do, agarche aik rassii hi ke badley mein wo farokht ho. ibne-Shahab ne kaha ke mujhey ye malum nahi ke (bechney ke liye) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teesri martaba farmaya tha ya chothi martaba ."
"2172, 2173","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muzaabna se mana farmaya, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Muzaabna ye hai ke koi shakhs darakht par ki khajoor sokhii khajoor ke badal maap-taul kar bechey aur khareedaar kahey agar darakht ka phal us sookhey phal se zyada nikley to wo uska hai aur kam nikley to wo nuqsan bhar dega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey araayaa ki ijazat de di thi jo andaazey hi se saude ki aik sura hai."
"2178, 2179","diinaar, Dinar ke badley main aur dirham, dirham ke badley mein (bechaa ja sakta hai) is par maine unse kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) to uski ijazat nahi detey. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se iske mutaalliq puchha ke aap ne ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha ya kitabullah mein aap ne usey paya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke unmein se kisi baat ka main dawedar nahi hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki ahaadees) ko aap log mujh se zyada jantey hain. albatta mujhey Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (mazkoora Suraton mein) sood sirf udhaar ki sura mein hota hai. diinaar, Dinar ke badley main aur dirham, dirham ke badley mein (bechaa ja sakta hai) is par maine unse kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) to uski ijazat nahi detey. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se iske mutaalliq puchha ke aap ne ye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha ya kitabullah mein aap ne usey paya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke unmein se kisi baat ka main dawedar nahi hun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (ki ahaadees) ko aap log mujh se zyada jantey hain. albatta mujhey Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (mazkoora Suraton mein) sood sirf udhaar ki sura mein hota hai."
"2180, 2181","maine Bara-bin-Aazib aur Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se sauda-sarf ke mutaalliq puchha to un donon hazraat ne aik doosrey ke mutaalliq farmaya ke ye mujh se behtar hain. aakhir donon hazraat ne batlaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ko chandi ke badley mein udhaar ki sura mein bechney se mana farmaya hai. maine Bara-bin-Aazib aur Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) se sauda-sarf ke mutaalliq puchha to un donon hazraat ne aik doosrey ke mutaalliq farmaya ke ye mujh se behtar hain. aakhir donon hazraat ne batlaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne soney ko chandi ke badley mein udhaar ki sura mein bechney se mana farmaya hai."
"2183, 2184","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, phal ( darakht par ka (us waqt tak na becho jab tak iska pakka hona na khul jaey. aur darakht par lagi hui khajoor ko khushk khajoor ke badley mein na becho . baad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sauda-ariya ki tar ya khushk khajoor ke badle mein ijazat de di thi lekin iske siwa kisi sura ki ijazat nahi di thi."
"2201, 2202","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar mein aik shakhs ko tehseel daar banaya. wo sahib aik umda qism ki khajoor laey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoor isi tarah ki hoti hain. unhon-ne jawab diya ke nahi Allah ki qasam, ya Rasulullah ! ham to isi tarah aik saa khajoor (is se ghatiyaa khajooron ke) 2 saa de kar khareedtey hain. aur 2 saa teen saa ke badley mein letey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa na karo. albatta ghatiyaa khajoor ko pahley bech kar un peson se achi qism ki khajoor khareed saktey ho. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar mein aik shakhs ko tehseel daar banaya. wo sahib aik umda qism ki khajoor laey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoor isi tarah ki hoti hain. unhon-ne jawab diya ke nahi Allah ki qasam, ya Rasulullah ! ham to isi tarah aik saa khajoor (is se ghatiyaa khajooron ke) 2 saa de kar khareedtey hain. aur 2 saa teen saa ke badley mein letey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa na karo. albatta ghatiyaa khajoor ko pahley bech kar un peson se achi qism ki khajoor khareed saktey ho."
"2232, 2233","un donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap se ghair shadi shuda baandi ke mutaalliq jo zina kar ley sawal kya gaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey kode lagaao, phir agar wo zina kar ley to usey kode lagaao aur phir usey bech do. (aakhirii jumla aap ne) teesri ya chothi martaba ke baad (farmaayaa tha) . un donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap se ghair shadi shuda baandi ke mutaalliq jo zina kar ley sawal kya gaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey kode lagaao, phir agar wo zina kar ley to usey kode lagaao aur phir usey bech do. ( aakhiri jumla aap ne) teesri ya chothi martaba ke baad) farmaya tha) ."
"2242, 2243","Abdullaah-bin-Shaddaad-bin-al-Haad aur abu-Barda mein Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq aapasii ikhtilaf hua. to un hazraat ne mujhey ibne-abii-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein bhejaa. chunanche maine unse puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke ham Rasulullah (sl), Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamanon mein geihun, jau, Munaqqaa aur khajoor ke saudey-Salam kartey they. phir maine ibne-Abzaa (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne bhi yahi jawab diya. Abdullaah-bin-Ahaddaad-bin-al-Haad aur abu-Barda mein Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq aapasii ikhtilaf hua. to un hazraat ne mujhey ibne-abii-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein bhejaa. chunanche maine unse puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke ham Rasulullah (sl), Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamanon mein geihun, jau, munaqqaa aur khajoor ke saudey Salam kartey they. phir maine ibn-Abzaa (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne bhi yahi jawab diya."
"2247, 2248","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor mein jabke wo darakht par lagi hui ho Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq poochha, to unhon-ne kaha ke jab tak wo kisi qaabil na ho jaey iske saude se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya hai. isi tarah chandi ko udhaar, naqd ke badley bechney se mana farmaya, phir maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor ke darakht par Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq puchha to aap ne bhi yahi kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt tak khajoor ke saudey se mana farmaya tha jab tak wo khaaii na ja sakey ya (ye farmaya ke) jab tak wo is qaabil na ho jaey ke usey koi kha sakey aur jab tak wo taulney ke qaabil na ho jaey. maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor mein jabke wo darakht par lagi hui ho Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq poochha, to unhon-ne kaha ke jab tak wo kisi qaabil na ho jaey iske saude se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya hai. isi tarah chandi ko udhaar, naqd ke badley bechney se mana farmaya, phir maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor ke darakht par Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq puchha to aap ne bhi yahi kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us waqt tak khajoor ke saudey se mana farmaya tha jab tak wo khaaii na ja sakey ya (ye farmaya ke) jab tak wo is qaabil na ho jaey ke usey koi kha sakey aur jab tak wo taulney ke qaabil na ho jaaey."
"2249, 2250","maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor ke darakht par Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phal ko us waqt tak bechney se mana farmaya hai jab tak wo nafa uthaney ke qaabil na ho jaey, isi tarah chandi ko soney ke badley bechney se jabke aik udhaar aur doosra naqd ho mana farmaya hai. phir maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ko darakht par bechney se jab tak wo khaney ke qaabil na ho jaey, isi tarah jab tak wo wazan karne ke qaabil na ho jaey mana farmaya hai. maine puchha ke wazan kiye janey ka kya matlab hai? to aik sahib ne jo unke paas baithey huey they kaha ke matlab ye hai ke jab tak wo is qaabil na ho jaey ke wo andaza ki ja sakey. maine ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se khajoor ke darakht par Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phal ko us waqt tak bechney se mana farmaya hai jab tak wo nafa uthaney ke qaabil na ho jaey, isi tarah chandi ko soney ke badley bechney se jabke aik udhaar aur doosra naqd ho mana farmaya hai. phir maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khajoor ko darakht par bechney se jab tak wo khaney ke qaabil na ho jaey, isi tarah jab tak wo wazan karne ke qaabil na ho jaey mana farmaya hai. maine puchha ke wazan kiye janey ka kya matlab hai? to aik sahib ne jo unke paas baithey huey they kaha ke matlab ye hai ke jab tak wo is qaabil na ho jaey ke wo andaza ki ja sakey."
"2254, 2255","mujhey abu-Barda aur Abdullaah-bin-Shaddaad ne Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Abza aur Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein bhejaa. maine un donon hazraat se Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ghaneemat ka maal paatey, phir Sham (Syria) ke Anbaat (eik kisaan qaum) hamarey yahan aatey to ham unse geihun, jau aur munaqqaa ke saudey Salam aik muddat muqarrar karke kar liya kartey they. unhon-ne kaha ke phir maine puchha ke unke paas us waqt ye cheezein maujood bhi hoti thin ya nahi? is par unhon-ne kaha ke ham iske mutaalliq unse kuchh poochhtey hi nahi they. mujhey abu-Barda aur Abdullaah-bin-Shaddaad ne Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Abza aur Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein bhejaa. maine un donon hazraat se Sauda Salam ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein ghaneemat ka maal paatey, phir Sham (Syria) ke Anbaat (eik kisaan qaum) hamarey yahan aatey to ham unse geihun, jau aur munaqqaa ke saudey Salam aik muddat muqarrar karke kar liya kartey they. unhon-ne kaha ke phir maine puchha ke unke paas us waqt ye cheezein maujood bhi hoti thin ya nahi? is par unhon-ne kaha ke ham iske mutaalliq unse kuchh poochhtey hi nahi they."
"2265, 2266","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Jaish-ul-Usra ( Jange- Tabook ( mein gaya tha ye mere nazdeek mera sabse zyada qaabile-bharosa nek amal tha. mere sath aik mazdoor bhi tha wo aik shakhs se jhagdaa aur unmein se aik ne doosrey muqabil waley ki ungli chabaa daalii. doosrey ne jo apna hath zor se kheenchaa to uske aagey ke daant bhi sath hi kheenchey chaley aaey aur gir gaey. is par wo shakhs apna muqaddima lekar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uske daant (tootney ka ( koi qisaas nahi dilwaayaa. balke farmaya ke kya wo ungli tumharey munh mein chabaaney ke liye chhod detaa. rawi ne kaha ke main khayal karta hun ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun bhi farmaya, jis tarah oont chabaa liya karta hai. ke aik shakhs ne aik doosrey shakhs ka hath kaat khaayaa. (doosrey ne apna hath kheenchaa to) us kaatney waley ka daant toot gaya aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska koi qisaas nahi dilwaayaa."
"2285, 2286","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (yahoodiyon ko) khaibar ki zameen de di thi ke usmein mehnat ke sath kaasht karein aur paidawar ka aadha hissey khud ley liya karein. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Naafe se ye bayan kya ke zameen kuchh kiraaye par di jati thi. Naafe ne us kiraaye ki ta'yun bhi kar di thi lekin wo mujhey yad nahi raha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zameenon ko kiraaye par deney se mana farmaya tha aur Ubaidullah ne Naafe se bayan kya, aur unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke) khaibar ke yahudiyon ke sath wahan ki zameen ka mamla barabar chalta raha ( yahan tak ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein jalaa watan kar diya."
"2302, 2303","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko khaibar ka tehseel daar banaya. wo umda qism ki khajoor laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoorein usi qism ki hain. unhon-ne kaha ke ham is tarah ki aik saa khajoor (is se ghatiyaa qism ki) 2 saa khajoor ke badal main aur 2 saa , teen saa ke badley mein khareedtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hidayat farmai ke aisa na kar, albatta ghatiyaa khajooron ko paisoon ke badley bech kar unse achi qism ki khajoor khareed saktey ho. aur tauley janey ki chizon mein bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hukm farmaya, rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko khaibar ka tehseel daar banaya. wo umda qism ki khajoor laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoorein usi qism ki hain. unhon-ne kaha ke ham is tarah ki aik saa khajoor (is se ghatiyaa qism ki) 2 saa khajoor ke badal main aur 2 saa , teen saa ke badley mein khareedtey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hidayat farmai ke aisa na kar, albatta ghatiyaa khajooron ko paisoon ke badley bech kar unse achi qism ki khajoor khareed saktey ho. aur tauley janey ki chizon mein bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi hukm farmaayaa,"
"2307, 2308","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (jange-Hunain ke baad) jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua to unhon-ne darkhaast ki ke unke maal w daulat aur unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sabse zyada sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pyari hai. tumhen apne 2 mataalbon mein se sirf kisi aik ko ikhtiyar karna hoga, ya qaidi wapas ley lo, ya maal ley lo, main is par ghaur karne ki wafad ko mohlat bhi deta hun. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se waapsii ke baad unka (Ja'araana mein) taqriban das raat tak intizar kya. phir jab qabila Hawazin ke wakeelon par ye baat waazeh ho gaee ke aap unke mutaalbe ka sirf aik hi hissey taslim kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham sirf apne un logon ko wapas lena chahtey hain jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya, pahley Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana bayan ki, phir farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke musalman ho kar tumharey paas aaey hain. isliye maine munasib jana ke unke qaidiyon ko wapas kar dun. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se aisa karna chahey to usey kar guzrey aur jo shakhs ye chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur ham iske us hisse ko) qeemat ki shakl mein) us waqt wapas kar dein jab Allah Taala (aaj ke baad) sabse pahlaa maale-ghanimat kahin se dila de to usey bhi kar guzarna chahiye ye sun kar sab log bol padey ke ham b-khushi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khaatir unke qaidiyon ko chhodney ke liye taiyaar hain. lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah ham uski tameez nahi kar saktey ke tum mein se kis ne ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye tum sab (apne apney deron mein) wapas jao aur wahan se tumharey wakeel tumhara faisla hamarey paas laaein. chunanche sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne (jo unke numaaindey they) is sura haal par baat ki phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aapko bataya ke sab ne b-khushi dil se ijazat de di hai. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (jange-Hunain ke baad) jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua to unhon-ne darkhaast ki ke unke maal w daulat aur unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sabse zyada sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pyari hai. tumhen apne 2 mataalbon mein se sirf kisi aik ko ikhtiyar karna hoga, ya qaidi wapas ley lo, ya maal ley lo, main is par ghaur karne ki wafad ko mohlat bhi deta hun. chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se waapsii ke baad unka (Ja'araana mein) taqriban das raat tak intizar kya. phir jab qabila Hawazin ke wakeelon par ye baat waazeh ho gaee ke aap unke mutaalbe ka sirf aik hi hissey taslim kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham sirf apne un logon ko wapas lena chahtey hain jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya, pahley Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana bayan ki, phir farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke musalman ho kar tumharey paas aaey hain. isliye maine munasib jana ke unke qaidiyon ko wapas kar dun. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se aisa karna chahey to usey kar guzrey aur jo shakhs ye chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur ham iske us hisse ko) qeemat ki shakl mein) us waqt wapas kar dein jab Allah Taala (aaj ke baad) sabse pahlaa maale-ghanimat kahin se dila de to usey bhi kar guzarna chahiye ye sun kar sab log bol padey ke ham b-khushi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khaatir unke qaidiyon ko chhodney ke liye taiyaar hain. lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah ham uski tameez nahi kar saktey ke tum mein se kis ne ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye tum sab (apne apney deron mein) wapas jao aur wahan se tumharey wakeel tumhara faisla hamarey paas laaein. chunanche sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne (jo unke numaaindey they) is sura haal par baat ki phir wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aapko bataya ke sab ne b-khushi dil se ijazat de di hai."
"2314, 2315","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ibne- Suhak Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya, aey Anees! us khatun ke yahan jaa. agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey sangsaar kar de. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ibne- Suhak Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya, aey Anees! us khatun ke yahan jaa. agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey sangsaar kar de."
"2340, 2341","sahaba tehai , chothai ya aadhe par batai ka mamla kya kartey they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jiske paas zameen ho to usey khud boey warna dusron ko bakhsh de. agar ye bhi nahi kar sakta to usey yun hi khali chhod de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jiske paas zameen ho to wo khud boey warna apne kisi ( musalman ( bhai ko bakhsh de, aur agar ye nahi kar sakta to usey yun hi khali chhod de."
"2343, 2344","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) apne kheton ko Nabi Karim (sl), Abu-Bakar , umr , Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ke ahad main aur Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke shuruati daure-khilaafat mein kiraaey par detey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kheton ko kiraaya par deney se mana kya tha. (ye sun kar) ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey. mein bhi unke sath tha. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse puchha to unhon-ne farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kheton ko kiraaya par deney se mana farmaya, is par ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke aapko malum hai Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein ham apne kheton ko us paidawar ke badal jo naaliyon par ho aur thodi ghaas ke badal diya kartey they."
"2346, 2347","mere chacha ( Zuhair aur muhair (Raziallahu anhu)) ne bayan kya ke wo log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein zameen ko batai par nehar (ke qareeb ki paidawar ( ki shart par diya kartey. ya koi bhi aisa khitta hota jisey Malik zameen (apne liye) chaant leta . isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farma diya. Hanzala ne kaha ke is par maine Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, agar dirham w Dinar ke badley ye mamla kya jaey to kya hukm hai? unhon-ne farmaya ke agar Dinar w dirham ke badley mein ho to usmein koi harj nahi. aur Leis ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jis tarah ki batai se mana farmaya tha, wo aisi sura hai ke halal w haram ki tameez rakhney wala koi bhi shakhs usey jaaiz nahi qarar de sakta. kyonke usmein khula dhoka hai. mere chacha ( Zuhair aur Muhair (Raziallahu anhu)) ne bayan kya ke wo log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein zameen ko batai par nehar (ke qareeb ki paidawar ( ki shart par diya kartey. ya koi bhi aisa khitta hota jisey Malik zameen (apne liye) chaant leta . isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farma diya. Hanzala ne kaha ke is par maine Rafe-bin-Khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) se poochha, agar dirham w Dinar ke badley ye mamla kya jaey to kya hukm hai? unhon-ne farmaya ke agar Dinar w dirham ke badley mein ho to usmein koi harj nahi. aur Leis ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jis tarah ki batai se mana farmaya tha, wo aisi sura hai ke halal w haram ki tameez rakhney wala koi bhi shakhs usey jaaiz nahi qarar de sakta. kyonke usmein khula dhoka hai."
"2356, 2357","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs koi aisi jhooti qism khaaey jiske zariey wo kisi musalman ke maal par nahaq qabza kar ley to wo Allah se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par bahut zyada ghazab naak hoga aur phir Allah Taala ne ( sura Aale-Imran ki ye ( aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi daulat khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak. phir Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) ne tum se kya hadis bayan ki hai? ye aayat to mere barey mein nazil hui thi. mera aik kunwaan mere chacha zaad bhai ki zameen mein tha. ( phir jhagdaa hua to ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke to apne gawah la . maine arz kya ke gawah to mere paas nahi hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir fareeq mukhalif se qism ley ley. is par maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! ye to qism kha baithey ga . ye sun kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya aur Allah Taala ne bhi us barey mein ye aayat nazil farma kar uski tasdeeq ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs koi aisi jhooti qism khaaey jiske zariey wo kisi musalman ke maal par nahaq qabza kar ley to wo Allah se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par bahut zyada ghazab naak hoga aur phir Allah Taala ne ( sura Aale-Imran ki ye ( aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi daulat khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak. phir Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) ne tum se kya hadis bayan ki hai? ye aayat to mere barey mein nazil hui thi. mera aik kunwaan mere chacha zaad bhai ki zameen mein tha. ( phir jhagdaa hua to ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya ke to apne gawah la . maine arz kya ke gawah to mere paas nahi hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir fareeq mukhalif se qism ley ley. is par maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! ye to qism kha baithey ga . ye sun kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya aur Allah Taala ne bhi us barey mein ye aayat nazil farma kar uski tasdeeq ki."
"2359, 2360","aik Ansari mard ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se Harra ke naley mein jiska pani Madina ke log khajoor ke darakhton ko diya kartey they, apne jhagdey ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Ansari Zuber se kehney laga pani ko aagey janey do, lekin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko us se inkar tha aur yahi jhagdaa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke (pahley apna baagh ( seench ley phir apne padosi bhai ke liye jaldi janey de. is par Ansari ko ghussa aa gaya aur unhon-ne kaha, haan Zuber aap ki phoophii ke ladkey hain naa . bas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehra Mubarak ka rang badal gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aey Zuber ! tum sairaab kar lo, phir pani ko itni der tak rokey rakho ke wo mundeeron tak chadh jaey. Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Allah ki qism ! mera to khayal hai ke ye aayat ( فلا وربك لا يؤمنون حتى يحكموك فيما شجر بينهم ) usi silsile mein nazil hui hai'' hargiz nahi, terey rab ki qism ! ye log us waqt tak momin nahi ho saktey jab tak apne jhagdon mein tujh ko Hakim na taslim kar lein '' aakhir tak. aik Ansari mard ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se Harra ke naley mein jiska pani Madina ke log khajoor ke darakhton ko diya kartey they, apne jhagdey ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Ansari Zuber se kehney laga pani ko aagey janey do, lekin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ko us se inkar tha aur yahi jhagdaa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke (pahley apna baagh ( seench ley phir apne padosi bhai ke liye jaldi janey de. is par Ansari ko ghussa aa gaya aur unhon-ne kaha, haan Zuber aap ki phoophii ke ladkey hain naa . bas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehra Mubarak ka rang badal gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aey Zuber ! tum sairaab kar lo, phir pani ko itni der tak rokey rakho ke wo mundeeron tak chadh jaey. Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, Allah ki qism ! mera to khayal hai ke ye aayat ( فلا وربك لا يؤمنون حتى يحكموك فيما شجر"
"2383, 2384","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sauda Muzaabna yani darakht par lagey huey khajoor ko khushk ki hui khajoor ke badley bechney se mana farmaya, ariya karne walon ke ilawa ke unhein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat de di thi. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (rh)) ne kaha ke ibne-Ishaq ne kaha ke mujh se Bashir ne isi tarah ye hadis bayan ki thii. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Sauda Muzaabna yani darakht par lagey huey khajoor ko khushk ki hui khajoor ke badley bechney se mana farmaya, ariya karne walon ke ilawa ke unhein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ijazat de di thi. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ke ibne-Ishaq ne kaha ke mujh se Bashir ne isi tarah ye hadis bayan ki thii."
"2405, 2406","(mere waalid) Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) Shahid huey to apne peechhey baal bachchey aur qarz chhod gaey. mein qarz-khaahon ke paas gaya ke apna kuchh qarz maaf kar dein, lekin unhon-ne inkar kya, phir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unki sifarish karwaaii. unhon-ne iske bawajud bhi inkar kya. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke (apne baagh ki) tamam khajoor ki qismein alag alag kar lo. azq-bin-Zaid alag, leen alag aur ajwa alag (ye sab umda qism ki khajooron ke naam hain) iske baad qarz-khaahon ko bulao aur main bhi aaoonga. chunanche maine aisa kar diya. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke dher par baith gaey aur har qarz-khaah ke liye maap shuru kar di. yahan tak ke sab ka qarz pura ho gaya aur khajoor isi tarah baqi bach rahi jaisey pahley thi. maano kisi ne usey chhuwa tak nahi. aur aik martaba main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik jihad mein aik oont par Sawar ho kar gaya. oont thak gaya. isliye main logon se peechhey reh gaya. itney main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey peechhey se maara aur farmaya ke ye oont mujhey bech do. Madina tak is par sawari ki tumhen ijazat hai. phir jab ham Madina se qareeb huey to maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat chaahii, arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! maine abhi nai shadi ki hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kunwari se ki hai ya bewa se ? maine kaha ke bewa se. mere walid Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) Shahid huey to apne peechhey kai chhoti bachchiyaan chhod gaey hain. isliye maine bewa se ki taake unhein taleem de aur adab sikhaatii rahe. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, achchha ab apne ghar jao. chunanche main ghar gaya. maine jab apne maamun se oont bechney ka zikr kya to unhon-ne mujhey malaamat ki. isliye maine unse oont ke thak janey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke waqia ka bhi zikr kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke oont ko maarney ka bhii. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina pahunchey to main bhi subah ke waqt oont lekar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey oont ki qeemat bhi de di, aur wo oont bhi mujhey wapas bakhsh diya aur qaum ke sath mera (maal ghaneemat ka ( hissey bhi mujh ko bakhsh diya."
"2416, 2417","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jisne koi jhooti qism jaan-boojh kar khaaii taake kisi musalman ka maal naajaaiz taur par hasil kar ley. to wo Allah Taala ke samney us haalat mein hazir hoga ke Allah paak is par bahut hi ghazabnaak hoga. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! mujh se hi mutaalliq aik masley mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. mere aur aik Yahudi ke darmyan aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. us ne inkar kya to maine muqaddima Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya, kya tumharey paas koi gawah hai? maine kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ke phir to qism khaa. Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye jhooti qism kha lega aur mera maal uda ley jaeyga is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( '' beshak wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon se thodi poonchii khareedtey hain.'' aakhir aayat tak. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jisne koi jhooti qism jaan-boojh kar khaaii taake kisi musalman ka maal naajaaiz taur par hasil kar ley. to wo Allah Taala ke samney us haalat mein hazir hoga ke Allah paak is par bahut hi ghazabnaak hoga. rawi ne bayan kya ke is par Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah ki qasam! mujh se hi mutaalliq aik masley mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. mere aur aik Yahudi ke darmyan aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. us ne inkar kya to maine muqaddima Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se malum farmaya, kya tumharey paas koi gawah hai? maine kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ke phir to qism khaa. Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye jhooti qism kha lega aur mera maal uda ley jaeyga is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا"
"2497, 2498","maine Abul-Minhaal se Sauda sirf naqd ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere aik Sharik ne koi cheez (soney aur chandi ki) kharidi naqd par bhi aur udhaar par bhii. phir hamarey yahan Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) aaey to ham ne unse uske barey mein poochha. unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere Sharik Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi ye Sauda kiya tha aur ham ne iske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha tha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jo naqd ho wo ley lo aur jo udhaar ho usey chhod do. maine Abul-Minhaal se Sauda sirf naqd ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere aik Sharik ne koi cheez (soney aur chandi ki) kharidi naqd par bhi aur udhaar par bhii. phir hamarey yahan Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) aaey to ham ne unse iske barey mein poochha. unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere Sharik Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi ye Sauda kiya tha aur ham ne iske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha tha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jo naqd ho wo ley lo aur jo udhaar ho usey chhod do."
"2501, 2502","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paya tha. unki walida Zainab-binte-Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aapko lekar hazir huin aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! us se bait ley lijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to abhi bachcha hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sar par hath phera aur unke liye dua ki aur Zohra-bin-Ma'bad se riwayat hai ke unke dada Abdullah-bin Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) unhein apne sath bazar ley jatey. wahan wo ghalla khareedtey. phir Abdullah-bin-Umar aur Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) unse miltey to wo kehtey ke hamein bhi us anaaj mein Sharik kar lo. kyonke aap ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne barkat ki dua ki hai. chunanche Abdullah-bin Hisham unhein bhi Sharik kar letey aur kabhi pura aik oont (ghalle ke saath) nafe mein paida kar letey aur usko ghar bhej detey. unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paya tha. unki walida Zainab-binte-Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aapko lekar hazir huin aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! us se bait ley lijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to abhi bachcha hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sar par hath phera aur unke liye dua ki aur Zohra-bin-Ma'bad se riwayat hai ke unke dada Abdullah-bin Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) unhein apne sath bazar ley jatey. wahan wo ghalla khareedtey. phir Abdullah-bin-Umar aur Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) unse miltey to wo kehtey ke hamein bhi us anaaj mein Sharik kar lo. kyonke aap ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne barkat ki dua ki hai. chunanche Abdullah-bin Hisham unhein bhi Sharik kar letey aur kabhi pura aik oont (ghalle ke saath) nafe mein paida kar letey aur usko ghar bhej detey."
"2505, 2506","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chothi Zil-Hijja ki subah ko Haj ka talbiya kehtey huey jiske sath koi aur cheez (Umra) na milaate huey (Makka mein) dakhil huey. jab ham Makka pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se ham ne apne Haj ko Umra kar dala. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke (Umra ke arkaan ada karne ke baad Haj ke ehram tak) hamari beeviyan hamarey liye halal rahengii. is par logon mein charcha honey laga. Ata ne bayan kya ke Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kuchh log kehney lagey kya ham mein se koi Mina is tarah jaey ke mani uske zakar (private part) se tapak rahi ho. Jaabir ne hath se ishara bhi kya. ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dene khadey huey aur farmaya mujhey malum hua hai ke kuchh log is tarah ki baatein kar rahe hain. Allah ki qism mein un logon se zyada nek aur Allah se darney wala hun. agar mujhey wo baat pahley hi malum hoti jo ab malum hui hai to main qurbani ke janwar apne sath na laataa aur agar mere sath qurbani ke janwar na hotey to main bhi ehram khol detaa. is par Suraaqa-bin-Maalik-bin-Ja'sham khadey huey aur kaha ya Rasulullah! kya ye hukm (Haj ke dinon mein Umra) khas hamarey hi liye hai ya hamesha ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke hamesha ke liye hai. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) (Yaman se) aaey. ab ata aur Taaus mein se aik to yun kehta hai Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ehram ke waqt yun kaha thaa. لبيك بما أهل به رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم aur doosra yun kehta hai ke unhon-ne لبيك بحجة رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم kahaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke wo apne ehram par qaaim rahen (jaisaa bhi unhon-ne baandha hai) aur unhein apni qurbani mein Sharik kar liya. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chothi Zil-Hijja ki subah ko Haj ka talbiya kehtey huey jiske sath koi aur cheez (Umra) na milaate huey (Makka mein) dakhil huey. jab ham Makka pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se ham ne apne Haj ko Umra kar dala. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke (Umra ke arkaan ada karne ke baad Haj ke ehram tak) hamari beeviyan hamarey liye halal rahengii. is par logon mein charcha honey laga. Ata ne bayan kya ke Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kuchh log kehney lagey kya ham mein se koi Mina is tarah jaey ke mani uske zakar (private part) se tapak rahi ho. Jaabir ne hath se ishara bhi kya. ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dene khadey huey aur farmaya mujhey malum hua hai ke kuchh log is tarah ki baatein kar rahe hain. Allah ki qism mein un logon se zyada nek aur Allah se darney wala hun. agar mujhey wo baat pahley hi malum hoti jo ab malum hui hai to main qurbani ke janwar apne sath na laataa aur agar mere sath qurbani ke janwar na hotey to main bhi ehram khol detaa. is par Suraaqa-bin-Maalik-bin-Ja'sham khadey huey aur kaha ya Rasulullah! kya ye hukm (Haj ke dinon mein Umra) khas hamarey hi liye hai ya hamesha ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke hamesha ke liye hai. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) (Yaman se) aaey. ab ata aur Taaus mein se aik to yun kehta hai Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ehram ke waqt yun kaha thaa. لبيك بما أهل به رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم aur doosra yun kehta hai ke unhon-ne لبيك بحجة رسول الله صلى الله عليه"
"2515, 2516","jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar us niyat se jhooti qism khaaey ke is tarah doosrey ke maal par apni milkiyat jamaaey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga. us irshad ki tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne (sura aale-Imraan mein) ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( ''wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi poojii khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak unhon-ne tilawat ki. abu-Waaeil ne kaha iske baad asha's-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey ghar tashrif laey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman (abu-Masood (rz)) ne tum se kon si hadis bayan ki hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne uper wali hadis unke samney pesh kar di. is par unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sach bayan kya hai. mera aik (yahoodii) shakhs se kuwein ke mamley mein jhagdaa hua tha. ham apna jhagdaa lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna doosrey fareeq se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya phir ye to qism kha lega aur (jhoot bolney par) usey kuchh parwah na hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar kisi ka maal hadap karne ke liye jhooti qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par bahut hi zyada ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki. iske baad unhon-ne wahi aayat padhi ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey thodi poojii khareedtey hain''. aakhir tak. jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar us niyat se jhooti qism khaaey ke is tarah doosrey ke maal par apni milkiyat jamaaey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga. us irshad ki tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne (sura aale-Imraan mein) ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( ''wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi poojii khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak unhon-ne tilawat ki. abu-Waaeil ne kaha iske baad asha's-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey ghar tashrif laey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman (abu-Masood (rz)) ne tum se kon si hadis bayan ki hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne uper wali hadis unke samney pesh kar di. is par unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sach bayan kya hai. mera aik (yahoodii) shakhs se kuwein ke mamley mein jhagdaa hua tha. ham apna jhagdaa lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna doosrey fareeq se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya phir ye to qism kha lega aur (jhoot bolney par) usey kuchh parwah na hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar kisi ka maal hadap karne ke liye jhooti qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par bahut hi zyada ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki. iske baad unhon-ne wahi aayat padhi ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا"
"2539, 2540","jab qabila Hawazin ki bhejey huey log (muslmaan ho kar) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey ho kar unse mulaqat farmai, phir un logon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney darkhaast ki ke unke amwaal aur qaidi wapas kar diye jaaein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey (khutba sunaayaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum dekhtey ho mere sath jo log hain (mein akelaa hota to tum ko wapas kar detaa) aur baat wahi mujhey pasand hai jo sach ho. isliye 2 chizon mein se aik hi tumhen ikhtiyar karni hogi, ya apna maal wapas ley lo, ya apne qaidiyon ko chhudaa lo, isi liye maine unki taqseem mein bhi der ki thii.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se laut'tey huey (Ja'araana mein) Hawazin walon ka wahan par kai raaton tak intizar kya tha. jab un logon par ye baat poori tarah zahir ho gaee ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 chizon (maal aur qaidi) mein se sirf aik hi ko wapas farma saktey hain. to unhon-ne kaha ke hamein hamarey aadmi hi wapas kar dijiye jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon se Khattab farmaya, Allah ki tareef uski shaan ke mutabiq karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai hamarey paas naadim ho kar aaey hain aur mera bhi khayal ye hai ke unke aadmi jo hamari qaid mein hain, unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se unke aadmiyon ko wapas karey wo aisa kar ley aur jo shakhs apne hissey ko chhodnaa na chahey (aur us shart par apne qaidiyon ko aazad karne ke liye taiyaar ho ke un qaidiyon ke badley mein) ham usey uske baad sabse pehli maale-ghanimat mein se jo Allah Taala hamein dega iske (is ( hissey ka badla iske hawale kar dengey to wo aisa kar ley.'' log is par bol padey ke ham apni khushi se qaidi ko wapas karne ke liye taiyaar hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ''lekin ham par ye zahir na ho saka ke kis ne hamein ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas jayen aur sab ke zimmedaar aa kar unki raey se hamein aagah karein.'' chunanche sab log chaley aaey aur unke sardaaron ne (unse guftgu ki) phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di ke sab ne apni khushi se ijazat de di hai. yahi wo khabar hai jo hamein Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein malum hui hai. (Zohri ne kaha) aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (jab Bahrain se maal aayaa) kaha tha ke (badr ke mauqe par) maine apna bhi fidya diya tha aur Aqeel (Raziallahu anhu) ka bhii. jab qabila Hawazin ki bhejey huey log (muslmaan ho kar) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey ho kar unse mulaqat farmai, phir un logon ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney darkhaast ki ke unke amwaal aur qaidi wapas kar diye jaaein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey (khutba sunaayaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum dekhtey ho mere sath jo log hain (mein akelaa hota to tum ko wapas kar detaa) aur baat wahi mujhey pasand hai jo sach ho. isliye 2 chizon mein se aik hi tumhen ikhtiyar karni hogi, ya apna maal wapas ley lo, ya apne qaidiyon ko chhudaa lo, isi liye maine unki taqseem mein bhi der ki thii.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se laut'tey huey (Ja'araana mein) Hawazin walon ka wahan par kai raaton tak intizar kya tha. jab un logon par ye baat poori tarah zahir ho gaee ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) 2 chizon (maal aur qaidi) mein se sirf aik hi ko wapas farma saktey hain. to unhon-ne kaha ke hamein hamarey aadmi hi wapas kar dijiye jo aap ki qaid mein hain. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon se Khattab farmaya, Allah ki tareef uski shaan ke mutabiq karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai hamarey paas naadim ho kar aaey hain aur mera bhi khayal ye hai ke unke aadmi jo hamari qaid mein hain, unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se unke aadmiyon ko wapas karey wo aisa kar ley aur jo shakhs apne hissey ko chhodnaa na chahey (aur us shart par apne qaidiyon ko aazad karne ke liye taiyaar ho ke un qaidiyon ke badley mein) ham usey uske baad sabse pehli maale-ghanimat mein se jo Allah Taala hamein dega iske (is ( hissey ka badla iske hawale kar dengey to wo aisa kar ley.'' log is par bol padey ke ham apni khushi se qaidi ko wapas karne ke liye taiyaar hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ''lekin ham par ye zahir na ho saka ke kis ne hamein ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas jayen aur sab ke zimmedaar aa kar unki raey se hamein aagah karein.'' chunanche sab log chaley aaey aur unke sardaaron ne (unse guftgu ki) phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di ke sab ne apni khushi se ijazat de di hai. yahi wo khabar hai jo hamein Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein malum hui hai. (Zohri ne kaha) aur Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se (jab Bahrain se maal aayaa) kaha tha ke (badr ke mauqe par) maine apna bhi fidya diya tha aur Aqeel (Raziallahu anhu) ka bhii."
"2555, 2556","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab baandi zina kiraaey to usey ( bataur had sharaee ( kode lagaao phir agar karey to usey kode lagaao teesri ya chothi baar mein (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) phir usey bech do, chahe qeemat mein aik rassii hi miley.'' nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab baandi zina kiraaey to usey ( bataur had sharaee ( kode lagaao phir agar karey to usey kode lagaao teesri ya chothi baar mein (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) phir usey bech do, chahe qeemat mein aik rassii hi miley.''"
"2583, 2584","jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko khitab farmaya aur Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq sana ke baad aap ne farmaya : ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke hamarey paas aaey hain aur main yahi behtar samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se ( qaidiyon ko) wapas karna chahey wo wapas kar de aur jo ye chahey ke unhein unka hissey miley (to wo bhi wapas kar de) aur hamein Allah Taala (iske baad) sabse pehli jo ghaneemat dega, usmein se ham usey muaawaza de dengey. logon ne kaha ham apni khushi se (unke qaidi wapas karke (aap ka irshad taslim kartey hain. jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko khitab farmaya aur Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq sana ke baad aap ne farmaya : ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke hamarey paas aaey hain aur main yahi behtar samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se ( qaidiyon ko) wapas karna chahey wo wapas kar de aur jo ye chahey ke unhein unka hissey miley (to wo bhi wapas kar de) aur hamein Allah Taala (iske baad) sabse pehli jo ghaneemat dega, usmein se ham usey muaawaza de dengey. logon ne kaha ham apni khushi se (unke qaidi wapas karke (aap ka irshad taslim kartey hain."
"2607, 2608","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein jab Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se darkhaast ki ke unke amwaal aur qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jayen to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya mere sath jitni badi jamat hai usey bhi tum dekh rahe ho aur sabse zyada sachchii baat hi mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai isliye tum log in 2 chizon mein se aik hi ley saktey ho, ya apne qaidi ley lo ya apna maal . maine tumhara pahley hi intizar kya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Taaif se waapsii par taqriban das din tak ( maqam Jaarana mein) un logon ka intizar farmatey rahe. phir jab un logon ke samney ye baat poori tarah waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez wapas farma saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidiyon hi ko (waapas lenaa) pasand kartey hain. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey ho kar musalmanon ko khitab kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef bayan ki aur farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai hamarey paas ab tauba karke aaey hain. mera khayal ye hai ke unhein unke qaidi wapas kar dun. isliye jo sahib apni khushi se wapas karna chaahein wo aisa kar lein aur jo log ye chahtey hon ke apne hissey ko na chhodein balke ham unhein iske badley mein sabse pehli ghaneemat ke maal mein se muaawaza dein, to wo bhi (apne maujooda qaidiyon ko) wapas kar dein. sab sahaba ne is par kaha, ya Rasulullah ! ham apni khushi se unhein wapas kartey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin waazeh taur par us waqt ye malum na ho saka ke kon apni khushi se dene ke liye taiyaar hai aur kon nahi. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas jayen aur tumharey zimmedaar log tumhara mamla la kar pesh karein. chunanche sab log wapas ho gaey aur numaaindon ne unse guftgu ki aur wapas ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bataya ke tamam logon ne khushi se ijazat de di hai. qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq hamein yahi baat malum hui hai. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ye Zohri (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ka aakhiri qaul tha. yani ye ke qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq hamein yahi baat malum hui hai. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein jab Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se darkhaast ki ke unke amwaal aur qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jayen to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya mere sath jitni badi jamat hai usey bhi tum dekh rahe ho aur sabse zyada sachchii baat hi mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai isliye tum log in 2 chizon mein se aik hi ley saktey ho, ya apne qaidi ley lo ya apna maal . maine tumhara pahley hi intizar kya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Taaif se waapsii par taqriban das din tak ( maqam Jaarana mein) un logon ka intizar farmatey rahe. phir jab un logon ke samney ye baat poori tarah waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez wapas farma saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidiyon hi ko (waapas lenaa) pasand kartey hain. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey ho kar musalmanon ko khitab kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef bayan ki aur farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai hamarey paas ab tauba karke aaey hain. mera khayal ye hai ke unhein unke qaidi wapas kar dun. isliye jo sahib apni khushi se wapas karna chaahein wo aisa kar lein aur jo log ye chahtey hon ke apne hissey ko na chhodein balke ham unhein iske badley mein sabse pehli ghaneemat ke maal mein se muaawaza dein, to wo bhi (apne maujooda qaidiyon ko) wapas kar dein. sab sahaba ne is par kaha, ya Rasulullah ! ham apni khushi se unhein wapas kartey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin waazeh taur par us waqt ye malum na ho saka ke kon apni khushi se dene ke liye taiyaar hai aur kon nahi. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas jayen aur tumharey zimmedaar log tumhara mamla la kar pesh karein. chunanche sab log wapas ho gaey aur numaaindon ne unse guftgu ki aur wapas ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bataya ke tamam logon ne khushi se ijazat de di hai. qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq hamein yahi baat malum hui hai. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ye Zohri (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ka aakhiri qaul tha. yani ye ke qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq hamein yahi baat malum hui hai."
"2615, 2616","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein dabeez qism ke resham ka aik jubba hadiye ke taur par pesh kya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske istemal se (mardon ko) mana farmatey they. sahaba ko badi hairat hui (ke kitna umda resham hai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (tumhein is par hairat hai) us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jaan hai, jannat mein Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ke roomaal us se bhi zyada khoobsurat hain. dauma (Tabook ke qareeb aik maqaam) ke Akeedar ( nasrani ( ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hadiya bheja tha."
"2666, 2667","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs ne koi aisi qism khaaii jis mein wo jhoota tha, kisi musalman ka maal chheenney ke liye, to wo Allah Taala se is tarah milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' unhon-ne bayan kya ke is par ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah gawah hai, ye hadis mere hi mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai thi. mera aik Yahudi se aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. Yahudi mere haq ka inkar kar raha tha. isliye main usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya (kyonke main muddaii tha) ke gawahi pesh karna tumharey hi zimme hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya gawah to mere paas koi bhi nahi. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ''phir tum qism khaao.'' ash'as (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main bol padaa, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye qism kha lega aur mera maal Hazam kar jaeyga unhon-ne bayan kya ke isi waqia par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ) ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur qasmon se maamooli poonjii khareedtey hain aakhir aayat tak. '' rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs ne koi aisi qism khaaii jis mein wo jhoota tha, kisi musalman ka maal chheenney ke liye, to wo Allah Taala se is tarah milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' unhon-ne bayan kya ke is par ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Allah gawah hai, ye hadis mere hi mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmai thi. mera aik Yahudi se aik zameen ka jhagdaa tha. Yahudi mere haq ka inkar kar raha tha. isliye main usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya (kyonke main muddaii tha) ke gawahi pesh karna tumharey hi zimme hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya gawah to mere paas koi bhi nahi. isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Yahudi se farmaya ''phir tum qism khaao.'' ash'as (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main bol padaa, ya Rasulullah! phir to ye qism kha lega aur mera maal Hazam kar jaeyga unhon-ne bayan kya ke isi waqia par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا"
"2669, 2670","Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jo shakhs ( jhooti ( qism kisi ka maal hasil karne ke liye khaaeyga to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke Allah paak is par ghazabnaak hoga. iske baad Allah Taala ne (is hadis ki) tasdeeq ke liye ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ) ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon se thodi poonjii khareedtey hain. ( azaabe-aleem)'' tak. phir Ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamari taraf tashrif laey aur poochhney lagey ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) tum se kon si hadis bayan kar rahe they. ham ne unki yahi hadis bayan ki to unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sahi bayan ki, ye aayat mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi. mera aik shakhs se jhagdaa tha. ham apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas le gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ya tum 2 gawah laao, warna uski qism par faisla hoga. maine kaha ke (gawaah mere paas nahi hain lekin agar faisla uski qism par hua) phir to ye zaroor hi qism kha lega aur koi parwah na karega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sun kar farmaya ''jo shakhs bhi kisi ka maal leney ke liye ( jhooti ( qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' uski tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne uper zikr ki gaee aayat nazil farmai thi, phir unhon-ne yahi aayat tilawat ki. Abdullaah (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke jo shakhs ( jhooti ( qism kisi ka maal hasil karne ke liye khaaeyga to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke Allah paak is par ghazabnaak hoga. iske baad Allah Taala ne (is hadis ki) tasdeeq ke liye ye aayat nazil farmaaii ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ) ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon se thodi poonjii khareedtey hain. ( azaabe-aleem)'' tak. phir Ash'as-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamari taraf tashrif laey aur poochhney lagey ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) tum se kon si hadis bayan kar rahe they. ham ne unki yahi hadis bayan ki to unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sahi bayan ki, ye aayat mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi. mera aik shakhs se jhagdaa tha. ham apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas le gaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ya tum 2 gawah laao, warna uski qism par faisla hoga. maine kaha ke (gawaah mere paas nahi hain lekin agar faisla uski qism par hua) phir to ye zaroor hi qism kha lega aur koi parwah na karega. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sun kar farmaya ''jo shakhs bhi kisi ka maal leney ke liye ( jhooti ( qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' uski tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne uper zikr ki gaee aayat nazil farmai thi, phir unhon-ne yahi aayat tilawat ki."
"2676, 2677","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs jhooti qism isliye khaaey ke iske zariey kisi ka maal ley sakey, ya unhon-ne yun bayan kya ke apne bhai ka maal ley sakey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne isi ki tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil farmai ke) إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni ( jhooti ( qasmon ke zariey maamooli poonjii hasil kartey hain.''   phir mujh se Ash'as (Raziallahu anhu) ki mulaqat hui to unhon-ne puchha ke Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne aaj tum logon se kya hadis bayan ki thi. maine unse bayan kar di to aap ne farmaya ke ye aayat mere hi waqiey ke silsiley mein nazil hui thi. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs jhooti qism isliye khaaey ke iske zariey kisi ka maal ley sakey, ya unhon-ne yun bayan kya ke apne bhai ka maal ley sakey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne isi ki tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil farmai ke) إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا"
"2695, 2696","aik dehati aaya aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! hamarey darmyan kitabullah se faisla kar dijiye. doosrey fareeq ne bhi yahi kaha ke usne sach kaha hai. aap hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dein. dehati ne kaha ke mera ladka iske yahan mazdoor tha. phir us ne uski biwi se zina kya. qaum ne kaha tumharey ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga lekin maine apne ladkey ke us jurm ke badley mein so bakriyan aur aik baandi de di, phir maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke iske siwa koi sura nahi ke tumharey ladkey ko so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr kar diya jaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main tumhara faisla kitabullah hi se karunga. baandi aur bakriyan to tumhen wapas lota di jati hain, albatta tumharey ladkey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr kya jaeyga aur Anees tum (ye qabila Aslam ke sahabi they) us aurat ke ghar jao aur usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do (agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley) chunanche Anees gaey, aur (choonke usne bhi zina ka iqrar kar liya tha us liye) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar diyaa.'' eik dehati aaya aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! hamarey darmyan kitabullah se faisla kar dijiye. doosrey fareeq ne bhi yahi kaha ke usne sach kaha hai. aap hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dein. dehati ne kaha ke mera ladka iske yahan mazdoor tha. phir us ne uski biwi se zina kya. qaum ne kaha tumharey ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga lekin maine apne ladkey ke us jurm ke badley mein so bakriyan aur aik baandi de di, phir maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke iske siwa koi sura nahi ke tumharey ladkey ko so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr kar diya jaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main tumhara faisla kitabullah hi se karunga. baandi aur bakriyan to tumhen wapas lota di jati hain, albatta tumharey ladkey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr kya jaeyga aur Anees tum (ye qabila Aslam ke sahabi they) us aurat ke ghar jao aur usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do (agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley) chunanche Anees gaey, aur (choonke usne bhi zina ka iqrar kar liya tha us liye) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar diyaa.''"
"2711, 2712","jab Suhail-bin-Amr ne ( Hudaibiya mein kuffaare-Quraish ki taraf se muaahida suleh ( likhwaayaa to jo sharaait Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney Suhel ne rakhi thin, unmein ye shart bhi thin ke ham mein se koi bhi shakhs agar aap ke yahan ( faraar ho kar) chala jaey chahe wo aap ke Deen par hi kyon na ho to aapko usey hamarey hawale karna hoga. musalman ye shart pasand nahi kar rahe they aur is par unhein dukh hua tha. lekin Suhel ne us shart ke baghair suleh qabool na ki. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi shart par suleh naamaa likhwaa liya. ittifaq se isi din abu-jandal (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo musalman ho kar aaya tha (muaahide ke tehet naa chahtey huey) unke walid Suhail-bin-Amr ke hawale kar diya gaya. isi tarah muddate-suleh mein jo mard bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (Makka se bhag kar aayaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey unke hawale kar diya. chahe wo musalman hi kyon na raha ho. lekin chand eman wali auratein bhi hijrat karke aa gaee thin, Umme- Kulsoom-bint-Aqba-bin-abii-Mueet (Raziallahu anhu) bhi unmein shamil thin jo isi din (Makka se nikal kar) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aai thin, wo jawan thin aur jab unke ghar waley aaey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unki waapsii ka mutalba kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein unke hawale nahi farmaya, balke aurton ke mutaalliq Allah Taala (sura Mumtahina mein) irshad farma chuka thaa إذا جاءكم المؤمنات مهاجرات فامتحنوهن الله أعلم بإيمانهن wla هم يحلون لهنtak ''jab musalman auratein tumharey yahan hijrat karke pahunchein to pahley tum unka imtihaan ley lo, yun to unke eman ke mutaalliq jaanney wala Allah Taala hi hai. Allah Taala ke us irshad tak ke ''kuffaar w mushrekeen unke liye halal nahi hain.'' jab Suhail-bin-Amr ne ( Hudaibiya mein kuffaare-Quraish ki taraf se muaahida suleh ( likhwaayaa to jo sharaait Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney Suhel ne rakhi thin, unmein ye shart bhi thin ke ham mein se koi bhi shakhs agar aap ke yahan ( faraar ho kar) chala jaey chahe wo aap ke Deen par hi kyon na ho to aapko usey hamarey hawale karna hoga. musalman ye shart pasand nahi kar rahe they aur is par unhein dukh hua tha. lekin Suhel ne us shart ke baghair suleh qabool na ki. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi shart par suleh naamaa likhwaa liya. ittifaq se isi din abu-jandal (Raziallahu anhu) ko jo musalman ho kar aaya tha (muaahide ke tehet naa chahtey huey) unke walid Suhail-bin-Amr ke hawale kar diya gaya. isi tarah muddate-suleh mein jo mard bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (Makka se bhag kar aayaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey unke hawale kar diya. chahe wo musalman hi kyon na raha ho. lekin chand eman wali auratein bhi hijrat karke aa gaee thin, Umme- Kulsoom-bint-Aqba-bin-abii-Mueet (Raziallahu anhu) bhi unmein shamil thin jo isi din (Makka se nikal kar) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aai thin, wo jawan thin aur jab unke ghar waley aaey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se unki waapsii ka mutalba kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein unke hawale nahi farmaya, balke aurton ke mutaalliq Allah Taala (sura Mumtahina mein) irshad farma chuka thaa إذا جاءكم المؤمنات مهاجرات فامتحنوهن الله أعلم بإيمانهن wla هم يحلون"
"2724, 2725","aik dehati sahabi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah! main aap se Allah ka waasta de kar kehta hun ke aap mera faisla kitabullah se kar dein. doosrey fareeq ne jo us se zyada samajh daar tha, kaha ke ji haan ! kitabullah se hi hamara faisla farmaiye, aur mujhey (apnaa muqaddima pesh karne ki) ijazat dijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke pesh kar. us ne bayan karna shuru kya ke mera betaa in sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. phir us ne inkii biwi se zina kar liya, jab mujhey malum hua ke (zinaa ki saza mein) mera ladka rajm (sangsaar) kar diya jaeyga to maine iske badley mein so bakriyan aur aik baandi di, phir ilm walon se iske barey mein puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ko (zinaa ki saza mein kyonke wo ghair shadi shuda tha) so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaeyga albatta uski biwi rajm (sangsaar) kar di jaeygi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah hi se karunga. baandi aur bakriyan tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey betey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye jalaa watan kya jaeyga achchha Anees! tum us aurat ke yahan jao, agar wo bhi) zina ka ( iqrar kar ley, to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do (kyonke wo shadi shuda thi) bayan kya ke Anees (Raziallahu anhu) us aurat ke yahan gaey aur us ne iqrar kar liya, isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se wo rajm (sangsaar) ki gaii.'' eik dehati sahabi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah! main aap se Allah ka waasta de kar kehta hun ke aap mera faisla kitabullah se kar dein. doosrey fareeq ne jo us se zyada samajh daar tha, kaha ke ji haan ! kitabullah se hi hamara faisla farmaiye, aur mujhey (apnaa muqaddima pesh karne ki) ijazat dijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke pesh kar. us ne bayan karna shuru kya ke mera betaa in sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. phir us ne inkii biwi se zina kar liya, jab mujhey malum hua ke (zinaa ki saza mein) mera ladka rajm (sangsaar) kar diya jaeyga to maine iske badley mein so bakriyan aur aik baandi di, phir ilm walon se iske barey mein puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ko (zinaa ki saza mein kyonke wo ghair shadi shuda tha) so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaeyga albatta uski biwi rajm (sangsaar) kar di jaeygi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah hi se karunga. baandi aur bakriyan tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey betey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye jalaa watan kya jaeyga achchha Anees! tum us aurat ke yahan jao, agar wo bhi) zina ka ( iqrar kar ley, to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do (kyonke wo shadi shuda thi) bayan kya ke Anees (Raziallahu anhu) us aurat ke yahan gaey aur us ne iqrar kar liya, isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se wo rajm (sangsaar) ki gaii.''"
"2731, 2732","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par (Makka) ja rahe they, abhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rastey hi mein they, farmaya Khalid-bin Waleed Quraish ke) 200 ( sawaaron ke sath hamari naql w harkat ka andaza lagaaney ke liye maqaame-Ghameem mein muqeem hai (ye Quraish ka muqaddimatul-jaish (main army) hai) isliye tum log dahini taraf se jao, to Allah ki qism Khalid ko unke mutaalliq kuchh bhi ilm na ho saka aur jab unhon-ne us lashkar ka ghubaar uthtaa hua dekha to Quraish ko jaldi-jaldi khabar dene gaey. idhar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaltey rahe yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us ghaati par pahunchey jis se Makka mein utartey hain to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari baith gaee. sahaba ontni ko uthaney ke liye hal-hal kehney lagey lekin wo apni jagah se na uthii. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qaswaa ad gaee Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya qaswaa Adi nahi aur na ye uski aadat hai, isey to us zaat ne rok liya jisne haathiyon (ke lashakr) ko (Makka) mein dakhil honey se rok liya tha. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai Quraish jo bhi aisa mutalba rakhengey jis mein Allah ki haram ki hui chizon ki badaai ho to main uska mutalba manzoor kar loonga. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ontni ko daantaa to wo uth gaee. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sahaba se aagey nikal gaey aur Hudaibiya ke aakhiri kinarey Samad (eik chashma ya garhaa) par jahan pani kam tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padao kya. log thoda thodaa pani istemal karne lagey, unhon-ne pani ko thaharney hi nahi diya, sab kheench dala. ab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se piyaas ki shikayat ki gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne tarkash mein se aik teer nikal kar diya ke us garhey mein daal dein b-khudaa teer gaadtey hi pani unhein sairaab karne ke liye ubalney laga aur wo log poori tarah sairaab ho gaey. log usi haal mein they ke Budail-bin-Warqaa Khuzai (Raziallahu anhu) apni qaum khuza'aa ke kai aadmiyon ko lekar hazir hua. ye log tahaama ke rehney waley they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mahrame-raaz badey khair-khaah they. unhon-ne khabar di ke main Ka'b-bin-Looii aur Aamir-bin-Looii ko peechhey chhod kar aa raha hun. jinhoney Hudaibiya ke pani ke zakheeron par apna padao daal diya hai, unke sath kasrat se doodh dene wali oontniyan apne naey-naey bachchon ke sath hain. wo aap se ladengey aur aap ke Baitullah pahunchne mein rukawat banengey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ham kisi se ladney nahi aaey hain sirf Umra ke iraadey se aaey hain aur waqia to ye hai (musalsal ladaaiyon) ne Quraish ko bhi kamzor kar diya hai aur unhein bada nuqsan uthana padaa hai, ab agar wo chaahein to main aik muddat unse suleh ka muaahida kar loonga, us arse mein wo mere aur Awam (kuffaar mushrekeene-arab) ke darmyan na padein phir agar main kaamyaab ho jaun aur (uske baad) wo chaahein to is Deen (Islam) mein wo bhi dakhil ho saktey hain (jis main aur tamam log dakhil ho chukey hongey) lekin agar mujhey kamiyabi nahi hui to unhein bhi aaraam mil jaeyga aur agar unhein meri pesh-kash se inkar hai to us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai jab tak mera sar tan se juda nahi ho jata, main is Deen ke liye barabar ladtaa rahunga ya phir Allah Taala usey laagu hi farma dega. Budail (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Quraish tak aap ki guftgu mein pohchaaunga, chunanche wo wapas huey aur Quraish ke yahan pahunchey aur kaha ke ham tumharey paas us shakhs (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ke yahan se aa rahe hain aur ham ne usey aik baat kehtey suna hai, agar tum chaho to tumharey samney usey bayan kar saktey hain. Quraish ke be-waqufon ne kaha ke hamein uski zarurat nahi ke tum us shakhs ki koi baat hamein sunao. jo log saahibur-Raaey they, unhon-ne kaha ke theek hai jo kuchh tum ne suna hai ham se bayan kar do. unhon-ne kaha ke maine usey (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ko ye kehtey suna hai aur phir jo kuchh unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha, sab bayan kar diya. is par Urwa-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) (jo us waqt tak kuffaar ke sath they) khadey huey aur kaha aey qaum ke logo ! kya tum mujh par bap ki tarah shafqat nahi rakhtey. sab ne kaha kyon nahi, zaroor rakhtey hain. Mina Urwa ne phir kaha kya main betey ki tarah tumhara khair-khaah nahi hun, unhon-ne kaha kyon nahi. Urwa ne phir kaha tum log mujh par kisi qism ki tohmat laga saktey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne puchha kya tumhen malum nahi hai ke maine Ukaaz walon ko tumhari madad ke liye kaha tha aur jab unhon-ne inkar kya to maine apne gharaaney, aulad aur un tamam logon ko tumharey paas la kar khada kar diya tha jinhoney mera kehna maanaa tha? Quraish ne kaha kyon nahi (aap ki baatein durust hain) iske baad unhon-ne kaha dekho ab us shakhs (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ne tumharey samney aik achi tajwiz rakhi hai, usey tum qabool kar lo aur mujhey uske paas ( guftgu (ke liye janey do, sab ne kaha aap zaroor jaaiye. chunanche Urwa-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se guftgu shuru ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse bhi wahi baatein kahin jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Budail se keh chukey they, Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne us waqt kaha, aey Muhammad (sl)! bataiye agar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni qaum ko tabah kar diya to kya apne se pahley kisi bhi Arab ke mutaalliq suna hai ke usne apne khandan ka naam w nishan mitaa diya ho lekin agar dusri baat waaqe hui (yani ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ghalib huey) to main Allah ki qism tumharey sathiyon ka munh dekhta hun ye mukhtalif jinson k log yahi karengey. us waqt ye sab log bhag jaeinge aur aapko tanha chhod dengey. is par Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) boley ( امصص بظر اللات ( . kya ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se bhag jaeinge aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tanha chhod dengey. Urwa ne puchha kon sahib hain? logon ne bataya ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) hain. Urwa ne kaha us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar tumhara mujh par aik ehsan na hota jiska ab tak mein badla nahi de saka hun to tumhen zaroor jawab deta. bayan kya ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir guftgu karne lagey aur guftgu kartey huey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak pakad liya kartey they. Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khadey they, talwaar latkaey huey aur sar par khud pahney. Urwa jab bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak ki taraf apna hath ley jatey to Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) talwaar ki niyaam ko iske hath par maartey aur unse kehtey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi se apna hath alag rakh. Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna sar uthaya aur puchha ye kon sahib hain? logon ne bataya ke Mugheera-bin-Sho'ba. Urwa ne unhein mukhaatab karke kaha aey daghaa baaz! kya maine teri daghaa bazi ki saza se tujh ko nahi bachaayaa? asl mein Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) (Islam laney se pahley) jahiliyat mein aik qaum ke sath rahe they phir un sab ko qatl karke unka maal ley liya tha. iske baad (Madina ( aaey aur Islam ke halqa bagosh ho gaey (to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein unka maal bhi rakh diya ke jo chaahein iske mutaalliq hukm farmaaein) lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke tera Islam to main qabool karta hun, raha ye maal to mera us se koi waasta nahi. kyonke wo daghaa bazi se hath aaya hai jisey main ley nahi sakta, phir Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ghoor-ghoor kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab ki naql w harkat dekhtey rahe. phir rawi ne bayan kya ke qism Allah ki agar kabhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne balgham bhi thooka to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab ne apne hathon par usey ley liya aur usey apne chehre aur badan par mal liya. kisi kaam ka agar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya to uski bajaa aawrii mein aik doosrey se aagey badh janey ki koshish kartey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wuzu karne lagey to aisa malum hua ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu ke pani par ladai ho jaeygi (yani har shakhs us pani ko leney ki koshish karta tha) jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guftgu karne lagey to sab par khamoshi chhaa jati. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ta'zeem ka ye haal tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathi nazar bhar kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh bhi nahi saktey they. khair Urwa jab apne sathiyon se ja kar miley to unse kaha aey logo! qism Allah ki main baadshaahon ke darbar mein bhi wafad lekar gaya hon, qaisar w Kisraa aur Najashi sab ke darbar mein lekin Allah ki qism maine kabhi nahi dekha ke kisi badshah ke sathi uski us darja ta'zeem kartey hon jitni Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ta'zeem kartey hain. qism Allah ki agar Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne balgham bhi thook diya to unke ashaab ne usey apne hathon mein ley liya aur usey apne chehra aur badan par mil liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein agar koi hukm diya to har shakhs ne usey bajaa laney mein aik doosrey par sabqat ki koshish ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar wuzu kya to aisa malum hota ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu par ladai ho jaeygi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab guftgu shuru ki to har taraf khamoshi chhaa gaee. unke dilon mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ta'zeem ka ye aalim tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko nazar bhar kar bhi nahi dekh saktey. unhon-ne tumharey samney aik bhalii sura rakhi hai, tumhen chahiye ke usey qabool kar lo. is par banu-kinaana ka aik shakhs bola ke achchha mujhey bhi unke yahan janey do, logon ne kaha tum bhi ja saktey ho. jab ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb pahunchey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye falan shakhs hai, aik aisi qaum ka fard jo Baitullah ki qurbani ke janwaron ki ta'zeem kartey hain. isliye qurbani ke janwar iske samney kar do. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne qurbani ke janwar iske samney kar diye aur labbaik kehtey huey uska istiqbaal kya jab us ne ye manzar dekha to kehney laga ke Subhan-Allah hargiz munasib nahi hai ke aisey logon ko Kaba se rokaa jaey. iske baad Quraish mein se aik doosra shakhs Makooz-bin-Hafs naam ke khada hua aur kehney laga ke mujhey bhi unke yahan janey do. sab ne kaha ke tum bhi ja saktey ho jab wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se qareeb hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye Makooz hai aik badtareen shakhs hai. phir wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se guftgu karne laga. abhi wo guftgu kar hi raha tha ke Suhail-bin-Amr aa gaya. Mina Mamar ne (pichhli sanad ke saath) bayan kya ke mujhey Ayub ne khabar di aur unhein Ikrima ne ke jab Suhail-bin-Amr aaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (nek faalii ke taur par) farmaya tumhara mamla aasan (Sahal) ho gaya. Mamar ne bayan kya ke Zohri ne apni hadis mein is tarah bayan kya tha ke jab Suhail-bin-Amr aaya to kehney laga ke hamarey aur apne darmyan (Suleh ( ki aik tahreer likh lo. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaatib ko bulwaya aur farmaya ke likho ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( Suhel kehney laga Rehman ko Allah ki qism main nahi janta ke wo kya cheez hai. albatta tum yun likh saktey ho باسمك اللهم jaisey pahley likha kartey they. musalmanon ne kaha ke qism Allah ki hamein ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم (ke siwa aur koi doosra jumla na likhnaa chahiye lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke باسمك اللهم hii likhney do. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne likhwaayaa ye Muhammad Rasulullah ki taraf se suleh naamaa ki dastaawez hai. Suhel ne kaha agar hamein ye malum hota ke aap Rasulullah hain to na ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Kaba se roktey aur na aap se jang kartey. aap to sirf itna likhiye ke ''Muhammad-bin-Abdullaah'' is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Allah gawah hai ke main uska sachcha rasool hun chahe tum mujhe jhutlaatey raho. likho ji ''Muhammad-bin-Abdullaah'' Zohri ne bayan kya ke ye sab kuchh (narmii aur riaayat) sirf Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ka nateeja tha (jo pahley Budail (Raziallahu anhu) se keh chukey they) ke Quraish mujh se jo bhi aisa mutalba karengey jis se Allah Taala ki hurmaton ki ta'zeem maqsud hogi to main unke mutaalbey ko zaroor maan loonga, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Suhel se farmaya lekin suleh ke liye pehli shart ye hogi ke tum log hamein Baitullah ke tawaaf karne ke liye janey doge. Suhel ne kaha qism Allah ki ham (is saal) aisa nahi honey dengey warna Arab kahengey ham maghloob ho gaey they (is liye ham ne ijazat de di) aainda saal ke liye ijazat hai. chunanche ye bhi likh liya. phir Suhel ne likha ke ye shart bhi (likh liijiye) ke hamari taraf ka jo shakhs bhi aap ke yahan jaeyga chahe wo aap ke Deen hi par kyon na ho aap usey hamein wapas kar dengey. musalmanon ne (ye shart sun kar kaha) sub'haan-Allaah! (eik shakhs ko) mushrikon ke hawale kis tarah kya ja sakta hai jo musalman ho kar aaya ho. abhi yahi baatein ho rahi thin ke abu-Jandal bin Suhail-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) apni bediyon ko ghaseet'tey huey aa pahunchey, wo Makka ke nashebii ilaaqey ki taraf se bhaagey they aur ab khud ko musalmanon ke samney daal diya tha. Suhel ne kaha aey Muhammad! ye pahlaa shakhs hai jiske liye (suleh naamaa ke mutaabiq) main mutalba karta hun ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein usey wapas kar dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke abhi to ham ne (suleh naame ki is baat ko) suleh naamaa mein likha bhi nahi hai (is liye jab suleh naamaa tay pa jaeyga uske baad isko laagu hona chaahiye) Suhel kehney laga ke Allah ki qism phir main kisi buniyad par bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suleh nahi karunga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya achchha mujh par us aik ko de kar ehsan kar do. usne kaha ke main is silsiley mein ehsan bhi nahi kar sakta. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi hamein ehsan kar dena chahiye lekin us ne yahi jawab diya ke main aisa kabhi nahi kar sakta. albatta makooz ne kaha ke chaliye ham iska Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ehsan kartey hain magar (uski baat nahi chalii) abu-Jandal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha muslmaanon! main musalman ho kar aaya hun. kya mujhey mushrikon ke hath mein de diya jaaeyga? kya mere sath jo aziyatein pahunchai gain thin. rawi ne bayan kya ke Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aakhir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya, kya ye waqia aur haqiqat nahi ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ke Nabi hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kyon nahi ! maine arz kya, kya ham haq par nahi hain aur kya hamarey dushman baatil par nahi hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kyon nahi ! maine kaha phir apne Deen ke mamley mein kyon dabein . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya main Allah ka rasool hon, uske hukm ki nafarmani nahi kar sakta aur wahi mera madadgaar hai. maine kaha kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se ye nahi farmatey they ke ham Baitullah jaeinge aur uska tawaaf karengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke theek hai lekin kya maine tum se ye kaha tha ke isi saal ham Baitullah pahunch jaengey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine kaha nahi (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us qaid ke sath nahi farmaya tha) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir usmein koi shuba nahi ke tum Baitullah tak zaroor pahuncho gey aur aik din iska tawaaf karogey. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaya aur unse bhi yahi puchha ke abu-Bakar! kya ye haqiqat nahi ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ke Nabi hain? unhon-ne bhi kaha ke kyon nahi. maine puchha kya ham haq par nahi hain? aur kya hamarey dushman baatil par nahi hain? unhon-ne kaha kyon nahin! maine kaha ke phir apne Deen ko kyon zaleel karein? Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : janaab! bila shak w shuba wo Allah ke rasool hain, aur apne rab ke hukm ki nafarmani nahi kar saktey aur rab hi unka madadgaar hai. to unki rassii mazbootii se pakad lo, Allah gawah hai ke wo haq par hain. Mina maine kaha kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se ye nahi kehtey they ke an-qareeb ham Baitullah pahunchengey aur iska tawaaf karengey unhon-ne farmaya ke ye bhi sahi hai lekin kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aap se ye farmaya tha ke usi saal aap Baitullah pahunch jaengey. maine kaha ke nahi. phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir usmein bhi koi shak w shuba nahi ke aap aik na aik din Baitullah pahunchengey aur uska tawaaf karengey. Zohri ne bayan kya ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya baad mein maine apni jald bazi ki bharpaaii ke liye nek aamaal kiye. phir jab suleh naame se aap farigh ho chukey to sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke ab utho aur (jin janwaron ko sath laey ho unkii) qurbani kar lo aur sar bhi mundwaa lo. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Allah gawah hai sahaba mein se aik shakhs bhi na utha aur teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye jumla farmaya. jab koi na utha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Umme-Salma ke kheme mein gaey aur unse logon ke tarze-amal ka zikr kya. Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha aey Allah ke nabii! kya aap ye pasand karengey ke bahar tashrif ley jayen aur kisi se kuchh na kahin balke apna qurbani ka janwar zabah kar lein aur apne hajjaam ko bula lein jo aap ke baal moond de. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey. kisi se kuchh nahi kaha aur sab kuchh kya, apne janwar ki qurbani kar li aur apne hajjaam ko bulwaya jisne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal moondey. jab sahaba ne dekha to wo bhi aik doosrey ke baal moondney lagey, aisa malum hota tha ke ranj w gham mein aik doosrey se lad padeingey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas (Makka se) chand momin auratein aaein to Allah Taala ne ye hukm nazil farmaya (ya أيها الذين آمنوا إذا جاءكم المؤمنات مهاجرات فامتحنوهن (aey logo! jo eman la chukey ho jab tumharey paas momin auratein hijrat karke aaein to unka imtihaan ley ( بعصم الكوافر ( tak. us din umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni 2 beeviyon ko talaaq di jo ab tak musalman na hui thin. unmein se aik ne to Muaawiya-bin-Abii-Sufiyaan (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar liya tha aur dusri se Safwaan-bin-Umayya ne. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina wapas tashrif laey to Quraish ke aik fard Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) (Makka se faraar ho kar) hazir huey. wo musalman ho chukey they. Quraish ne unhein wapas leney ke liye 2 aadmiyon ko bheja aur unhon-ne aa kar kaha ke hamarey sath aap ka muaahida ho chuka hai. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) ko wapas kar diya. Quraish ke donon afraad jab unhein wapas lekar lautey aur zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to khajoor khaney ke liye utrey jo unke sath thi. Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) ne unmein se aik se farmaya qism Allah ki tumhari talwaar bahut achi malum hoti hai. doosrey sathi ne talwaar niyaam se nikal di. us shakhs ne kaha haan Allah ki qism bahut hi zyada umda talwaar hai, main iska bahut baar tajriba kar chuka hun. Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) is par boley ke zara mujhey bhi to dikhao aur is tarah apne qabze mein kar liya phir us shakhs ne talwaar ke Malik ko aisi zarb lagai ke wo wahin thanda ho gaya. uska doosra sathi bhag kar Madina aaya aur masjid mein daudta hua dakhil hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab usey dekha to farmaya ye shakhs kuchh khof-zada malum hota hai. jab wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb pahuncha to kehney laga Allah ki qism mera sathi to maara gaya aur main bhi maara jaaunga (agar aap logon ne Abu-Baseer ko na rokaa) itney mein Abu-Baseer bhi aagey aur arz kya aey Allah ke Nabi ! Allah ki qism Allah Taala ne aap ki zimme-dari poori kar di, aap mujhey unke hawale kar chukey they lekin Allah Taala ne mujhey unse nijat dilaaii. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (teri maa ki kharaabii) agar iska koi aik bhi madadgaar hota to phir ladai ke sholey bhadak uthtey. jab unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ye alfaz suney to samajh gaey ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phir kuffaar ke hawale kar dengey isliye wahan se nikal gaey aur samandar ke kinarey par aa gaey. rawi ne bayan kya ke apne ghar walon (Makka se) chhoot kar abu-jandal-bin-Suhail (Raziallahu anhu) bhi Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) se ja miley aur ab ye haal tha ke Quraish ka jo shakhs bhi Islam laataa (bajaaey Madina aaney ke) Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan (saahile-samandar par) chala jata. is tarah se aik jamat bin gaee aur Allah gawah hai ye log Quraish ke jis qafley ke mutaalliq bhi sun letey ke wo Sham (Syria) ja raha hai to usey rastey hi mein rok kar loot letey aur qaafila walon ko qatl kar detey. ab Quraish ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan Allah aur raham ka waasta de kar darkhaast bheji ke aap kisi ko bhejiin (Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke doosrey sathiyon ke yahan ke wo Quraish ko takleefein dene se ruk jaaein) aur uske baad jo shakhs bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan jaeyga (Makka se) usey amn hai. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke yahan apna aadmi bheja aur Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmaaii وهو الذي كف أيديهم عنكم وأيديكم عنهم ببطن مكة من بعد أن أظفركم عليهم''aur wo zaat parwardigar jisne rok diya tha tumharey hathon ko unse aur unke hathon ko tum se (yani jang nahi ho saki thi) wadi Makka mein (Hudaibiya mein) baad mein iske ke tum ko ghalib kar diya tha un par yahan tak ke baat jahiliyat ke daur ki be-jaa himaayat tak pahunch gaee thii).'' unki hamiiyat ( jahiliyat ( ye thi ke unhon-ne (muaahidey mein bhi) aap ke liye Allah ke Nabi honey ka iqrar nahi kya isi tarah unhon-ne ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( nahi likhney diya aur aap Baitullah janey se rukey rahey. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par (Makka) ja rahe they, abhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rastey hi mein they, farmaya Khalid-bin Waleed Quraish ke) 200 ( sawaaron ke sath hamari naql w harkat ka andaza lagaaney ke liye maqaame-Ghameem mein muqeem hai (ye Quraish ka muqaddimatul-jaish (main army) hai) isliye tum log dahini taraf se jao, to Allah ki qism Khalid ko unke mutaalliq kuchh bhi ilm na ho saka aur jab unhon-ne us lashkar ka ghubaar uthtaa hua dekha to Quraish ko jaldi-jaldi khabar dene gaey. idhar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaltey rahe yahan tak ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us ghaati par pahunchey jis se Makka mein utartey hain to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sawari baith gaee. sahaba ontni ko uthaney ke liye hal-hal kehney lagey lekin wo apni jagah se na uthii. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qaswaa ad gaee Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya qaswaa Adi nahi aur na ye uski aadat hai, isey to us zaat ne rok liya jisne haathiyon (ke lashakr) ko (Makka) mein dakhil honey se rok liya tha. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai Quraish jo bhi aisa mutalba rakhengey jis mein Allah ki haram ki hui chizon ki badaai ho to main uska mutalba manzoor kar loonga. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ontni ko daantaa to wo uth gaee. rawi ne bayan kya ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sahaba se aagey nikal gaey aur Hudaibiya ke aakhiri kinarey Samad (eik chashma ya garhaa) par jahan pani kam tha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padao kya. log thoda thodaa pani istemal karne lagey, unhon-ne pani ko thaharney hi nahi diya, sab kheench dala. ab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se piyaas ki shikayat ki gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne tarkash mein se aik teer nikal kar diya ke us garhey mein daal dein b-khudaa teer gaadtey hi pani unhein sairaab karne ke liye ubalney laga aur wo log poori tarah sairaab ho gaey. log usi haal mein they ke Budail-bin-Warqaa Khuzai (Raziallahu anhu) apni qaum khuza'aa ke kai aadmiyon ko lekar hazir hua. ye log tahaama ke rehney waley they aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke mahrame-raaz badey khair-khaah they. unhon-ne khabar di ke main Ka'b-bin-Looii aur Aamir-bin-Looii ko peechhey chhod kar aa raha hun. jinhoney Hudaibiya ke pani ke zakheeron par apna padao daal diya hai, unke sath kasrat se doodh dene wali oontniyan apne naey-naey bachchon ke sath hain. wo aap se ladengey aur aap ke Baitullah pahunchne mein rukawat banengey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ham kisi se ladney nahi aaey hain sirf Umra ke iraadey se aaey hain aur waqia to ye hai (musalsal ladaaiyon) ne Quraish ko bhi kamzor kar diya hai aur unhein bada nuqsan uthana padaa hai, ab agar wo chaahein to main aik muddat unse suleh ka muaahida kar loonga, us arse mein wo mere aur Awam (kuffaar mushrekeene-arab) ke darmyan na padein phir agar main kaamyaab ho jaun aur (uske baad) wo chaahein to is Deen (Islam) mein wo bhi dakhil ho saktey hain (jis main aur tamam log dakhil ho chukey hongey) lekin agar mujhey kamiyabi nahi hui to unhein bhi aaraam mil jaeyga aur agar unhein meri pesh-kash se inkar hai to us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai jab tak mera sar tan se juda nahi ho jata, main is Deen ke liye barabar ladtaa rahunga ya phir Allah Taala usey laagu hi farma dega. Budail (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Quraish tak aap ki guftgu mein pohchaaunga, chunanche wo wapas huey aur Quraish ke yahan pahunchey aur kaha ke ham tumharey paas us shakhs (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ke yahan se aa rahe hain aur ham ne usey aik baat kehtey suna hai, agar tum chaho to tumharey samney usey bayan kar saktey hain. Quraish ke be-waqufon ne kaha ke hamein uski zarurat nahi ke tum us shakhs ki koi baat hamein sunao. jo log saahibur-Raaey they, unhon-ne kaha ke theek hai jo kuchh tum ne suna hai ham se bayan kar do. unhon-ne kaha ke maine usey (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ko ye kehtey suna hai aur phir jo kuchh unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha, sab bayan kar diya. is par Urwa-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) (jo us waqt tak kuffaar ke sath they) khadey huey aur kaha aey qaum ke logo ! kya tum mujh par bap ki tarah shafqat nahi rakhtey. sab ne kaha kyon nahi, zaroor rakhtey hain. Urwa ne phir kaha kya main betey ki tarah tumhara khair-khaah nahi hun, unhon-ne kaha kyon nahi. Urwa ne phir kaha tum log mujh par kisi qism ki tohmat laga saktey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. unhon-ne puchha kya tumhen malum nahi hai ke maine Ukaaz walon ko tumhari madad ke liye kaha tha aur jab unhon-ne inkar kya to maine apne gharaaney, aulad aur un tamam logon ko tumharey paas la kar khada kar diya tha jinhoney mera kehna maanaa tha? Quraish ne kaha kyon nahi (aap ki baatein durust hain) iske baad unhon-ne kaha dekho ab us shakhs (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam)) ne tumharey samney aik achi tajwiz rakhi hai, usey tum qabool kar lo aur mujhey uske paas ( guftgu (ke liye janey do, sab ne kaha aap zaroor jaaiye. chunanche Urwa-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se guftgu shuru ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse bhi wahi baatein kahin jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Budail se keh chukey they, Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne us waqt kaha, aey Muhammad (sl)! bataiye agar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni qaum ko tabah kar diya to kya apne se pahley kisi bhi Arab ke mutaalliq suna hai ke usne apne khandan ka naam w nishan mitaa diya ho lekin agar dusri baat waaqe hui (yani ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ghalib huey) to main Allah ki qism tumharey sathiyon ka munh dekhta hun ye mukhtalif jinson k log yahi karengey. us waqt ye sab log bhag jaeinge aur aapko tanha chhod dengey. is par Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) boley ( امصص بظر اللات ( . kya ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas se bhag jaeinge aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tanha chhod dengey. Urwa ne puchha kon sahib hain? logon ne bataya ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) hain. Urwa ne kaha us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai agar tumhara mujh par aik ehsan na hota jiska ab tak mein badla nahi de saka hun to tumhen zaroor jawab deta. bayan kya ke wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se phir guftgu karne lagey aur guftgu kartey huey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak pakad liya kartey they. Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas khadey they, talwaar latkaey huey aur sar par khud pahney. Urwa jab bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi Mubarak ki taraf apna hath ley jatey to Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) talwaar ki niyaam ko iske hath par maartey aur unse kehtey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki dadhi se apna hath alag rakh. Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne apna sar uthaya aur puchha ye kon sahib hain? logon ne bataya ke Mugheera-bin-Sho'ba. Urwa ne unhein mukhaatab karke kaha aey daghaa baaz! kya maine teri daghaa bazi ki saza se tujh ko nahi bachaayaa? asl mein Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) (Islam laney se pahley) jahiliyat mein aik qaum ke sath rahe they phir un sab ko qatl karke unka maal ley liya tha. iske baad (Madina ( aaey aur Islam ke halqa bagosh ho gaey (to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein unka maal bhi rakh diya ke jo chaahein iske mutaalliq hukm farmaaein) lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke tera Islam to main qabool karta hun, raha ye maal to mera us se koi waasta nahi. kyonke wo daghaa bazi se hath aaya hai jisey main ley nahi sakta, phir Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ghoor-ghoor kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab ki naql w harkat dekhtey rahe. phir rawi ne bayan kya ke qism Allah ki agar kabhi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne balgham bhi thooka to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab ne apne hathon par usey ley liya aur usey apne chehre aur badan par mal liya. kisi kaam ka agar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya to uski bajaa aawrii mein aik doosrey se aagey badh janey ki koshish kartey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wuzu karne lagey to aisa malum hua ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu ke pani par ladai ho jaeygi (yani har shakhs us pani ko leney ki koshish karta tha) jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) guftgu karne lagey to sab par khamoshi chhaa jati. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ta'zeem ka ye haal tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sathi nazar bhar kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh bhi nahi saktey they. khair Urwa jab apne sathiyon se ja kar miley to unse kaha aey logo! qism Allah ki main baadshaahon ke darbar mein bhi wafad lekar gaya hon, qaisar w Kisraa aur Najashi sab ke darbar mein lekin Allah ki qism maine kabhi nahi dekha ke kisi badshah ke sathi uski us darja ta'zeem kartey hon jitni Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ta'zeem kartey hain. qism Allah ki agar Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne balgham bhi thook diya to unke ashaab ne usey apne hathon mein ley liya aur usey apne chehra aur badan par mil liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein agar koi hukm diya to har shakhs ne usey bajaa laney mein aik doosrey par sabqat ki koshish ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar wuzu kya to aisa malum hota ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wuzu par ladai ho jaeygi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab guftgu shuru ki to har taraf khamoshi chhaa gaee. unke dilon mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ta'zeem ka ye aalim tha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko nazar bhar kar bhi nahi dekh saktey. unhon-ne tumharey samney aik bhalii sura rakhi hai, tumhen chahiye ke usey qabool kar lo. is par banu-kinaana ka aik shakhs bola ke achchha mujhey bhi unke yahan janey do, logon ne kaha tum bhi ja saktey ho. jab ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ashaab (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb pahunchey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye falan shakhs hai, aik aisi qaum ka fard jo Baitullah ki qurbani ke janwaron ki ta'zeem kartey hain. isliye qurbani ke janwar iske samney kar do. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne qurbani ke janwar iske samney kar diye aur labbaik kehtey huey uska istiqbaal kya jab us ne ye manzar dekha to kehney laga ke Subhan-Allah hargiz munasib nahi hai ke aisey logon ko Kaba se rokaa jaey. iske baad Quraish mein se aik doosra shakhs Makooz-bin-Hafs naam ke khada hua aur kehney laga ke mujhey bhi unke yahan janey do. sab ne kaha ke tum bhi ja saktey ho jab wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se qareeb hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye Makooz hai aik badtareen shakhs hai. phir wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se guftgu karne laga. abhi wo guftgu kar hi raha tha ke Suhail-bin-Amr aa gaya. Mamar ne (pichhli sanad ke saath) bayan kya ke mujhey Ayub ne khabar di aur unhein Ikrima ne ke jab Suhail-bin-Amr aaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (nek faalii ke taur par) farmaya tumhara mamla aasan (Sahal) ho gaya. Mamar ne bayan kya ke Zohri ne apni hadis mein is tarah bayan kya tha ke jab Suhail-bin-Amr aaya to kehney laga ke hamarey aur apne darmyan (Suleh ( ki aik tahreer likh lo. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaatib ko bulwaya aur farmaya ke likho ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم ( Suhel kehney laga Rehman ko Allah ki qism main nahi janta ke wo kya cheez hai. albatta tum yun likh saktey ho باسمك اللهم jaisey pahley likha kartey they. musalmanon ne kaha ke qism Allah ki hamein ( بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم (ke siwa aur koi doosra jumla na likhnaa chahiye lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke باسمك اللهم hii likhney do. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne likhwaayaa ye Muhammad Rasulullah ki taraf se suleh naamaa ki dastaawez hai. Suhel ne kaha agar hamein ye malum hota ke aap Rasulullah hain to na ham Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Kaba se roktey aur na aap se jang kartey. aap to sirf itna likhiye ke ''Muhammad-bin-Abdullaah'' is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Allah gawah hai ke main uska sachcha rasool hun chahe tum mujhe jhutlaatey raho. likho ji ''Muhammad-bin-Abdullaah'' Zohri ne bayan kya ke ye sab kuchh (narmii aur riaayat) sirf Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ka nateeja tha (jo pahley Budail (Raziallahu anhu) se keh chukey they) ke Quraish mujh se jo bhi aisa mutalba karengey jis se Allah Taala ki hurmaton ki ta'zeem maqsud hogi to main unke mutaalbey ko zaroor maan loonga, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Suhel se farmaya lekin suleh ke liye pehli shart ye hogi ke tum log hamein Baitullah ke tawaaf karne ke liye janey doge. Suhel ne kaha qism Allah ki ham (is saal) aisa nahi honey dengey warna Arab kahengey ham maghloob ho gaey they (is liye ham ne ijazat de di) aainda saal ke liye ijazat hai. chunanche ye bhi likh liya. phir Suhel ne likha ke ye shart bhi (likh liijiye) ke hamari taraf ka jo shakhs bhi aap ke yahan jaeyga chahe wo aap ke Deen hi par kyon na ho aap usey hamein wapas kar dengey. musalmanon ne (ye shart sun kar kaha) sub'haan-Allaah! (eik shakhs ko) mushrikon ke hawale kis tarah kya ja sakta hai jo musalman ho kar aaya ho. abhi yahi baatein ho rahi thin ke abu-Jandal bin Suhail-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) apni bediyon ko ghaseet'tey huey aa pahunchey, wo Makka ke nashebii ilaaqey ki taraf se bhaagey they aur ab khud ko musalmanon ke samney daal diya tha. Suhel ne kaha aey Muhammad! ye pahlaa shakhs hai jiske liye (suleh naamaa ke mutaabiq) main mutalba karta hun ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein usey wapas kar dein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke abhi to ham ne (suleh naame ki is baat ko) suleh naamaa mein likha bhi nahi hai (is liye jab suleh naamaa tay pa jaeyga uske baad isko laagu hona chaahiye) Suhel kehney laga ke Allah ki qism phir main kisi buniyad par bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suleh nahi karunga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya achchha mujh par us aik ko de kar ehsan kar do. usne kaha ke main is silsiley mein ehsan bhi nahi kar sakta. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi hamein ehsan kar dena chahiye lekin us ne yahi jawab diya ke main aisa kabhi nahi kar sakta. albatta makooz ne kaha ke chaliye ham iska Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par ehsan kartey hain magar (uski baat nahi chalii) abu-Jandal (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha muslmaanon! main musalman ho kar aaya hun. kya mujhey mushrikon ke hath mein de diya jaaeyga? kya mere sath jo aziyatein pahunchai gain thin. rawi ne bayan kya ke Umar-bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aakhir main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya, kya ye waqia aur haqiqat nahi ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ke Nabi hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kyon nahi ! maine arz kya, kya ham haq par nahi hain aur kya hamarey dushman baatil par nahi hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kyon nahi ! maine kaha phir apne Deen ke mamley mein kyon dabein . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya main Allah ka rasool hon, uske hukm ki nafarmani nahi kar sakta aur wahi mera madadgaar hai. maine kaha kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se ye nahi farmatey they ke ham Baitullah jaeinge aur uska tawaaf karengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke theek hai lekin kya maine tum se ye kaha tha ke isi saal ham Baitullah pahunch jaengey. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine kaha nahi (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us qaid ke sath nahi farmaya tha) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir usmein koi shuba nahi ke tum Baitullah tak zaroor pahuncho gey aur aik din iska tawaaf karogey. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaya aur unse bhi yahi puchha ke abu-Bakar! kya ye haqiqat nahi ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ke Nabi hain? unhon-ne bhi kaha ke kyon nahi. maine puchha kya ham haq par nahi hain? aur kya hamarey dushman baatil par nahi hain? unhon-ne kaha kyon nahin! maine kaha ke phir apne Deen ko kyon zaleel karein? Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : janaab! bila shak w shuba wo Allah ke rasool hain, aur apne rab ke hukm ki nafarmani nahi kar saktey aur rab hi unka madadgaar hai. to unki rassii mazbootii se pakad lo, Allah gawah hai ke wo haq par hain. maine kaha kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se ye nahi kehtey they ke an-qareeb ham Baitullah pahunchengey aur iska tawaaf karengey unhon-ne farmaya ke ye bhi sahi hai lekin kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aap se ye farmaya tha ke usi saal aap Baitullah pahunch jaengey. maine kaha ke nahi. phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha phir usmein bhi koi shak w shuba nahi ke aap aik na aik din Baitullah pahunchengey aur uska tawaaf karengey. Zohri ne bayan kya ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya baad mein maine apni jald bazi ki bharpaaii ke liye nek aamaal kiye. phir jab suleh naame se aap farigh ho chukey to sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke ab utho aur (jin janwaron ko sath laey ho unkii) qurbani kar lo aur sar bhi mundwaa lo. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Allah gawah hai sahaba mein se aik shakhs bhi na utha aur teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye jumla farmaya. jab koi na utha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Umme-Salma ke kheme mein gaey aur unse logon ke tarze-amal ka zikr kya. Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha aey Allah ke nabii! kya aap ye pasand karengey ke bahar tashrif ley jayen aur kisi se kuchh na kahin balke apna qurbani ka janwar zabah kar lein aur apne hajjaam ko bula lein jo aap ke baal moond de. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey. kisi se kuchh nahi kaha aur sab kuchh kya, apne janwar ki qurbani kar li aur apne hajjaam ko bulwaya jisne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baal moondey. jab sahaba ne dekha to wo bhi aik doosrey ke baal moondney lagey, aisa malum hota tha ke ranj w gham mein aik doosrey se lad padeingey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas (Makka se) chand momin auratein aaein to Allah Taala ne ye hukm nazil farmaya (ya أيها الذين آمنوا إذا جاءكم المؤمنات مهاجرات فامتحنوهن (aey logo! jo eman la chukey ho jab tumharey paas momin auratein hijrat karke aaein to unka imtihaan ley ( بعصم الكوافر ( tak. us din umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni 2 beeviyon ko talaaq di jo ab tak musalman na hui thin. unmein se aik ne to Muaawiya-bin-Abii-Sufiyaan (Raziallahu anhu) se nikah kar liya tha aur dusri se Safwaan-bin-Umayya ne. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina wapas tashrif laey to Quraish ke aik fard Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) (Makka se faraar ho kar) hazir huey. wo musalman ho chukey they. Quraish ne unhein wapas leney ke liye 2 aadmiyon ko bheja aur unhon-ne aa kar kaha ke hamarey sath aap ka muaahida ho chuka hai. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) ko wapas kar diya. Quraish ke donon afraad jab unhein wapas lekar lautey aur zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to khajoor khaney ke liye utrey jo unke sath thi. Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) ne unmein se aik se farmaya qism Allah ki tumhari talwaar bahut achi malum hoti hai. doosrey sathi ne talwaar niyaam se nikal di. us shakhs ne kaha haan Allah ki qism bahut hi zyada umda talwaar hai, main iska bahut baar tajriba kar chuka hun. Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) is par boley ke zara mujhey bhi to dikhao aur is tarah apne qabze mein kar liya phir us shakhs ne talwaar ke Malik ko aisi zarb lagai ke wo wahin thanda ho gaya. uska doosra sathi bhag kar Madina aaya aur masjid mein daudta hua dakhil hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab usey dekha to farmaya ye shakhs kuchh khof-zada malum hota hai. jab wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb pahuncha to kehney laga Allah ki qism mera sathi to maara gaya aur main bhi maara jaaunga (agar aap logon ne Abu-Baseer ko na rokaa) itney mein Abu-Baseer bhi aagey aur arz kya aey Allah ke Nabi ! Allah ki qism Allah Taala ne aap ki zimme-dari poori kar di, aap mujhey unke hawale kar chukey they lekin Allah Taala ne mujhey unse nijat dilaaii. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (teri maa ki kharaabii) agar iska koi aik bhi madadgaar hota to phir ladai ke sholey bhadak uthtey. jab unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ye alfaz suney to samajh gaey ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) phir kuffaar ke hawale kar dengey isliye wahan se nikal gaey aur samandar ke kinarey par aa gaey. rawi ne bayan kya ke apne ghar walon (Makka se) chhoot kar abu-jandal-bin-Suhail (Raziallahu anhu) bhi Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) se ja miley aur ab ye haal tha ke Quraish ka jo shakhs bhi Islam laataa (bajaaey Madina aaney ke) Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan (saahile-samandar par) chala jata. is tarah se aik jamat bin gaee aur Allah gawah hai ye log Quraish ke jis qafley ke mutaalliq bhi sun letey ke wo Sham (Syria) ja raha hai to usey rastey hi mein rok kar loot letey aur qaafila walon ko qatl kar detey. ab Quraish ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan Allah aur raham ka waasta de kar darkhaast bheji ke aap kisi ko bhejiin (Abu-Baseer (Raziallahu anhu) aur unke doosrey sathiyon ke yahan ke wo Quraish ko takleefein dene se ruk jaaein) aur uske baad jo shakhs bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan jaeyga (Makka se) usey amn hai. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke yahan apna aadmi bheja aur Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmaaii وهو الذي كف أيديهم عنكم وأيديكم عنهم ببطن مكة من بعد أن أظفركم عليهم''aur wo zaat parwardigar jisne rok diya tha tumharey hathon ko unse aur unke hathon ko tum se (yani jang nahi ho saki thi) wadi Makka mein (Hudaibiya mein) baad mein iske ke tum ko ghalib kar diya tha un par yahan tak ke baat jahiliyat ke daur ki be-jaa himaayat tak pahunch gaee thii).'' unki hamiiyat ( jahiliyat ( ye thi ke unhon-ne (muaahidey mein bhi) aap ke liye Allah ke Nabi honey ka iqrar nahi kya isi tarah unhon-ne ( بسم الله الرحمن"
"2788, 2789","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan tashrif ley jaya kartey they (ye Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khala thin jo Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thiin) aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein khana pesh kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar se juein nikalney lagiin, us waqt mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey, jab bedaar huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa rahe they. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya maine puchha ya Rasulullah ! kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney is tarah pesh kiye gaey ke wo Allah ke rastey mein jang karne ke liye dariya ke beech mein sawar is tarah ja rahe hain jis tarah badshah takht par hotey hain ya jaisey badshah takhte-rawaan par Sawar hotey hain ye shak Ishaq rawi ko tha. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! aap dua farmaiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unhiin mein se kar de, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye dua farmai phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar rakh kar so gaey, us martaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar huey to muskuraa rahe they. maine puchha ya Rasulullah! kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney is tarah pesh kiye gaey ke wo Allah ki raah mein jang ke liye ja rahe hain pahley ki tarah , us martaba bhi farmaya unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unhein mein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke to sabse pehli fauj mein shamil hogi (jo pani ke rastey se jihad karegii) chunanche Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamane mein umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne pani ka safar kya phir jab samandar se bahar aaiin to unki sawari ne unhein nichey gira diya aur usi haadise mein unki maut ho gaee. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan tashrif ley jaya kartey they (ye Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khala thin jo Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thiin) aik din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein khana pesh kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sar se juein nikalney lagiin, us waqt mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey, jab bedaar huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa rahe they. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya maine puchha ya Rasulullah ! kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney is tarah pesh kiye gaey ke wo Allah ke rastey mein jang karne ke liye dariya ke beech mein sawar is tarah ja rahe hain jis tarah badshah takht par hotey hain ya jaisey badshah takhte-rawaan par Sawar hotey hain ye shak Ishaq rawi ko tha. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! aap dua farmaiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unhiin mein se kar de, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye dua farmai phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar rakh kar so gaey, us martaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar huey to muskuraa rahe they. maine puchha ya Rasulullah! kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney is tarah pesh kiye gaey ke wo Allah ki raah mein jang ke liye ja rahe hain pahley ki tarah , us martaba bhi farmaya unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unhein mein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke to sabse pehli fauj mein shamil hogi (jo pani ke rastey se jihad karegii) chunanche Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamane mein umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne pani ka safar kya phir jab samandar se bahar aaiin to unki sawari ne unhein nichey gira diya aur usi haadise mein unki maut ho gaii."
"2799, 2800","aik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere qareeb hi so gaey. phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar huey to muskuraa rahe they, meine arz kya ke aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? farmaya meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney pesh kiye gaey jo jang karne ke liye us bahte dariya par Sawar ho kar ja rahe they jaisey badshah takht par chadhtey hain. maine arz kya phir aap mere liye bhi dua kar dijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unhiin mein se bana de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye dua farmai. phir dobara Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur pahley hi ki tarah us martaba bhi kya ( bedaar hotey huey muskuraaey ( umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne pahley hi ki tarah us martaba bhi kaha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahi jawab diya. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya aap dua kar dein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unhein mein se bana de to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum sabse pahley lashkar ke sath hogi chunanche wo apne shauhar Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath musalmanon ke sabse pahley behrii (paanii key) bedey mein Sharik huin Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamaney mein jang se laut'tey waqt jab Sham (Syria) ke saahil par lashkar utra to umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb aik sawari laai gaee taake is par Sawar ho jayen lekin janwar ne unhein gira diya aur usi mein unka intiqal ho gaya. eik din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere qareeb hi so gaey. phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar huey to muskuraa rahe they, meine arz kya ke aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? farmaya meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney pesh kiye gaey jo jang karne ke liye us bahte dariya par Sawar ho kar ja rahe they jaisey badshah takht par chadhtey hain. maine arz kya phir aap mere liye bhi dua kar dijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unhiin mein se bana de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye dua farmai. phir dobara Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur pahley hi ki tarah us martaba bhi kya ( bedaar hotey huey muskuraaey ( umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne pahley hi ki tarah us martaba bhi kaha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahi jawab diya. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya aap dua kar dein ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unhein mein se bana de to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum sabse pahley lashkar ke sath hogi chunanche wo apne shauhar Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath musalmanon ke sabse pahley behrii (paanii key) bedey mein Sharik huin Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamaney mein jang se laut'tey waqt jab Sham (Syria) ke saahil par lashkar utra to umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb aik sawari laai gaee taake is par Sawar ho jayen lekin janwar ne unhein gira diya aur usi mein unka intiqal ho gayaa."
"2805, 2806","mere chacha Anas-bin-Nazar (Raziallahu anhu) badr ki ladai mein hazir na ho sakey, isliye unhon-ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! main pehli ladai hi se ghayab raha jo aap ne mushrekeen ke khilaf ladii lekin agar ab Allah Taala ne mujhey mushrekeen ke khilaf kisi ladai mein haziri ka mauqa diya to Allah Taala dekh lega ke main kya karta hun. phir jab Uhud ki ladai ka mauqa aaya aur musalman bhag nikley to Anas-bin-Nazar ne kaha ke aey Allaah! jo kuchh musalmanon ne kya main us se ma'zirat karta hun aur jo kuchh un mushrekeen ne kya hai main us se bezaar hun. phir wo aagey badhey (mushrekeen ki taraf) to Sad-bin-Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se saamnaa hua. unse Anas-bin-Nazar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aey Sa'd-bin-Muaaz! main to jannat mein jana chahta hun aur nazar (unke baap) ke rab ki qism mein jannat ki khushbu Uhud pahaad ke qareeb paata hun. Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ya Rasulullah (sl)! jo unhon-ne kar dikhaya uski mujh mein himmat na thi. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke iske baad jab Anas-bin-Nazar (Raziallahu anhu) ko ham ne paya to talwaar neze aur teer ke taqriban assii zakhm unke jism par they wo Shahid ho chukey they mushrikon ne unke aaza kaat diye they aur koi shakhs unhein pehchan na saka tha, sirf unki behan ungliyon se unhein pehchan saki thin. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ham samajhtey hain (ya aap ne bajaey ( نرى ( ke) نظن ( kaha ( matlab aik hi hai ke ye aayat unke aur un jaisey momineen ke barey mein nazil hui thi ke من المؤمنين رجال صدقوا ما عاهدوا الله عليه''mominon mein kuchh wo log hain jinhoney apne us waadey ko sachcha kar dikhaya jo unhon-ne Allah Taala se kya tha.'' aakhir aayat tak. Anas-bin-Nazar (Raziallahu anhu) ki aik behan Rabe naam ke (Raziallahu anhu) ne kisi khatun ke aagey ke daant tod diye they, isliye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse qisaas leney ka hukm diya. Anas-bin-Nazar (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ya Rasulullah! us zaat ki qism jisne aapko haq ke sath Nabi banaya hai) qisaas mein) unke daant na tootengey. chunanche muddaii taawaan leney par razi ho gaey aur qisaas ka khayal chhod diya, is par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke kuchh bandey hain ke agar wo Allah ka naam lekar qism kha lein to Allah khud unki qism poori kar deta hai."
"2877, 2878","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan ke yahan tashrif le gaey aur unke yahan takiya laga kar so gaey phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( uthey to ( muskuraa rahe they. umme-Haraam ne puchha ya Rasulullah ! aap kyon hans rahe they? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab diya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke rastey mein (jihad ke liye) sabz samandar par Sawar ho rahe hain unki misal (duniyaa ya aakhirat mein) takht par baithey huey baadshaahon ki si hai. unhon-ne arz kya ya Rasulullah ! Allah Taala se dua farma dijiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki aey Allah ! unhein bhi un logon mein se kar de phir dobara Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) letey aur) uthey ( to muskuraa rahe they. unhon-ne us martaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se wahi sawal kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi pehli hi wjah bataaii. unhon-ne phir arz kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua kar dijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein se kar de, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum sabse pahley lashkar mein Sharik hogi aur ye ke baad walon mein tumhari shirkat nahi hai. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir aap ne (umme-Haraam ne) Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath nikah kar liya aur binte-Qarz Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi ke sath unhon-ne dariya ka safar kya. phir jab wapas huin aur apni sawari par chadhiin to usne unki gardan tod daalii. wo us sawari se gir gain aur (usi mein) unki maut hui. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan ke yahan tashrif le gaey aur unke yahan takiya laga kar so gaey phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ( uthey to ( muskuraa rahe they. umme-Haraam ne puchha ya Rasulullah ! aap kyon hans rahe they? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jawab diya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke rastey mein (jihad ke liye) sabz samandar par Sawar ho rahe hain unki misal (duniyaa ya aakhirat mein) takht par baithey huey baadshaahon ki si hai. unhon-ne arz kya ya Rasulullah ! Allah Taala se dua farma dijiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki aey Allah ! unhein bhi un logon mein se kar de phir dobara Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) letey aur) uthey ( to muskuraa rahe they. unhon-ne us martaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se wahi sawal kya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi pehli hi wjah bataaii. unhon-ne phir arz kya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dua kar dijiye ke Allah Taala mujhey bhi unmein se kar de, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum sabse pahley lashkar mein Sharik hogi aur ye ke baad walon mein tumhari shirkat nahi hai. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke phir aap ne (umme-Haraam ne) Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath nikah kar liya aur binte-Qarz Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki biwi ke sath unhon-ne dariya ka safar kya. phir jab wapas huin aur apni sawari par chadhiin to usne unki gardan tod daalii. wo us sawari se gir gain aur (usi mein) unki maut huii."
"2894, 2895","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din unke ghar tashrif la kar qailula farmaya tha. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar huey to hans rahe they. unhon-ne puchha ya Rasulullah ! kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? farmaya mujhey apni ummat mein aik aisi qaum ko) khuwab mein dekh kar) khushi hui jo samandar main ( jang ke liye) is tarah ja rahe they jaisey badshah takht par baithey hun. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi wo unmein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum bhi unmein se ho. iske baad phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur jab bedaar huey to phir hans rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us martaba bhi wahi baat bataaii. aisa 2 ya teen baar hua. maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum sabse pahley lashkar ke sath hogi wo Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thin aur wo unko (Islam ke sabse pahley behrii bedey ke saath) jang mein le gaey, waapsii mein sawar honey ke liye apni sawari se qareeb huin (sawaar hotey huey ya sawar honey ke baad) gir padiin jis se aap ki gardan toot gaee aur shahadat ki maut paaii. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din unke ghar tashrif la kar qailula farmaya tha. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bedaar huey to hans rahe they. unhon-ne puchha ya Rasulullah ! kis baat par aap hans rahe hain? farmaya mujhey apni ummat mein aik aisi qaum ko) khuwab mein dekh kar) khushi hui jo samandar main ( jang ke liye) is tarah ja rahe they jaisey badshah takht par baithey hun. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi wo unmein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum bhi unmein se ho. iske baad phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur jab bedaar huey to phir hans rahe they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us martaba bhi wahi baat bataaii. aisa 2 ya teen baar hua. maine kaha : aey Allah ke rasool! Allah Taala se dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum sabse pahley lashkar ke sath hogi wo Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ke nikah mein thin aur wo unko (Islam ke sabse pahley behrii bedey ke saath) jang mein le gaey, waapsii mein sawar honey ke liye apni sawari se qareeb huin (sawaar hotey huey ya sawar honey ke baad) gir padiin jis se aap ki gardan toot gaee aur shahadat ki maut paaii."
"2906, 2907","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere yahan tashrif laey to 2 ladkiyan mere paas jang Buaas ke geet ga rahi thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bistar par let gaey aur chehra Mubarak dusri taraf kar liya iske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aagey aur aap ne mujhey daantaa ke ye shaitaanii gaanaa aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki maujoodgii mein! lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ke unhein gaaney do, phir jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) dusri taraf mutwajjeh ho gaey to maine un ladkiyon ko ishara kya aur wo chali gaiin. eid ke din soodaan ke kuchh sahaba dhaal aur haraab ka khel dikhaa rahe they, ab ya maine khud Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hi farmaya ke tum bhi dekhnaa chahti ho? maine kaha ji haan. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey apne peechhey khada kar liya, mera chehra Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chehra par tha (is tarah mein peechhey pardey se khel ko b-khoobii dekh sakti thi) aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they : ''khoob banu-arfada!'' jab main thak gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''bas?'' maine kaha ji haan, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : ''to phir jaao.'' Ahmed ne bayan kya aur unse ibne-wahab ne (abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke aaney ke baad dusri taraf mutwajjeh ho janey ke liye lafz (amal) ke bajaey) (فلما"
"2940, 2941","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaisar ko aik khat likha jis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey Islam ki dawat di thi. Dahiya Kalbi (Raziallahu anhu) ko Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne maktoob de kar bheja aur unhein hukm diya ke maktoob Basra ke governer ke hawale kar dein wo usey qaisar tak pahuncha dega. jab Faaris ki fauj (iske muqaabley mein) shikast kha kar peechhey hat gaee thi (aur iske mulk ke maqbooza ilaaqey wapas mil gaey they) to us inaam ke shukraane ke taur par jo Allah Taala ne (iska mulk usey wapas de kar) is par kya tha abhi qaisar teiswin se iiliyaa (baitul-maqdis) tak paidal chal kar aaya tha. jab uske paas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka naamaa Mubarak pahuncha aur uske samney padha gaya to usne kaha ke agar unki (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki) qaum ka koi shakhs yahan ho to usey talash karke lao taake main us rasool ke mutaalliq us se kuchh sawalat karun. Quraish ke aik qafley ke sath wo un dinon Sham (Syria) mein muqeem they. ye qaafila us daur mein yahan tijarat ki gharaz se aaya tha jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur kuffaare-Quraish mein aapasii suleh ho chuki thi. (Suleh Hudaibiya ( Abu-Sufiyan ne kaha ke qaisar ke aadmi ki ham se Sham (Syria) ke aik maqam par mulaqat hui aur wo mujhey aur mere sathiyon ko apne ( qaisar ke darbar mein baitul-maqdis ( lekar chala phir jab ham iiliyaa ( baitul-maqdis ( pahunchey to qaisar ke darbar mein hamein bulaya gaya. us waqt qaisar darbar mein betha hua tha. uske sar par taaj tha aur Rome (mojooda Itly) ke ameer uske aas-paas they, us ne apne tarjuman se kaha ke unse poochho ke jinhoney unke yahan nabwooat ka dawa kya hai nasb ke eitibaar se unse qareeb unmein se kon shakhs hai? Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke maine kaha, main nasb ke eitibaar se unke zyada qareeb hun. qaisar ne puchha tumhari aur unki qaraabat kya hai? maine kaha ( rishtey mein) wo mere chacha zaad bhai hotey hain, ittifaq tha ke us martaba qafley mein mere siwa bani abd munaaf ka aur aadmi maujood nahi tha. qaisar ne kaha ke us shakhs ( Abu-Sufiyan (Raziallahu anhu)) ko mujh se qareeb kar do aur jo log mere sath they uske hukm se mere peechhey qareeb mein khadey kar diye gaey. uske baad us ne apne tarjuman se kaha ke us shakhs (abu-Sufiyaan) ke sathiyon se keh do ke us se main un sahib ke barey mein poochhunga jo Nabi honey ke muddaii hain, agar ye unke barey mein koi jhoot baat kahey to tum fauran usko jhutlaa do. Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke Allah ki qism ! agar us din is baat ki sharm na hoti ke kahin mere sathi meri takzeeb na kar baithein to main un sawalat ke jawabaat mein zaroor jhoot bol jata jo usney Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke barey mein kiye they, lekin mujhey to uska khatrah laga raha ke kahin mujhey jhutlaa na dein. isliye maine sachchai se kaam liya. iske baad us ne apne tarjuman se kaha us se poochho ke tum logon mein un sahib (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka nasb kaisa samjha jata hai? maine bataya ke ham mein unka nasb bahut umda samjha jata hai. us ne puchha achchha ye nabwooat ka dawa us se pahley bhi tumharey yahan kisi ne kya tha? maine kaha ke nahi. us ne puchha kya us da'we se pahley un par koi jhoot ka ilzam tha? maine kaha ke nahi, us ne puchha unke bap daadon mein koi badshah guzra hai? maine kaha nahi. us ne puchha to ab badey ameer log unki ittaba (pairvi) kartey hain ya kamzor aur kam haisiyat ke log ? maine kaha ke kamzor aur maamooli haisiyat ke log hi unke ( zyada tar manney waley hain) us ne puchha ke iske manney walon ki tadaad badhtii rehti hai ya ghat'tii ja rahi hai? maine kaha ji nahi tadaad barabar badhtii ja rahi hai. us ne puchha koi unke Deen se bezaar ho kar Islam laney ke baad phir bhi gaya hai kiya? maine kaha ke nahi, us ne puchha unhon-ne kabhi wada khilaafii bhi ki hai? maine kaha ke nahi lekin aaj kal hamara unse aik muaahida ho raha hai aur hamein unki taraf se muaahide ki khilaaf-warzii ka khatrah hai. Abu-Sufiyan ne kaha ke poori guftgu mein siwa iske aur koi aisa mauqa nahi mila jis mein main koi aisi baat mila sakun jis se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tauheen ho. aur apne sathiyon ki taraf se bhi jhutlaaney ka dar na ho. us ne phir puchha kya tum ne kabhi unse ladai ki hai ya unhon-ne tum se jang ki hai? maine kaha ke haan, us ne puchha tumhari ladai ka kya nateeja nikalta hai? maine kaha ladai mein hamesha kisi aik giroh ne fateh nahi hasil ki. kabhi wo hamein maghloob kar letey hain aur kabhi ham unhein, us ne puchha wo tumhen kin kaamon ka hukm detey hain? kaha hamein wo iska hukm detey hain ke ham sirf Allah ki ibadat karein aur iska kisi ko bhi Sharik na thehraein , hamein un buton ki ibadat se mana kartey hain jinki hamarey bap dada ibadat kya kartey they, Namaz , sadqa , paak bazi w marawwat, wafaa, ahad aur amanat ke ada karne ka hukm detey hain. jab main usey ye tamam baatein bata chuka to usne apne tarjuman se kaha, unse kaho ke maine tum se un (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nasb ke mutaalliq malum kya to tum ne bataya ke wo tumharey yahan saahibe-nasb aur sharif samjhey jatey hain aur anbiya bhi yun hi apni qaum ke aalaa nasb mein paida kiye jatey hain. maine tum se ye puchha tha ke kya nabwooat ka dawa tumharey yahan us se pahley bhi kisi ne kya tha tum ne bataya ke hamarey yahan aisa dawa pahley kisi ne nahi kya tha, us se main ye samjha ke agar us se pahley tumharey yahan kisi ne nabwooat ka dawa kya hota to main ye bhi keh sakta tha ke ye sahib bhi usi da'we ki naql kar rahe hain jo us se pahley kya ja chuka hai. maine tum se malum kya ke kya tum ne dawa-e-nabwooat se pahley kabhi unki taraf jhoot mansub kya tha, tum ne bataya ke aisa kabhi nahi hua. us se main us nateejey par pahuncha ke ye mumkin nahi ke aik shakhs jo logon ke mutaalliq kabhi jhoot na bol saka ho wo Allah ke mutaalliq jhoot bol de. maine tum se malum kya ke unke bap daadon mein koi badshah tha, tum ne bataya ke nahi. maine us se ye faisla kya ke agar unke bap daadon mein koi badshah guzra hota to main ye bhi keh sakta tha ke) nabwooat ka dawa karke ( wo apne bap-dada ki saltanat hasil karna chahtey hain, maine tum se malum kya ke unki ittaba (pairvi) qaum ke badey log kartey hain ya kamzor aur be haisiyat log, tum ne bataya ke kamzor ghareeb qism ke log unki taabea'daarii kartey hain aur yahi giroh anbiya ki (har door mein) itaat karne wala raha hai. maine tum se puchha ke un taabea'daaron ki tadaad badhtii rehti hai ya ghat'tii bhi hai? tum ne bataya ke wo log barabar badh hi rahe hain, eman ka bhi yahi haal hai, yahan tak ke wo mukammal ho jaey, maine tum se malum kya ke kya koi shakhs unke Deen mein dakhil honey ke baad kabhi us se phir bhi gaya hai? tum ne kaha ke aisa kabhi nahi hua, eman ka bhi yahi haal hai jab wo dil ki gahraaiyon mein utar jaey to phir koi cheez us se momin ko hata nahi saktii. maine tum se malum kya ke kya unhon-ne wada khilaafii bhi ki hai? tum ne iska bhi jawab diya ke nahi, anbiya ki yahi shaan hai ke wo wada khilaafii kabhi nahi kartey. maine tum se malum kya ke kya tum ne kabhi unse ya unhon-ne tum se jang bhi ki hai? tum ne bataya ke aisa hua hai aur tumhari ladaaiyon ka nateeja hamesha kisi aik hi ke haq mein nahi gaya. balke kabhi tum maghloob huey ho aur kabhi wo. anbiya ke sath bhi aisa hi hota hai wo imtihaan mein daley jatey hain lekin anjam unhiin ka behtar hota hai. maine tum se malum kya ke wo tum ko kin kaamon ka hukm detey hain? tum ne bataya ke wo hamein iska hukm detey hain ke Allah ki ibadat karo aur uske sath kisi ko Sharik na thehrao aur tumhen tumharey un ma'boodon ki ibadat se mana kartey hain jinki tumharey bap dada ibadat kya kartey they. tumhen wo namaaz, sadqa, paak-baazii, wada wafaaii aur ada amanat ka hukm detey hain, usne kaha ke aik Nabi ki yahi sifat hai mere bhi ilm mein ye baat thi ke wo Nabi maboos hone-waale hain. lekin ye khayal na tha ke tum mein se wo maboos hongey, jo baatein tum ne bataein agar wo sahi hain to wo din bahut qareeb hai jab wo us jagah par hukmaraan hongey jahan us waqt mere donon qadam maujood hain, agar mujhey un tak pahunch sakney ki tawaqqoa' hoti to main unki khidmat mein hazir honey ki poori koshish karta aur agar main unki khidmat mein maujood hota to unke paon dhota . Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke iske baad qaisar ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka naamaa Mubarak talab kya aur wo uske samney padha gaya usmein likha hua tha ( tarjama ( shuru karta hun Allah ke naam se jo bada hi meharban bahut hi zyada raham karne wala hai. ye khat hai Muhammad Allah ke bandey aur uske rasool ki taraf se Rome (mojooda Itly) ke badshah Hiraql ki taraf, us shakhs par salamati ho jo hidayat qabool kar ley. ammaa baad (ammaa ba'd) main tumhen Islam ki dawat deta hun. Islam qabool karo, tumhen bhi salamati w amn hasil hogi aur Islam qabool karo Allah tumhen dohra ajr dega (eik tumharey apne Islam ka aur doosra tumhari qaum ke Islam ka jo tumhari wjah se Islam mein dakhil hogi) lekin agar tum ne us dawat se munh mod liya to tumhari riaya ka gunah bhi tum par hoga aur aey ahle-kitab! aik aisey kalime par aa kar ham se mil jao jo hamarey aur tumharey darmyan aik hi hai ye ke ham Allah ke siwa aur kisi ki ibadat na karein na iske sath kisi ko Sharik thehraein aur na ham mein se koi Allah ko chhod kar aapas mein aik doosrey ko parwardigar banaey ab bhi agar tum munh modtey ho to uska iqrar kar lo ke) Allah Taala ka waaqeii) farman bardaar ham hi hain. Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke jab Hiraql apni baat poori kar chuka to Rome ke sardaar uske ird-gird jama they, sab aik sath cheekhney lagey aur shor w ghul bahut badh gaya. mujhey kuchh pata nahi chala ke ye log kya keh rahe they. phir hamein hukm diya gaya aur ham wahan se nikal diye gaey. jab main apne sathiyon ke sath wahan se chala aaya aur unke sath tanhai hui to maine kaha ke ibne-abii-Kabsha (muraad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hai) ka mamla bahut aagey badh chuka hai, ''banu-al-Asfar'' (Roomiyon) ka badshah bhi us se darta hai, Abu-Sufiyan ne bayan kya ke Allah ki qasam! mujhey isi din se apni zillat ka yaqin ho gaya tha aur barabar is baat ka bhi yaqin raha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zaroor ghalib hongey, yahan tak ke Allah Taala ne mere dil mein bhi Islam dakhil kar diya. halanke (pahley ( mein Islam ko bura janta tha."
"2956, 2957","ham log bhaley hi duniya mein sabse peechhey aaey lekin (aakhirat mein) jannat mein sabse aagey hongey.'' jisne meri itaat ki us ne Allah ki itaat ki aur jisne meri nafarmani ki us ne Allah ki nafarmani ki aur jisne ameer ki itaat ki us ne meri itaat ki aur jisne ameer ki nafarmani ki, us ne meri nafarmani ki. imam ki misal dhaal jaisi hai ke iske peechhey reh kar uski aad mein (yani iske sath ho kar) jang ki jati hai. aur usi ke zariey (dushman ke hamle se) bacha jata hai, isliye agar imam tumhen Allah se dartey rehney ka hukm de aur insaf karey iska sawab usey milega, lekin agar be-insaafii karega to uska wabaal is par hoga."
"2962, 2963","main apne bhai ke sath (fatah Makka ke baad) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya ke ham se hijrat par bait ley lijiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat to (Makka ke fateh honey ke ba'd, wahan se) hijrat karke aaney walon par khatm ho gaee. maine arz kya, phir aap ham se kis baat par bait lengey ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Islam aur jihad par. main apne bhai ke sath (fatah Makka ke baad) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kya ke ham se hijrat par bait ley lijiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat to (Makka ke fateh honey ke ba'd, wahan se) hijrat karke aaney walon par khatm ho gaee. maine arz kya, phir aap ham se kis baat par bait lengey ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Islam aur jihad par."
"2965, 2966","Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khat likha aur maine usey padha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne kuchh dinon mein jin mein aap jang kartey they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) intizar kartey yahan tak ke suraj dhal jata ( phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ladai shuru kartey ( . iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ko khitab kartey huey farmaya : ''logo! dushman ke sath jang ki khahish aur tamanna dil mein na rakha karo, balke Allah Taala se amn w aafiyat ki dua kya karo, albatta jab dushman se mudbhed ho hi jaey to phir sabr w istiqaamat ka saboot do, yad rakho ke jannat talwaaron ke saaey taley hai, iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun dua ki اللهم منزل الكتاب ومجري السحاب وهازم الأحزاب ، Mina padhi. اهزمهم وانصرنا"
"3024, 3025","jab wo khawaarij se ladney ke liye rawaana huey to unhein Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ka khat mila. maine usey padha to usmein unhon-ne likha tha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik ladai ke mauqe par intizar kya, phir jab suraj dhal gaya. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko khitab kartey huey farmaya ''aey logo ! dushman se ladai bhidaaii ki tamanna na karo, balke Allah se salamati maango. haan! jab jang chhid jaey to phir sabr kiye raho aur dat kar muqaabla karo aur jaan lo ke jannat talwaaron ke saaey mein hai.'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yun dua ki (اللهم منزل الكتاب ومجري السحاب وهازم الأحزاب اهزمهم وانصرنا عليهم) ''aey Allah ! kitab ( Quran (ke nazil farmaney waale, aey badalon ke chalaney waley ! aey ehzaab (yani kaafiron ki jamaton ko Khandaq ki jang ke mauqe par) shikast dene waley ! hamarey dushman ko shikast de aur unke muqaabley mein hamari madad kar.'' aur Musa-bin-Aqba ne kaha ke mujh se Salim abu-Nazar ne bayan kya ke main Umar-bin Ubaidullah ka munshi tha. unke paas Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) ka khat aaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha '' dushman se ladai ladney ki tamanna na karo.''"
"3027, 3028","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Kisraa ( Iraan ka badshah ( barbad w halaak ho gaya, ab iske baad koi Kisraa nahi aayega aur qaisar ( Rome (mojooda Itly) ka badshah ( bhi halaak w barbad ho gaya, aur uske baad) Sham (Syria) mein) koi qaisar baqi nahi reh jaeyga aur unke khazaaney Allah ke rastey mein taqseem hongey.'' aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ladai ko makar aur faraib farmaya."
"3035, 3036","jab se main Islam laayaa, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (parde ke saath) mujhey (apne ghar mein dakhil honey se) kabhi nahi rokaa aur jab bhi aap mujh ko dekhtey, khushi se aap muskuraaney lagtey. aik baar maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein shikayat ki ke main ghodey ki peeth par achi tarah nahi jam paata hun, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere seeney par apna daste-mubaarak maaraa, aur dua ki) اللهم ثبته واجعله هاديا"
"3056, 3057","(eik martaba ( Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ko sath lekar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us khajoor ke baagh mein tashrif laey jis mein ibne-Sayyaad maujood tha. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baagh mein dakhil ho gaey to khajoor ke tanon ki aad letey huey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aagey badhney lagey. aap chahtey ye they ke usey aap ki maujoodgii ka ehsas na ho sakey aur aap uski baatein sun lein. ibne-Sayyaad us waqt apne bistar par aik chadar odhey padaa tha aur kuchh gungunaa raha tha. itney mein uski maan ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekh liya ke aap khajoor ke tanon ki aad lekar aagey aa rahe hain aur usey aagah kar diya ke aey saaf ! ye iska naam tha. ibne-Sayyaad ye suntey hi uchhal padaa . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, agar uski maan ne usey yun hi rehney diya hota to haqiqat khul jati. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba ko khitab farmaya, aap ne Allah Taala ki sana bayan ki, jo uski shaan ke laaiq thi. phir dajjal ka zikr farmaya, aur farmaya ke main bhi tumhen iske (fitnon se) daraataa hun, koi Nabi aisa nahi guzra jisne apni qaum ko uske fitnon se na daraayaa ho, Nuh (Alaihissalam) ne bhi apni qaum ko us se daraayaa tha lekin main iske barey main tum se aik aisi baat kahunga jo kisi Nabi ne apni qaum se nahi kahi , aur wo baat ye hai ke dajjal kaana hoga aur Allah Taala us se paak hai."
"3078, 3079","majaashea' apne bhai majaalid bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar khidmat nabwi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ye majaalid hain. aap se hijrat par bait karna chahtey hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke fateh Makka ke baad ab hijrat baqi nahi rahi. haan main Islam par unse bait ley loonga. majaashea' apne bhai majaalid bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar khidmat nabwi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke ye majaalid hain. aap se hijrat par bait karna chahtey hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke fateh Makka ke baad ab hijrat baqi nahi rahi. haan main Islam par unse bait ley loonga."
"3092, 3093","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) se mutalba kya tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us tarka se unhein unki meeraas ka hissa dilaya jaey jo Allah Taala ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Faiy ki sura mein diya tha (jaisey fidak wghaira). Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (apni hayaat mein) farmaya tha ke hamara (garoh anbiya (Alaihissalam) ka ( wirsa taqseem nahi hota, hamara tarka sadqa hai. Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ye sun kar ghussa ho gain aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se tarake-mulaaqaat ki aur wafat tak unse na milein. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad chh mahiney zinda rahi thin. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khaibar aur fidak aur Madina ke sadqey ki wiraasat ka mutalba Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) se kya tha Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko us se inkar tha. unhon-ne kaha ke main kisi bhi aisey amal ko nahi chhod sakta jisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni zindagi mein kartey rahe they. (Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Madina ka jo sadqa tha wo umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko (apne daure-khilaafat mein) de diya. albatta khaibar aur fidak ki jaaidaad ko umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne rok rakha aur farmaya ke ye donon Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sadqa hain aur un huquq ke liye jo waqti taur par pesh aatey ya waqti haadsaat ke liye rakhi thin. ye jaaidaad us shakhs ke ikhtiyar mein rahengii jo khaleefae-waqt ho. Zohri ne kaha, chunanche un donon jaaydaadon ka intizam aaj tak (bazariey hukoomat) isi tarah hota chala aata hai."
"3131, 3132","jab Hawazin ka wafad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur apne maalon aur qaidiyon ki waapsii ka sawal kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai. in donon chizon mein se tum aik hi wapas ley saktey ho. apne qaidi wapas ley lo ya phir maal ley lo, aur maine tumhara intizar bhi kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqriban das din tak Taaif se waapsii par unka intizar kya aur jab ye baat un par waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez ( qaidi ya maal ( wapas kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidi hi wapas lena chahtey hain. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! tumharey ye bhai ab hamarey paas tauba karke aaey hain aur main munasib samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. isi liye jo shakhs apni khushi se ghaneemat ke apne hissey ke (qaidii) wapas karna chahey wo kar de aur jo shakhs chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur hamein jab iske baad sabse pehli ghaneemat miley to usmein se iske hissey ki adaaeygi kar di jaey to wo bhi apne qaidi wapas kar de, (aur jab hamein doosrey ghaneemat milegii to uska hissey ada kar diya jaaeyga).'' is par sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! ham apni khushi se unhein apne hissey wapas kar detey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''lekin hamein ye malum na ho saka ke kin logon ne apni khushi se ijazat di aur kin logon ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas chaley jayen aur tumharey sardaar log tumhari baat hamarey samney aa kar bayan karein.'' sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne us masla par guftgu ki aur phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aa kar khabar di ke sab log khushi se ijazat detey hain. yahi wo khabar hai jo Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein hamein malum hui hai. jab Hawazin ka wafad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur apne maalon aur qaidiyon ki waapsii ka sawal kya, to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai. in donon chizon mein se tum aik hi wapas ley saktey ho. apne qaidi wapas ley lo ya phir maal ley lo, aur maine tumhara intizar bhi kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqriban das din tak Taaif se waapsii par unka intizar kya aur jab ye baat un par waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez ( qaidi ya maal ( wapas kar saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidi hi wapas lena chahtey hain. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab farmaya : Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq hamd w sana karne ke baad farmaya ''ammaa ba'd! tumharey ye bhai ab hamarey paas tauba karke aaey hain aur main munasib samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. isi liye jo shakhs apni khushi se ghaneemat ke apne hissey ke (qaidii) wapas karna chahey wo kar de aur jo shakhs chahta ho ke iska hissey baqi rahe aur hamein jab iske baad sabse pehli ghaneemat miley to usmein se iske hissey ki adaaeygi kar di jaey to wo bhi apne qaidi wapas kar de, (aur jab hamein doosrey ghaneemat milegii to uska hissey ada kar diya jaaeyga).'' is par sahaba kiram (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah! ham apni khushi se unhein apne hissey wapas kar detey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''lekin hamein ye malum na ho saka ke kin logon ne apni khushi se ijazat di aur kin logon ne nahi di hai. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas chaley jayen aur tumharey sardaar log tumhari baat hamarey samney aa kar bayan karein.'' sab log wapas chaley gaey aur unke sardaaron ne us masla par guftgu ki aur phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aa kar khabar di ke sab log khushi se ijazat detey hain. yahi wo khabar hai jo Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke silsiley mein hamein malum hui hai."
"3156, 3157","main Jaabir bin Zaid aur Amr bin Aus ke sath betha hua tha to un donon buzurgon se Bajaala ne bayan kya ke 70 hijri mein jis saal Musab bin Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) ne Basra walon ke sath Haj kya tha. zamzam ki seedhiyon ke paas unhon-ne bayan kya tha ke main Ahnaf bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke chacha Juz-bin-Muaawiya ka kaatib tha. to wafat se aik saal pahley umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ka aik khat hamarey paas aaya ke jis paarsii ne apni mohrim (ehraam walaa shakhs) aurat ko biwi banaya ho to unko juda kar do aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne paarsiyon se jiziya nahi liya tha. lekin jab Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne gawahi di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hijr ke paarsiyon se jiziya liya tha (to wo bhi leney lagey they)."
"3159, 3160","kuffaar se jang ke liye umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne faujon ko) Faaris ke) badey badey shehron ki taraf bheja tha. (jab lashkar qaadsiya pahuncha aur ladai ka nateeja musalmanon ke haq mein niklaa) to harmuzaan (Shoster ka haakim) Islam ley aaya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne us se farmaya ke main tum se un (mumaalik Faaris wghaira) par fauj bhejney ke silsiley mein mashwara chahta hun (ke pahley un teen maqaamon Faaris , Asfahaan aur aazarbaaijaan mein kahan se ladai shuru ki jaey) usne kaha ji haan! us mulk ki misal aur is mein rehney waley Islam dushman baashindon ki misal aik parindey jaisi hai jiska sar hai, 2 bazu hain. agar uska aik bazu tod diya jaey to wo apne donon paon par aik bazu aur aik sar ke sath khada reh sakta hai. agar doosra bazu bhi tod diya jaey to donon paon aur sar ke sath khada reh sakta hai. lekin agar sar tod diya jaey to donon paon donon bazu aur sar sab be-kaar reh jata hai. to sar to Kisraa hai, aik bazu qaisar hai aur doosra faaras! isliye aap musalmanon ko hukm de dein ke pahley wo Kisraa par hamla karein aur Bakr-bin-Abdullaah aur Ziyad bin-Jubair donon ne bayan kya ke unse Jubair-bin-Hayi ne bayan kya ke hamein umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne (jihad ke liye) bulaya aur Naumaan-bin-Muqrin (Raziallahu anhu) ko hamara ameer muqarrar kya. jab ham dushman ki sar zameen ( nahaawand (ke qareeb pahunchey to Kisraa ka aik afsar chalis (40) hazaar ka lashkar sath liye huey hamarey muqable ke liye badha . phir aik tarjuman ne aa kar kaha ke tum mein se koi aik shakhs ( maamlaat par) guftgu kare. Mughira-bin-Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) ne ( musalmanon ki numaaindagii ki aur) farmaya ke jo tumharey mataalbaat (maangein) hon, unhein bayan karo. us ne puchha aakhir tum log ho kon ? Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ham Arab ke rehney waley hain, ham intihai bd-bakhtiyon aur museebaton mein mubtala they. bhook ki shiddat mein ham chamdey, aur guthliyaan choosaa kartey they. oon aur baal hamari poshak thi aur pattharon aur darakhton ki ham ibadat kya kartey they. hamari museebatein isi tarah qaaim thin ke aasman aur zameen ke rab ne, jiska zikr apni tamam azmat w jalaal ke sath buland hai. hamari taraf hamari hi tarah (ke insani aadaat w khususiyaat rakhney wala) aik Nabi bhejaa. ham uske bap aur maan ko jantey hain. Allah ke rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein hukm diya ke ham tum se us waqt tak jang kartey rahen. jab tak tum sirf Allah akeley ki ibadat na karne lago . ya phir Islam na qabool karne ki sura mein jiziya dena qabool kar lo aur hamarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein apne rab ka ye paigham bhi pahunchaya hai ke (Islam ke liye ladtey huey) jihad mein hamara jo aadmi bhi qatl kya jaeyga wo aisi jannat mein jaeyga jo usney kabhi nahi dekhi aur jo log ham mein se zinda baqi reh jaeinge wo (fatah hasil karke) tum par Hakim bin sakengey (mugheera (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye guftgu tamam karke Nauman (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ladai shuru karo). tum ko to Allah paak aisi kai ladaaiyon main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sharik rakh chuka hai. aur us ne (ladaaii mein der karne par) tum ko na sharminda kya na zaleel kya aur main to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ladai mein maujood tha. aap ka qaayeda tha agar subah sawerey ladai shuru na kartey aur din chadh jata to us waqt tak thahrey rahtey ke suraj dhal jaey, hawaaein chalney lagein, namazon ka waqt aan pahunchey."
"3164, 3165","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke agar hamarey paas Bahrain se rupya aaya, to main tumhen itna , itna , itna ( teen lap ( doonga . phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gaee aur uske baad Bahrain ka rupya aaya to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne agar kisi se koi dene ka wada kya ho to wo hamarey paas aaey. chunanche main hazir hua aur arz kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke agar Bahrain ka rupya hamarey yahan aaya to main tumhen itnaa, itna aur itna doonga. is par unhon-ne farmaya ke achchha aik lap bharo, maine aik lap bharii, to unhon-ne farmaya ke usey gino, maine ginaa to panch so tha, phir unhon-ne mujhey dedh hazaar inayat farmaya, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan Bahrain se khiraaj ka rupya aaya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey masjid mein phaila do, Bahrain ka wo maal un tamam amwaal mein sabse zyada tha jo ab tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan aa chukey they. itney mein Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif laey aur kehney lagey ke ya Rasulullah ! mujhey bhi inayat farmaiye (main zere-baar hon yani mujh par qarz hai) kyonke maine (badr ke mauqe par) apna bhi fidya ada kya tha aur Aqeel (Raziallahu anhu) ka bhi ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha ley lijiye . chunanche unhon-ne apne kapdey mein rupya bhar liya ( lekin uthaya na ja sakaa) to usmein se kam karne lagey. lekin kam karne ke baad bhi na uth saka to arz kya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi ko hukm dein ke uthaney mein meri madad karey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aisa nahi ho sakta , unhon-ne kaha ke phir aap khud hi uthwa dein. farmaya ke ye bhi nahi ho sakta. phir Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne usmein se kuchh kam kya, lekin is par bhi na utha sakey to kaha ke kisi ko hukm dijiye ke wo utha de, farmaya ke nahi aisa nahi ho sakta, unhon-ne kaha phir aap hi utha dein, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye bhi nahi ho sakta. aakhir usmein se unhein phir kam karna padaa aur tab kahin ja ke usey apne kaandhey par utha sakey aur lekar janey lagey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt tak unhein barabar dekhtey rahe, jab tak wo hamari nazron se chhup na gaey. unke hirs par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tajjub farmaya aur aap us waqt tak wahan se na uthey jab tak wahan aik dirham bhi baqi raha."
"3186, 3187","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din har daghaa baaz ke liye aik jhanda hoga, unmein se aik sahib ne bayan kya ke wo jhanda (iske peechhey ( gaad diya jaeyga aur doosrey sahib ne bayan kya ke usey qiyamat ke din sab dekhengey, iske zariey usey pehchaana jaaeyga.'' nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din har daghaa baaz ke liye aik jhanda hoga, unmein se aik sahib ne bayan kya ke wo jhanda (iske peechhey ( gaad diya jaeyga aur doosrey sahib ne bayan kya ke usey qiyamat ke din sab dekhengey, iske zariey usey pehchaana jaaeyga.''"
"3252, 3253","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein aik darakht hai jiske saaey mein aik sawar 100 saal tak chal sakega aur agar tumhara ji chahey to ye aayat padh lo ( وظل ممدود ) aur lamba saaya.'' aur kisi shakhs ke liye aik kamaan ke barabar jannat mein jagah is poori duniya se behtar hai jis par suraj tuloo aur ghurub hota hai."
"3272, 3273","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab suraj ka uper ka kinara nikal aaey to Namaz na padho jab tak wo poori tarah zahir na ho jaey aur jab ghurub honey lagey tab bhi us waqt tak ke liye Namaz chhod do jab tak bilkul ghurub na ho jaaey.'' aur Namaz suraj ke nikalney aur doobney ke waqt na padho, kyonke suraj shaitan ke sar ke ya shaitanon ke sar ke donon konon ke beech mein se nikalta hai. Abda ne kaha, main nahi janta Hisham ne shaitan ka sar kaha ya shaitanon kaa."
"3297, 3298","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) member par khutba detey huey farma rahe they ke saanpon ko mar daala karo) khususan ( unko jinke saron par 2 nuqtey hotey hain aur dam Barida sanp ko bhi, kyonke donon aankh ki roshni tak khatm kar detey hain aur hamal tak gira detey hain. aik martaba mein aik sanp ko maarney ki koshish kar raha tha ke mujh se abu-Lubaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne pukar kar kaha ke usey na maaro , maine kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to saanpon ke maarney ka hukm diya tha. unhon-ne bataya ke baad mein phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gharon mein rehney waley saanpon ko jo jin hotey hain achcha mar dalney se mana farmaayaa."
"3310, 3311","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) saanpon ko pahley mar daala kartey they lekin baad mein unhein maarney se khud hi mana karne lagey. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni aik diwar girwaaii to usmein se aik sanp ki keinchulii niklii, aap ne farmaya ke dekho, wo sanp kahan hai. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne talash kya (aur wo mil gaya to) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey mar daalo, main bhi isi wjah se saanpon ko mar daala karta tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''patley ya safaid saanpon ko na maara karo. albatta dam katey huey sanp ko jis par 2 safaid dhaariyaan hoti hain usko mar daalo, kyonke ye itna zahreela hai ke haamla ke hamal ko gira deta hai aur aadmi ko andha bana deta hai.''"
"3312, 3313","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) saanpon ko mar daala kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gharon ke patley ya safaid saanpon ko maarney se mana farmaya hai to unhon-ne maarna chhod diya."
"3362, 3363","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala Ismail (Alaihissalam) ki walida (Haajira (Alaihissalam) ( par raham karey, agar unhon-ne jaldi na ki hoti (aur zamzam ke pani ke gird munder na banaatiin) to aaj wo aik bahtaa hua chashma hotaa.'' main aur Usman bin-abu-Sulaimaan donon Saeed-bin-Jubair ke paas baithey huey they, itney mein unhon-ne kaha ke Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se ye hadis is tarah bayan nahi ki balke yun kaha ke Ibrahim apne betey Ismail aur unki walida Hajra (Alaihissalam) Ismail (Alaihissalam) ko lekar Makka ki sar zameen ki taraf aaey. Hajra (Alaihissalam) Ismail (Alaihissalam) ko doodh pilaatii thin. unke sath aik puraanii mashk thi. Ibne-Abbas ne us hadis ko marfooa' nahi kya."
"3395, 3396","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi shakhs ko yun na kehna chahiye ke main Yoonus-bin-Mattii se behtar hon, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka naam unke walid ki taraf mansub karke liyaa.'' Musa (Alaihissalam) gandumi aur daraaz qad they. aisa malum hota tha jaisey qabila shanooh ke koi sahib hon aur farmaya ke Esa (Alaihissalam) ghungariyaaley baal waley aur beech ke qad ke they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne darogha jahannam Malik ka bhi zikr farmaya aur dajjal ka bhii."
"3414, 3415","aik martaba logon ko aik Yahudi apna saman dikhaa raha tha lekin usey uski jo qeemat lagai gaee is par wo razi na tha. isliye kehney laga ke hargiz nahi, us zaat ki qism jisne Musa ko tamam insanon mein barguzeeda qarar diya. ye lafz aik Ansari sahabi ne sun liye aur khadey ho kar unhon-ne aik thappad uske munh par maara aur kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) abhi ham mein maujood hain aur to is tarah qism khata hai ke us zaat ki qism jisne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko tamam insanon mein barguzeeda qarar diya. is par wo Yahudi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha : aey abul-Qaasim! mera musalmanon ke sath amn aur suleh ka ahad w paiman hai. phir falan shakhs ka kya haal hoga jisne mere munh par chaantaa maara hai, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us sahabi se malum farmaya ke tum ne iske munh par kyon chaantaa maara ? unhon-ne wjah bayan ki to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghussey ho gaey is qadr ke ghussey ke aasaar chehre par numaayaan ho gaey. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ke anbiya mein aapas mein aik ko doosrey par fazeelat na diya karo, jab Saur phoonkaa jaeyga to aasman w zameen ki tamam makhlooq par be-hoshi taarii ho jaeygi, siwa unke jinhein Allah Taala chaahega. phir dusri martaba Saur phoonkaa jaeyga aur sabse pahley mujhey uthaya jaeyga, lekin main dekhoonga ke Musa (Alaihissalam) arsh ko pakdey huey khadey hongey, ab mujhey malum nahi ke ye unhein taur ki be-hoshi ka badla diya gaya hoga ya mujh se bhi pahley unki be-hoshi khatm kar di gaee hogi. aur main to ye bhi nahi keh sakta ke koi shakhs Yoonus-bin-Matti se behtar hai."
"3426, 3427","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''meri aur tamam insanon ki misal aik aisey shakhs ki si hai jisne aag roshan ki ho. phir parwaaney aur keedey-makodey usmein girney lagey hoon.'' 2 auratein thin aur donon ke sath donon ke bachchey they. itney mein aik bhediyaa aaya aur aik aurat ke bachchey ko utha ley gaya. un donon mein se aik aurat ne kaha bhediyaa tumharey betey ko ley gaya hai aur dusri ne kaha ke tumharey betey ko ley gaya hai. donon Dawud (Alaihissalam) ke yahan apna muqaddima le gain . aap ne badi aurat ke haq mein faisla kar diya. uske baad wo donon Sulaimaan-bin-Daawood (Alaihissalam) ke yahan aaiin aur unhein us jhagdey ki khabar di. unhon-ne farmaya ke achchha chhuri laao. is bachchey ke 2 tukdey karke donon ke darmyan baant dun. chhoti aurat ne ye sun kar kaha : Allah aap par raham farmaai aisa na keejiye, maine maan liya ke usi badi ka ladka hai. is par Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ne us chhoti ke haq mein faisla kya. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine (sikkeen) ka lafz isi din suna, warna ham hamesha (chhurii ke liye) ("
"3439, 3440","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik din logon ke samney dajjal ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke ismein koi shuba nahi ke Allah Taala kaana nahi hai, lekin dajjal dahini aankh se kaana hoga, uski aankh uthey huey angoor ki tarah hogi. aur maine raat Kaba ke paas khuwab mein aik gehunwey rang ke aadmi ko dekha jo gehunwey rang ke aadmiyon mein shakl ke eitibaar se sabse zyada khoobsurat tha. iske sar ke baal shaanon tak latak rahe they, sar se pani tapak raha tha aur donon hath 2 aadmiyon ke kandhon par rakhey huey wo Baitullah ka tawaaf kar rahe they. maine puchha ye kon buzurg hain? to farishton ne bataya ke ye Masih ibne-Maryam hain. iske baad maine aik shakhs ko dekha, sakht aur mudey huey baalon wala jo dahini aankh se kaana tha. usey maine ibne-qatan se sabse zyada shakl mein milta hua paya, wo bhi aik shakhs ke shaanon par apne donon hath rakhey huey Baitullah ka tawaaf kar raha tha. maine poochha, ye kon hain? farishton ne bataya ke ye dajjal hai. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Ubaidullah ne Naafe se ki hai."
"3450, 3451, 3452","Aqba-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha, kya aap wo hadis ham se nahi bayan karengey jo aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suni thi? unhon-ne kaha ke maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna tha ke jab dajjal niklega to uske sath aag aur pani donon hongey lekin logon ko jo aag dikhai degi wo thanda pani hoga aur logon ko jo thanda pani dikhai dega to wo jalaaney wali aag hogi. isliye tum mein se jo koi uske zamaney mein ho to usey usmein girnaa chahiye jo aag hogi kyonke wahi intihai sheereen aur thanda pani hoga. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna tha ke pahley zamaney mein aik shakhs ke paas malakul-maut unki Rooh qabz karne aaey to unse puchha gaya koi apni neki tumhen yad hai? unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey to yad nahi padtii . unse dobara kaha gaya ke yad karo ! unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey koi apni neki yad nahi, siwa iske ke main duniya mein logon ke sath khareed w farokht kya karta tha aur lein-dein kya karta tha, jo log khush'haal hotey unhein to main (apnaa qarz wsool kartey waqt) mohlat diya karta tha aur tang hath walon ko maaf kar diya karta tha. Allah Taala ne unhein usi par jannat mein dakhil kya. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna ke aik shakhs ki maut ka jab waqt aa gaya aur wo apni zindagi se bilkul maayoos ho gaya to usne apne ghar walon ko wasiiyat ki ke jab meri maut ho jaey to mere liye bahut saari lakdiyan jama karna aur unmein aag laga dena. jab aag mere gosht ko jalaa chukey aur aakhiri haddi ko bhi jalaa de to un jalii hui haddiyon ko pees daalnaa aur kisi tund hua waley din ka intizar karna aur) aisey kisi din) meri raakh ko dariya mein baha dena. iske ghar walon ne aisa hi kya. lekin Allah Taala ne uski raakh ko jama kya aur us se puchha aisa tu ney kyon karwaya tha? us ne jawab diya ke terey hi khof se aey Allah ! Allah Taala ne usi wjah se uski maghfirat farma di. Aqba-bin-Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine aapko ye farmatey suna tha ke ye shakhs kafan chor tha."
"3453, 3454","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaan nikalney ki haalat taarii hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar chehra Mubarak par baar-baar daal letey phir jab shiddat badhtii to usey hata detey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi haalat mein farmaya tha, Allah ki laanat ho yahood w nasara par ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is ummat ko unke kiye se daraanaa chahtey they. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jaan nikalney ki haalat taarii hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar chehra Mubarak par baar-baar daal letey phir jab shiddat badhtii to usey hata detey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usi haalat mein farmaya tha, Allah ki laanat ho yahood w nasara par ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is ummat ko unke kiye se daraanaa chahtey they."
"3486, 3487","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ham (duniyaa mein) tamam ummaton ke aakhir mein aaey lekin (qiyamat ke din) tamam ummaton se aagey hongey. sirf itna farq hai ke unhein pahley kitab di gaee aur hamein baad mein mili aur yahi wo (Jum'a ka ( din hai jiske barey mein logon ne ikhtilaf kya. yahudiyon ne to usey uske doosrey din (hafte ko) kar liya aur nasara ne teesrey din (itwaar ko).'' to har musalman ko haftey mein aik din (yani Juma ke din) to usey jism aur sar ko dho lena lazim hai."
"3493, 3494","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum insanon ko kaan ki tarah paogey (bhalaaii aur burai mein) jo log jahiliyat ke zamaney mein behtar aur achi sifaat ke Malik they wo Islam laney ke baad bhi behtar aur achi sifaat waley hain basharte ke wo Deen ka ilm bhi hasil karein aur hukumat aur sardaarii ke laaiq usko paogey jo hukumat aur sardaarii ko bahut na-pasand karta ho.'' aur aadmiyon mein sabse bura usko paogey jo do-rukha ( doghla ( ho. un logon mein aik munh lekar aaey, dusron mein doosra munh."
"3495, 3496","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''khilaafat ke mamley mein log Quraish ke taabe hain, aam musalman qureshi musalmanon ke taabe hain jis tarah unke aam kuffaar qureshi kuffaar ke taabe rahtey chaley aaey hain.'' aur insanon ki misal kaan ki tarah hai, jo log jahiliyat ke daur mein sharif they wo Islam laney ke baad bhi sharif hain jabke unhon-ne Deen ki samajh bhi hasil ki ho tum dekhogey ke behtreen aur laaiq wahi Sabit hongey jo khilafat w imaarat ke ohdey ko bahut zyada na-pasand kartey rahe hon, yahan tak ke wo usmein giraftaar ho jaaein."
"3529, 3530","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) unke yahan tashrif laey to wahan (ansaar ki) 2 ladkiyan daf bajaa kar ga rahi thin. ye Haj ke dinon Mina ka waqia hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chehrey par kapda daley huey letey they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein daantaa to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne chehre se kapda hata kar farmaya ''abu-Bakar! unhein chhod do, ye eid ke din hain, ye Mina mein thaharney ke din they.'' maine dekha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujh ko parde mein rakhey huey hain aur main habshiyon ko dekh rahi thi jo nezon ka khel masjid mein kar rahe they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein daantaa. lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''unhein chhod do, bani arfada tum be-fikr ho kar khelo.''"
"3567, 3568","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) itney thahar-thahar kar baatein kartey ke agar koi shakhs (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke alfaaz) gin lena chahta to gin sakta tha. (abu-Huraira (rz)) par tumhen tajjub nahi hua. wo aaey aur mere hujre ke aik koney mein baith kar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadison mujhey sunaney ke liye bayan karne lagey. main us waqt Namaz padh rahi thi. phir wo meri Namaz khatm honey se pahley hi uth kar chaley gaey. agar wo mujhey mil jatey to main unki khabar leti ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tumhari tarah yun jaldi-jaldi baatein nahi kya kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aankhen zahir mein soti thin lekin dil ghaafil nahi hota tha."
"3587, 3588, 3589","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat us waqt tak nahi qaaim hogi jab tak tum aik aisi qaum ke sath jang na kar lo jinke jootey baal ke hon aur jab tak tum turkon se jang na kar lo, jinki aankhen chhoti hongii, chehrey surkh hongey, naak chhoti aur chaptii hogi, chehrey aisey hongey jaisey teh-b-teh dhaal hoti hai.'' aur tum hukumat ke liye sabse zyada behtar shakhs usey paogey jo hukumat karne ko bura janey (yani us mansab ko khud ke liye na-pasand karey) yahan tak ke wo usmein phans jaey. logon ki misal kaan ki si hai jo jahiliyat mein sharif they, wo Islam laney ke baad bhi sharif hain. aur tum par aik aisa daur bhi aaney wala hai ke tum mein se koi apne sarey gharbaar aur maal w daulat se badh kar mujh ko dekh lena zyada pasand karega."
"3601, 3602","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''fitnon ka daur jab aayega to usmein baithney wala khada rehney waley se behtar hoga, khada rehney wala chalney waley se behtar hoga aur chalney wala daudney waley se behtar hoga jo usmein jhaankega fitna bhi usey uchak lega aur us waqt jisey jahan bhi panah mil jaey bas wahin panah pakad ley taake apne Deen ko fitnon se bacha sakey. '' namazon mein aik Namaz aisi hai ke jis se wo chhoot jaey maano uska gharbaar sab barbad ho gaey. (aur wo Asr ki Namaz hai)."
"3620, 3621","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein Musailma kazzaab Madina mein aaya aur ye kehney laga ke agar Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ''Amr'' (yani khilaafat) ko apne baad mujhey saunp dein to main unki ittaba (pairvi) ke liye taiyaar hun. Musailma apne bahut se mureedon ko sath lekar Madina aaya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uske paas (usey samjhaaney ke liye) tashrif ley gaey. aap ke sath Saabit-bin-Qais-bin Shamas (Raziallahu anhu) they aur aap ke hath mein khajoor ki aik chhadi thi. aap wahan thahar gaey jahan Musailma apne aadmiyon ke sath maujood tha. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya agar to mujh se chhadi bhi maangey to main tujhey nahi de sakta (khilaafat to badi cheez hai) aur parwardigar ki marzii ko to taal nahi sakta agar to Islam se peeth pherega to Allah tujh ko tabah kar dega aur main samajhta hun ke to wahi hai jo mujhey (khuwaab mein) dikhaya gaya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ''main soyaa hua tha ke maine ( khuwab mein) soney ke 2 kangan apne hathon mein dekhey. mujhey us khuwab se bahut fikr hui, phir khuwab mein hi wahi ke zariey mujhey batlaya gaya ke main un par phoonk maarun . chunanche jab maine phoonk maari to wo donon ud gaey. maine us se ye tabeer li ke mere baad jhootey Nabi hongey.'' to unmein se aik to Aswad ansaa hai aur doosra Yamaama ka Musailma kazzaab tha."
"3623, 3624","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aaiin, unki chaal main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chaal se badi mushabihat (similarity) thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : beti aao marhabaa! iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein apni daain taraf ya baain taraf bithaayaa, phir unke kaan mein aap ne chupkey se koi baat kahi to wo roney lagiin, maine unse kaha ke aap roti kyon ho? phir dobara Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke kaan mein kuchh kaha to wo hans din. maine unse kaha aaj gham ke fauran baad hi khushi ki jo kaifiyat maine aap ke chehrey par dekhi wo pahley kabhi nahi dekhi thi. phir maine unse puchha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya tha? unhon-ne kaha jab tak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) zinda hain mein aap ke raaz ko kisi par nahi khol saktii. chunanche maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad poochha. to unhon-ne bataya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere kaan mein kaha tha ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) har saal Quran Majeed ka aik door kya kartey they, lekin us saal unhon-ne 2 martaba door kya hai, mujhey yaqin hai ke ab meri maut qareeb hai aur mere gharaaney mein sabse pahley mujh se aa milney wali tum hogi. mein (aap ki us khabar par) roney lagi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum is par razi nahi ke jannat ki aurton ki sardaar banegii ya (aap ne farmaya ke) momina aurton ki, to is par main hansi thi."
"3625, 3626","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne marz ke zamane main apni beti Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko bulaya aur chupkey se koi baat unse farmai to wo roney lagiin. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulaya aur chupkey se phir koi baat farmai to wo hansiin. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir maine Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se iske mutaalliq poochha. to unhon-ne bataya ke pehli martaba jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se aahista se guftgu ki thi to usmein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke aap ki is marz mein wafat ho jaeygi jis mein waqei aap ki wafat hui. main is par ro padii. phir dobara Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aahista se mujh se jo baat kahi usmein aap ne farmaya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahale-bait mein, main sabse pahley Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ja miloongii. main is par hansi thi."
"3642, 3643","maine apne qabeele ke logon se suna tha, wo log Urwa se naql kartey they (jo abul-Jaad ke betey aur sahabi they) ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein aik Dinar diya ke wo uski aik bakri khareed kar ley aaein. unhon-ne us Dinar se 2 bakriyan khareediin, phir aik bakri ko aik Dinar mein bech kar Dinar bhi wapas kar diya aur bakri bhi pesh kar di. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par unki tijarat mein barkat ki dua farmai. phir to unka ye haal hua ke agar mitti bhi khareedtey to usmein unhein nafa ho jata. Sufiyan ne kaha ke Hasan-bin-Umaara ne hamein ye hadis pahunchai thi shabeeb-bin-gharqada se. Hasan-bin-Umaara ne kaha ke shabeeb ne ye hadis khud Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) se suni thi. chunanche main shabeeb ki khidmat mein gaya to unhon-ne bataya ke maine ye hadis khud Urwa se nahi suni thi. albatta maine apne qabeele ke logon ko unke hawale se bayan kartey suna tha. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya khair aur bhalai ghodon ki peshani ke sath qiyamat tak ke liye bandhi hui hai. shabeeb ne kaha ke maine Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar mein 70 ghodey dekhey. Sufiyan ne kaha ke Urwa (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye bakri kharidi thi. shayad wo qurbani ke liye hogi."
"3667, 3668","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki jab wafat hui to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) us waqt maqam Sunh mein they. Ismail ne kaha yani awaalii ke aik gaaun mein. aap ki khabar sun kar umr (Raziallahu anhu) uth kar ye kehney lagey ke Allah ki qism Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat nahi hui. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they Allah ki qism us waqt mere dil mein yahi khayal aata tha aur main kehta tha ke Allah aapko zaroor is bimari se achchha karke uthaaeyga aur aap un logon ke hath aur paon kaat dengey (jo aap ki maut ki baatein kartey hain) itney mein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif ley aaey aur andar ja kar aap ki laash Mubarak ke uper se kapda uthaya aur bosa diya aur kaha : mere maan-baap aap par fidaa hon. aap zindagi mein bhi pakeeza they aur wafat ke baad bhi aur us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, Allah Taala aap par 2 martaba maut hargiz taarii nahi karega . iske baad aap bahar aaey aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) se kehney lagey, aey qism khaney waale! zara thahar jaa. phir jab Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne guftgu shuru ki to umr (Raziallahu anhu) khamosh baith gaey. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne pahley Allah ki hamd w sana bayan ki. phir farmaya : logo ! dekho agar koi Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko poojtaa tha (yani ye samajhta tha ke wo aadmi nahi hain, wo kabhi nahi marengey) to usey malum hona chahiye ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho chuki hai aur jo shakhs Allah ki puja karta tha to Allah hamesha zinda hai usey maut kabhi nahi aaeygi. (phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne sura Zumar ki ye aayat padhii)  إنك ميت وإنهم ميتون ''aey paighambar! to bhi marney wala hai aur wo bhi marengey.'' aur Allah Taala ne farmaayaa وما محمد إلا رسول قد خلت من قبله الرسل أفإن مات أو قتل انقلبتم على أعقابكم ومن ينقلب على عقبيه فلن يضر الله شيئا وسيجزي الله الشاكرين'' Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) sirf aik rasool hain. us se pahley bhi bahut se rasool guzar chukey hain. to kya agar wo wafat pa jayen ya unhein Shahid kar diya jaey to tum Islam se phir jaogey aur jo shakhs apni eidiyon ke bal phir jaey to wo Allah ko koi nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakega aur Allah an-qareeb shukr-guzar bandon ko badla dene wala hai.'' raawii ne bayan kya ke ye sun kar log phoot-phoot kar roney lagey. rawi ne bayan kya ke Ansar Saqeefa-banii-Saaida mein Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jama ho gaey aur kehney lagey ke aik ameer ham mein se hoga aur aik ameer tum (muhaajireen) mein se hoga (donon mil kar hukumat karengey) phir abu-Bakar, umr bin-Khattab aur abu-Ubaida bin-Jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) unki majlis mein pahunchey . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne guftgu karni chahi lekin Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse khamosh rehney ke liye kaha, umr (Raziallahu anhu) kaha kartey they ke Allah ki qism maine aisa sirf is wjah se kya tha ke maine pahley hi se aik taqreer taiyaar kar li thi jo mujhey bahut pasand aai thi phir bhi mujhey dar tha ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki baraabrii us se bhi nahi ho sakegi. phir Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne intihai balaaghat ke sath baat shuru ki. unhon-ne apni taqreer mein farmaya ke ham (Quraish) Ameer hain aur tum (jama'at ansaar) Wazeer ho. is par Hubaab-bin-Munzir (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke nahi Allah ki qism ham aisa nahi honey dengey, aik ameer ham mein se hoga aur aik ameer tum mein se hoga. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke nahi ham Ameer hain tum Wazeer ho (wjah ye hai ke) Quraish ke log sarey Arab mein sharif khandan shumaar kiye jatey hain aur unka mulk (yani Makka) Arab ke beech mein hai to ab tum ko ikhtiyar hai ya to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki bait kar lo ya abu-Ubaida-bin-Jarraah ki. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : nahi ham aap ki hi bait karengey. aap hamarey sardaar hain, ham mein sabse behtar hain aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke nazdeek aap ham sabse zyada mahboob hain. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unka hath pakad liya aur unke hath par bait kar li phir sab logon ne bait ki. itney mein kisi ki awaz aai ke Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ko tum logon ne mar dala. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : unhein Allah ne mar dala."
"3669, 3670","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki nazar (wafaat se pahley) uthi aur aap ne farmaya : aey Allah ! mujhey rafeeq aalaa main ( dakhil kar) aap ne ye jumla teen martaba farmaya aur rawi ne poori hadis bayan ki. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Abu-Bakar aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) donon hi ke Khutbon se nafa pahuncha. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne logon ko dhamkaayaa kyonke unmein kuchh munaafeqeen bhi they, isliye Allah Taala ne is tarah (ghalat afwahen phailaaney se) unko baaz rakha. aur baad mein Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo haq aur hidayat ki baat thi wo logon ko samjha di aur unko batla diya jo un par lazim tha (yani Islam par qaaim rehna (aur wo ye aayat tilawat kartey huey bahar aaey وما محمد إلا رسول قد خلت من قبله الرسل''Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik rasool hain aur unse pahley bhi rasool guzar chukey hain ( الشاكرين ( tak."
"3711, 3712","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan apna aadmi bhej kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se milney wali meeraas ka mutalba kya jo Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko Fai ki sura mein di thi. yani aap ka mutalba Madina ki us jaaidaad ke barey mein tha jiski aamadni se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khair ke kaamon mein kharch kartey they, aur isi tarah fidak ki jaaidaad aur khaibar ke khums ka bhi mutalba kya. hamari meeraas nahi hoti. ham ( anbiya ( jo kuchh chhod jatey hain wo sadqa hota hai aur ye ke aale-Muhammad ke kharchey usi maal mein se poorey kiye jayen magar unhein ye haq nahi hoga ke khaney ke ilawa aur kuchh tasarruf karein aur mein, Allah ki qism ! aap ke sadqey mein jo aap ke zamaney mein hua kartey they unmein koi radd w badal nahi karunga balke wahi nizaam jari rakhoonga jaisey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qaaim farmaya tha. phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur kehney lagey : aey Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ham aap ki fazeelat w martabe ka iqrar kartey hain. iske baad unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se apni qaraabat ka aur apne haq ka zikr kya, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya is zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qaraabat walon se sulook karna mujh ko apni qaraabat walon ke sath sulook karne se zyada pasand hai."
"3715, 3716","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko apne us marz ke mauqe par bulaya jis mein aap ki wafat hui, phir aahista se koi baat kahi to wo roney lagiin, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulaya aur aahista se koi baat kahi to wo hansney lagiin, Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir maine unse iske mutaalliq poochha. to unhon-ne bataya ke pahley mujh se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aahista se ye farmaya tha ke wo apni usi bimari mein wafat pa jaaeinge, main is par roney lagi phir mujh se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aahista se farmaya ke aap ke ahale-bait mein sabse pahley mein aap se ja miloongii, is par main hansi thi."
"3722, 3723","kuchh un jangon mein jin main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khud Sharik huey they (Uhud ki jang mein) aap ke sath Talha aur Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwa aur koi baqi nahi raha tha. kuchh un jangon mein jin main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khud Sharik huey they (Uhud ki jang mein) aap ke sath Talha aur Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwa aur koi baqi nahi raha thaa."
"3738, 3739","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab maujood they, to jab bhi koi shakhs koi khuwab dekhta to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se usey bayan karta. mere dil mein bhi ye tamanna paida ho gaee ke main bhi koi khuwab dekhun aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan karun. mein un dinon kunwaaraa tha aur nau-umr bhi tha. main aap ke zamaney mein masjid mein soyaa karta tha to maine khuwab mein 2 farishton ko dekha ke mujhey pakad kar dozakh ki taraf ley gaey. maine dekha ke wo bal daar kuwein ki tarah pech dar pech thi. kuwein hi ki tarah iske bhi 2 kinarey they aur uske andar kuchh aisey log they jinhein main pehchanta tha. main usey dekhtey hi kehney laga dozakh se main Allah ki panah mangta hun, dozakh se main Allah ki panah mangta hun. iske baad mujh se aik doosrey Farishtey ki mulaqat hui, usne mujh se kaha ke khof na khaa, maine apna ye khuwab Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se bayan kya. Hafsa ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mera khuwab bayan kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abdullah bahut achchha ladka hai. kash! ! raat mein wo tahajjud ki Namaz padha karta. Salim ne bayan kya ke Abdullah iske baad raat mein bahut kam soyaa kartey they."
"3740, 3741","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya tha ke Abdullah nek aadmi hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya tha ke Abdullah nek aadmi hai."
"3759, 3760","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zabaane-mubaarak par koi bura kalima nahi aata tha aur na Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zaat se ye mumkin tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke tum mein sabse zyada azeez mujhey wo shakhs hai jiske aadaat w akhlaq sabse umda hon. aur aap ne farmaya ke Quran Majeed char aadmiyon se seekho, Abdullaah-bin-Mas'ood, abu-Huzaifa ke Maula Saalim, Ubai-bin-Kab aur Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) se."
"3939, 3940","mere aik saajhii ne bazar mein chand dirham udhaar farokht kiye, maine us se kaha : sub'haan-Allaah! kya ye jaaiz hai? unhon-ne kaha : Subhan-Allah , Allah ki qism ! maine bazar mein usey bechaa to kisi ne bhi qaabile-aitiraaz nahi samjhaa. maine Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ( hijrat karke ( tashrif laey to is tarah khareed w farokht kya kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khareed w farokht ki is sura mein agar mamla dast-badast ( naqd (ho to koi muzaayqa nahi lekin agar udhaar par mamla kya to phir ye sura jaaiz nahi aur Zaid-bin-Arqam se bhi mil kar iske mutaalliq poochh lo kyonke wo ham mein badey sodagar they. maine Zaid-bin-Arqam se puchha to unhon-ne bhi yahi kaha ke Sufiyan ne aik martaba yun bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab hamarey yahan Madina tashrif laey to ham (is tarah ki) khareed w farokht kya kartey they aur bayan kya ke udhaar mausam tak ke liye ya ( yun bayan kya ke) Haj tak ke liye. mere aik saajhii ne bazar mein chand dirham udhaar farokht kiye, maine us se kaha : sub'haan-Allaah! kya ye jaaiz hai? unhon-ne kaha : Subhan-Allah , Allah ki qism ! maine bazar mein usey bechaa to kisi ne bhi qaabile-aitiraaz nahi samjhaa. maine Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) se iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab ( hijrat karke ( tashrif laey to is tarah khareed w farokht kya kartey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khareed w farokht ki is sura mein agar mamla dast-badast ( naqd (ho to koi muzaayqa nahi lekin agar udhaar par mamla kya to phir ye sura jaaiz nahi aur Zaid-bin-Arqam se bhi mil kar iske mutaalliq poochh lo kyonke wo ham mein badey sodagar they. maine Zaid-bin-Arqam se puchha to unhon-ne bhi yahi kaha ke Sufiyan ne aik martaba yun bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab hamarey yahan Madina tashrif laey to ham (is tarah ki) khareed w farokht kya kartey they aur bayan kya ke udhaar mausam tak ke liye ya ( yun bayan kya ke) Haj tak ke liye."
"3978, 3979","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke samney kisi ne iska zikr kya ke ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hawale se bayan kartey hain ke maiyat ko qabr mein uske ghar walon ke, is par roney se bhi azab hota hai. is par Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to ye farmaya tha ke azab maiyat par uski bd-amaliyon aur gunahon ki wjah se hota hai. aur uske ghar waley hain ke ab bhi uski judai par rotey rahtey hain. unhon-ne kaha ke uski misal bilkul aisi hi hai jaisey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne badr ke us kuwein par khadey ho kar jis mein mushrekeen ki laashein daal di gain thin, unke barey mein farmaya tha ke jo kuchh mein keh raha hun, ye usey sun rahe hain. to aap ke farmaney ka maqsad ye tha ke ab unhein malum ho gaya hoga ke unse mein jo kuchh keh raha tha wo haq tha. phir unhon-ne us aayat ki tilawat ki (إنك لا تسمع الموتى)'' aap mardon ko nahi suna saktey. '' ( وما أنت بمسمع من في"
"3980, 3981","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne badr ke kuwein par khadey ho kar farmaya ''kya jo kuchh tumharey rab ne tumharey liye wada kar rakha tha, usey tum ne sachcha pa liyaa?'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo kuchh mein keh raha hun ye ab bhi usey sun rahe hain.'' is hadis ka zikr jab Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se kya gaya to unhon-ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha ke unhon-ne ab jaan liya hoga ke jo kuchh maine unse kaha tha wo haq tha. iske baad unhon-ne aayat (إنك لا تسمع الموتى)'' beshak aap un mardon ko nahi suna saktey.'' poori padhi. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne badr ke kuwein par khadey ho kar farmaya ''kya jo kuchh tumharey rab ne tumharey liye wada kar rakha tha, usey tum ne sachcha pa liyaa?'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo kuchh mein keh raha hun ye ab bhi usey sun rahe hain.'' is hadis ka zikr jab Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se kya gaya to unhon-ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha ke unhon-ne ab jaan liya hoga ke jo kuchh maine unse kaha tha wo haq tha. iske baad unhon-ne aayat (إنك لا تسمع"
"4012, 4013","unke 2 chachaon (Zaheer aur Mazahar Raafe bin Adii-bin Zaid Ansari ke beton) jinhonney badr ki ladai mein shirkat ki thi, ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zameen ko kiraaye par deney se mana kya tha. maine Salim se kaha lekin aap to kiraaya par detey hain. unhon-ne kaha ke haan, Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne uper zyadti ki thi. unke 2 chachaon (Zaheer aur Mazahar Raafe bin Adii-bin Zaid Ansari ke beton) jinhonney badr ki ladai mein shirkat ki thi, ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne zameen ko kiraaye par deney se mana kya tha. maine Salim se kaha lekin aap to kiraaya par detey hain. unhon-ne kaha ke haan, Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ne apne uper zyadti ki thii."
"4016, 4017","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) har tarah ke sanp ko mar daala kartey they. lekin jab abu-Lubaba Bashir bin abdul-Munzir (Raziallahu anhu) ne jo badr ki ladai mein Sharik they, unse bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghar mein nikalney waley sanp ke maarney se mana farmaya tha to unhon-ne bhi usey maarna chhod diya tha."
"4033, 4034","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bulaya tha. (wo bhi ameerul-momineen) ki khidmat mein maujood they ke ameerul-momineen ke chaukidar Yarfaa aaey aur arz kya ke Usman-bin-Affan aur Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Auf, Zubair-bin-Awaam aur Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) andar aana chahtey hain. kya aap ki taraf se unhein ijazat hai? ameerul-momineen ne farmaya ke haan, unhein andar bula lo. thodi der baad Yarfaa phir aaey aur arz kya Abbas aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) bhi ijazat chahtey hain kya unhein andar aaney ki ijazat hai? aap ne farmaya ke haan, jab ye bhi donon buzurg andar tashrif ley aaey to Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, ameerul-momineen ! mera aur in ( Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) ka faisla kar dijiye. wo donon us jaaidaad ke barey mein jhagad rahe they jo Allah Taala ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko maal banu- nazeer se faiy ke taur par di thi. us mauqe par Ali aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik doosrey ko sakht sust kaha aur aik doosrey par tanqeed ki to haaziriin boley, ameerul-momineen ! aap un donon buzurgon ka faisla kar dein taake donon mein koi jhagdaa na rahe. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, jaldi na keejiye. mein aap logon se us Allah ka waasta de kar poochhta hun jiske hukm se aasman w zameen qaaim hain, kya aapko malum hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke ham anbiya ki wiraasat taqseem nahi hoti jo kuchh ham chhod jayen wo sadqa hota hai aur us se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki murad khud apni zaat se thi? haaziriin boley ke ji haan, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya tha. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) Abbas aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unse kaha, main aap donon se bhi Allah ka waasta de kar poochhta hun. kya aapko bhi malum hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye hadis irshad farmai thi? un donon buzurgon ne bhi jawab haan mein diya. iske baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, phir main aap logon se us maamle par guftgu karta hun. Allah Taala ne apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us maale-faiy mein se (jo banu- nazeer se mila tha) aapko khas taur par ata farma diya tha. Allah Taala ne iske mutaalliq farmaya hai ke '' banu-nazeer ke maalon se jo Allah ne apne rasool ko diya hai to tum ne uske liye ghodey aur oont nahi daudaaey . (yani jang nahi ki) Allah Taala ka irshad '' qadeer '' tak. to ye maal khas Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye tha lekin Allah ki qasm ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tumhen nazar andaz karke apne liye usey makhsoos nahi farmaya tha na tum par apni zaat ko tarjeeh di thi. pahley us maal mein se tumhen diya aur tum mein uski taqseem ki aur aakhir us faiy mein se ye jaaidaad bach gaee. to aap apni paak beeviyon ka saalaana kharch bhi usi mein se nikaaltey they aur jo kuchh usmein se baqi bachta usey aap Allah Taala ke rastey mein kharch kartey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zindagi mein ye jaaidaad unhi raston mein kharch ki. phir jab aap ki wafat ho gaee to Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khaleefa bana diya gaya hai. isliye unhon-ne usey apne qabze mein ley liya aur usey unhi maamlon mein kharch kartey rahe jis main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kharch kya kartey they aur aap log yahin maujood they. iske baad umr (Raziallahu anhu) Ali (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya, aap logon ko malum hai ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi wahi tariqa ikhtiyar kya, jaisa ke aap logon ko bhi iska iqrar hai aur Allah ki qasm ke wo apne us tarze-amal mein sachchey, mukhlis, sahi rastey par aur haq ki pairwi karne waley they. phir Allah Taala ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhi utha liya, isliye maine kaha ke mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka khaleefa banaya gaya hai. chunanche main us jaaidaad par apni khilafat ke 2 saalon se qaabiz hun aur usey unhiin mamalon mein kharch karta hun jis mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kya tha aur Allah Taala janta hai ke main bhi apne tarze-amal mein sachchaa, mukhlis, sahi rastey par aur haq ki pairwi karne wala hun. phir aap donon mere paas aaey hain. aap donon aik hi hain aur aap ka mamla bhi aik hai. phir aap mere paas aaey. aap ki murad Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se thi. to maine aap donon ke samney ye baat saaf keh di thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma gaey they ke ''hamaaraa tarka taqseem nahi hota. ham jo kuchh chhod jayen wo sadqa hai.'' phir jab mere dil mein aaya ke wo jaaidaad bataur intizam mein aap donon ko de dun to maine aap se kaha ke agar aap chaahein to main ye jaaidaad aapko de sakta hun. lekin shart ye hai ke Allah Taala ke samney kiye huey ahad ki tamam zimme daariyon ko aap pura karein. aap logon ko malum hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur khud maine, jab se main khaleefa bana hun. us jaaidaad ke maamle mein kis tarze-amal ko ikhtiyar kya hua hai. agar ye shart aapko manzoor na ho to phir mujh se iske barey mein aap log baat na karein. aap logon ne is par kaha ke theek hai. aap isi shart par wo jaaidaad hamarey hawale kar dein. chunanche maine usey aap logon ke hawale kar diya. kya aap hazraat iske siwa koi aur faisla is silsiley mein mujh se karwaanaa chahtey hain? us Allah ki qasam! jiske hukm se aasman w zameen qaaim hain, qiyamat tak main iske siwa koi aur faisla nahi kar sakta. agar aap log (shart ke mutabiq iske intizam se) aajiz hain to wo jaaidaad mujhey wapas kar dein main khud uska intizam karunga. Malik bin Aus ne ye riwayat tum se sahi bayan ki hai. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak biwi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon ne Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ko Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas bheja aur unse darkhaast ki ke Allah Taala ne jo faiy apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko di thi usmein se unke hissey diye jaaein, lekin maine unhein rokaa aur unse kaha tum Allah se nahi dartii ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud nahi farmaya tha ke hamara tarka taqseem nahi hotaa? ham jo kuchh chhod jayen wo sadqa hota hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ishara us irshad mein khud apni zaat ki taraf tha. albatta aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us jaaidaad mein se poori zindagi (unki zarooriyaat ke liye) milta rahega. jab maine paak beeviyon ko ye hadis sunai to unhon-ne bhi apna khayal badal diya. Urwa ne kaha ke yahi wo sadqa hai jiska intizam pahley Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke hath mein tha. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ko iske intizam mein Sharik nahi kya tha balke khud iska intizam kartey they (aur jis tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey kharch kya tha, isi tarah unhiin raston mein wo bhi kharch kartey they) iske baad wo sadqa Hasan-bin-Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke intizam mein aa gaya tha. phir Husain bin Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke intizam mein raha. phir janab Ali-bin Husain aur Hasan-bin-Hasan ke intizam mein aa gaya tha aur ye haq hai ke ye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka sadqa tha."
"4035, 4036","Fatima (Raziallahu anha) aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zameen jo fidak mein thi aur jo khaibar mein aapko hissey mila tha, usmein se apni meeraas ka mutalba kya. maine khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke hamara tarka taqseem nahi hota. jo kuchh ham chhod jayen wo sadqa hai. albatta aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us jaaidaad mein se kharch zaroor milta rahega aur Allah ki qism ! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qaraabat daaron ke sath umda mamla karna mujhey khud apne qaraabat daaron ke sath husne-muaamlat se zyada azeez hai."
"4043, 4044","jange-Uhud ke mauqe par jab mushrekeen se muqable ke liye ham pahunchey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne teerandaazon ka aik dasta Abdullaah-bin-Jubair (Raziallahu anhu) ki ma-tehti main ( pahaadii par) muqarrar farmaya tha aur unhein ye hukm diya tha ke tum apni jagah se na hatna , us waqt bhi jab tum log dekh lo ke ham un par ghalib aagey hain phir bhi yahan se na hatna aur us waqt bhi jab dekh lo ke wo ham par ghalib aa gaey, tum log hamari madad ke liye na aana . phir jab hamari mudbhed kuffaar se hui to unmein bhagdad mach gaee. maine dekha ke unki auratein pahaadiyon par badi tezi ke sath bhaagii ja rahi thin, pindliyon se uper kapdey uthaey huey, jis se unke paazeb dikhai de rahe they. Abdullaah-bin-Jubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke) teerandaaz ( sathi kehney lagey ke ghaneemat ghaneemat . is par Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha ke mujhey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne takeed ki thi ke apni jagah se na hatna (is liye tum log maale-ghanimat lootney na jaao) lekin unke sathiyon ne unka hukm manney se inkar kar diya. unki us hukm ki nafarmani ke nateejey mein musalmanon ko haar hui aur 70 musalman Shahid ho gaey. iske baad Abu-Sufiyan ne pahaadii par se awaz di, kya tumharey sath Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maujood hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi jawab na de, phir unhon-ne poochha, kya tumharey sath ibn-abii-Qahaafa maujood hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske jawab ki bhi manaahii farma di. unhon-ne poochha, kya tumharey sath ibne-khattaab maujood hain? iske baad wo kehney lagey ke ye sab qatl kar diye gaey. agar zinda hotey to jawab detey. is par umr (Raziallahu anhu) be qaabu ho gaey aur farmaya : Allah ke dushman to jhoota hai. Allah ne abhi unhein tumhen zaleel karne liye baqi rakha hai. Abu-Sufiyan ne kaha, hubal (eik but ( buland rahe. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke iska jawab do. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ham kya jawab dein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho , Allah sabse buland aur buzurg w bartar hai. Abu-Sufiyan ne kaha, hamarey paas uzzaa (but) hai aur tumharey paas koi uzzaa nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke iska jawab do. sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya, kya jawab dein ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho , Allah hamara haami aur madadgaar hai aur tumhara koi haami nahi. Abu-Sufiyan ne kaha, aaj ka din badr ke din ka badla hai aur ladai ki misal dol ki hoti hai. ( kabhi hamarey hath main aur kabhi tumharey hath mein) tum apne maqtooleen mein kuchh laashon ka musla kya hua paogey, maine iska hukm nahi diya tha lekin mujhey bura nahi malum hua. kuchh sahaba ne Uhud ki jang ki subah ko sharab pi (jo abhi haram nahi hui thi) aur phir shahadat ki maut naseeb hui."
"4060, 4061","un jangon mein se jin main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuffaar se qitaal kya. kuchh jange-Uhud mein aik mauqe par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Talha aur Sad ke siwa aur koi baqi nahi reh gaya tha. abu-Usman ne ye baat Talha aur Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki thi. un jangon mein se jin main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuffaar se qitaal kya. kuchh jange-Uhud mein aik mauqe par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Talha aur Sad ke siwa aur koi baqi nahi reh gaya tha. abu-Usman ne ye baat Talha aur Sad (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat ki thii."
"4079, 4080","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Uhud ke shohdaa ko aik hi kapdey mein 2-2 ko kafan diya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) malum farmatey ke unmein Quran ka aalim sabse zyada kon hai? jab kisi aik ki taraf ishara karke aapko bataya jata to lahad mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhi ko aagey farmatey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ke din main un sab par gawah rahoonga. phir aap ne tamam shohdaa ko khoon samet dafn karne ka hukm farma diya aur unki namaaze-janaaza nahi padhi aur na unhein ghusl diya gaya. mere walid Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) Shahid kar diye gaey to main roney laga aur baar-baar unke chehrey se kapda hataataa . sahaba mujhey roktey they lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nahi rokaa. ( Fatima binte- umr (Raziallahu anhu) Abdullah ki behan bhi roney lagiin (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke ro'o mat. Farishtey barabar unki laash par apne paron ka saaya kiye huey they. yahan tak ke unko utha liya gaya."
"4157, 4158","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par taqriban aik hazaar sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ko sath lekar rawaana huey. jab aap zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to aap ne qurbani ke janwar ko haar pahnaayaa aur un par nishan lagaya aur Umre ka ehram baandhaa. main nahi shumaar kar sakta ke maine ye hadis Sufiyan bin Yasar se kitni baar suni aur aik martaba ye bhi suna ke wo bayan kar rahe they ke mujhey Zohri se nishan lagaaney aur haar pahnaaney ke mutaalliq yad nahi raha. isliye main nahi janta, us se unki murad sirf nishan lagaaney aur haar pahnaaney se thi ya poori hadis se thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par taqriban aik hazaar sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ko sath lekar rawaana huey. jab aap zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to aap ne qurbani ke janwar ko haar pahnaayaa aur un par nishan lagaya aur Umre ka ehram baandhaa. main nahi shumaar kar sakta ke maine ye hadis Sufiyan bin Yasar se kitni baar suni aur aik martaba ye bhi suna ke wo bayan kar rahe they ke mujhey Zohri se nishan lagaaney aur haar pahnaaney ke mutaalliq yad nahi raha. isliye main nahi janta, us se unki murad sirf nishan lagaaney aur haar pahnaaney se thi ya poori hadis se thi."
"4160, 4161","main umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath bazar gaya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) se aik naujawaan aurat ne mulaqat ki aur arz kya ke ameerul-momineen ! mere shauhar ki wafat ho gaee hai aur chand chhoti chhotii bachchiyaan chhod gaey hain. Allah ki qasm ke ab na unke paas bakri ke paaey hain ke unko pakka lein, na kheti hai, na doodh ke janwar hain. mujhey dar hai ke wo faqr w faaqa se halaak na ho jaaein. main Khufaaf bin Iimaa Ghifari (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti hun. mere walid Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jang Hudaibiya mein Sharik they. ye sun kar umr (Raziallahu anhu) unke paas thodi der ke liye khadey ho gaey, aagey nahi badhey. phir farmaya, marhabaa, tumhara khaandaanii talluq to bahut qaribi hai. phir aap aik bahut qawii oont ki taraf mudey jo ghar mein bandhaa hua tha aur is par 2 borey ghalley se bharey huey rakh diye. un donon boron ke darmyan rupya aur dusri zarurat ki cheezein aur kapdey rakh diye aur uski nakel unke hath mein thamaa kar farmaya ke isey ley jaa, ye khatm na hoga us se pahley hi Allah Taala tujhey is se behtar dega. aik sahib ne is par kaha, aey ameerul-momineen ! aap ne usey bahut de diya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, teri maan tujhey roey, Allah ki qasam! us aurat ke walid aur uske bhai jaisey ab bhi meri nazron ke samney hain ke aik muddat tak aik qile ke muhaasrey mein wo Sharik rahe, aakhir usey fateh kar liya. phir ham subah ko un donon ka hissa maale-ghanimat se wsool kar rahe they. main umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath bazar gaya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) se aik naujawaan aurat ne mulaqat ki aur arz kya ke ameerul-momineen ! mere shauhar ki wafat ho gaee hai aur chand chhoti chhotii bachchiyaan chhod gaey hain. Allah ki qasm ke ab na unke paas bakri ke paaey hain ke unko pakka lein, na kheti hai, na doodh ke janwar hain. mujhey dar hai ke wo faqr w faaqa se halaak na ho jaaein. main Khufaaf bin Iimaa Ghifari (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti hun. mere walid Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath jang Hudaibiya mein Sharik they. ye sun kar umr (Raziallahu anhu) unke paas thodi der ke liye khadey ho gaey, aagey nahi badhey. phir farmaya, marhabaa, tumhara khaandaanii talluq to bahut qaribi hai. phir aap aik bahut qawii oont ki taraf mudey jo ghar mein bandhaa hua tha aur is par 2 borey ghalley se bharey huey rakh diye. un donon boron ke darmyan rupya aur dusri zarurat ki cheezein aur kapdey rakh diye aur uski nakel unke hath mein thamaa kar farmaya ke isey ley jaa, ye khatm na hoga us se pahley hi Allah Taala tujhey is se behtar dega. aik sahib ne is par kaha, aey ameerul-momineen ! aap ne usey bahut de diya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, teri maan tujhey roey, Allah ki qasam! us aurat ke walid aur uske bhai jaisey ab bhi meri nazron ke samney hain ke aik muddat tak aik qile ke muhaasrey mein wo Sharik rahe, aakhir usey fateh kar liya. phir ham subah ko un donon ka hissa maale-ghanimat se wsool kar rahe they."
"4178, 4179","jab Zohri ne ye hadis bayan ki (jo aagey mazkoor hui hai) to usmein se kuchh maine yad rakhi aur Mamar ne usko achi tarah yad dilaya . unse Urwa-bin-Zubair ne, unse Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) aur Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne bayan kya, unmein se har aik doosrey se kuchh badhata hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par taqriban aik hazaar sahaba ko sath lekar rawaana huey. phir jab aap zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to aap ne qurbani ke janwar ko haar pahnaayaa aur is par nishan lagaya aur wahin se Umre ka ehram baandhaa. phir aap ne qabila khuza'aa ke aik sahabi ko jaasoosii ke liye bheja aur khud bhi safar jari rakha. jab aap Ghadeerul-ashtaat par pahunchey to aap ke jaasus bhi khabrein lekar aa gaey. jinhoney bataya ke Quraish ne aap ke muqaabley ke liye bahut bada lashkar taiyaar kar rakha hai aur bahut se qabaayel ko bulaya hai. wo aap se jang karne par tuley huey hain aur aapko Baitullah se rokengey. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke mujhey mashwara do kya tumharey khayal mein ye munasib hoga ke main un kuffaar ki aurton aur bachchon par hamla kar dun jo hamarey Baitullah tak pahunchne mein rukawat bannaa chahtey hain? agar unhon-ne hamara muqaabla kya to izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne mushrekeen se hamarey jaasus ko mehfooz rakha hai aur agar wo hamarey muqaabley par nahi aatey to ham unhein aik haarii hui qaum jaan kar chhod dengey. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! aap to sirf Baitullah ke Umra ke liye nikley hain na aap ka irada kisi ko qatl karne ka hai aur na kisi se ladai kaa. isliye aap Baitullah tashrif ley chalein . agar hamein phir bhi koi Baitullah tak janey se rokega to ham us se jang karengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Allah ka naam lekar safar jari rakho. jab Zohri ne ye hadis bayan ki (jo aagey mazkoor hui hai) to usmein se kuchh maine yad rakhi aur Mamar ne usko achi tarah yad dilaya . unse Urwa-bin-Zubair ne, unse Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) aur Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne bayan kya, unmein se har aik doosrey se kuchh badhata hai. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par taqriban aik hazaar sahaba ko sath lekar rawaana huey. phir jab aap zul-Hulaifa pahunchey to aap ne qurbani ke janwar ko haar pahnaayaa aur is par nishan lagaya aur wahin se Umre ka ehram baandhaa. phir aap ne qabila khuza'aa ke aik sahabi ko jaasoosii ke liye bheja aur khud bhi safar jari rakha. jab aap Ghadeerul-ashtaat par pahunchey to aap ke jaasus bhi khabrein lekar aa gaey. jinhoney bataya ke Quraish ne aap ke muqaabley ke liye bahut bada lashkar taiyaar kar rakha hai aur bahut se qabaayel ko bulaya hai. wo aap se jang karne par tuley huey hain aur aapko Baitullah se rokengey. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke mujhey mashwara do kya tumharey khayal mein ye munasib hoga ke main un kuffaar ki aurton aur bachchon par hamla kar dun jo hamarey Baitullah tak pahunchne mein rukawat bannaa chahtey hain? agar unhon-ne hamara muqaabla kya to izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ne mushrekeen se hamarey jaasus ko mehfooz rakha hai aur agar wo hamarey muqaabley par nahi aatey to ham unhein aik haarii hui qaum jaan kar chhod dengey. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! aap to sirf Baitullah ke Umra ke liye nikley hain na aap ka irada kisi ko qatl karne ka hai aur na kisi se ladai kaa. isliye aap Baitullah tashrif ley chalein . agar hamein phir bhi koi Baitullah tak janey se rokega to ham us se jang karengey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Allah ka naam lekar safar jari rakho."
"4180, 4181","mujh ko Urwa-bin-Zubair ne khabar di aur unhon-ne Marwaan-bin-Hakam aur Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, donon rawiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Umra Hudaibiya ke barey mein bayan kya to Urwa ne mujhey usmein jo kuchh khabar di thi, usmein ye bhi tha ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur (Quraish ka numaainda ( Suhail-bin-Amr Hudaibiya mein aik muqarrara muddat tak ke liye suleh ki dastaawez likh rahe they aur is mein Suhel ne ye shart bhi rakhi thi ke hamara agar koi aadmi aap ke yahan panah ley chahe wo aap ke Deen par hi kyon na ho jaey to aapko usey hamarey hawale karna hi hoga taake ham iske sath jo chaahein karein. Suhel us shart par ad gaya aur kehney laga ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us shart ko qabool kar lein aur musalman us shart par kisi tarah razi na they. majbooran unhon-ne is par guftgu ki (kaha ye kaise ho sakta hai ke musalman ko kaafir ke sipurd kar dein) Suhel ne kaha ke ye nahi ho sakta to suleh bhi nahi ho saktii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye shart bhi taslim kar li aur abu-jandal bin Suhel (Raziallahu anhu) ko unke walid Suhail-bin-Amr ke sipurd kar diya (jo usi waqt Makka se faraar ho kar bedii ko ghaseet'tey huey musalmanon ke paas pahunchey they) ( shart ke mutabiq suleh ki muddat main Makka se faraar ho kar) jo bhi aata Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey wapas kar detey, chahe wo musalman hi kyon na hota. us muddat mein kuchh momin auratein bhi hijrat karke Makka se aaein. umme-kulsoom binte- Aqba-ibn-abii-Mueet bhi unmein se hain jo us muddat main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai thin, wo us waqt naujawaan thin, unke ghar waley Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aap se mutalba kya ke unhein wapas kar dein. is par Allah Taala ne momin aurton ke barey mein wo aayat nazil ki jo shart ke munasib thi. mujh ko Urwa-bin-Zubair ne khabar di aur unhon-ne Marwaan-bin-Hakam aur Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, donon rawiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Umra Hudaibiya ke barey mein bayan kya to Urwa ne mujhey usmein jo kuchh khabar di thi, usmein ye bhi tha ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur (Quraish ka numaainda ( Suhail-bin-Amr Hudaibiya mein aik muqarrara muddat tak ke liye suleh ki dastaawez likh rahe they aur is mein Suhel ne ye shart bhi rakhi thi ke hamara agar koi aadmi aap ke yahan panah ley chahe wo aap ke Deen par hi kyon na ho jaey to aapko usey hamarey hawale karna hi hoga taake ham iske sath jo chaahein karein. Suhel us shart par ad gaya aur kehney laga ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us shart ko qabool kar lein aur musalman us shart par kisi tarah razi na they. majbooran unhon-ne is par guftgu ki (kaha ye kaise ho sakta hai ke musalman ko kaafir ke sipurd kar dein) Suhel ne kaha ke ye nahi ho sakta to suleh bhi nahi ho saktii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye shart bhi taslim kar li aur abu-jandal bin Suhel (Raziallahu anhu) ko unke walid Suhail-bin-Amr ke sipurd kar diya (jo usi waqt Makka se faraar ho kar bedii ko ghaseet'tey huey musalmanon ke paas pahunchey they) ( shart ke mutabiq suleh ki muddat main Makka se faraar ho kar) jo bhi aata Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey wapas kar detey, chahe wo musalman hi kyon na hota. us muddat mein kuchh momin auratein bhi hijrat karke Makka se aaein. umme-kulsoom binte- Aqba-ibn-abii-Mueet bhi unmein se hain jo us muddat main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aai thin, wo us waqt naujawaan thin, unke ghar waley Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur aap se mutalba kya ke unhein wapas kar dein. is par Allah Taala ne momin aurton ke barey mein wo aayat nazil ki jo shart ke munasib thii."
"4221, 4222","wo log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, phir unhein gadhey miley to unhon-ne unka gosht pakaya lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke manaadii ne elaan kya ke haandiyaan undel do. wo log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they, phir unhein gadhey miley to unhon-ne unka gosht pakaya lekin Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke manaadii ne elaan kya ke haandiyaan undel do."
"4223, 4224","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar ki jang ke mauqe par farmaya tha ke haandiyon ka gosht phenk do, us waqt haandiyaan choolhey par rakhi ja chuki thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar ki jang ke mauqe par farmaya tha ke haandiyon ka gosht phenk do, us waqt haandiyaan choolhey par rakhi ja chuki thin."
"4240, 4241","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas kisi ko bheja aur unse apni meeraas ka mutalba kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us maal se jo aapko Allah Taala ne Madina aur fidak mein inayat farmaya tha aur khaibar ka jo panchwan hissey reh gaya tha. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye jawab diya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud hi irshad farmaya tha ke ham paighambaron ka koi waaris nahi hota, ham jo kuchh chhod jayen wo sab sadqa hota hai, albatta aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usi maal se khaatii rahegi aur main, Allah ki qism ! jo sadqa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chhod gaey hain usmein kisi qism ka badlaaw nahi karunga. jis haal mein wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein tha ab bhi isi tarah rahega aur us main (uskii taqseem wghaira) mein main bhi wahi tarze-amal ikhtiyar karunga jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka apni zindagi mein tha. gharaz Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko kuchh bhi dena manzoor na kya. is par Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se khafa ho gain aur unse tarake-mulaaqaat kar liya aur uske baad wafat tak unse koi guftgu nahi ki. Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad chh mahiney tak zinda rahiin. jab unki wafat hui to unke shauhar Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein raat mein dafn kar diya aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko uski khabar nahi di aur khud unki namaaze-janaaza padh li. Fatima (Raziallahu anha) jab tak zinda rahiin Ali (Raziallahu anhu) par log bahut tawajjoh rakhtey rahe lekin unki wafat ke baad unhon-ne dekha ke ab logon ke munh unki taraf se phirey huey hain. us waqt unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se suleh kar lena aur unse bait kar lena chaha. us se pahley chh maah tak unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se bait nahi ki thi phir unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bula bheja aur kelha bheja ke aap sirf tanha aaein aur kisi ko apne sath na laaein unko ye manzoor na tha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) unke sath aaein . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke Allah ki qism ! aap tanha unke paas na jaaein. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha kyon wo mere sath kya karengey main to Allah ki qism ! zaroor unke paas jaaunga. aakhir aap Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaey. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Allah ko gawah kya, uske baad farmaya hamein aap ke Fazal w kamaal aur jo kuchh Allah Taala ne aapko bakhshaa hai, sab ka hamein iqrar hai jo khair w imtiyaz aapko Allah Taala ne diya tha ham ne usmein koi kami bhi nahi ki lekin aap ne hamarey sath zyadti ki (ke khilafat ke maamle mein ham se koi mashwara nahi liyaa) ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath apni qaraabat ki wjah se apna haq samajhtey they (ke aap ham se mashwara kartey) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) par un baton se giryaa (ronaa) taarii ho gaee aur jab baat karne ke qaabil huey to farmaya us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qaraabat ke sath sila-rehmii mujhey apni qaraabat se sila rehmii se zyada azeez hai. lekin mere aur logon ke darmyan un amwaal ke silsiley mein jo ikhtilaf hua hai to main usmein haq aur khair se nahi hata hun aur is silsile mein jo rasta maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka dekha khud maine bhi usi ko ikhtiyar kya. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke do-pahar ke baad mein aap se bait karunga. chunanche Zohar ki Namaz se farigh ho kar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) member par aaey aur khutbe ke baad Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley ka aur unke ab tak bait na karne ka zikr kya aur wo uzr bhi bayan kya jo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne pesh kya tha. phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne istighfar aur shahadat ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka haq aur unki buzurgi bayan ki aur farmaya ke jo kuchh unhon-ne kya hai iski wjah Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se hasad nahi tha aur na unke Fazal w kamaal ka inkar maqsud tha jo Allah Taala ne unhein inayat farmaya ye baat zaroor thi ke ham is muaamlae-khilaafat mein apna haq samajhtey they (ke ham se mashwara liya jaataa) hamarey sath yahi zyadti hui thi jis se hamein ranj pahuncha. musalman us waaqie par bahut khush huey aur kaha ke aap ne durust farmaya, jab Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne us maamle mein ye munasib rasta ikhtiyar kar liya to musalman unse khush ho gaey aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se aur zyada mohabbat karne lagey jab dekha ke unhon-ne achi baat ikhtiyar kar li hai. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas kisi ko bheja aur unse apni meeraas ka mutalba kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us maal se jo aapko Allah Taala ne Madina aur fidak mein inayat farmaya tha aur khaibar ka jo panchwan hissey reh gaya tha. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne ye jawab diya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud hi irshad farmaya tha ke ham paighambaron ka koi waaris nahi hota, ham jo kuchh chhod jayen wo sab sadqa hota hai, albatta aale-Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usi maal se khaatii rahegi aur main, Allah ki qism ! jo sadqa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chhod gaey hain usmein kisi qism ka badlaaw nahi karunga. jis haal mein wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein tha ab bhi isi tarah rahega aur us main (uskii taqseem wghaira) mein main bhi wahi tarze-amal ikhtiyar karunga jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka apni zindagi mein tha. gharaz Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko kuchh bhi dena manzoor na kya. is par Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki taraf se khafa ho gain aur unse tarake-mulaaqaat kar liya aur uske baad wafat tak unse koi guftgu nahi ki. Fatima (Raziallahu anha) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke baad chh mahiney tak zinda rahiin. jab unki wafat hui to unke shauhar Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein raat mein dafn kar diya aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko uski khabar nahi di aur khud unki namaaze-janaaza padh li. Fatima (Raziallahu anha) jab tak zinda rahiin Ali (Raziallahu anhu) par log bahut tawajjoh rakhtey rahe lekin unki wafat ke baad unhon-ne dekha ke ab logon ke munh unki taraf se phirey huey hain. us waqt unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se suleh kar lena aur unse bait kar lena chaha. us se pahley chh maah tak unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se bait nahi ki thi phir unhon-ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ko bula bheja aur kelha bheja ke aap sirf tanha aaein aur kisi ko apne sath na laaein unko ye manzoor na tha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) unke sath aaein . umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke Allah ki qism ! aap tanha unke paas na jaaein. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha kyon wo mere sath kya karengey main to Allah ki qism ! zaroor unke paas jaaunga. aakhir aap Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaey. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Allah ko gawah kya, uske baad farmaya hamein aap ke Fazal w kamaal aur jo kuchh Allah Taala ne aapko bakhshaa hai, sab ka hamein iqrar hai jo khair w imtiyaz aapko Allah Taala ne diya tha ham ne usmein koi kami bhi nahi ki lekin aap ne hamarey sath zyadti ki (ke khilafat ke maamle mein ham se koi mashwara nahi liyaa) ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath apni qaraabat ki wjah se apna haq samajhtey they (ke aap ham se mashwara kartey) Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) par un baton se giryaa (ronaa) taarii ho gaee aur jab baat karne ke qaabil huey to farmaya us zaat ki qasam! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki qaraabat ke sath sila-rehmii mujhey apni qaraabat se sila rehmii se zyada azeez hai. lekin mere aur logon ke darmyan un amwaal ke silsiley mein jo ikhtilaf hua hai to main usmein haq aur khair se nahi hata hun aur is silsile mein jo rasta maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka dekha khud maine bhi usi ko ikhtiyar kya. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha ke do-pahar ke baad mein aap se bait karunga. chunanche Zohar ki Namaz se farigh ho kar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) member par aaey aur khutbe ke baad Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke mamley ka aur unke ab tak bait na karne ka zikr kya aur wo uzr bhi bayan kya jo Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne pesh kya tha. phir Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne istighfar aur shahadat ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ka haq aur unki buzurgi bayan ki aur farmaya ke jo kuchh unhon-ne kya hai iski wjah Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) se hasad nahi tha aur na unke Fazal w kamaal ka inkar maqsud tha jo Allah Taala ne unhein inayat farmaya ye baat zaroor thi ke ham is muaamlae-khilaafat mein apna haq samajhtey they (ke ham se mashwara liya jaataa) hamarey sath yahi zyadti hui thi jis se hamein ranj pahuncha. musalman us waaqie par bahut khush huey aur kaha ke aap ne durust farmaya, jab Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne us maamle mein ye munasib rasta ikhtiyar kar liya to musalman unse khush ho gaey aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) se aur zyada mohabbat karne lagey jab dekha ke unhon-ne achi baat ikhtiyar kar li hai."
"4244, 4245","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi (Suwaad-bin-Ghaziya (Raziallahu anhu)) ko khaibar ka aamil muqarrar kya. wo wahan se umda qism ki khajoorein laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoorein aisi hi hain? unhon-ne arz kya ke nahi, Allah ki qism ya Rasulullah ! ham is tarah ki aik saa khajoor (is se kharaab ( 2 ya teen saa khajoor ke badley mein unse ley letey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah na kya karo, balke (agar achi khajoor laanii ho to) raddi khajoor pahley dirham ke badley beech daala karo, phir un daraahim se achi khajoor khareed liya karo. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahabi (Suwaad-bin-Ghaziya (Raziallahu anhu)) ko khaibar ka aamil muqarrar kya. wo wahan se umda qism ki khajoorein laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke kya khaibar ki tamam khajoorein aisi hi hain? unhon-ne arz kya ke nahi, Allah ki qism ya Rasulullah ! ham is tarah ki aik saa khajoor (is se kharaab ( 2 ya teen saa khajoor ke badley mein unse ley letey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah na kya karo, balke (agar achi khajoor laanii ho to) raddi khajoor pahley dirham ke badley beech daala karo, phir un daraahim se achi khajoor khareed liya karo."
"4246, 4247","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ke khandan bani Adi ke bhai ko khaibar bheja aur unhein wahan ka aamil muqarrar kya aur Abdul-Majeed se riwayat hai ke unse Abu-Saleh samaan ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) aur abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi tarah naql kya hai. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ke khandan bani Adi ke bhai ko khaibar bheja aur unhein wahan ka aamil muqarrar kya aur Abdul-Majeed se riwayat hai ke unse Abu-Saleh samaan ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) aur abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne isi tarah naql kya hai."
"4253, 4254","main aur Urwa-bin-Zubair donon masjide-Nabawi mein dakhil huey to ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujrey ke nazdeek baithey huey they. Urwa ne sawal kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kal kitney Umerey kiye they? ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke char aur aik unmein se rajab mein kya tha. phir ham ne Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke (apne ghar mein) miswak karne ki awaz suni to Urwa ne unse puchha : aey eman walon ki maan! aap ne suna hai ya nahi, abu-Abdur-Rehman (Abdullaah-bin-Umar (rz)) kehtey hain ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne char Umerey kiye they jis mein se aik rajab mein kya tha. Ummul-Momenin (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jab bhi Umra kya to Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) aap ke sath they lekin aap ne rajab mein koi Umra nahi kya."
"4282, 4283","fateh Makka ke safar mein unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : ya Rasulullah! kal (Makka mein) aap kahan qiyam farmaaengey ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hamarey liye Aqeel ne koi ghar hi kahan chhoda hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke momin, kaafir ka waaris nahi ho sakta aur na kaafir momin ka waaris ho sakta hai. Zohri se puchha gaya ke phir abu-Taalib ki wiraasat kisey mili thi? unhon-ne bataya ke unke waaris Aqeel aur taalib huey they. Mamar ne Zohri se ( Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ka sawal yun naql kya hai ke) aap apne Haj ke doran kahan qiyam farmaaengey ? aur Yunus ne (apni riwayat mein) na Haj ka zikr kya hai aur na fateh Makka kaa."
"4305, 4306","fateh Makka ke baad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne bhai ( majaalid ( ko lekar hazir hua aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! main isey isliye lekar hazir hua hun taake aap hijrat par is se bait ley lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat karne waley uski fazeelat w sawab ko hasil kar chukey (yani ab hijrat karne ka zamana to guzar chukaa). maine arz kya : phir aap is se kis cheez par bait lengey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke eman , Islam aur jihad par. abi Usman nehdi ne kaha ke phir main (majaashea' ke bhai ( abu-Ma'bad majaalid se mila wo donon bhaiyon se badey they, maine unse bhi us hadis ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke majaashea' ne hadis theek tarah bayan ki hai. fatah Makka ke baad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne bhai ( majaalid ( ko lekar hazir hua aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! main isey isliye lekar hazir hua hun taake aap hijrat par is se bait ley lein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat karne waley uski fazeelat w sawab ko hasil kar chukey (yani ab hijrat karne ka zamana to guzar chukaa). maine arz kya : phir aap is se kis cheez par bait lengey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke eman , Islam aur jihad par. abi Usman nehdi ne kaha ke phir main (majaashea' ke bhai ( abu-Ma'bad majaalid se mila wo donon bhaiyon se badey they, maine unse bhi us hadis ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke majaashea' ne hadis theek tarah bayan ki hai."
"4307, 4308","main apne bhai ( abu-Ma'bad (Raziallahu anhu)) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aap se hijrat par bait karaaney ke liye ley gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat ka sawab to hijrat karne walon ke sath khatm ho chukaa. albatta main is se Islam aur jihad par bait leta hun. abu-Usman ne kaha ke phir maine abu-Ma'bad (Raziallahu anhu) se mil kar unse iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke majaashea' (Raziallahu anhu) ne theek bayan kya aur Khalid Hazaa ne bhi abu-Usman se bayan kya, unse majaashea' (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke wo apne bhai majaalid (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar aaey they, (phir hadis ko aakhir tak bayan kya, isko Ismail ne wasl kya hai). main apne bhai ( abu-Ma'bad (Raziallahu anhu)) ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aap se hijrat par bait karaaney ke liye ley gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke hijrat ka sawab to hijrat karne walon ke sath khatm ho chukaa. albatta main is se Islam aur jihad par bait leta hun. abu-Usman ne kaha ke phir maine abu-Ma'bad (Raziallahu anhu) se mil kar unse iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke majaashea' (Raziallahu anhu) ne theek bayan kya aur Khalid Hazaa ne bhi abu-Usman se bayan kya, unse majaashea' (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke wo apne bhai majaalid (Raziallahu anhu) ko lekar aaey they, (phir hadis ko aakhir tak bayan kya, isko Ismail ne wasl kya hai)."
"4318, 4319","jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukhsat dene khadey huey, unhon-ne aap se ye darkhaast ki ke unka maal aur unke (qabeeley ke qaidi) unhein wapas de diye jaaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jaisa ke tum log dekh rahe ho, mere sath kitney aur log bhi hain aur dekho sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai. isliye tum log aik hi cheez pasand kar lo ya to apne qaidi ley lo ya maal ley lo. maine tum hi logon ke khayal se (qaidiyon ki taqseem mein) taakheer ki thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se wapas ho kar taqriban das din unka intizar kya tha. aakhir jab un par waazeh ho gaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein sirf aik hi cheez wapas karengey to unhon-ne kaha ke phir ham apne ( qabeeley ke) qaidiyon ki waapsii chahtey hain. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab kya, Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq sana karne ke baad farmaya : ammaa ba'd! tumharey bhai (qabeela Hawazin ke log) tauba karke hamarey paas aaey hain, musalman ho kar aur meri raey ye hai ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. isliye jo shakhs (bila kisi duniyawi sile ke) unhein apni khushi se wapas karna chahey wo wapas kar de ye behtar hai aur jo log apna hissey na chhodnaa chahtey hun, unka haq qaaim rahega. wo yun kar lein ke iske baad jo sabse pahley ghaneemat Allah Taala hamein inayat farmaeyga usmein se ham unhein iske badle de dengey to wo unke qaidi wapas kar dein. tamam sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! ham khushi se (bila kisi badle ke) wapas karna chahtey hain lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah hamein iska ilm nahi hoga ke kis ne apni khushi se wapas kya hai aur kis ne nahi, isliye sab log jayen aur tumharey chaudhry log tumhara faisla hamarey paas laaein . chunanche sab wapas aagey aur unke chaudhariyon ne unse guftgu ki phir wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke sab ne khushi aur khuley dil ke sath ijazat de di hai. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha yahi hai wo hadis jo mujhey qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq pahunchi hai. jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) rukhsat dene khadey huey, unhon-ne aap se ye darkhaast ki ke unka maal aur unke (qabeeley ke qaidi) unhein wapas de diye jaaein. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jaisa ke tum log dekh rahe ho, mere sath kitney aur log bhi hain aur dekho sachchii baat mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai. isliye tum log aik hi cheez pasand kar lo ya to apne qaidi ley lo ya maal ley lo. maine tum hi logon ke khayal se (qaidiyon ki taqseem mein) taakheer ki thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif se wapas ho kar taqriban das din unka intizar kya tha. aakhir jab un par waazeh ho gaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhein sirf aik hi cheez wapas karengey to unhon-ne kaha ke phir ham apne ( qabeeley ke) qaidiyon ki waapsii chahtey hain. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne musalmanon ko khitab kya, Allah Taala ki uski shaan ke mutabiq sana karne ke baad farmaya : ammaa ba'd! tumharey bhai (qabeela Hawazin ke log) tauba karke hamarey paas aaey hain, musalman ho kar aur meri raey ye hai ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. isliye jo shakhs (bila kisi duniyawi sile ke) unhein apni khushi se wapas karna chahey wo wapas kar de ye behtar hai aur jo log apna hissey na chhodnaa chahtey hun, unka haq qaaim rahega. wo yun kar lein ke iske baad jo sabse pahley ghaneemat Allah Taala hamein inayat farmaeyga usmein se ham unhein iske badle de dengey to wo unke qaidi wapas kar dein. tamam sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! ham khushi se (bila kisi badle ke) wapas karna chahtey hain lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah hamein iska ilm nahi hoga ke kis ne apni khushi se wapas kya hai aur kis ne nahi, isliye sab log jayen aur tumharey chaudhry log tumhara faisla hamarey paas laaein . chunanche sab wapas aagey aur unke chaudhariyon ne unse guftgu ki phir wo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur arz kya ke sab ne khushi aur khuley dil ke sath ijazat de di hai. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha yahi hai wo hadis jo mujhey qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq pahunchi hai."
"4326, 4327","maine Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, jinhoney sabse pahley Allah ke rastey mein teer chillaayaa tha aur Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se jo Taaif ke qil'ey par chand musalmanon ke sath chadhey they aur is tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey they. un donon sahaabiyon ne bayan kya ke ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they ke jo shakhs jantey huey apne bap ke siwa kisi doosrey ki taraf apne aapko mansub karey to is par jannat haram hai. aur Hisham ne bayan kya aur unhein Mamar ne khabar di, unhein Aasim ne, unhein abul-Aaliyaa ya abu-Usman nehdi ne, kaha ke maine Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Aasim ne bayan kya ke maine (abul-Aaliyaa ya abu-Usman nehdi (rz)) se kaha aap se ye riwayat aisey 2 ashaab (Sa'd aur Abu-Bakra (rz)) ne bayan ki hai ke yaqin ke liye unke naam kafi hain. unhon-ne kaha yaqinan unmein se aik (Sa'd-bin-abii-Waqaas (rz)) to wo hain jinhoney Allah ke rastey mein sabse pahley teer chillaayaa tha aur doosrey (abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu)) wo hain jo teeswein aadmi they un logon mein jo Taaif ke qil'a se utar kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey they. maine Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, jinhoney sabse pahley Allah ke rastey mein teer chillaayaa tha aur Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se jo Taaif ke qil'ey par chand musalmanon ke sath chadhey they aur is tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey they. un donon sahaabiyon ne bayan kya ke ham ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap farma rahe they ke jo shakhs jantey huey apne bap ke siwa kisi doosrey ki taraf apne aapko mansub karey to is par jannat haram hai. aur Hisham ne bayan kya aur unhein Mamar ne khabar di, unhein Aasim ne, unhein abul-Aaliyaa ya abu-Usman nehdi ne, kaha ke maine Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) aur Abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Aasim ne bayan kya ke maine (abul-Aaliyaa ya abu-Usman nehdi (rz)) se kaha aap se ye riwayat aisey 2 ashaab (Sa'd aur Abu-Bakra (rz)) ne bayan ki hai ke yaqin ke liye unke naam kafi hain. unhon-ne kaha yaqinan unmein se aik (Sa'd-bin-abii-Waqaas (rz)) to wo hain jinhoney Allah ke rastey mein sabse pahley teer chillaayaa tha aur doosrey (abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu)) wo hain jo teeswein aadmi they un logon mein jo Taaif ke qil'a se utar kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey they."
"4341, 4342","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Musa Ash-ari aur Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ka Hakim bana kar bhejaa. rawi ne bayan kya ke donon sahaabiyon ko iske eik-eik soobey mein bhejaa. rawi ne bayan kya ke Yaman ke 2 soobey they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke dekho logon ke liye aasaaniyaan paida karnaa, dushwaariyaan na paida karnaa, unhein khush karne ki koshish karnaa, Deen se nafrat na dilaanaa . ye donon buzurg apne apney kaamon par rawaana ho gaey. donon mein se jab koi apne ilaaqey ka daurah kartey kartey apne doosrey sathi ke paas pahunch jata to unse taazii ( mulaqat (ke liye aata aur salam karta. aik martaba Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) apne ilaqe mein apne sahib abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb pahunch gaey aur apne khachchar par unse mulaqat ke liye chaley. jab unke qareeb pahunchey to dekha ke wo baithey huey hain aur unke paas kuchh log jama hain aur aik shakhs unke samney hai jiski mashkein kasi hui hain. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse puchha : aey Abdullah-bin-Qais ! ye kya waqia hai? abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke ye shakhs Islam laney ke baad murtad ho gaya hai. unhon-ne kaha ke phir jab tak usey qatl na kar diya jaey main apni sawari se nahi utroonga. Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qatl karne hi ke liye usey yahan laya gaya hai. aap utar jayen lekin unhon-ne ab bhi yahi kaha ke jab tak usey qatl na kya jaeyga main na utroonga. aakhir Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya aur usey qatl kar diya gaya. tab wo apni sawari se utrey aur poochha, Abdullah ! aap Quran kis tarah padhtey hain? unhon-ne kaha, main to thoda thodaa har waqt padhta rehta hun phir unhon-ne Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke Muaz ! aap Quran Majeed kis tarah padhtey hain? Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main to raat ke shuru mein sota hun phir apni neend ka aik hissey pura karke mein uth baithtaa hun aur jo kuchh Allah Taala ne mere liye muqaddar kar rakha hai is mein Quran Majeed padhta hun. is tarah bedaarii mein jis sawab ki ummeed Allah Taala se rakhta hun soney ki haalat ke sawab ka bhi us se isi tarah ummeedwaar rehta hun. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Musa Ash-ari aur Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ka Hakim bana kar bhejaa. rawi ne bayan kya ke donon sahaabiyon ko iske eik-eik soobey mein bhejaa. rawi ne bayan kya ke Yaman ke 2 soobey they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke dekho logon ke liye aasaaniyaan paida karnaa, dushwaariyaan na paida karnaa, unhein khush karne ki koshish karnaa, Deen se nafrat na dilaanaa . ye donon buzurg apne apney kaamon par rawaana ho gaey. donon mein se jab koi apne ilaaqey ka daurah kartey kartey apne doosrey sathi ke paas pahunch jata to unse taazii ( mulaqat (ke liye aata aur salam karta. aik martaba Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) apne ilaqe mein apne sahib abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ke qareeb pahunch gaey aur apne khachchar par unse mulaqat ke liye chaley. jab unke qareeb pahunchey to dekha ke wo baithey huey hain aur unke paas kuchh log jama hain aur aik shakhs unke samney hai jiski mashkein kasi hui hain. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse puchha : aey Abdullah-bin-Qais ! ye kya waqia hai? abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke ye shakhs Islam laney ke baad murtad ho gaya hai. unhon-ne kaha ke phir jab tak usey qatl na kar diya jaey main apni sawari se nahi utroonga. Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke qatl karne hi ke liye usey yahan laya gaya hai. aap utar jayen lekin unhon-ne ab bhi yahi kaha ke jab tak usey qatl na kya jaeyga main na utroonga. aakhir Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya aur usey qatl kar diya gaya. tab wo apni sawari se utrey aur poochha, Abdullah ! aap Quran kis tarah padhtey hain? unhon-ne kaha, main to thoda thodaa har waqt padhta rehta hun phir unhon-ne Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha ke Muaz ! aap Quran Majeed kis tarah padhtey hain? Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main to raat ke shuru mein sota hun phir apni neend ka aik hissey pura karke mein uth baithtaa hun aur jo kuchh Allah Taala ne mere liye muqaddar kar rakha hai is mein Quran Majeed padhta hun. is tarah bedaarii mein jis sawab ki ummeed Allah Taala se rakhta hun soney ki haalat ke sawab ka bhi us se isi tarah ummeedwaar rehta hoon."
"4344, 4345","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke dada abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) aur Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ka Hakim bana kar bheja aur farmaya ke logon ke liye aasani paida karnaa, unko dushwaariyon mein na daalnaa . logon ko khush khabriyaan dena Deen se nafrat na dilaanaa aur tum donon aapas mein muwafiqat rakhna. is par abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! hamarey mulk mein jau se aik sharab taiyaar hoti hai jiska naam '' Muzar '' hai aur shehad se aik sharab taiyaar hoti hai jo '' bitaa' '' kahlaatii hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har nasha laney wali cheez haram hai. phir donon buzurg rawaana huey. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha aap Quran kis tarah padhtey hain? unhon-ne bataya ke khadey ho kar bhi, baith kar bhi aur apni sawari par bhi aur main thodey thodey arsa baad padhta hi rehta hun. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha lekin mera mamool (routine) ye hai ke shuru raat mein, main so jata hun aur phir bedaar ho jata hun. is tarah main apni neend par bhi sawab ka ummeedwaar hun jis tarah bedaar ho kar) ibadat karne par) sawab ki mujhey ummeed hai aur unhon-ne aik khema laga liya aur aik doosrey se mulaqat barabar hoti rehti . aik martaba Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se milney ke liye aaey, dekha aik shakhs bandhaa hua hai. puchha ye kya baat hai? abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke ye aik Yahudi hai, pahley khud Islam laya ab ye murtad ho gaya hai. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main usey qatl kiye baghair hargiz na rahunga . Muslim-bin Ibrahim ke sath is hadis ko Abdul-Malik bin-Amr aqadii aur Wahab bin Jarir ne Shoba se riwayat kya hai aur Wakee , nazar aur Abu-Dawud ne isko Shoba se, unhon-ne Saeed se, unhon apne bap burda se, unhon-ne Saeed ke dada abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya aur Jarir bin abdul-Hameed ne usko Shebani se riwayat kya, unhon-ne abu-Barda se. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke dada abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) aur Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman ka Hakim bana kar bheja aur farmaya ke logon ke liye aasani paida karnaa, unko dushwaariyon mein na daalnaa . logon ko khush khabriyaan dena Deen se nafrat na dilaanaa aur tum donon aapas mein muwafiqat rakhna. is par abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya : aey Allah ke Nabi ! hamarey mulk mein jau se aik sharab taiyaar hoti hai jiska naam '' Muzar '' hai aur shehad se aik sharab taiyaar hoti hai jo '' bitaa' '' kahlaatii hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har nasha laney wali cheez haram hai. phir donon buzurg rawaana huey. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha aap Quran kis tarah padhtey hain? unhon-ne bataya ke khadey ho kar bhi, baith kar bhi aur apni sawari par bhi aur main thodey thodey arsa baad padhta hi rehta hun. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha lekin mera mamool (routine) ye hai ke shuru raat mein, main so jata hun aur phir bedaar ho jata hun. is tarah main apni neend par bhi sawab ka ummeedwaar hun jis tarah bedaar ho kar) ibadat karne par) sawab ki mujhey ummeed hai aur unhon-ne aik khema laga liya aur aik doosrey se mulaqat barabar hoti rehti . aik martaba Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se milney ke liye aaey, dekha aik shakhs bandhaa hua hai. puchha ye kya baat hai? abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke ye aik Yahudi hai, pahley khud Islam laya ab ye murtad ho gaya hai. Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main usey qatl kiye baghair hargiz na rahunga . Muslim-bin Ibrahim ke sath is hadis ko Abdul-Malik bin-Amr aqadii aur Wahab bin Jarir ne Shoba se riwayat kya hai aur Wakee , nazar aur Abu-Dawud ne isko Shoba se, unhon-ne Saeed se, unhon apne bap burda se, unhon-ne Saeed ke dada abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat kya aur Jarir bin abdul-Hameed ne usko Shebani se riwayat kya, unhon-ne abu-Barda se."
"4353, 4354","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umra aur Haj donon ka ehram baandha tha aur ham ne bhi aap ke sath Haj hi ka ehram baandha tha. phir ham jab Makka aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jiske sath qurbani ka janwar na ho wo apne Haj ke ehram ko Umre ka ehram kar ley (aur tawaaf aur saee karke ehram khol de) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath qurbani ka janwar tha. phir Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) Yaman se lot kar Haj ka ehram baandh kar aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke tum ne kis tarah ehram baandha hai? hamarey sath tumhari bevi Fatima bhi hain. unhon-ne arz kya ke maine isi tarah ka ehram baandha hai jis tarah Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baandha ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir apne ehram par qaaim raho, kyonke hamarey sath qurbani ka janwar hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Umra aur Haj donon ka ehram baandha tha aur ham ne bhi aap ke sath Haj hi ka ehram baandha tha. phir ham jab Makka aaey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jiske sath qurbani ka janwar na ho wo apne Haj ke ehram ko Umre ka ehram kar ley (aur tawaaf aur saee karke ehram khol de) aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath qurbani ka janwar tha. phir Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) Yaman se lot kar Haj ka ehram baandh kar aaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke tum ne kis tarah ehram baandha hai? hamarey sath tumhari bevi Fatima bhi hain. unhon-ne arz kya ke maine isi tarah ka ehram baandha hai jis tarah Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne baandha ho. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir apne ehram par qaaim raho, kyonke hamarey sath qurbani ka janwar hai."
"4373, 4374","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein Musailma kazzaab aaya, is da'we ke sath ke agar Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey apne baad) apna naaib w khaleefa ( bana dein to main unki ittaba (pairvi) kar loon. iske sath uski qaum (banu-Haneefa) ka bahut bada lashkar tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski taraf tableegh ke liye tashrif ley gaey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sabit bin Qais-bin Shamas (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. aap ke hath mein khajoor ki aik tahnii thi. jahan Musailma apni fauj ke sath padao kiye huey tha, aap wahin ja kar thahar gaey aur aap ne us se farmaya agar to mujh se ye tahnii maangega to main tujhey ye bhi nahi doonga aur to Allah ke us faisley se aagey nahi badh sakta jo terey barey mein pahley hi ho chuka hai. tu ney agar meri itaat se ru-gardani (munh pherna) ki to Allah Taala tujhey halaak kar dega. mera to khayal hai ke to wahi hai jo mujhey khuwab mein dikhaya gaya tha. ab teri baton ka jawab meri taraf se Saabit-bin-Qais dengey, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas tashrif laey. phir maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad ke mutaalliq puchha ke ''meraa khayal to ye hai ke to wahi hai jo mujhey khuwab mein dikhaya gaya tha.'' to Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main soyaa hua tha, maine apne hathon mein soney ke 2 kangan dekhey, mujhey unhein dekh kar bada dukh hua phir khuwab hi mein mujh par wahi ki gaee ke main unmein phoonk mar dun. chunanche maine unmein phoonkaa to wo ud gaey. maine uski tabeer 2 jhooton se li jo mere baad niklengey. aik Aswad ansaa tha aur doosra Musailma kazzaab, jin har 2 ko khuda ne phoonk ki tarah khatm kar diya."
"4376, 4377","ham pahley patthar ki puja kartey they aur agar koi patthar hamein us se achchha mil jata to usey phenk detey aur us doosrey ki puja shuru kar detey. agar hamein patthar na milta to mitti ka aik teela bana letey aur bakri la kar is par dohtey aur uske gird tawaaf kartey. jab rajab ka mahina aa jata to ham kehtey ke ye mahina nezon ko door rakhney ka hai. chunanche hamarey paas lohey se baney huey jitney bhi neze ya teer hotey ham rajab ke mahiney mein unhein apne se door rakhtey aur unhein kisi taraf phenk detey. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maboos huey to main abhi kam-Umr tha aur apne ghar ke oont charaaya karta tha phir jab ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki fateh (Makka ki khabar suni ( to ham aapko chhod kar dozakh mein chaley gaey, yani Musailma kazzaab ke perokar bin gaey."
"4378, 4379","hamein malum hai ke jab Musailma kazzaab Madina aaya to binte- Haris ke ghar us ne qiyam kya, kyonke binte- Haris bin kurez uski biwi thi. yahi Abdullah bin-abdullaah-bin-Aamir ki maan hai, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iske yahan tashrif laey ( tableegh ke liye) aap ke sath Sabit bin Qais-bin Shamas (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) wahi hain jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke khateeb ke naam se mashhoor they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik chhadi thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uske paas aa kar thahar gaey aur us se guftgu ki aur usey Islam ki dawat di. Musailma ne kaha ke main is shart par musalman hota hun ke aap ke baad mujh ko hukumat miley. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum mujh se ye chhadi maangogey to main ye bhi nahi de sakta aur main to samajhta hun ke tum wahi ho jo mujhey khuwab mein dikhaaey gaey they. ye Saabit-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hain aur meri taraf se tumhari baton ka yahi jawab dengey , phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas tashrif ley aaey. mujhey malum hua hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke mujhey khuwab mein dikhaya gaya tha ke mere hathon par soney ke 2 kangan rakh diye gaey hain. main us se bahut ghabraayaa aur un kanganon se mujhey tashwish hui, phir mujhey hukm hua aur maine unhein phoonk diya to donon kangan ud gaey. maine uski tabeer 2 jhooton se li jo khurooj karne waley hain. Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke unmein se aik Aswad ansaa tha, jisey feeroz ne Yaman mein qatl kya aur doosra Musailma kazzaab tha."
"4402, 4403","ham (hijjatul-wadaa') kaha kartey they, jabke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) maujood they aur ham nahi samajhtey they ke Hijjatul-wada ka mafhoom kya hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki hamd aur uski sana bayan ki phir Masih dajjal ka zikr tafseel ke sath kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jitney bhi anbiya Allah ne bhejey hain, sab ne dajjal se apni ummat ko daraayaa hai. Nuh (Alaihissalam) ne apni ummat ko us se daraayaa aur doosrey baad mein aaney waley anbiya ne bhi aur wo tum hi mein se niklega. to yad rakhna ke tum ko iske jhootey honey ki aur koi daleel na malum ho to yahi daleel kafi hai ke wo mardood kaana hoga aur tumhara rab kaana nahi hai uski aankh aisi malum hogi jaisey angoor ka daana ! . khub sun lo ke Allah Taala ne tum par tumharey aapas ke khoon aur amwaal isi tarah haram kiye hain jaisey is din ki hurmat is Shahar aur us mahiney mein hai. haan bolo! kya maine pahuncha diya? sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke aap ne pahuncha diya. farmaya : aey Allah ! to gawah rahiyo, teen martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye jumla dohraayaa. afsos! (aap ne ( ويلكم ( farmaya ya ("
"4433, 4434","marzul-maut main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko bulaya aur aahista se koi baat unse kahi jis par wo roney lagiin. phir dobara aahista se koi baat kahi jis par wo hansney lagiin. phir ham ne unse iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke aap ki wafat usi marz mein ho jaeygi, main ye sun kar roney lagi dusri martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se jab sargoshi ki to ye farmaya ke aap ke ghar ke aadmiyon mein sabse pahley mein aap se ja miloongii to main hansi thi. marzul-maut main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko bulaya aur aahista se koi baat unse kahi jis par wo roney lagiin. phir dobara aahista se koi baat kahi jis par wo hansney lagiin. phir ham ne unse iske mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne batlaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya tha ke aap ki wafat usi marz mein ho jaeygi, main ye sun kar roney lagi dusri martaba Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se jab sargoshi ki to ye farmaya ke aap ke ghar ke aadmiyon mein sabse pahley mein aap se ja miloongii to main hansi thii."
"4443, 4444","shiddate-marz ke dinon main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar kheench kar baar-baar apne chehrey par daltey they, phir jab dam ghutney lagta to chehrey se hata detey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usi shiddat ke aalim mein farmatey they, yahood w nasara Allah ki rehmat se door huey kyonke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liya tha. is tarah Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apni ummat ko) unka amal ikhtiyar karne se bachtey rehney ki takeed farma rahe they. shiddate-marz ke dinon main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni chadar kheench kar baar-baar apne chehrey par daltey they, phir jab dam ghutney lagta to chehrey se hata detey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usi shiddat ke aalim mein farmatey they, yahood w nasara Allah ki rehmat se door huey kyonke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liya tha. is tarah Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (apni ummat ko) unka amal ikhtiyar karne se bachtey rehney ki takeed farma rahe they."
"4452, 4453, 4454","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) apni qiyam gaah, Sunh se ghodey par aaey aur aa kar utrey , phir masjid ke andar gaey. kisi se aap ne koi baat nahi ki. iske baad aap Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre mein aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf gaey, laash Mubarak aik yamnii chadar se dhakii hui thi. aap ne chehra khola aur jhuk kar chehra Mubarak ko bosa diya aur roney lagey, phir kaha mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan hon Allah ki qism ! Allah Taala aap par 2 martaba maut taarii nahi karega. jo aik maut aap ke muqaddar mein thi, wo aap par taarii ho chuki hai. abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) apni qiyam gaah, Sunh se ghodey par aaey aur aa kar utrey , phir masjid ke andar gaey. kisi se aap ne koi baat nahi ki. iske baad aap Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke hujre mein aaey aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf gaey, laash Mubarak aik yamnii chadar se dhakii hui thi. aap ne chehra khola aur jhuk kar chehra Mubarak ko bosa diya aur roney lagey, phir kaha mere maan-baap aap par qurbaan hon Allah ki qism ! Allah Taala aap par 2 martaba maut taarii nahi karega. jo aik maut aap ke muqaddar mein thi, wo aap par taarii ho chuki hai. Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) aaey to umr (Raziallahu anhu) logon se kuchh keh rahe they Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : umr ! baith jao, lekin umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne baithney se inkar kya. itney mein log umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko chhod kar Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas aagey aur aap ne khutba masnoona ke baad farmaya : ammaa ba'd! tum mein jo bhi Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ibadat karta tha to usey malum hona chahiye ke aap ki wafat ho chuki hai aur jo Allah Taala ki ibadat karta tha to (uska ma'bood) Allah hamesha zinda rehney wala hai aur usko kabhi maut nahi aaeygi. Allah Taala ne khud farmaya hai (وما محمد إلا رسول قد خلت من قبله الرسل) ke '' Muhammad sirf rasool hain, unse pahley bhi rasool guzar chukey hain.'' irshad ("
"4455, 4456, 4457","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapko bosa diya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapko bosa diya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ke baad Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aapko bosa diya tha."
"4464, 4465","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (nabi banaey janey ke baad) Makka mein das saal tak qiyam kya. jis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi nazil hoti rahi aur Madina mein bhi das saal tak aap ka qiyam raha. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (nabi banaey janey ke baad) Makka mein das saal tak qiyam kya. jis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi nazil hoti rahi aur Madina mein bhi das saal tak aap ka qiyam rahaa."
"4513, 4514, 4515","unke paas ibne-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) ke fitney ke zamane mein (jab un par Hajjaj zaalim ne hamla kya aur Makka ka muhaasra kya ( 2 aadmi (Alaa-bin-Araar aur Hibban salmaa) aaey aur kaha ke log aapas mein lad kar tabah ho rahe hain. aap umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke sahibzadey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahabi hain phir aap kyon khamosh hain? us fasaad ko rafa' kyon nahi kartey? ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke meri khamoshi ki wjah sirf ye hai ke Allah Taala ne mere kisi bhi bhai musalman ka khoon mujh par haram qarar diya hai. is par unhon-ne kaha : kya Allah Taala ne ye irshad nahi farmaya hai (وقاتلوهم حتى لا تكون فتنة) ke ''aur unse lado yahan tak ke fasaad baqi na rahe.'' ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke ham ( Quran ke hukm ke mutabiq ( ladey hain, yahan tak ke fitna yani shirk w kufr baqi nahi raha aur Deen khalis Allah ke liye ho gaya, lekin tum log chahtey ho ke tum isliye lado ke fitna aur fasaad paida ho aur deene-Islam zaeef ho, kaafiron ko jeet ho aur Allah ke bar-khilaf dusron ka hukm suna jaey. aik shakhs ( hakeem ( ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur kaha ke aey abu-Abdur-Rehman ! tum ko kya ho gaya hai ke tum aik saal Haj kartey ho aur aik saal Umra aur izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah ke rastey mein jihad mein Sharik nahi hotey . aapko khud malum hai ke Allah Taala ne jihad ki taraf kitni raghbat dilai hai. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya ke mere bhatijey ! Islam ki buniyad panch chizon par hai. Allah aur uske rasool par eman lana , panch waqt ki Namaz padhnaa, Ramazan ke rozey rakhna , zakat dena aur Haj karna. '' unhon-ne kaha : aey abba Abdur-Rehman ! kitabullah mein jo Allah Taala ne irshad farmaya kya aapko wo malum nahi hai ( وإن طائفتان من المؤمنين اقتتلوا فأصلحوا بينهما ) ke ''muslmaanon ki 2 jamatein agar aapas mein jang karein to unmein suleh karao . Allah Taala ke irshad ( إلى أمر الله ( tak (aur Allah Taala ka irshad ke unse jang karo) yahan tak ke fasaad baqi na rahe. ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) boley ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein ham ye farz anjam de chukey hain us waqt musalman bahut thodey they, kaafiron ka hujoom tha to kaafir log musalmanon ka Deen kharaab kartey they, kahin musalmanon ko mar daaltey, kahin takleef detey yahan tak ke musalman bahut ho gaey fitna jata raha. phir us shakhs ne puchha achchha ye to kaho ke Usman aur Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ke barey main tumhara kya maanna hai. unhon-ne kaha Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ka qasoor Allah ne maaf kar diya lekin tum us maafi ko achchha nahi samajhtey ho. ab rahe Ali (Raziallahu anhu) to wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chacha zaad bhai aur aap ke daamaad they aur hath ke ishaarey se batlaya ke ye dekho unka ghar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ghar se mila hua hai."
"4524, 4525","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sura Yusuf ki aayat حتى إذا استيأس الرسل وظنوا أنهم قد كذبوا (main ( كذبوا ( ko zaal ki) kami ke sath qirat kya kartey they. aayat ka jo mafhoom wo murad ley saktey they liya, iske baad yun tilawat kartey حتى يقول الرسول والذين آمنوا معه متى نصر الله ألا إن نصر الله قريب phir meri mulaqat Urwa-bin-Zubair se hui, to maine unse Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki tafseer ka zikr kya. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) to kehti thin Allah ki panah ! paighambar , to jo wada Allah ne unse kya hai usko samajhtey hain ke wo marney se pahley zaroor pura hoga. baat ye ke hai paighambaron ki aazmaish barabar hoti rahi hai. ( madad aaney mein itni der hui (ke paighambar dar gaey. aisa na ho unki ummat ke log unko jhoota samajh lein to Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) is aayat sura yoosuf) ko yun padhti thiin وظنوا أنهم قد كذبوا"
"4526, 4527","jab ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Quran padhtey to aur koi lafz zaban par nahi latey yahan tak ke tilawat se farigh ho jatey. aik din main ( Quran Majeed lekar ( unke samney baith gaya aur unhon-ne sura al-Baqara ki tilawat shuru ki. jab is aayat (نساؤكم حرث لكم) par pahunchey to farmaya, malum hai ye aayat kis ke barey mein nazil hui thi? maine arz kya ke nahi, farmaya ke falan-falan cheez, yani aurat se peechhey ki taraf se hambistari karne ke barey mein nazil hui thi aur phir tilawat karne lagey. aayat ( فأتوا حرثكم أنى شئتم ( ''so tum apne khet mein aao jis tarah chaaho.'' ke barey mein farmaya ke (peechhey se bhi) aa sakta hai. aur is hadis ko Muhammad-bin Yahya-bin-Saeed bin qattaan ne bhi apne walid se, unhon-ne Ubaidullah se, unhon-ne Naafe se aur unhon-ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat kya hai."
"4549, 4550","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis shakhs ne isliye qism khaaii ke kisi musalman ka maal (jhoot bol kar wo) mar ley to jab wo Allah se milega , Allah Taala is par bahut hi ghussa hoga, phir Allah Taala ne aap ke us farman ki tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا أولئك لا خلاق لهم في الآخرة '' beshak jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ko thodi qeemat par bechtey hain, ye wahi log hain jinke liye aakhirat mein koi bhalai nahi hai.'' aakhir aayat tak. abu-Waeil ne bayan kya ke Ashas bin Qais Kandi (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif laey aur puchha : abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) ne aap logon se koi hadis bayan ki hai? ham ne bataya ke yahaan, is-is tarah se hadis bayan ki hai. Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke ye aayat to mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi. mere aik chacha ke betey ki zameen mein mera aik kunwaan tha (ham donon ka is barey mein jhagdaa hua aur muqaddima Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh hua to (aap ne mujh se farmaya ke to gawah pesh kar ya phir uski qism par faisla hoga. maine kaha phir to ya Rasulullah wo ( jhooti ( qism kha lega . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jhooti qism isliye khaaey ke iske zariey kisi musalman ka maal ley aur uski niyat buri ho to wo Allah Taala se us haalat mein milega ke Allah is par bahut hi ghazabnaak hoga. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jis shakhs ne isliye qism khaaii ke kisi musalman ka maal (jhoot bol kar wo) mar ley to jab wo Allah se milega , Allah Taala is par bahut hi ghussa hoga, phir Allah Taala ne aap ke us farman ki tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا أولئك لا خلاق لهم في الآخرة '' beshak jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ko thodi qeemat par bechtey hain, ye wahi log hain jinke liye aakhirat mein koi bhalai nahi hai.'' aakhir aayat tak. abu-Waeil ne bayan kya ke Ashas bin Qais Kandi (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif laey aur puchha : abu-Abdur-Rehman ( Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu)) ne aap logon se koi hadis bayan ki hai? ham ne bataya ke yahaan, is-is tarah se hadis bayan ki hai. Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke ye aayat to mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi. mere aik chacha ke betey ki zameen mein mera aik kunwaan tha (ham donon ka is barey mein jhagdaa hua aur muqaddima Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh hua to (aap ne mujh se farmaya ke to gawah pesh kar ya phir uski qism par faisla hoga. maine kaha phir to ya Rasulullah wo ( jhooti ( qism kha lega . Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jhooti qism isliye khaaey ke iske zariey kisi musalman ka maal ley aur uski niyat buri ho to wo Allah Taala se us haalat mein milega ke Allah is par bahut hi ghazabnaak hoga."
"4828, 4829","aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kabhi is tarah hanstey nahi dekha ke aap ke halaq ka kowa nazar aa jaey balke aap tabassum farmaya kartey they, bayan kya ke jab bhi aap badal ya hawa dekhtey to ( ghabraahat aur Allah ka khauf) aap ke chehre se pehchan liya jata. ya Rasulullah ! jab log badal dekhtey hain to khush hotey hain ke us se barish barsegii lekin iske bar-khilaf aapko main dekhti hon ke aap badal dekhtey hain to na-gawari ka asar aap ke chehre par numaayaan ho jata hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aey Aaisha ! kya zamaanat hai ke usmein azab na ho. aik qaum ( aad ( par hawa ka azab aaya tha. unhon-ne jab azab dekha to boley ke ye to badal hai jo ham par barsega."
"4879, 4880","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jannat mein khokhley motii ka khema hoga, uski chaudai sath miil hogi aur uske har kinarey par musalman ki aik biwi hogi aik kinarey wali doosrey kinarey wali ko na dekh sakegi. aur momin unke paas baari-baari jaeinge aur 2 baagh hongey jinke bartan aur tamam dusri cheezein chandi ki hongi aur aisey bhi 2 baagh hongey jabke bartan aur tamam dusri cheezein soney ki hongii. jannate-adn walon ko Allah paak ke deedaar mein sirf aik jalaal ki chadar haail hogi jo iske ( Mubarak ( munh par padi hogi."
"4978, 4979","mujh ko Aaisha, Abdullah aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein das saal rahe aur Quran nazil hota raha aur Madina mein bhi das saal tak rahe aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahan bhi Quran nazil hota raha. mujh ko Aaisha, Abdullah aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein das saal rahe aur Quran nazil hota raha aur Madina mein bhi das saal tak rahe aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahan bhi Quran nazil hota raha."
"5110, 5111","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana kya hai ke kisi aurat ko uski phoophii ya uski khala ke sath nikah mein jama kya jaey (Zohri ne kaha ke) ham samajhtey hain ke aurat ke bap ki khala bhi (haraam honey mein) usi darje mein hai kyonke (aglii hadis dekhein). razaat se bhi un tamam rishton ko haram samjho jo khoon ki wjah se haram hotey hain."
"5117, 5118","ham aik lashkar mein they. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya ke tumhen mutaa karne ki ijazat di gaee hai is liye tum nikah kar saktey ho. ham aik lashkar mein they. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya ke tumhen mutaa karne ki ijazat di gaee hai is liye tum nikah kar saktey ho."
"5143, 5144","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bad-gumaanii se bachtey raho kyonke bad-gumaanii sabse jhooti baat hai (aur logon ke raazon ki) khod kured na kya karo aur na ( logon ki niji baat-cheet ko) kaan laga kar suno , aapas mein dushmanii na paida karo balke bhaaii-bhaaii bin kar raho. aur koi shakhs apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bhejey yahan tak ke wo nikah karey ya chhod de."
"5185, 5186","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs Allah aur qiyamat ke din par eman rakhta ho wo apne padosi ko takleef na pahunchaaey aur main tumhen .) Baqiiya agli hadis dekhein ( . aurton ke barey mein bhalai ki wasiiyat karta hun kyonke wo paslii se paida ki gaee hain aur paslii mein bhi sabse zyada tedhaa uske uper ka hissa hai. agar tum usey seedha karna chaahogey to usey tod daalogey aur agar usey chhod doge to wo tedhii hi baqi reh jaeygi isliye main tumhen aurton ke barey mein achchhey sulook ki wasiiyat karta hun."
"5208, 5209","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein jab Quran nazil ho raha tha ham azl kartey they. Quran nazil ho raha tha aur ham azl kartey they."
"5271, 5272","qabila Aslam ka aik shakhs Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein tashrif rakhtey they. unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mukhaatab kya aur arz kya ke unhon-ne zina kar liya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse munh mod liya hai lekin wo aadmi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney us rukh ki taraf mud gaya, jidhar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chehra Mubarak pher liya tha aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! doosrey (yani khud ( ne zina kya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us martaba bhi munh mod liya lekin wo phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney us rukh ki taraf aa gaya jidhar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne munh mod liya tha aur yahi arz kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir unse munh mod liya, phir jab chothi martaba wo isi tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke samney aa gaya aur apne uper us ne char martaba (zinaa ki) shahadat di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse malum farmaya ke tum paagal to nahi ho? unhon-ne arz kya ke nahi. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke unhein ley jao aur sangsaar karo kyonke wo shadi shuda they. mujhey aik aisey shakhs ne khabar di jinhoney Jabir-bin-Abdullah Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se suna tha ke unhon-ne bayan kya ke main bhi un logon mein tha jinhoney un sahabi ko sangsaar kya tha. ham ne Madina Munawra ki eidgaah par sangsaar kya tha. jab un par patthar padaa to wo bhaagney lagey lekin ham ne unhein Harra mein phir pakad liya aur unhein sangsaar kya yahan tak ke wo mar gaey."
"5321, 5322","Yahyaa-bin-Saeed-bin-Aas ne Abdur-Rehmaan-bin-Hakam ki sahibzadi (Umra) ko talaaq de di thi aur unke bap Abdur-Rehman unhein unke (shauhar ke) ghar se ley aaey (iddat ke din guzarney se pahley). Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko jab malum hua to unhon-ne Marwaan-bin-Hakam ke yahaan, jo us waqt Madina ka ameer tha, kahlwaayaa ke Allah se daro aur ladki ko uske ghar (jahaan usey talaaq hui hai) pahuncha do. jaisa ke Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ki hadis mein hai. Marwan ne usko jawab ye diya ke ladki ke walid Abdur-Rehman bin Hakam ne meri baat nahi maana aur Qasim-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya ke) Marwan ne Ummul-Momenin ko ye jawab diya ke) kya aapko Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke maamle ka ilm nahi hai? ( unhon-ne bhi apne shauhar ke ghar iddat nahi guzari thi). Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne batlaya ke agar tum Fatima ke waqia ka hawale na detey tab bhi tumhara kuchh na bigadtaa (kyonke wo tumharey liye daleel nahi bin saktaa) . Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne is par kaha ke agar aap ke nazdeek (Faatima (Raziallahu anhu) ka unke shauhar ke ghar se muntaqil karnaa) unke aur unke shauhar ke rishte daari ke darmyan kasheedgii ki wjah se tha to yahan bhi yahi wjah kafi hai ke donon ( miyan biwi (ke darmyan kasheedgii thi. Yahya-bin-Saeed bin al-Aas ne Abdur-Rehman bin-Hakam ki sahibzadi (Umra) ko talaaq de di thi aur unke bap Abdur-Rehman unhein unke (shauhar ke) ghar se ley aaey (iddat ke din guzarney se pahley) . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko jab malum hua to unhon-ne Marwaan-bin-Hakam ke yahan , jo us waqt Madina ka ameer tha, kahlwaayaa ke Allah se daro aur ladki ko iske ghar ( jahan usey talaaq hui hai) pahuncha do. jaisa ke Sulaiman-bin-Yasar ki hadis mein hai. Marwan ne usko jawab ye diya ke ladki ke walid Abdur-Rehman bin-Hakam ne meri baat nahi maana aur Qasim-bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya ke) Marwan ne Ummul-Momenin ko ye jawab diya ke) kya aapko Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ke maamle ka ilm nahi hai? ( unhon-ne bhi apne shauhar ke ghar iddat nahi guzari thi). Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne batlaya ke agar tum Fatima ke waqia ka hawale na detey tab bhi tumhara kuchh na bigadtaa (kyonke wo tumharey liye daleel nahi bin saktaa). Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne is par kaha ke agar aap ke nazdeek (Faatima (Raziallahu anhu) ka unke shauhar ke ghar se muntaqil karna ( unke aur unke shauhar ke rishta daari ke darmyan kasheedgii ki wjah se tha to yahan bhi yahi wjah kafi hai ke donon ( miyan biwi (ke darmyan kasheedgii thi."
"5323, 5324","Fatima binte- Qais , Allah se dartii nahin! unka ishara unke us qaul ki taraf tha (ke baain talaaq wali ko) khaana-kharcha dena zaroori nahi jo kehti hai ke talaaq baain jis aurat par padey usey rehney aur kharcha nahi milega. Fatima binte- Qais , Allah se dartii nahi ! unka ishara unke us qaul ki taraf tha (ke baain talaaq wali ko) khaana khacha dena zaroori nahi jo kehti hai ke talaaq baain jis aurat par padey usey maskan aur kharcha nahi milega."
"5325, 5326","aap fulaana ( Umra binte- hakam ( binte-Hakam ka mamla nahi dekhteen . unke shauhar ne unhein talaaqe-baain de di aur wo wahan se nikal aaein (iddat guzaarey baghair). Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke jo kuchh us ne kya bahut bura kya. Urwa ne kaha aap ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke waqia ke mutaalliq nahi suna. batlaya ke uske liye us hadis ko zikr karne mein koi khair nahi hai aur ibne-abi zanaad ne Hisham se ye izafa kya hai aur unse unke walid ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne ( Umra binte-Hakam ke mamla par) apni shadeed na-gawari ka izhar farmaya aur farmaya ke Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) to aik ujaad jagah mein thin aur uske charon taraf khof aur wahshat barastii thi, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( wahan se muntaqil honey ki) unhein ijazat de di thi. aap fulaana ( Umra binte-Hakam ( binte-Hakam ka mamla nahi dekhteen . unke shauhar ne unhein talaaq baain de di aur wo wahan se nikal aaein ( iddat guzaarey baghair ( . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne farmaya ke jo kuchh us ne kya bahut bura kya. Urwa ne kaha aap ne Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke waaqie ke mutaalliq nahi suna. batlaya ke uske liye is hadis ko zikr karne mein koi khair nahi hai aur ibne-abi zanaad ne Hisham se ye izafa kya hai aur unse unke walid ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne (Umra binte-Hakam ke maamle par) apni shadeed na-gawari ka izhar farmaya aur farmaya ke Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) to aik ujaad jagah mein thin aur uske charon taraf khof aur wahshat barastii thi, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( wahan se muntaqil honey ki) unhein ijazat de di thi."
"5327, 5328","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki is baat ka (ke baain talaaq wali ko khaana-khacha nahi milega) inkar kya. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne Fatima binte- Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ki is baat ka (ke baain talaaq wali ko khaana kharcha nahi milega ( inkar kya."
"5525, 5526","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gadhey ka gosht khaney se mana farma diya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne gadhey ka gosht khaney se mana farma diya tha."
"5641, 5642","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalman jab bhi kisi pareshaanii, beemaarii, ranj w malaal, takleef aur gham mein mubtala ho jata hai yahan tak ke agar usey koi kaantaa bhi chubh jaey to Allah Taala usey uske gunahon ka kaffara bana deta hai. nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke musalman jab bhi kisi pareshaanii, beemaarii, ranj w malaal, takleef aur gham mein mubtala ho jata hai yahan tak ke agar usey koi kaantaa bhi chubh jaey to Allah Taala usey uske gunahon ka kaffara bana deta hai."
"5692, 5693","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tum log is aud hindii ( كست (ka istemal kya karo kyonke usmein saat (7) beemaariyon ka ilaaj hai. halaq ke dard mein usey naak mein daala jata hai, paslii ke dard mein chabaaii jati hai. aur main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat main apne aik doodh-peetey ladkey ko lekar hazir hui phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke uper us ne peshab kar diya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pani mangwa kar peshab ki jagah par chhinta diya."
"5698, 5699","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Makka ke rastey mein maqam Luhiy-jamal main apne sar ke beech mein pachhna lagwaayaa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt ehram ki haalat mein they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sar mein pachhna lagwaayaa."
"5700, 5701","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne haalate-ehraam main apne sar mein pachhna lagwaayaa (ye pachhna aap ne sar ke) dard ki wjah se lagwaayaa tha jo Luhyi-jamal naam ke pani ke ghaat par aapko ho gaya tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehram ki haalat main apne sar mein pachhna lagwaayaa . aadhey sar ke dard ki wjah se jo aapko ho gaya tha."
"5709-5712","Raportat de Ibn `Abbas și `Aisha:\n\nAbu Bakr a sărutat (fruntea) Profetului (ﷺ) când a murit. `Aisha a adăugat: Am pus medicament într-o parte a gurii sale dar el a început să ne semnaleze să nu introducem medicamentul în gura sa. Am spus: „Îi displace medicamentul ca un pacient de obicei.\" Dar când și-a revenit în simțiri, a spus: „Nu v-am interzis să puneți medicament (cu forța) în partea gurii mele?\" Am spus: „Am crezut că este doar pentru că un pacient de obicei îi displace medicamentul.\" El a spus: „Niciunul dintre cei din casă nu va fi forțat să ia medicament în partea gurii sale în timp ce eu privesc, cu excepția lui Al-`Abbas, pentru că el nu a fost martor la faptul vostru.\""
"5719, 5720, 5721","Ayub sakhtiyan ke samney abu-Qilaba ki likhi hui hadison padhi gain unmein wo hadison bhi thin jinhein ( Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se) bayan kya tha aur wo bhi thin jo unke samney padh kar sunai gaee thin. un likhi hui hadison ke zakheere mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye hadis bhi thi ke abu-Talha aur Anas-bin-Nazar ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko dagh laga kar unka ilaaj kya tha ya abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khud apne hath se daaghaa tha aur Ibaad-bin-Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse abu-Qilaba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ansar ke kuchh gharaanon ko zahreeley janwaron ke kaatney aur kaan ki takleef mein jhadney ki ijazat di thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke zaatul-janb ki bimari mein mujhey daaghaa gaya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi main aur us waqt abu-Talha, Anas-bin-Nazar aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey daaghaa tha. Ayyoob sakhtiyan ke samney abu-Qilaba ki likhi hui hadison padhi gain unmein wo hadison bhi thin jinhein ( Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se) bayan kya tha aur wo bhi thin jo unke samney padh kar sunai gaee thin. un likhi hui hadison ke zakheere mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye hadis bhi thi ke abu-Talha aur Anas-bin-Nazar ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko dagh laga kar unka ilaaj kya tha ya abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khud apne hath se daaghaa tha aur Ibaad-bin-Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse abu-Qilaba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ansar ke kuchh gharaanon ko zahreeley janwaron ke kaatney aur kaan ki takleef mein jhadney ki ijazat di thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke zaatul-janb ki bimari mein mujhey daaghaa gaya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi main aur us waqt abu-Talha, Anas-bin-Nazar aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey daaghaa thaa. Ayyoob sakhtiyan ke samney abu-Qilaba ki likhi hui hadison padhi gain unmein wo hadison bhi thin jinhein ( Ayub ne abu-Qilaba se) bayan kya tha aur wo bhi thin jo unke samney padh kar sunai gaee thin. un likhi hui hadison ke zakheere mein Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki ye hadis bhi thi ke abu-Talha aur Anas-bin-Nazar ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko dagh laga kar unka ilaaj kya tha ya abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne unko khud apne hath se daaghaa tha aur Ibaad-bin-Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ayub ne, unse abu-Qilaba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Ansar ke kuchh gharaanon ko zahreeley janwaron ke kaatney aur kaan ki takleef mein jhadney ki ijazat di thi to Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke zaatul-janb ki bimari mein mujhey daaghaa gaya tha Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi main aur us waqt abu-Talha, Anas-bin-Nazar aur Zaid-bin-Saabit (Raziallahu anhu) maujood they aur abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey daaghaa thaa."
"5759, 5760","2 auratein thin, aik ne dusri ko patthar de maara jis se uske pet ka hamal gir gaya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us maamle mein aik ghulam ya baandi ka diyat mein diye janey ka faisla kya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne janeen jisey uski maa ke pet mein mar daala gaya ho, ki diyat ke taur par aik ghulam ya aik baandi diye janey ka faisla kya tha jisey diyat deeni thi usne kaha ke aisey bachche ki diyat aakhir kyon dun jisne na khaayaa, na piyaa, na bola aur na wilaadat ke waqt hi awaz nikaalii? aisi sura main to diyat nahi ho saktii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye shakhs to kaahinon ka bhai malum hota hai."
"5773-5775","Raportat de Abu Huraira:\n\nTrimisul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus: „Nu există 'Adwa.\" Abu Huraira a mai spus: Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Vitela suferind de o boală nu trebuie amestecată cu vite sănătoase (sau a spus „Nu pune un pacient cu o persoană sănătoasă ca o precauție.\"). Abu Huraira a mai spus: Trimisul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus: „Nu există 'Adwa.\" Un beduin s-a ridicat și a spus: „Nu vezi că cămilele de pe nisip arată ca căprioarele dar când o cămilă bolnavă se amestecă cu ele, toate se infectează cu râia?\" La care Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Atunci cine a transmis boala primei cămila?\""
"5780, 5781","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har daant se khaney waley darinde janwar (ke gosht) se mana farmaya, Zohri ne bayan kya ke maine ye hadis us waqt tak nahi suni jab tak Sham (Syria) nahi aaya. maine abu-Idrees se puchha kya ham ( dawaa ke taur par) gadhi ke doodh se wuzu kar saktey hain ya usey pi saktey hain ya darinda janwaron ke pittey istemal kar saktey hain ya oont ka peshab pi saktey hain. abu-Idrees ne kaha ke musalman oont ke peshab ko dawaa ke taur par istemal kartey they aur is mein koi harj nahi samajhtey they. albatta gadhi ke doodh ke barey mein hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ye hadis pahunchi hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske gosht se mana farmaya tha. iske doodh ke mutaalliq hamein koi hukm ya manaahii Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se malum nahi hai. albatta darindon ke pittey ke mutaalliq jo ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey abu-Idrees Kholani ne khabar di aur unhein abu-So'lba Khushni (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har daant waley shikaarii darindey ka gosht khaney se mana farmaya hai."
"5815, 5816","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jab aakhiri marz taarii hua to aap apni kamlii chehra Mubarak par daltey they aur jab saans ghutney lagta to chehra khol letey aur usi haalat mein farmatey ''yahood w nasara Allah Taala ki rehmat se door ho gaey ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liyaa.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke burey kaamo se (musalmaanon ko) dara rahe they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par jab aakhiri marz taarii hua to aap apni kamlii chehra Mubarak par daltey they aur jab saans ghutney lagta to chehra khol letey aur usi haalat mein farmatey ''yahood w nasara Allah Taala ki rehmat se door ho gaey ke unhon-ne apne anbiya ki qabron ko sajda gaah bana liyaa.'' Nabi Karim (sl) unke burey kaamo se (musalmaanon ko) dara rahe they."
"5908, 5909","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bharey huey qadmon waley they, bahut hi Husain w jameel, aap jaisa khoobsurat maine aap ke baad kisi ko nahi dekha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bharey huey qadmon waley they, bahut hi Husain w jameel, aap jaisa khoobsurat maine aap ke baad kisi ko nahi dekha."
"5911, 5912","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheliyan aur qadam bharey huey they, aap jaisa phir maine koi khoobsurat aadmi nahi dekha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hatheliyan aur qadam bharey huey they, aap jaisa phir maine koi khoobsurat aadmi nahi dekha."
"6026, 6027","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik momin doosrey momin ke liye is tarah hai jaisey Imaarat, ke iska aik hissey doosrey hissey ko thaamey rehta hai) girney nahi deta ( phir aap ne apni ungliyon ko qainchi ki tarah kar liya. aur aisa hua ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt baithey huey they ke aik sahib ne aa kar sawal kya ya koi zarurat poori karaanii chaahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamari taraf mutwajjeh huey aur farmaya ke tum khamosh kyon baithey rahtey ho balke uski sifarish karo taake tumhen bhi ajr miley aur Allah jo chaahega apne Nabi ki zaban par jari karega (tum apna sawab kyon kho'o)."
"6073-6075","Raportat de `Aisha:\n\n(soția Profetului) că i s-a spus că `Abdullah bin Az-Zubair (la auzul că ea vindea sau dădea ceva cadou) a spus: „Pe Allah, dacă `Aisha nu renunță la aceasta, o voi declara incompetentă să-și dispună de averea sa.\" Am spus: „A spus el (`Abdullah bin Az-Zubair) așa?\" Ei (oamenii) au spus: „Da.\" `Aisha a spus: „Jur pe Allah că nu voi vorbi niciodată cu Ibn Az-Zubair.\" Când această părăsire a durat mult, `Abdullah bin Az-Zubair a căutat intercesiunea ei, dar ea a spus: „Pe Allah, nu voi accepta intercesiunea nimănui pentru el și nu voi comite un păcătuind îmi jurământul.\" Când această stare de lucruri s-a prelungit pentru Ibn Az-Zubair (i s-a părut greu), el a spus lui Al-Miswar bin Makhrama și `Abdur-Rahman bin Al-Aswad bin 'Abu Yaghuth, care erau din tribul Bani Zahra: „Vă implor, pe Allah, să mă lăsați să intru la `Aisha, pentru că este ilegal ca ea să jure să taie relația cu mine.\" Așadar Al-Miswar și `Abdur-Rahman, înfășurându-și hainele în jurul lor, au cerut permisiunea lui `Aisha spunând: „Pace și Mila și Binecuvântările lui Allah fie asupra ta! Să intrăm?\" `Aisha a spus: „Intrați.\" Ei au spus: „Toți?\" Ea a spus: „Da, intrați toți,\" neștiind că Ibn Az-Zubair era și el cu ei. Așadar când au intrat, Ibn Az-Zubair a intrat în locul ecranizat și a prins-o pe `Aisha și a început să o roagă să-l ierte și a plâns. Al-Miswar și `Abdur-Rahman au început și ei să o roage să vorbească cu el și să accepte căința sa. Ei i-au spus: „Profetul (ﷺ) a interzis ceea ce știți despre părăsirea (a nu vorbi cu frații tăi musulmani), pentru că este ilegal pentru orice musulman să nu vorbească cu fratele săi mai mult de trei nopți (zile).\" Așadar când au crescut amintirea ei (despre superioritatea de a avea relații bune cu rudele și de a ierta păcatele altora) și au coborât-o într-o situație critică, ea a început să le amintească și a plâns, spunând: „Am făcut un jurământ, și (chestiunea) jurământului este una dificilă.\" Ei (Al-Miswar și `Abdur-Rahman) au persistat în cererea lor până când ea a vorbit cu `Abdullah bin Az-Zubair și a eliberat patruzeci de sclavi ca ispășire pentru jurământul său. Mai târziu, de fiecare dată când își amintea jurământul, plângea atât de mult că vălul său obișnuia să se umezească de lacrimile sale."
"6089, 6090","jab se maine Islam qabool kya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (apne paas aaney se) kabhi nahi rokaa aur jab bhi aap ne mujhey dekha to muskuraaey. main ghodey par jam kar nahi baith paata to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna hath mere seeney par maara aur dua ki (اللهم ثبته واجعله هاديا"
"6142, 6143","Abdullah-bin Sehal aur muahaiisa bin Masood khaibar se aaey aur khajoor ke baagh mein aik doosrey se juda ho gaey. Abdullah-bin Sehal wahin qatl kar diye gaey. phir Abdur-Rehman bin Sehal aur Masood ke donon betey huwesa aur muahaiisa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey apne maqtool sathi (Abdullaah (rz)) ke muqaddima mein baat-cheet ki. pahley Abdur-Rehman ne bolnaa chaha jo sabse chhotey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke badey ki badaai karo. (ibne Saeed ne iska maqsad ye) bayan kya ke jo bada hai wo baat-cheet karey, phir unhon-ne apne sathi ke muqaddima mein baat-cheet ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum mein se pachaas (50) aadmi qism kha lein ke Abdullah ko yahudiyon ne maara hai to tum diyat ke mustahiq ho jaogey . unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham ne khud to usey dekha nahi tha (phir iske mutaalliq qism kaisey kha saktey hain?) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir yahood apne pachaas (50) aadmiyon se qism khilwaa kar tum se chhutkara pa lengey. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye kaafir log hain (unki qism ka kya bharosa) chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah-bin Sehal ke waarison ko diyat khud apni taraf se ada kar di. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke un oonton mein se (jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein diyat mein diye they) aik ontni ko maine pakda wo thaan mein ghus gaee, us ne aik laat mujh ko lagai aur Leis ne kaha mujh se Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Bashir ne aur unse Sehal ne, Yahya ne yahan bayan kya ke main samajhta hun ke Bashir ne (saath mein 'Raafe'-bin-Khadeej) ke alfaz kahey they. aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya, unse Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Bashir ne aur unhon-ne sirf Sehal se riwayat ki. Abdullah-bin Sehal aur muahaiisa bin Masood khaibar se aaey aur khajoor ke baagh mein aik doosrey se juda ho gaey. Abdullah-bin Sehal wahin qatl kar diye gaey. phir Abdur-Rehman bin Sehal aur Masood ke donon betey huwesa aur muahaiisa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey apne maqtool sathi ( Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu)) ke muqaddima mein guftagu ki. pahley Abdur-Rehman ne bolnaa chaha jo sabse chhotey they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke badey ki badaai karo. (ibne Saeed ne iska maqsad ye) bayan kya ke jo bada hai wo guftagu karey, phir unhon-ne apne sathi ke muqaddima mein guftgu ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum mein se pachaas (50) aadmi qism kha lein ke Abdullah ko yahudiyon ne maara hai to tum diyat ke mustahiq ho jaogey . unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ham ne khud to usey dekha nahi tha (phir iske mutaalliq qism kaisey kha saktey hain?) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir yahood apne pachaas (50) aadmiyon se qism khilwaa kar tum se chhutkara pa lengey. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! ye kaafir log hain (unki qism ka kya bharosa) chunanche Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Abdullah-bin Sehal ke waarison ko diyat khud apni taraf se ada kar di. Sehal (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke un oonton mein se (jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein diyat mein diye they) aik ontni ko maine pakda wo thaan mein ghus gaee, us ne aik laat mujh ko lagai aur Leis ne kaha mujh se Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Bashir ne aur unse Sehal ne, Yahya ne yahan bayan kya ke main samajhta hun ke Bashir ne (saath mein 'Raafe'-bin-Khadeej) ke alfaz kahey they. aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya, unse Yahya ne bayan kya, unse Bashir ne aur unhon-ne sirf Sehal se riwayat ki."
"6173-6175","Raportat de către `Abdullah bin `Umar:\n\n`Umar bin Al-Khattab a plecat împreună cu Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) și un grup din tovarășii săi către Ibn Saiyad.\nL-au găsit jucându-se cu băieții în fortă sau apropie de dealurile Bani Maghala. Ibn Saiyad\nse apropia de vârsta pubertății în acel moment și nu a observat sosirea Profetului (ﷺ) până când\nApostolul lui Allah l-a mângăiat pe cu mâna sa și i-a spui: „Mărturisești că eu sunt Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)?\"\nIbn Saiyad s-a uitat la el și a spus: „Mărturisesc că tu ești Apostolul celor nefiind instruiți\n(analfabeți).\" Apoi Ibn Saiyad i-a spus Profetului: „Mărturisești că eu sunt Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)?\"\nProfetul a negat acest lucru, spunând: „Cred în Allah și în toți Apostolii Săi,\" și apoi i-a spus lui Ibn Saiyad:\n„Ce vezi?\" Ibn Saiyad a răspuns: „Oameni de vreme și mincinoși mă vizitează.\" Profetul (ﷺ) a spus:\n„Ai fost confuzat în această chestiune.\" Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a adăugat: „Am păstrat ceva pentru tine\n(în mintea mea).\" Ibn Saiyad a spus: „Ad-Dukh.\" Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Ikhsa (să te fie rușine), pentru că\nnu poți depăși talele tale.\" `Umar a spus: „O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)! Dă-mi voie să-i tai gâtul.\"\nApostolul lui Allah i-a spus (lui `Umar): „Dacă această persoană este el (adică Ad-Dajjal), atunci nu îl poți învinge;\nși dacă este altcineva, atunci nu îți va folosi nimic să-l omori.\" `Abdullah bin `Umar a adăugat:\nMai târziu, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) și Ubai bin Ka`b Al-Ansari (din nou) au mers în grădină în care Ibn\nSaiyad era prezent.\nCând Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a intrat în grădină, a început să se ascundă în trunchiurile de curmale\nintenționând să audă ceva de la Ibn Saiyad înainte ca acesta să-l poată vedea. Ibn Saiyad zăcea pe\npatul său, acoperit cu un velur din care se auzeau murmurele sale. Mama lui Ibn Saiyad l-a văzut\npe Profet și a spus: „O, Saf ( porecla lui Ibn Saiyad)! Aici este Muhammad!\" Ibn Saiyad a încetat\nsă mai murmure. Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Dacă mama lui ar fi tăcut, atunci ar fi învățat mai multe despre el.\"\n`Abdullah a adăugat: Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) s-a înaintea oamenilor (predicând un sermon), și după ce a lăudat\nși preamărit Allah pe cuviință, a pomenit despre Ad-Dajjal, spunând: „Vă avertizez împotriva lui, și nu a fost\nprofet care să nu-i fi avertizat urmașii săi împotriva lui. Noe i-a avertizat pe urmașii săi împotriva lui, dar eu\nvă spun despre el ceva ce niciun profet nu i-a spus poporului său, și anume: Să știți că el este orb dintr-un ochi,\nîn timp cât Allah nu este așa.\""
"6282, 6283","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quba tashrif ley jatey they, to umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar bhi jatey they aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khana khilaatii thin phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur bedaar huey to aap hans rahe they. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke rastey mein jang kartey huey mere samney ( khuwab mein) pesh kiye gaey, jo us samandar ke uper (kashtiyon mein) sawar hongey ( jannat mein wo aisey nazar aaey ( jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain, ya bayan kya ke baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. Ishaq ko un lafzon mein zara shuba tha (umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! dua karein ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se banaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar rakh kar so gaey aur jab bedaar huey to hans rahe they. maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke raaste mein jang kartey huey mere samney pesh kiye gaey jo us samandar ke uper sawar hongey jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain ya baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. maine arz kya ke Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to us giroh ke sabse pahley logon mein hogi chunanche umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki Sham (Syria) par governary ke zamane mein) samandari safar kya aur khushkii par utarney ke baad apni sawari se gir padiin aur wafat pa gain . jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Quba tashrif ley jatey they, to umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke ghar bhi jatey they aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khana khilaatii thin phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey aur bedaar huey to aap hans rahe they. umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine puchha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke rastey mein jang kartey huey mere samney ( khuwab mein) pesh kiye gaey, jo us samandar ke uper (kashtiyon mein) sawar hongey ( jannat mein wo aisey nazar aaey ( jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain, ya bayan kya ke baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. Ishaq ko un lafzon mein zara shuba tha (umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) maine arz kya ya Rasulullah! dua karein ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se banaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua ki phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar rakh kar so gaey aur jab bedaar huey to hans rahe they. maine kaha : ya Rasulullah ! aap kis baat par hans rahe hain? farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log Allah ke raaste mein jang kartey huey mere samney pesh kiye gaey jo us samandar ke uper sawar hongey jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain ya baadshaahon ki tarah takht par. maine arz kya ke Allah se mere liye dua kijiye ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke to us giroh ke sabse pahley logon mein hogi chunanche umme-Haraam (Raziallahu anhu) ne (Muaawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ki Sham (Syria) par governary ke zamane mein) samandari safar kya aur khushkii par utarney ke baad apni sawari se gir padiin aur wafat pa gain ."
"6285, 6286","ye tamam paak beeviyon (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wafat k marz mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas thin, koi wahan se nahi hata tha ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) chaltii hui aaein. Allah ki qasam! unki chaal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chaal se alag nahi thi ( balke bahut hi mushabeh (similar) thi) jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to khush aamadeed kaha, farmaya beti ! marhaba ! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni daain taraf ya baain taraf unhein bithaya . iske baad aahista se unse kuchh kaha aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) bahut zyada roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka gham dekha to dobara unse sargoshi ki is par wo hansney lagiin. tamam beeviyon mein se maine unse kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham mein sirf aapko sargoshi ki khusoosiyat bakhshii. phir aap roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey to maine unse puchha ke aap ke kaan mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya tha unhon-ne kaha ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz nahi khol saktii. phir jab aap ki wafat ho gaee to maine Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke mera jo haq aap par hai iska waasta deti hun ke aap mujhey wo baat bata dein. unhon-ne kaha ke ab bata sakti hun, chunanche unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se pehli sargoshi ki thi to farmaya tha ke '' Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) har saal mujh se saal mein aik martaba daur kya kartey they lekin is saal mujh se unhon-ne 2 martaba daur kya aur mera khayal hai ke meri wafat ka waqt qareeb hai, Allah se dartii rehna aur sabr karna kyonke main tumharey liye aik achchha aagey janey wala hun '' bayan kya ke us waqt mera ronaa jo aap ne dekha tha uski wjah yahi thi. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri pareshani dekhi to aap ne dobara mujh se sargoshi ki, farmaya ''Faatima betii! kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke jannat main tum mominon ki aurton ki sardaar hogi, ya (farmaayaa ke) is ummat ki aurton ki sardaar hogii.'' ye tamam paak beeviyon (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke wafat k marz mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas thin, koi wahan se nahi hata tha ke Fatima (Raziallahu anha) chaltii hui aaein. Allah ki qasam! unki chaal Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki chaal se alag nahi thi ( balke bahut hi mushabeh (similar) thi) jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to khush aamadeed kaha, farmaya beti ! marhaba ! phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni daain taraf ya baain taraf unhein bithaya . iske baad aahista se unse kuchh kaha aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) bahut zyada roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka gham dekha to dobara unse sargoshi ki is par wo hansney lagiin. tamam beeviyon mein se maine unse kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham mein sirf aapko sargoshi ki khusoosiyat bakhshii. phir aap roney lagiin. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey to maine unse puchha ke aap ke kaan mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya farmaya tha unhon-ne kaha ke main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka raaz nahi khol saktii. phir jab aap ki wafat ho gaee to maine Fatima (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke mera jo haq aap par hai iska waasta deti hun ke aap mujhey wo baat bata dein. unhon-ne kaha ke ab bata sakti hun, chunanche unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se pehli sargoshi ki thi to farmaya tha ke '' Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) har saal mujh se saal mein aik martaba daur kya kartey they lekin is saal mujh se unhon-ne 2 martaba daur kya aur mera khayal hai ke meri wafat ka waqt qareeb hai, Allah se dartii rehna aur sabr karna kyonke main tumharey liye aik achchha aagey janey wala hun '' bayan kya ke us waqt mera ronaa jo aap ne dekha tha uski wjah yahi thi. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne meri pareshani dekhi to aap ne dobara mujh se sargoshi ki, farmaya ''Faatima betii! kya tum is par khush nahi ho ke jannat main tum mominon ki aurton ki sardaar hogi, ya (farmaayaa ke) is ummat ki aurton ki sardaar hogii.''"
"6378, 6379","unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Anas Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khaadim hai uske liye Allah se dua kijiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmai (اللهم أكثر ماله  وولده  وبارك له فيما أعطيته) ''aey Allah ! iske maal w aulad mein zyadti kar aur jo kuchh to usey de usmein barkat ata farmaa.'' aur Hisham bin Zaid se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah suna. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! Anas Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khaadim hai uske liye Allah se dua kijiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dua farmai (اللهم أكثر ماله  وولده  وبارك له فيما"
"6380, 6381","Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! Anas aap ka khaadim hai uske liye dua farmaiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (اللهم أكثر ماله  وولده  وبارك له فيما أعطيته) ''aey Allah ! iske maal w aulad mein zyadti kar aur jo kuchh to de usmein barkat ata farmaa.'' Umme-Sulaim (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! Anas aap ka khaadim hai uske liye dua farmaiye . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (اللهم أكثر ماله  وولده  وبارك له فيما"
"6567, 6568","Haarisa-bin-Suraaqa bin-Haaris (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin. Harisa badr ki ladai mein aik naa-maaloom teer lag janey ki wjah se Shahid ho gaey they aur unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! aapko malum hai ke Harisa se mujhey kitni mohabbat thi, agar wo jannat mein hai to is par main nahiin ro'ongii, warna aap dekhengey ke main kya karti hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke bewaqoof ho gaee ho, kya koi jannat aik hi hai, jannatein to bahut si hain aur Harisa ''firdause-aa'laa'' ( jannat ke oonchey darjey ( mein hai. Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye aik subah ya aik Sham safar karna duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, se badh kar hai aur jannat mein tumhari aik kamaan ke barabar jagah ya aik qadam ke faasley ke barabar jagah duniya aur jo kuchh usmein hai, se behtar hai aur agar jannat ki aurton mein se koi aurat poori zameen ki taraf jhank kar dekh ley to aasman se lekar zameen tak munawwar kar de aur un tamam ko khushbu se bhar de aur uska dupatta ( duniya aur jo kuch usmein hai) se badh kar hai."
"6599, 6600","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi bachcha aisa nahi hai jo fitrat par na paida hota ho. lekin uske waalidain usey Yahudi ya nasrani bana detey hain jaisa ke tumharey janwaron ke bachchey paida hotey hain. kya unmein koi kaan kata paida hota hai? wo to tum hi uska kaan kaat detey ho. sahaba ne arz kya : phir ya Rasulullah ! us bachchey ke mutaalliq kya khayal hai jo bachpan hi mein mar gaya ho? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah khub janta hai ke wo ( bada ho kar) kya amal karta."
"6633, 6634","2 aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein apna jhagdaa pesh kya. unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamarey darmyan aap kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. doosrey ne, jo zyada samajhdaar tha kaha ke theek hai, ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dijiye aur mujhey ijazat dijiye ke us maamle mein kuchh arz karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho. un sahib ne kaha ke mera ladka us shakhs ke yahan ( Aseef ( tha. ( Aseef ( , Mina ( الأجير ( ko kehtey hain. ( الأجير (ke mana mazdoor ke hain) aur us ne uski biwi se zina kar liya. unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke ab mere ladkey ko sangsaar kya jaeyga isliye (is se nijat dilaane ke liye) maine so bakriyon aur aik londi ka unhein fidya de diya phir maine doosrey ilm walon se us masla ko puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza ye hai ke usey so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaey, sangsaari ki saza sirf us aurat ko hogi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga . tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hogi aur phir aap ne iske ladkey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye jilaa watan kar diya. phir aap ne Anees Aslami se farmaya ke muddaii ki biwi ko laey aur agar wo zina ka iqrar karey to usey sangsaar kar de. us aurat ne zina ka iqrar kar liya aur sangsaar kar di gaee. 2 aadmiyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein apna jhagdaa pesh kya. unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamarey darmyan aap kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. doosrey ne, jo zyada samajh daar tha kaha ke theek hai, ya Rasulullah ! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dijiye aur mujhey ijazat dijiye ke is maamle mein kuchh arz karun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho. un sahib ne kaha ke mera ladka is shakhs ke yahan ( Aseef ( tha. ( Aseef ), Mina ( الأجير ( ko kehtey hain. ( الأجير (ke mana mazdoor ke hain) aur us ne uski biwi se zina kar liya. unhon-ne mujh se kaha ke ab mere ladkey ko sangsaar kya jaeyga isliye (is se nijat dilaane ke liye) maine so bakriyon aur aik londi ka unhein fidya de diya phir maine doosrey ilm walon se is mas'ale ko puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza ye hai ke usey so kode lagaey jayen aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kar diya jaey, sangsaari ki saza sirf us aurat ko hogi. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga . tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hogi aur phir aap ne iske ladkey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye jalaa watan kar diya. phir aap ne Anees Aslami se farmaya ke muddaii ki biwi ko laey aur agar wo zina ka iqrar karey to usey sangsaar kar de. us aurat ne zina ka iqrar kar liya aur sangsaar kar di gaee."
"6659, 6660","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne jhooti qism is maqsad se khaaii ke kisi musalman ka maal iske zariey naajaaiz tareeqey par hasil karey to wo Allah Taala se is haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazab naak hoga. phir Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq nazil ki) Quran Majeed mein ke) ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله ( bila shubah wo log jo Allah ke ahad ke zariey khareedtey hain.'' phir Ashas bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) wahan se guzrey aur puchha ke Abdullah tum se kya bayan kar rahe they. ham ne unse bayan kya to Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye aayat mere aur mere aik sathi ke barey mein nazil hui thi, aik kuwein ke silsiley mein ham donon ka jhagdaa tha."
"6676, 6677","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne jhooti qism is taur se khaaii ke iske zariey kisi musalman ka maal naajaaiz tareeqe se hasil karey to wo Allah Taala se is haal mein milega ke Allah is par bahut hi ghussa hoga.'' phir Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq wahi ke zariey nazil ki) إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا (ke '' bila shubah wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke badley maamooli duniya ki poonjii khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak. Abdullah ye hadis bayan kar chukey they, itney mein Ashas bin Qais aaey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman ne tum logon se kya hadis bayan ki hai? logon ne kaha is-is mazmoon ki. unhon-ne kaha ajii ye aayat to mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi mere aik chacha-zad bhai ki zameen mein mera aik kunwaan tha iske jhagdey ke silsile mein main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna muddua-alaih se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! phir wo to jhooti qism kha lega. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne jhooti qism bd-niyati ke sath isliye khaaii ke iske zariey kisi musalman ka maal hadap kar jaey to qiyamat ke din Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo Allah is par intihai ghazabnaak hoga."
"6725, 6726","Fatima aur Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) , Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se apni meeraas ka mutalba karne aaey, ye fidak ki zameen ka mutalba kar rahe they aur khaibar mein bhi apne hissey kaa. hamara koi waaris nahi hota jo kuchh ham chhodein wo sab sadqa hai, bila shubah aale-Muhammad usi maal mein se apna kharch pura karegi Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! main koi aisi baat nahi honey doonga , balke jisey maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kartey dekha hoga wo main bhi karunga . bayan kya ke is par Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne unse talluq kaat liya aur maut tak unse kalam nahi kya."
"6766, 6767","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jisne apne bap ke siwa kisi aur ke betey honey ka dawa kya ye jantey huey ke wo iska bap nahi hai to jannat is par haram hai. is hadis ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mere donon kanon ne bhi suna hai aur mere dil ne usko mehfooz rakha hai."
"6815, 6816","aik sahib Maaiz bin Malik Aslami Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaey, us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein they, unhon-ne aapko awaz di aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kar liya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unki taraf se munh pher liya. unhon-ne ye baat char baar dohraaii jab char baar unhon-ne us gunah ki apne uper shahadat di to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bulaya aur malum farmaya kya tum deewaaney ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke phir kya tum shadi shuda ho? unhon-ne kaha ji haan. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein ley jao aur rajm (sangsaar) kar do. rajm (sangsaar) karne walon mein, main bhi tha ham ne unhein aabadi se bahar eidgaah ke paas rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhag padey lekin ham ne unhein Harra ke paas pakda aur rajm (sangsaar) kar diya."
"6825, 6826","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik sahib aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt masjid mein baithey huey they. unhon-ne awaz di ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kya hai. khud apne mutaalliq wo keh rahe they. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse apna munh pher liya. lekin wo sahib bhi hat kar usi taraf khadey ho gaey jidhar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh phera tha aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! maine zina kya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir apna munh pher liya aur wo bhi dobara us taraf aagey jidhar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna munh phera tha aur is tarah jab us ne char martaba apne gunah ka iqrar kar liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usko bulaya aur puchha kya tum paagal (پاگل) ho? unhon-ne kaha ke nahi ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya tum shadi shuda ho? unhon-ne kaha : ji ya Rasulullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sahaba se farmaya ke unhein ley jao aur rajm (sangsaar) kar do. main bhi un logon mein shamil tha jinhoney unhein rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhaagney lagey. lekin ham ne unhein Harra (Harra Madina ki pathreelii zameen) mein ja liya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kar diya."
"6827, 6828","main bhi un logon mein shamil tha jinhoney unhein rajm (sangsaar) kya tha jab un par patthar padey to wo bhaagney lagey. lekin ham ne unhein Harra (Harra Madina ki pathreelii zameen) mein ja liya aur unhein rajm (sangsaar) kar diya. ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas they, to aik sahib khadey huey aur kaha, main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan Allah ki kitab se faisla karein. is par uska muqabil bhi khada ho gaya aur wo pahley se zyada samajhdaar tha, phir usne kaha ke waqei aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah se hi faisla kijiye aur mujhey bhi guftgu ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, us shakhs ne kaha ke mera betaa us shakhs ke yahan mazdoorii par kaam karta tha phir us ne uski aurat se zina kar liya, maine iske fidya mein usey sou (100) bakri aur aik khaadim diya, phir maine kuchh ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal Shahar Badr honey ki had wajib hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tumharey darmyan kitabullah hi ke mutabiq faisla karunga . sou (100) bakriyaan aur khaadim tumhen wapas hongey aur tumharey betey ko so kode lagaey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye usey shahar badar kya jaeyga aur aey unnais ! subah ko uski aurat ke paas jana agar wo (zinaa ka ( iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche wo subah ko uske paas gaey aur us ne iqrar kar liya aur unhon-ne rajm (sangsaar) kar diya. Ali-bin-Abdullaah-madeenii kehtey hain maine Sufiyaan-bin-Ueina se puchha jis shakhs ka betaa tha us ne yun nahi kaha ke un aalimon ne mujh se bayan kya ke terey betey par rajm (sangsaar) hai. unhon-ne kaha ke mujh ko usmein shak hai ke Zohri se maine suna hai ya nahi, isliye maine usko kabhi bayan kya, kabhi nahi bayan kya, balkii khaamoosh raha."
"6831, 6832","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un logon ke barey mein hukm de rahe they jo ghair shadi shuda hon aur zina kya ho ke so kode maarey jayen aur saal bhar ke liye jilaa watan kar diya jaey. umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne jilaa watan kya tha phir yahi tariqa qaaim ho gaya."
"6835, 6836","aik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par doosrey ne khadey ho kar kaha ke unhon-ne sahi kaha ya Rasulullah ! unka kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karein, mera ladka unke yahan mazdoor tha aur phir us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga chunanche maine so bakriyon aur aik kaneez ka fidya diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unka khayal hai ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii lazimi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tum donon ka faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. bakriyan aur kaneez tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey ladkey ko so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii ki saza milegii aur Anees ! subah us aurat ke paas jao (aur agar wo iqrar karey to) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche unhon-ne usey rajm (sangsaar) kya. (wo aurat kahin aur jagah thi) aap ne usey rajm (sangsaar) karne ke liye Anees ko bheja usi se baab ka matlab nikla . qastalaanii ne kaha ke aap ne jo Anees ko fareeq saanii ki joru ke paas bheja wo zina ki had maarney ke liye nahi bheja kyonke zina ki had lagaaney ke liye tajassus karna ya dhoondhnaa bhi durust nahi hai agar koi khud aa kar bhi zina ka iqrar karey uske liye bhi chhaanbeen karna mustahab hai, yani yun kehna ke shayad tu ney bosa diya hoga ya chhuaa hoga balke aap ne Anees ko sirf isliye bheja ke us aurat ko khabar kar dein ke falan shakhs ne tujh par zina ki tohmat lagai hai. ab wo hade-qazaf ka mutalba karti hai ya maaf karti hai. jab Anees uske paas pahunchey to us aurat ne saaf taur par zina qabool kya. is qabool karney par Anees (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko had lagai aur rajm (sangsaar) kya. eik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah! hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par doosrey ne khadey ho kar kaha ke unhon-ne sahi kaha ya Rasulullah ! unka kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karein, mera ladka unke yahan mazdoor tha aur phir us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujhey bataya ke mere ladkey ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga chunanche maine so bakriyon aur aik kaneez ka fidya diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unka khayal hai ke mere ladkey par so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii lazimi hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai main tum donon ka faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. bakriyan aur kaneez tumhen wapas milengii aur tumharey ladkey ko so kode aur aik saal ki jilaa watanii ki saza milegii aur Anees ! subah us aurat ke paas jao (aur agar wo iqrar karey to) usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche unhon-ne usey rajm (sangsaar) kya. (wo aurat kahin aur jagah thi) aap ne usey rajm (sangsaar) karne ke liye Anees ko bheja usi se baab ka matlab nikla . qastalaanii ne kaha ke aap ne jo Anees ko fareeq saanii ki joru ke paas bheja wo zina ki had maarney ke liye nahi bheja kyonke zina ki had lagaaney ke liye tajassus karna ya dhoondhnaa bhi durust nahi hai agar koi khud aa kar bhi zina ka iqrar karey uske liye bhi chhaanbeen karna mustahab hai, yani yun kehna ke shayad tu ney bosa diya hoga ya chhuaa hoga balke aap ne Anees ko sirf isliye bheja ke us aurat ko khabar kar dein ke falan shakhs ne tujh par zina ki tohmat lagai hai. ab wo hade-qazaf ka mutalba karti hai ya maaf karti hai. jab Anees uske paas pahunchey to us aurat ne saaf taur par zina qabool kya. is qabool karney par Anees (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko had lagai aur rajm (sangsaar) kya."
"6837, 6838","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us kaneez ke mutaalliq puchha gaya jo ghair shadi shuda ho aur zina kara liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo zina kiraaey to usey kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro aur usey bech dalo chahe aik rassii hi qeemat mein miley. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey yaqin nahi ke teesri martaba (kode lagaaney ke hukm (ke baad ye farmaya ya chothi martaba ke baad . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us kaneez ke mutaalliq puchha gaya jo ghair shadi shuda ho aur zina kara liya to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wo zina kiraaey to usey kode maaro , agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro, agar phir zina kiraaey to phir kode maaro aur usey bech dalo chahe aik rassii hi qeemat mein miley. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey yaqin nahi ke teesri martaba ( kode lagaaney ke hukm (ke baad ye farmaya ya chothi martaba ke baad ."
"6842, 6843","2 aadmi apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey aur unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur doosrey ne jo zyada samajhdaar they kaha ke ji haan ya Rasulullah! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur mujhey arz karne ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, unhon-ne kaha ke mera betaa un sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. Malik ne bayan kya ke) Aseef ( mazdoor ko kehtey hain aur us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujh se kaha ke mere betey ki saza rajm (sangsaar) hai. chunanche maine iske fidye mein so bakriyan aur aik londi de di phir jab maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr karna hai. rajm (sangsaar) to sirf us aurat ko kya jaeyga isliye ke wo shadi shuda hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hain phir unke betey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kya aur Anees Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm farmaya ke us mazkura (uper zikr) aurat ke paas jayen agar wo iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar dein chunanche us ne iqrar kya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaee. 2 aadmi apna muqaddima Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas laey aur unmein se aik ne kaha ke hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur doosrey ne jo zyada samajhdaar they kaha ke ji haan ya Rasulullah! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur mujhey arz karne ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho, unhon-ne kaha ke mera betaa un sahib ke yahan mazdoor tha. Malik ne bayan kya ke) Aseef ( mazdoor ko kehtey hain aur us ne unki biwi ke sath zina kar liya. logon ne mujh se kaha ke mere betey ki saza rajm (sangsaar) hai. chunanche maine iske fidye mein so bakriyan aur aik londi de di phir jab maine ilm walon se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke mere ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye mulk badr karna hai. rajm (sangsaar) to sirf us aurat ko kya jaeyga isliye ke wo shadi shuda hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq karunga. tumhari bakriyan aur tumhari londi tumhen wapas hain phir unke betey ko so kode lagwaaey aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr kya aur Anees Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm farmaya ke us mazkura (uper zikr) aurat ke paas jayen agar wo iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar dein chunanche us ne iqrar kya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaii."
"6859, 6860","aik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha ke main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par fareeq mukhalif khada hua, ye zyada samajhdaar tha aur kaha ke unhon-ne sach kaha, hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kijiye aur ya Rasulullah ! mujhey ( guftgu ki) ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kahiye. unhon-ne kaha ke mera ladka inke yahan mazdoorii karta tha phir us ne inkii biwi ke sath zina kar liya. maine iske fidya mein aik so bakriyan aur aik khaadim diya phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza milnii chahiye aur iski biwi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq hi karunga. so bakriyan aur khaadim tumhen wapas milengey aur tumharey betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza di jaeygi aur aey Anees us aurat ke paas subah jana aur us se poochhna agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) karnaa, us aurat ne iqrar kar liya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaee. eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kaha ke main aapko Allah ki qism deta hun aap hamarey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla kar dein. is par fareeq mukhalif khada hua, ye zyada samajhdaar tha aur kaha ke unhon-ne sach kaha, hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kijiye aur ya Rasulullah ! mujhey ( guftgu ki) ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kahiye. unhon-ne kaha ke mera ladka inke yahan mazdoorii karta tha phir us ne inkii biwi ke sath zina kar liya. maine iske fidya mein aik so bakriyan aur aik khaadim diya phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne mujhey bataya ke mere betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza milnii chahiye aur iski biwi ko rajm (sangsaar) kya jaeyga Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai, main tumhara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq hi karunga. so bakriyan aur khaadim tumhen wapas milengey aur tumharey betey ko so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza di jaeygi aur aey Anees us aurat ke paas subah jana aur us se poochhna agar wo zina ka iqrar kar ley to usey rajm (sangsaar) karnaa, us aurat ne iqrar kar liya aur wo rajm (sangsaar) kar di gaii."
"6865, 6866","wo badr ki ladai main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Sharik they ke aap ne puchha : ya Rasulullah ! agar jang ke doran meri kisi kaafir se mudbhed ho jaey aur ham aik doosrey ko qatl karne ki koshish karne lagein phir wo mere hath par apni talwaar mar kar usey kaat de aur uske baad kisi darakht ki aad lekar kahey ke main Allah par eman laya to kya main usey uske us iqrar ke baad qatl kar sakta hoon? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey qatl na karna. unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! us ne to mera hath bhi kaat daala aur ye iqrar us waqt kya jab usey yaqin ho gaya ke ab main usey qatl hi kar doonga? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey qatl na karna kyonke agar tum ne usey Islam laney ke baad qatl kar diya to wo tumharey martabe mein hoga jo tumhara usey qatl karne se pahley tha yani ma'soom, aur tum uske martabe mein hogey jo uska us kalima ke iqrar se pahley tha jo usney ab kya hai (yani zaalim). Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Miqdad (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya tha ke agar koi musalman kaafiron ke sath rehta ho phir wo dar ke maarey apna eman chhipata ho, agar wo apna eman zahir kar de aur to usko mar daley ye kyon kar durust hoga khud tum bhi to Makka mein pahley apna eman chhipaatey they."
"6887, 6888","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ham aakhiri ummat hain lekin (qiyamat ke din) sabse aagey rehney waley hain. (riwaayat hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ( agar koi shakhs terey ghar main ( kisi suraakh ya jangley wghaira se) tum se ijazat liye baghair jhank raha ho aur tum usey kankari maaro jis se uski aankh phoot jaey to tum par koi saza nahi hai na gunah hoga na duniya ki koi saza laagu hogi."
"6905, 6906","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse aik aurat ke hamal gira dene ke khoon baha ke silsile mein mashwara kya to Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ghulam ya kaneez ka is silsiley mein faisla kya tha. jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska faisla kya tha to wo maujood they."
"6907, 6908","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne logon se qism de kar puchha ke kis ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hamal girney ke silsiley mein faisla suna hai? Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai, aap ne usmein aik ghulam ya kaneez dene ka faisla kya tha. is par apna koi gawah laao. chunanche Muhammad-bin-Muslima (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main gawahi deta hun ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye faisla kya tha."
"6924, 6925","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki wafat ho gaee aur Abu-Bakar siddeeq (Raziallahu anhu) khaleefa baney aur Arab ke kuchh log kaafir ban gaey to umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse kaha tum un logon se kaisey lado gey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to ye farmaya hai mujh ko logon se ladney ka us waqt tak hukm hua jab tak wo la ilaaha-illallaah na kahin phir jisne la ilaaha-illallaah keh liya us ne apne maal aur apni jaan ko mujh se bacha liya albatta kisi haq ke badla uski jaan ya maal ko nuqsan pahunchaya jaey to ye aur baat hai. ab iske dil mein kya hai iska hisab leney wala Allah hai. main to Allah ki qism us shakhs se ladunga jo Namaz aur zakat mein farq karey, isliye ke zakat maal ka haq hai) jaisey Namaz jism ka haq hai) Allah ki qism ! agar ye log mujh ko aik bakri ka bachcha na dengey jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko diya kartey they, to main uske na dene par unse ladunga. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha qism Allah ki iske baad mein samajh gaya ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ke dil mein jo ladai ka irada hua hai ye Allah ne unke dil mein daala hai aur main pehchan gaya ke Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki raey haq hai."
"6957, 6958","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din tum mein se kisi ka khazaana chitkabraa azdahaa bin kar aayega uska Malik us se bhagega lekin wo usey talash kar raha hoga aur kahega ke main tumhara khazaana hun. farmaya Allah ki qism wo musalsal talash karta rahega yahan tak ke wo shakhs apna hath phaila dega aur azdahaa usey luqma banaega. '' aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jaanwaron ke Malik jinhoney unka sharaee haq ada nahi kya hoga qiyamat ke din un par wo janwar ghalib kar diye jaeinge aur wo apni khuron se uske chehrey ko nochengey aur kuchh logon ne ye keh diya ke agar aik shakhs ke paas oont hain aur usey khatrah hai ke zakat is par wajib ho jaeygi aur isliye wo kisi din zakat se bachney ke liye heele ke taur par usi jaisey oont ya bakri ya gaaey ya dirhamon ke badley mein bech de to is par koi zakat nahi aur phir uska ye bhi kehna hai ke agar wo apne oont ki zakat saal poorey honey se aik din ya aik saal pahley dedey to zakat ada ho jati hai."
"7001, 7002","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) umme-Haraam binte-Milhaan (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan tashrif ley jaya kartey they, wo Ubada-bin-Samit ke nikah mein thin. aik din aap unke yahan gaey to unhon-ne aap ke samney khaney ki cheez pesh ki aur aap ka sar jhadney lagiin. us arse mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) so gaey phir bedaar huey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa rahe they. maine is par puchha : ya Rasulullah! aap kyon hans rahe hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney Allah ke rastey mein jang kartey huey pesh kiye gaey, us dariya ki pusht par, wo is tarah sawar hain jaisey badshah takht par hotey hain. Ishaq ko shak tha (hadees ke alfaz (ملوكا على الأسرة) they ya (ملوكا على الأسرة ke jaisey) unhon-ne kaha ke maine is par arz kya : ya Rasulullah! dua kijiye ke Allah mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke liye dua ki phir aap ne sar Mubarak rakha (aur so gaey) phir bedaar huey to muskuraa rahe they. maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! aap kyon hans rahe hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat ke kuchh log mere samney Allah ke rastey mein jang kartey pesh kiye gaey. jis tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pehli martaba farmaya tha. bayan kya ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah! Allah se dua karein ke mujhey bhi unmein se kar de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum sabse pahley logon mein hogi. chunanche umme-Haraam (rz), Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke zamane mein samandari safar par gain aur jab samandar se bahar aaiin to sawari se gir kar Shahid ho gaiin."
"7015, 7016","maine khuwab mein dekha ke maano mere hath mein resham ka aik tukda hai aur main jannat mein jis jagah jana chahta hun wo mujhey uda kar wahan pahuncha deta hai. maine iska zikr Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se kya. aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us khuwab ka zikr kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhara bhai mard nek ya farmaya ke Abdullah nek aadmi hai."
"7028, 7029","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se kuchh log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahad mein khuwab dekhtey they aur usey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bayan kartey they, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uski tabeer detey jaisa ke Allah chaahtaa. main us waqt naujawaan tha aur mera ghar masjid thi ye meri shadi se pahley ki baat hai. maine apne dil mein sochaa ke agar tujh mein koi khair hoti to too bhi un logon ki tarah khuwab dekhta . chunanche jab main aik raat leta to maine kaha : aey Allah ! agar to mere andar koi khair w bhalai janta hai to mujhey koi khuwab dikhaa . main usi haal main ( so gaya aur maine dekha ke) mere paas 2 Farishtey aaey, unmein se har aik ke hath mein lohey ka hathodaa tha aur wo mujhey jahannam ki taraf ley chaley. mein un donon farishton ke darmyan mein tha aur Allah se dua karta ja raha tha ke aey Allah ! main jahannam se teri panah mangta hun phir mujhey dikhaya gaya ( khuwab hi mein) ke mujh se aik aur farishta mila jiske hath mein lohey ka aik hathodaa tha aur us ne kaha daro nahi tum kitney achchhey aadmi ho agar tum Namaz zyada padhtey . chunanche wo mujhey lekar chaley aur jahannam ke kinarey par ley ja kar mujhey khada kar diya to jahannam aik gol kuwein ki tarah thi aur kuwein ke matkon ki tarah uske bhi matkey they aur har 2 matkon ke darmyan aik farishta tha. jiske hath mein lohey ka aik hathodaa tha aur maine usmein kuchh log dekhey jinhein zanjeeron mein latkaa diya gaya tha aur unke sar nichey they. (aur paon uper ( unmein se kuchh Quraish ke logon ko maine pehchaana bhi, phir wo mujhey daain taraf lekar chaley. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye ( sun kar) farmaya, Abdullah mard nek hai, (agar raat ko tahajjud padhta hota ( Naafe kehtey hain ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jab se ye khuwab dekha wo nafl Namaz bahut padha kartey they. matkey jin par mooth ki lakdiyan khadi kartey hain."
"7030, 7031","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein naujawaan ghair shadi shuda tha to masjide-Nabawi mein sota tha aur jo shakhs bhi khuwab dekhta wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se uska tazkira karta. maine sochaa : aey Allah ! agar terey nazdeek mujh mein koi khair hai to mujhey bhi koi khuwab dikhaa jiski Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mujhey tabeer dein. phir main soyaa aur maine 2 Farishtey dekhey jo mere paas aaey aur mujhey ley chaley. phir un donon se tesraa farishta bhi aa mila aur us ne mujh se kaha ke daro nahi tum nek aadmi ho. phir wo donon Farishtey mujhey jahannam ki taraf le gaey to wo kuwein ki tarah teh-b-teh thi aur is mein kuchh log they jin mein se kuchh ko maine pehchaana bhi, phir wo donon Farishtey mujhey daain taraf ley chaley, jab subah hui to maine us tazkira apni behan Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) se kya. Ummul-Momenin Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us khuwab ka zikr kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Abdullah nek mard hai. kash! wo raat mein Namaz zyada padha karta. Zohri ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us farman ke baad wo raat mein nafli Namaz zyada padha kartey they."
"7036, 7037","ye wo hadis hai jo ham se Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan ki ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ham sab ummaton se aakhiri ummat (waqt ke eitibaar se) aur sab ummaton se pehli ummat (jannat mein daakhila ke eitibaar se) hain.'' aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main soyaa hua tha ke zameen ke khazaaney mere paas laey gaey aur mere hath mein 2 soney ke kangan rakh diye gaey jo mujhey bahut sakht guzrey . phir mujhey wahi ki gaee ke main un par phoonk maarun maine phoonkaa to wo ud gaey. maine unki tabeer 2 jhooton se li jinke darmyan mein main hun aik san'aa ka aur doosra yamaama kaa. ''"
"7055, 7056","ham Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein pahunchey wo mareez they aur ham ne arz kya : Allah Taala aapko sihat ata farmaaey. koi hadis bayan kijiye jiska nafa aapko Allah Taala pahunchaaey. unhon-ne bayan kya ke maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Lailatal-Aqbaa mein suna hai ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein bulaya aur ham ne aap se bait ki. jin baton ka Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se ahad liya tha unmein ye bhi tha ke khushi aur naa-gawaarii, tangi aur kushadgi aur apni haq talafi (تلفی) mein bhi itaat aur farmaanbardaarii karein aur ye bhi ke hukmaraanon ke sath hukumat ke barey mein us waqt tak jhagdaa na karein jab tak unko ea'laaniya kufr kartey na dekh lein. agar wo ea'laaniya kufr karein to tum ko Allah ke paas se daleel mil jaeygi."
"7062, 7063","nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din se pahley aisey din hongey jin mein jahaalat utar padegii aur ilm utha liya jaeyga aur (هرج) badh jaeyga aur (هرج) qatl hai.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din se pahley aisey din hongey jin mein jahaalat utar padegii aur ilm utha liya jaeyga aur (هرج) badh jaeyga aur (هرج) qatl hai.''"
"7102, 7103, 7104","abu-Musa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar bin-Yaasir (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey jab unhein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ahale-koofa ke paas isliye bheja tha ke logon ko ladney ke liye taiyaar karein. abu-Musa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kehney lagey jab se tum muslmaan huey ho ham ne koi baat us se zyada buri nahi dekhi jo tum is kaam mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya maine bhi jab se tum donon musalman huey ho tumhari koi baat is se buri nahi dekhi jo tum us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) aur abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) donon ko eik-eik kapdey ka nayaa joda pahnaayaa phir teenon mil kar masjid mein tashrif ley gaey. abu-Moosa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar bin-Yaasir (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey jab unhein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ahale-koofa ke paas isliye bheja tha ke logon ko ladney ke liye taiyaar karein. abu-Musa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kehney lagey jab se tum muslmaan huey ho ham ne koi baat us se zyada buri nahi dekhi jo tum is kaam mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya maine bhi jab se tum donon musalman huey ho tumhari koi baat is se buri nahi dekhi jo tum us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) aur abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) donon ko eik-eik kapdey ka nayaa joda pahnaayaa phir teenon mil kar masjid mein tashrif ley gaey. abu-Moosa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar bin-Yaasir (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey jab unhein Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ahale-koofa ke paas isliye bheja tha ke logon ko ladney ke liye taiyaar karein. abu-Musa aur Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) donon Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kehney lagey jab se tum muslmaan huey ho ham ne koi baat us se zyada buri nahi dekhi jo tum is kaam mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne jawab diya maine bhi jab se tum donon musalman huey ho tumhari koi baat is se buri nahi dekhi jo tum us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) aur abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) donon ko eik-eik kapdey ka nayaa joda pahnaayaa phir teenon mil kar masjid mein tashrif ley gaey."
"7105, 7106, 7107","main abu-Masood, abu-Musa aur Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath betha hua tha. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha hamarey sath waley jitney log hain main agar chaahoon to tumharey siwa unmein se har aik ka kuchh na kuchh aib bayan kar sakta hun. (lekin tum aik be-aeib ho) aur jab se tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki, maine koi aib ka kaam tumhara nahi dekha. aik yahi aib ka kaam dekhta hun, tum us daur mein yani logon ko jang ke liye uthaney mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) tum se aur tumharey sathi abu-Musa Ash-ari se jab se tum donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki hai maine koi aib ka kaam us se zyada nahi dekha jo tum donon us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. is par Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aur wo maaldaar aadmi they ke ghulam ! 2 hulley laao. chunanche unhon-ne aik hulla abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko diya aur doosra Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko aur kaha ke aap donon bhai kapdey pahan kar Juma padhney chalein . main abu-Masood, abu-Musa aur Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath betha hua tha. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha hamarey sath waley jitney log hain main agar chaahoon to tumharey siwa unmein se har aik ka kuchh na kuchh aib bayan kar sakta hun. (lekin tum aik be-aeib ho) aur jab se tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki, maine koi aib ka kaam tumhara nahi dekha. aik yahi aib ka kaam dekhta hun, tum us daur mein yani logon ko jang ke liye uthaney mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) tum se aur tumharey sathi abu-Musa Ash-ari se jab se tum donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki hai maine koi aib ka kaam us se zyada nahi dekha jo tum donon us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. is par Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aur wo maaldaar aadmi they ke ghulam ! 2 hulley laao. chunanche unhon-ne aik hulla abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko diya aur doosra Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko aur kaha ke aap donon bhai kapdey pahan kar Juma padhney chalein . main abu-Masood, abu-Musa aur Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath betha hua tha. Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha hamarey sath waley jitney log hain main agar chaahoon to tumharey siwa unmein se har aik ka kuchh na kuchh aib bayan kar sakta hun. (lekin tum aik be-aeib ho) aur jab se tum ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki, maine koi aib ka kaam tumhara nahi dekha. aik yahi aib ka kaam dekhta hun, tum us daur mein yani logon ko jang ke liye uthaney mein jaldi kar rahe ho. Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) tum se aur tumharey sathi abu-Musa Ash-ari se jab se tum donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sohbat ikhtiyar ki hai maine koi aib ka kaam us se zyada nahi dekha jo tum donon us kaam mein der kar rahe ho. is par Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha aur wo maaldaar aadmi they ke ghulam ! 2 hulley laao. chunanche unhon-ne aik hulla abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ko diya aur doosra Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko aur kaha ke aap donon bhai kapdey pahan kar Juma padhney chalein ."
"7176, 7177","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne, jab musalmanon ne qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ko ijazat di to farmaya ke mujhey nahi malum ke tum mein se kis ne ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. to wapas jao aur tumhara mamla hamarey paas tumharey naqeeb ya chaudhrii aur tumharey sardaar laaein. chunanche log wapas chaley gaey aur unke zimme-daaron ne unse baat ki aur phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aa kar itlaa di ke logon ne dilii khushi se ijazat de di hai. rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne, jab musalmanon ne qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ko ijazat di to farmaya ke mujhey nahi malum ke tum mein se kis ne ijazat di hai aur kis ne nahi di hai. to wapas jao aur tumhara mamla hamarey paas tumharey naqeeb ya chaudhrii aur tumharey sardaar laaein. chunanche log wapas chaley gaey aur unke zimme-daaron ne unse baat ki aur phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko aa kar itlaa di ke logon ne dilii khushi se ijazat de di hai."
"7183, 7184","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs aisi qism khaaey jo jhooti ho jiske zariey wo kisi doosrey ka maal mar ley to Allah se wo us haal mein mileygaa ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' phir Allah Taala ne ye aayat (uskii tasdeeq mein) nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا ( '' bila shubah jo log Allah ke ahad aur uski qasmon ko thodi poonjii ke badley khareedtey hain'' itney mein Ashas (Raziallahu anhu) bhi aa gaey. abhi Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) unse hadis bayan kar hi rahe they. unhon-ne kaha ke mere hi barey mein ye aayat nazil hui thi aur aik shakhs ke barey mein mera unse kuwein ke barey mein jhagdaa hua to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( mujh se) kaha ke tumharey paas koi gawahi hai? maine kaha ke nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir fareeq muqabil ki qism par faisla hoga. maine kaha ke phir to ye ( jhooti ( qism kha lega . chunanche aayat ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد"
"7193, 7194","aik dehati aaey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye. phir doosrey fareeq khadey huey aur unhon-ne bhi kaha ke ye sahi kehtey hain, hamara faisla kitabullah se kar dijiye. phir dehati ne kaha mera ladka us shakhs ke yahan mazdoor tha, phir us ne uski biwi ke sath zina kar liya to logon ne mujh se kaha ke tumharey ladkey ka hukm usey rajm (sangsaar) karna hai lekin maine apne ladkey ki taraf se so bakriyon aur aik baandi ka fidya de diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke tumharey ladkey ko so kode maarey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr hoga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumharey darmyan Allah ki kitab ke mutabiq faisla karunga . baandi aur bakriyan to tumhen wapas mileingii aur terey ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye jilaa watan hona hai aur Anees (jo aik sahabi they) se farmaya ke tum uski biwi ke paas jao aur usey rajm (sangsaar) karo. chunanche Anees (Raziallahu anhu) uske paas gaey aur usey rajm (sangsaar) kya. eik dehati aaey aur arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye. phir doosrey fareeq khadey huey aur unhon-ne bhi kaha ke ye sahi kehtey hain, hamara faisla kitabullah se kar dijiye. phir dehati ne kaha mera ladka us shakhs ke yahan mazdoor tha, phir us ne uski biwi ke sath zina kar liya to logon ne mujh se kaha ke tumharey ladkey ka hukm usey rajm (sangsaar) karna hai lekin maine apne ladkey ki taraf se so bakriyon aur aik baandi ka fidya de diya. phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke tumharey ladkey ko so kode maarey jaeinge aur aik saal ke liye Shahar badr hoga. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumharey darmyan Allah ki kitab ke mutabiq faisla karunga . baandi aur bakriyan to tumhen wapas mileingii aur terey ladkey ki saza so kode aur aik saal ke liye jilaa watan hona hai aur Anees (jo aik sahabi they) se farmaya ke tum uski biwi ke paas jao aur usey rajm (sangsaar) karo. chunanche Anees (Raziallahu anhu) uske paas gaey aur usey rajm (sangsaar) kya."
"7199, 7200","ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aap ki sunney aur itaat karne ki bait ki, khushi aur naakhushii donon haalaton mein. aur is shart par ke jo shakhs sardaarii ke laaiq hoga ( maslan Quraish mein se ho aur shara' par qaaim ho ( uski sardaarii qabool kar lengey us se jhagdaa na karein aur ye ke ham haq ko lekar khadey hongey ya haq baat kahengey jahan bhi hon aur Allah ke rastey mein malaamat karne waley ki malaamat ki parwah na karengey."
"7222, 7223","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) meri ummat mein) baara ameer hongey, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi aisi baat farmai jo maine nahi suni , baad mein mere walid ne bataya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya ke wo sab ke sab Quraish khandan se hongey. maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) meri ummat mein) baara ameer hongey, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi aisi baat farmai jo maine nahi suni , baad mein mere walid ne bataya ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye farmaya ke wo sab ke sab Quraish khandan se hongey."
"7258, 7259","2 log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas apna jhagdaa laey. dusri sanad aur imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha (tafseel aagey nichey ki hadis mein hai). 2 log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas apna jhagdaa laey. dusri sanad aur imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha (tafseel aagey nichey ki hadis mein hai)."
"7278, 7279","Raportat de către Abu Huraira și Zaid bin Khalid:\n\nAm fost cu Profetul (ﷺ) când el a spus (la doi bărbați): „Vă voi judeca conform Cartii lui Allah (Legile).\""
"7284, 7285","Raportat de către Abu Huraira:\n\nCând Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a murit și Abu Bakr a fost ales ca Calif după el, unii dintre arabi s-au întors la necredință.\n`Umar i-a spus lui Abu Bakr: „Cum îndrăznești să lupți împotriva oamenilor, când Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus:\n«Mi s-a poruncit să lupt împotriva oamenilor până când vor spune: «Nimeni nu are dreptul de a fi adorat în afară de Allah».\nȘi cine spune: «Nimeni nu are dreptul de a fi adorat în afară de Allah», își va proteja averea și viața de mine,\ncu excepția unui pedeapsă legală, și socoteala lui va fi la Allah!» Abu Bakr a spus: „Pe Allah, voi lupta cu cel ce face\ndiferență între Zakat și rugăciuni, căci Zakat este dreptul obligatoriu de luat din avere. Pe Allah, dacă ar refuză\nsă-mi dea măcar o frânghie pe care o foloseau să o dea lui Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ), aș lupta împotriva lor pentru\no rețin.\" `Umar a spus: „Pe Allah, nu a fost nimic, decât că am văzut că Allah deschis pieptul lui Abu Bakr pentru\nluptă, și am ajuns să știu cu certitudine că aceasta era adevărul.\""
"7317, 7318","Raportat de către Al-Maghira bin Shu`ba:\n\n`Umar bin Al-Khattab a întrebat (oamenii) despre Imlasul unei femei, adică o femeie care are un avort\ndin cauza loviturii pe abdomen, spunând: „Cine dintre voi a auzit ceva despre asta de la Profet?\"\nAm spus: „Eu am auzit.\" El a spus: „Ce este?\" Am spus: „L-am auzit pe Profet spunând: «Diya (despăgubirea) sa\neste fie un sclav masculin, fie o sclavă feminină.»\" `Umar a spus: „Nu pleca până nu prezinți un martor\ncare să susțină afirmația ta.\" Așa că am ieșit și am găsit Muhammad bin Maslama. L-am adus, și el a mărturisit\nîmpreună cu mine că a auzit pe Profet (ﷺ) spunând: „Diya (despăgubirea) sa este fie un sclav masculin, fie o sclavă feminină.\""
"7327, 7328","Raportat de către tatăl lui Hisham:\n\n`Aisha i-a spus lui `Abdullah bin Az-Zubair: „Îngroape-mă cu tovarășele mele femei (adică, soțiile Profetului)\nși nu mă îngrăpa cu Profetul (ﷺ) în casă, pentru că nu mi-ar plăcea să fiu considerată sfântă (doar pentru că\nsunt îngropată acolo).\"\nRaportat de către tatăl lui Hisham: `Umar a trimis un mesaj la `Aisha, spunând: „Îmi permiți să fiu\nîngropat cu cei doi tovarăși (Profetul (ﷺ) și Abu Bakr)?\" Ea a spus: „Da, pe Allah.\" deși era obiceiul ei că, dacă un bărbat\ndintre tovarășii (Profetului (ﷺ)) îi trimitea un mesaj cerându-i să-i permită să fie îngropat acolo, ea spunea:\n„Nu, pe Allah, nu voi da niciodată permisiune nimănui să fie îngropat cu ei.\""
"7340, 7341","Raportat de către Anas:\n\nProfetul (ﷺ) a adus Ansarii și pe oamenii Qurish în alianță în casa mea la Medina, și a invocat Allah\ntimp de o lună împotriva tribului Bani Sulaim (în ultima rak`a din fiecare rugăciune) obligatorie."
"7350, 7351","Raportat de către Abu Sa`id Al-Khudri și Abu Huraira:\n\nMesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a trimis pe fratele tribului Bani Adi Al-Ansari ca guvernator al Khaibar.\nApoi băratul s-a întors, aducând Janib (un fel de curmale de bună calitate). Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) l-a întrebat:\n„Sunt toate curmalele din Khaibar așa?\" El a răspuns: „Nu, pe Allah, O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)! Luăm un Sa' din aceste\ncurmale (bune) pentru două Sa' de curmale amestecate.\" Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus atunci: „Nu face așa.\nAr trebie să iei un Sa' din acest (fel) pentru un Sa' din celalt; sau să vinzi un fel și apoi să cumperi cu prețul său\ncelalt fel (de curmale), și ar trebui să faci la fel la cântărit.\""
"7371","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman bhejaa."
"7372","maine Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne kaha ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko Yaman bheja to unse farmaya ke tum ahle-kitab mein se aik qaum ke paas ja rahe ho. isliye sabse pahley unhein uski dawat dena ke wo Allah ko aik maanein (aur meri risalat ko maanein ( jab wo usey samajh lein to phir unhein batana ke Allah ne aik din aur raat mein un par panch namazein farz ki hain. jab wo Namaz padhney lagein to unhein batana ke Allah ne un par unke maalon mein zakat farz ki hai, jo unke ameeron se li jaeygi aur unke ghareebon ko lota di jaeygi. jab wo iska bhi iqrar kar lein to unse zakat lena aur logon ke umda maal leney se parhez karna."
"7373","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Muaz ! kya tumhen malum hai ke Allah ka uske bandon par kya haq hai? ''unhon-ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool hi zyada jantey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye hai ke wo sirf usi ki ibadat karein aur uska koi Sharik na thehraein . kya tumhen malum hai phir bandon ka Allah par kya haq hai? arz kya ke Allah aur uske rasool hi zyada jantey hain, farmaya ye hai ke wo unhein azab na de."
"7374","aik shakhs ne aik doosrey shakhs Qatada bin Nauman ko baar-baar Sura ikhlas padhtey suna. subah hui to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar is tarah waqia bayan kya jaisey wo usey kam samajhtey hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai ! ye sura tehai Quran ke barabar hai. Ismail bin Jafar ne Imam Malik se ye badhaya ke unse Abdur-Rehman ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke mujhey mere bhai Qatada bin Nauman ne khabar di Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"7375","wo Ummul-Momenin Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki parwarish mein thin. unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahib ko aik muhim par rawaana kya. wo sahib apne sathiyon ko Namaz padhatey they aur Namaz mein khatm Sura ikhlas par kartey they. jab log wapas aaey to iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unse poochho ke wo ye tarze-amal kyon ikhtiyar kiye huey they. chunanche logon ne puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke wo aisa isliye kartey they ke ye Allah ki sifat hai aur main usey padhna azeez rakhta hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein bata do ke Allah bhi unhein azeez rakhta hai."
"7376","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo logon par raham nahi khata Allah bhi is par raham nahi khaataa.''"
"7377","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas they ke aap ki aik sahibzadi Zenab ke bhejey huey aik shakhs aap ki khidmat mein hazir huey ke unke ladkey jaan nikalney ki haalat mein mubtala hain aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bula rahi hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke tum ja kar unhein bata do ke Allah hi ka sab maal hai jo chahey le-ley aur jo chahey dedey aur uski bargah mein har cheez ke liye aik waqt muqarrar hai to unse kaho ke sabr karein aur is par sabr sawab ki niyat se karein. sahibzadi ne dobara aapko qism de kar kelha bheja ke aap zaroor tashrif laey. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur aap ke sath Sad-bin-Muaz aur Muaz-bin-Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) bhi khadey huey ( phir jab aap sahibzadi ke ghar pahunchey to ( bachcha aapko diya gaya aur uski saans ukhad rahi thi jaisey puraanii mashk ka haal hota hai. ye dekh kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aankhon mein aansu bhar aaey. is par Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! ye kya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye rehmat hai jo Allah Taala ne apne bandon ke dilon mein rakhi hai aur Allah bhi apne unhein bandon par raham karta hai jo raham dil hotey hain."
"7378","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''takleef deh baat sun kar Allah se zyada sabr karne wala koi nahi hai, kambakht mushrik kehtey hain ke Allah aulad rakhta hai aur phir bhi wo unhein maaf karta hai aur unhein rozii deta hai.''"
"7379","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ghaib ki panch kunjiyaan hain, jinhein Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta. Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta ke maa k pet mein kya hai, Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta ke kal kya hoga, Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta ke barish Kab aaeygii , Allah ke siwa aur koi nahi janta ke kis jagah koi marega aur Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta ke qiyamat Kab qaaim hogi. ''"
"7380","agar tum se koi ye kehta hai ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne rab ko dekha to wo ghalat kehta hai kyonke Allah Taala apne barey mein khud kehta hai ke nazrein usko dekh nahi saktin aur jo koi kehta hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghaib jantey they, to ghalat kehta hai kyonke Allah Taala khud kehta hai ke ghaib ka ilm Allah ke siwa aur kisi ko nahi."
"7381","ham (shuru Islam mein) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke peechhey Namaz padhtey they aur kehtey they السلام على الله to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya ke Allah to khud hi ( السلام . Mina ( hai, albatta is tarah kaha karo التحيات لله والصلوات والطيبات ، Mina padhi. Assalamualaik أيها النبي ورحمة الله وبركاته ، Mina padhi. السلام علينا وعلى عباد الله الصالحين ، Mina padhi. أشهد أن لا إله إلا الله وأشهد أن محمدا عبده ورسوله"
"7382","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah qiyamat ke din zameen ko apni muththii mein ley lega aur aasman ko apne daaein hath mein lapet lega phir farmaeyga mein badshah hun, kahan hain zameen ke baadshaah.'' Shuaib aur Zubaidi bin musaafir aur Ishaq bin Yahya ne Zohri se bayan kya aur unse abu-Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"7383","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kaha kartey they ''terii izzat ki panah mangta hun ke koi maabood terey siwa nahi, teri aisi zaat hai jisey maut nahi aur jin w ins fana ho jaaengey.''"
"7384","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' logon ko dozakh mein daala jaeyga (doosri sanad) aur mujh se khaleefa bin khayyaat ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Yazeed bin zurea' ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Saeed-bin-abi-Aruba ne, unse Qatada ne, unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne. ( teesri sanad) aur khaleefa bin khayyaat ne is hadis ko moa'tamir-bin-Sulaimaan se riwayat kya, kaha maine apne walid se suna, unhon-ne Qatada se, unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''dozkhiyon ko barabar dozakh mein daala jata rahega aur wo kahey jaeygi ke kya abhi aur hai. yahan tak ke rabbul-aalameen is par apna qadam rakh dega aur phir uska ek hissey doosrey se simat jaeyga aur us waqt wo kahegii ke bas bas, teri izzat aur karam ki qasam! aur jannat mein jagah baqi reh jaeygi. yahan tak ke Allah uske liye aik aur makhlooq paida kar dega aur wo log jannat ke baqi hissey mein raheingey.''"
"7385","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat mein ye dua kartey they اللهم لك الحمد أنت رب السموات والأرض ، Mina padhi. لك الحمد أنت قيم السموات والأرض ومن فيهن ، Mina padhi. لك الحمد أنت نور السموات والأرض ، Mina padhi. قولك الحق ، Mina padhi. ووعدك الحق ، Mina padhi. ولقاؤك حق ، Mina padhi. والجنة حق ، Mina padhi. والنار حق ، Mina padhi. والساعة حق ، Mina padhi. اللهم لك أسلمت ، Mina padhi. وبك آمنت ، Mina padhi. وعليك توكلت ، Mina padhi. وإليك أنبت ، Mina padhi. وبك خاصمت ، Mina padhi. وإليك حاكمت ، Mina padhi. فاغفر لي ما قدمت وما أخرت ، Mina padhi. وأسررت وأعلنت ، Mina padhi. أنت إلهي لا إله لي غيرك ''aey Allah ! terey hi liye tareef hai to aasman w zameen ka Malik hai, hamd terey liye hi hai to aasman w zameen ka qaaim karne wala hai aur un sab ka jo usmein hain. teri hi liye hamd hai to aasman w zameen ka noor hai. tera qaul haq hai aur tera wada sach hai aur teri mulaqat sach aur jannat sach aur dozakh sach hai aur qiyamat sach hai. aey Allaah! maine terey hi samney sar jhukaa diya, main tujh hi par eman laayaa, maine terey hi uper bharosa kya aur teri hi taraf rujoo kya. maine teri hi madad ke sath muqaabla kya aur main tujhii se insaf ka talabgaar hun. to to meri maghfirat kar, un tamam gunahon mein jo main pahley kar chuka hun aur jo baad mein mujh se saadir hon jo maine chipa rakhey hain aur jinka maine izhar kya hai, to hi mera maabood hai aur terey siwa aur koi maabood nahi. ''aur ham se Sabit bin-Muhammad ne bayan kya aur kaha ke ham se Sufiyan Sory ne phir yahi hadis bayan ki aur is mein yun hai) أنت الحق وقولك"
"7386","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein they aur jab ham bulandi par chadhtey to (zor se chilla kar) takbeer kehtey. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke logo! apne uper raham khaao ! Allah bahraa nahi hai aur na wo kahin door hai. tum aik bahut sunney, bahut jaankaar aur qareeb rehney wali zaat ko bulatey ho. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mere paas aaey. main us waqt dil main لا حول wla قوة إلا بالله keh raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya '' Abdullah-bin-Qais ! لا حول wla قوة إلا"
"7387, 7388","Raportat de către `Abdullah bin `Amr:\n\nAbu Bakr As-Siddiq i-a spus Profetului (ﷺ): „O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)! Învață-mă o invocație cu care să-L invoc\nAllah în rugăciunile mele.\" Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Spune: O, Allah! Am nedreptățit sufletul meu foarte mult (m-am oprimat),\nși nertat nu iartă păcatele decât Tu; așa că, te rog, acordă-mi Îți iertare. Fără îndoială, Tu ești Iertătorul cel Mare, Milostivul cel Mare.\""
"7389","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Jibraaiil (Alaihissalam) ne mujhey pukar kar kaha ke Allah ne aap ki qaum ki baat sun li aur wo bhi sun liya jo unhon-ne aapko jawab diyaa.''"
"7390","mujhey Jabir-bin-Abdullah Salma (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di, unhon-ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne sahaba ko har jaayez kaam mein istikhaara karna sikhatey they jis tarah aap Quran ki sura sikhatey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ke jab tum mein se koi kisi kaam ka irada karey to usey chahiye ke farz ke siwa 2 rakaat nafl Namaz padhey, phir salam ke baad ye dua karey ''aey Allah ! main terey ilm ke Tufail us kaam mein khairiyat talab karta hun aur teri qudrat ke Tufail taqat mangta hun aur tera fazal. kyonke tujhey qudrat hai aur mujhey nahi, to janta hai aur main nahi janta aur to ghaibon ka bahut jaanney wala hai. aey Allah ! to agar to ye baat janta hai (is waqt istikhaara karne waley ko us kaam ka naam lena chahiye (ke is kaam mein mere liye duniya w aakhirat mein bhalai hai ya is tarah farmaya ke ''mere Deen main aur guzraan main aur mere har anjam ke eitibaar se bhalai hai to is par mujhey qaadir bana de aur mere liye usey aasan kar de, phir usmein mere liye barkat ata farmaa. aey Allaah! aur agar to janta hai ke ye kaam mere liye bura hai. mere Deen aur guzaara ke eitibaar se aur mere anjam ke eitibaar se, ya farmaya ke meri duniya w Deen ke eitibaar se to mujhey us kaam se door kar de aur mere liye bhalai muqaddar kar de jahan bhi wo ho aur phir mujhey is par razi aur khush rakh."
"7391","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qism is tarah khaatey ''qasam uski jo dilon ka pher dene wala hai.''"
"7392","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ke ninyaanwe naam hain, jo unhein yad kar lega wo jannat mein jaaeyga.''"
"7393","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo shakhs apne bistar par jaey to usey chahiye ke usey apne kapdey ke kinarey se teen martaba saaf kar ley aur ye dua padhey باسمك رب وضعت جنبي وبك أرفعه ، Mina padhi. إن أمسكت نفسي فاغفر لها ، Mina padhi. وإن أرسلتها فاحفظها بما تحفظ به عبادك الصالحين ''aey mere rab! tera naam lekar main apni karwat rakhta hun aur terey naam hi ke sath usey uthaaoonga. agar tu ney meri jaan ko baqi rakha to usey maaf karna aur agar usey (apni taraf sotey hi mein) utha liya to uski hifazat is tarah karna jis tarah to apne neku-kaar bandon ki hifazat karta hai.'' is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Yahya aur Bishr bin Fazal ne Ubaidullah se ki hai, unse Saeed ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aur zuhair, abu-Zamra aur Ismail bin Zakariya ne Ubaidullah se ye izafa kya ke unse Saeed ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aur uski riwayat ibne- Ajlan ne ki, unse Saeed ne, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne. uski mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman darawardi aur Usama bin Hafs ne ki."
"7394","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab apne bistar par letney jatey to ye dua kartey ( اللهم باسمك أحيا وأموت )''aey Allah ! terey naam ke sath zinda hun aur usi ke sath maroonga . ''aur jab subah hoti to ye dua kartey الحمد لله الذي أحيانا بعد ما أماتنا وإليه النشور ''tamaam tareef us Allah ke liye hai jisne iske baad zinda kya ke ham mar chukey they aur usi ki taraf uth kar jana hai.''"
"7395","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein letney jatey to kehtey (باسمك نموت ونحيا ( ''ham terey hi naam se marengey aur usi se zinda hongey. ''aur jab bedaar hotey to kehtey الحمد لله الذي أحيانا بعد ما أماتنا وإليه النشور '' tamam tareef us Allah ke liye hai jisne hamein maarney ke baad zinda kya aur usi ki taraf jana hai.''"
"7396","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ''jab tum mein se koi apni biwi ke paas janey ka irada karey aur ye dua padh ley ( باسم الله , Mina اللهم جنبنا الشيطان , Mina وجنب الشيطان ما رزقتنا) '' shuru Allah ke naam se, aey Allaah! hamein shaitan se door rakhna aur to jo hamein bachcha ata karey usey bhi shaitan se door rakhnaa.'' to agar isi sohbat mein un donon se koi bachcha naseeb hua to shaitan usey kabhi nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakega.''"
"7397","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke main apne sadhaaey huey kuttey ko shikar ke liye chhorta hun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum sadhaaey huey kuttey chhodo aur unke sath Allah ka naam bhi ley lo, phir wo koi shikar pakdein aur usey khaaein nahi to tum usey kha saktey ho aur jab shikar par bin phaal ke teer yani lakdi se koi shikar maarey lekin wo nauk se lag kar janwar ka gosht cheer de to aisa shikar bhi khaao."
"7398","unse Ummul-Momenin Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke logon ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! wahan ke qabeeley abhi haal hi mein Islam laey aur wo hamein gosht la kar detey hain. hamein yaqin nahi hota ke zabah kartey waqt unhon-ne Allah ka naam bhi liya tha ya nahi (to kya ham usey kha saktey hain?) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum is par Allah ka naam lekar usey kha liya karo. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman darawardi aur Usama bin Hafs ne ki."
"7399","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne 2 mendhon ki qurbani ki aur zabah kartey waqt bismillaahi-Allahu-akbar padha ."
"7400","wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Zil-Hijja ki dasween taareekh ko maujood they Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Namaz padhai phir khutba diya aur farmaya ''jisne Namaz se pahley janwar zabah kar liya to uski jagah doosra janwar zabah karey aur jisne zabah abhi na kya ho to wo Allah ka naam lekar zabah kare.''"
"7401","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''apne bap daadon ki qism na khaya karo, agar kisi ko qism khaani hi ho to Allah ke naam ki qism khaaey warna khamosh rahe.''"
"7402","jo bani zohra ke haleef they aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke shagirdon mein they ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Azl aur qaara walon ki darkhaast par das akaabir sahaba ko jin mein Khubaib (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they, unke yahan bhejaa. ibne-Shahab ne kaha ke mujhey Ubaidullah bin ayaaz ne khabar di ke Haris ki sahibzadi Zenab ne unhein bataya ke jab log Khubaib (Raziallahu anhu) ko qatl karne ke liye aamada huey (aur qaid mein they) to usi zamaney mein unhon-ne unse safaaii karne ke liye ustra liya tha, jab wo log Khubaib (Raziallahu anhu) ko haram se bahar qatl karne le gaey to unhon-ne ye ashaar kahey . ''aur jab main musalman honey ki haalat mein qatl kya ja raha hun to mujhey uski parwaa nahi ke mujhey kis pahlu par qatl kya jaeyga aur mera ye marnaa Allah ke liye hai aur agar wo chaahega to mere tukdey tukdey kiye huey aaza par barkat nazil karega .'' phir ibne- al-Haaris ne unhein qatl kar diya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne sahaba ko us haadisa ki itlaa isi din di jis din ye hazraat Shahid kiye gaey they."
"7403","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii bhi Allah se zyada ghairat mand nahi aur isi liye us ne fawaahish ko haram qarar diya hai aur Allah se zyada koi tareef pasand karne wala nahi. ''"
"7404","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Allah Taala ne makhlooq ko paida kya to apni kitab mein usey likhaa, us ne apni zaat ke mutaalliq bhi likha aur ye ab bhi arsh par likha hua maujood hai إن رحمتي تغلب"
"7405","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke main apne bandey ke guman ke sath hun aur jab wo mujhey apne dil mein yad karta hai to main bhi usey apne dil mein yad karta hun aur jab wo mujhey majlis mein yad karta hai to main usey us se behtar farishton ki majlis mein usey yad karta hun aur agar wo mujh se aik baalisht qareeb aata hai to main us se aik hath qareeb ho jata hun aur agar wo mujh se aik hath qareeb aata hai to main us se 2 hath qareeb ho jata hun aur agar wo meri taraf chal kar aata hai to main uske paas daud kar aa jata hoon.''"
"7406","jab ye aayat nazil huii قل هو القادر على أن يبعث عليكم عذابا من فوقكم''aap keh dijiye ke wo qaadir hai is par ke tum par tumharey uper se azab nazil kare.'' to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kaha ''main terey munh ki panah mangta hoon.'' phir aayat ke ye alfaz nazil huey أو من تحت أرجلكم ''wo tumharey uper se tum par azab nazil karey ya tumharey paon ke nichey se azab aa jaaey.'' to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir ye dua ki ke main terey munh ki panah chahta hun. phir ye aayat nazil hui ( أو يلبسكم"
"7407","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas dajjal ka zikr hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tumhen achi tarah malum hai ke Allah kaana nahi hai aur aap ne hath se apni aankh ki taraf ishara kya aur dajjal Masih ki daain aankh kaani hogi, jaisey uski aankh par angoor ka aik utha hua daana ho."
"7408","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ne jitney Nabi bhejey un sab ne jhootey kaaney dajjal se apni qaum ko daraayaa, wo dajjal kaana hoga aur tumhara rab (aankhon wala hai) kaana nahi hai, us dajjal ki donon aankhon ke darmyan likha hua hoga (lafz) kaafir.''"
"7409","jang banu-mustaliq mein unhein baandiyaan ghaneemat mein miliin to unhon-ne chaha ke unse ham-bistarii karein lekin hamal na thahrey . chunanche logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se azl ke mutaalliq puchha : to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar tum azl bhi karo to koi qabahat nahi magar qiyamat tak jis jaan ke mutaalliq Allah Taala ne paida hona likh diya hai wo zaroor paida ho kar rahegi (is liye tumhara azl karna bekaar hai. maujooda jabrii nasl bandi ka jawaz us se nikaalnaa bilkul ghalat hai. aur Mujahid ne Qaza se bayan kya ke unhon-ne Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke koi bhi jaan jo paida honii hai, Allah Taala zaroor usey paida karke rahega."
"7410","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala qiyamat ke din isi tarah jaisey ham duniya mein jama hotey hain, mominon ko ikattha karega (wo garmi wghaira se pareshan ho kar) kahengey kash! ham kisi ki sifarish apne Malik ke paas ley jatey taake hamein apni is haalat se aaraam miltaa. chunanche sab mil kar Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey. unse kahengey Adam ! aap logon ka haal nahi dekhtey kis bula mein giraftaar hain. aapko Allah Taala ne ( khas ( apne hath se banaya aur farishton se aapko sajda karaya aur har cheez ke naam aapko batlaaiye (har lughat mein bolnaa baat karna sikhlaayaa) kuchh sifarish kijiye taake ham logon ko is jagah se nijat ho kar aaraam miley. kahengey mein is laaiq nahi, unko wo gunah yad aa jaeyga jo unhon-ne kya tha ( mamnoo darakht mein se khana ( . (wo kahengey ( magar tum log aisa karo Nuh (Alaihissalam) paighambar ke paas jao wo pahley paighambar hain jinko Allah Taala ne zameen walon ki taraf bheja tha. aakhir wo log sab Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey, wo bhi yahi jawab dengey, main us laaiq nahi apni khata jo unhon-ne ( duniya mein) ki thi yad karengey. kahengey tum log aisa karo paighambar Ibrahim ke paas jao jo Allah ke khaleel hain ( log unke paas jaeinge ( wo bhi apni khataein yad karke kahengey main is laaiq nahi tum Musa (Alaihissalam) paighambar ke paas jao Allah ne unko Taurait inayat farmai, unse bol kar baatein kin. ye log Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey wo bhi yahi kahengey mein is laaiq nahi apni khata jo unhon-ne duniya mein ki thi yad karengey magar tum aisa karo Esa (Alaihissalam) paighambar ke paas jao wo Allah ke bandey, uske rasool, uske khas kalima aur khas Rooh hain. ye log Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey wo kahengey main is laaiq nahi tum aisa karo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jao wo Allah ke aisey bandey hain jinki agli pichhli khataein sab bakhsh di gaee hain. aakhir ye sab log jama ho kar mere paas aaeingey. main chaloonga aur apne parwardigar ki bargah mein hazir honey ki ijazat maangonga , mujh ko ijazat milegii. main apne parwardigar ko dekhtey hi sajdey mein gir padoonga aur jab tak usko manzoor hai wo mujh ko sajdey hi mein padaa rehney dega. iske baad hukm hoga '' Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apna sar uthao aur arz karo tumhari arz suni jaeygi tumhari darkhaast manzoor hogi, tumhari sifarish maqbool hogi us waqt main apne Malik ki aisi aisii ta'reefein karunga jo wo mujh ko sikhaa chuka hai. (ya sikhlaaeyga) phir logon ki sifarish shuru kar doonga. sifarish ki aik had muqarrar kar di jaeygi. main unko jannat mein ley jaunga, phir lot kar apne parwardigar ke paas hazir hunga aur usko dekhtey hi sajdey mein gir padoon ga jab tak parwardigar chaahega mujh ko sajdey mein padaa rehney dega. iske baad irshad hoga '' Muhammad apna sar uthao jo tum kahogey suna jaeyga aur sifarish karogey to qabool hogi phir main apne parwardigar ki aisi ta'reefein karunga jo Allah ne mujh ko sikhlaayein (ya sikhlaaeyga) iske baad sifarish kar doonga lekin sifarish ki aik had muqarrar kar di jaeygi. main unko jannat mein ley jaaunga phir lot kar apne parwardigar ke paas hazir hunga usko dekhtey hi sajdey mein gir padoon ga jab tak parwardigar chaahega mujh ko sajdey mein padaa rehney dega. iske baad irshad hoga Muhammad apna sar uthao jo tum kahogey suna jaeyga aur sifarish karogey to qabool hogi phir main apne parwardigar ki aisi ta'reefein karunga jo Allah ne mujh ko sikhlaayein (ya sikhlaaeyga) iske baad sifarish shuru kar doonga lekin sifarish ki aik had muqarrar kar di jaeygi. mein unko bahisht mein ley jaaunga phir lot kar apne parwardigar ke paas hazir hoonga. arz karunga : ya paak parwardigaar! ab to dozakh mein aisey hi log reh gaey hain jo Quran ki wajah se dozakh hi mein hamesha rehney ke laaiq hain. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke dozakh se wo log nikal liye jaeinge jinhoney (duniyaa mein) la ilaaha-illallaah kaha hoga aur unke dil mein aik jau barabar eman hoga phir wo log bhi nikal liye jaeinge jinhoney la ilaaha-illallaah kaha hoga aur unke dil mein gehun barabar eman hoga. ( gehun jau se chhota hota hai) phir wo bhi nikal liye jaeinge jinhoney la ilaaha-illallaah kaha hoga aur unke dil mein chewntii barabar (ya bhungey barabar ( eman hoga."
"7411","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah ka hath bharaa hua hai, usey raat din ki bakhshish bhi kam nahi karti , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya tumhen malum hai ke jab us ne aasman w zameen paida kiye hain us ne kitna kharch kya hai us ne bhi usmein koi kami nahi paida ki jo iske hath mein hai aur farmaya ke uska arsh pani par hai aur uske doosrey hath mein taraazu hai, jisey wo jhukata aur uthata rehta hai."
"7412, 7413","Raportat de către Ibn `Umar:\n\nMesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus: „În Înviere, Allah va ține toată Pământul cu Mâna Sa, și toate Cerurile în\nDreapta Sa, și atunci va spus: «Eu sunt Regele.»\" Abu Huraira a spus: „Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus:\n«Allah va ține Pământul...»\""
"7414","aik Yahudi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha : aey Muhammad! Allah aasmanon ko aik ungli par rok lega aur zameen ko bhi aik ungli par aur pahadon ko aik ungli par aur darakhton ko aik ungli par aur makhlooqat ko aik ungli par, phir farmaeyga ke main badshah hun. iske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa diye yahan tak ke aap ke aagey ke dandaane-mubaarak dikhai dene lagey. phir sura Al-Anaam ki ye aayat padhii  وما قدروا الله حق قدره. Yahya-bin-Saeed ne bayan kya ke is riwayat mein Fuzel bin ayaaz ne Mansoor se izafa kya, unse Ibrahim ne, unse Ubeda ne, unse Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ne ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par tajjub ki wjah se aur uski tasdeeq kartey huey hans diye."
"7415","ahle-kitab mein se aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke aey abul-Qaasim ! Allah aasmanon ko aik ungli par rok lega , zameen ko aik ungli par rok lega, darakht aur mitti ko aik ungli par rok lega aur tamam makhlooqat ko aik ungli par rok lega aur phir farmaeyga ke main ''baadshaah hun, main badshah hoon'' maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap is par hans diye, yahan tak ke aap ke daant dikhai dene lagey, phir ye aayat padhii  وما قدروا الله حق قدره"
"7416","Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke agar main apni biwi ke sath kisi ghair mard ko dekhun to seedhi talwaar se uski gardan mar dun phir ye baat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kya tumhen Sad ki ghairat par hairat hai? bila shubah mein unse zyada ghairat mand hun aur Allah Taala mujh se zyada ghairat mand hai aur Allah ne ghairat hi ki wjah se fawaahish ko haram kya hai. chahey wo zahir mein hon ya chhup kar aur ma'zirat Allah se zyada kisi ko pasand nahi, isi liye us ne bashaarat dene waley aur daraane waley bhejey aur tareef Allah se zyada kisi ko pasand nahi, isi wjah se us ne jannat ka wada kya hai."
"7417","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik sahib se puchha kya aapko Quran mein se kuchh cheez yad hai? unhon-ne kaha ke haan, falan-falan soortein unhon-ne unke naam bataaey ."
"7418","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas tha ke aap ke paas banu- Tameem ke kuchh log aaey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : aey banu- Tameem ! bashaarat qabool karo. unhon-ne is par kaha ke aap ne hamein bashaarat de di, ab hamein bakhshish bhi dijiye. phir aap ke paas Yaman ke kuchh log pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey ahal Yaman ! banu- Tameem ne bashaarat nahi qabool ki tum usey qabool karo. unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne qabool kar li. ham aap ke paas isliye hazir huey hain taake Deen ki samajh hasil karein aur taake aap se us duniya ki shuruaat ke mutaalliq poochhein ke kis tarah thi? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah tha aur koi cheez nahi thi aur Allah ka arsh pani par tha. phir us ne aasman w zameen paida kiye aur Lauhe-mahfooz mein har cheez likh di (Imraan bayan kartey hain ke) mujhey aik shakhs ne aa kar khabar di ke Imran apni ontni ki khabar lo wo bhag gaee hai. chunanche main uski talash mein nikla . maine dekha ke mere aur uske darmyan ret ka chatiyal maidan rukawat hai aur Allah ki qism meri tamanna thi ke wo chali hi gaee hoti aur main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein se na utha hota."
"7419","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ka hath bharaa hua hai usey koi kharch kam nahi karta jo din w raat wo karta rehta hai kya tumhen malum hai ke jab se zameen w aasman ko us ne paida kya hai kitna kharch kar diya hai. us sarey kharch ne usmein koi kami nahi ki jo iske hath mein hai aur iska arsh pani par tha aur uske doosrey hath mein taraazu hai jisey wo uthata aur jhukata hai."
"7420","Zaid-bin-Haarisa (Raziallahu anhu) (apni biwi ki) shikayat karne lagey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah se daro aur apni biwi ko apne paas hi rakho . Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke agar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kisi baat ko chhipaaney waley hotey to usey zaroor chhipaatey . bayan kya chunanche Zenab (Raziallahu anha) tamam paak beeviyon par fakhr se kehti thi ke tum logon ki tumharey ghar walon ne shadi ki. aur meri Allah Taala ne saat (7) aasmanon ke uper se shadi ki aur Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) se marwi (bayan) hai ke aayat ( وتخفي في نفسك ما الله مبديه"
"7421","parde ki aayat Ummul-Momenin Zenab bin Jahash (Raziallahu anhu) ke barey mein nazil hui aur us din aap ne roti aur gosht ke waleeme ki dawat di aur Zenab (Raziallahu anha) tamam paak beeviyon par fakhr kya karti thin aur kehti thin ke mera nikah Allah ne aasman par karaya tha."
"7422","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne jab makhlooq paida ki to arsh ke uper apne paas likh diya ke meri rehmat mere ghusse se badh kar hai.''"
"7423","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo Allah aur uske rasool par eman laya , Namaz qaaim ki, Ramazan ke rozey rakhey to Allah par haq hai ke usey jannat mein dakhil kare. chahe us ne hijrat ki ho ya wahin muqeem raha ho jahan uski paidaaish hui thii.'' sahaba ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! kya ham iski itlaa logon ko na de dein ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jannat mein so darjey hain jinhein Allah Taala ne apne rastey mein jihad karne walon ke liye taiyaar kya hai, har 2 darjon ke darmyan itna fasla hai jitna aasman w zameen ke darmyan hai. to jab tum Allah se sawal karo to firdaus ka sawal karo kyonke wo darmyaana darjey ki jannat hai aur buland tareen aur uske uper Rehman ka arsh hai aur usi se jannat ki nehrein nikalti hain."
"7424","mein masjid mein dakhil hua aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they, phir jab suraj ghurub hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Abu-Zar ! kya tumhen malum hai ye kahan jata hai? '' bayan kya ke maine arz kya ke Allah aur uska rasool zyada jaanney waley hain. farmaya ke ye jata hai aur sajda ki ijazat chahta hai phir usey ijazat di jati hai aur maano us se kaha jata hai ke wapas wahan jao jahan se aaey ho. chunanche wo maghrib ki taraf se tuloo hota hai, phir aap ne ye aayat padhii ذلك مستقر"
"7425","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujhey bula bhejaa, phir maine Quran ki talash ki aur sura Tauba ki aakhiri aayat abu-Khuzaima Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas paaii. ye aayatein mujhey kisi aur ke paas nahi mili thiin لقد جاءكم رسول من أنفسكم sura Bara't (Tauba) ke aakhir tak. ham se Yahya-bin-Bukair ne bayan kya, unse Leis ne bayan kya aur unse Yunus ne yahi bayan kya ke abu-Khuzaima Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas sura tauba ki aakhiri aayatein paaein."
"7426","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pareshani ke waqt ye dua kartey they لا إله إلا الله العليم الحليم لا إله إلا الله رب العرش العظيم لا إله إلا الله رب السموات ورب الأرض رب العرش الكريم''Allaah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo bahut jaanney wala bada burdbaar hai, Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi jo arshe-azeem ka rab hai, Allah ke siwa koi rab nahi jo aasmanon ka rab hai, zameen ka rab hai aur arsh Karim ka rab hai.''"
"7427, 7428","Raportat de către Abu Sa`id Al-Khudri:\n\nProfetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Oamenii vor cădea inconștienți În Înviere, și atunci voi vedea pe Moise ținând unul dintre\nstâlpii Tronului.\" Abu Huraira a spus: Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Eu voi fi prima persoană înviată și voi vedea\npe Moise ȣinând Tronul.\""
"7429","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ek ke baad doosrey tumharey paas raat aur din ke Farishtey aatey rahtey hain aur ye Asr aur fajr ki Namaz mein jama hotey hain, phir wo uper chadhtey hain, jinhoney raat tumharey sath guzari hoti hai. phir Allah tumharey barey mein unse poochhta hai halanke usey tumhari khub khabar hai, poochhta hai ke mere bandon ko tum ne kis haal mein chhodaa? wo kehtey hain ke ham ne us haal mein chhoda ke wo Namaz padh rahe they. ''"
"7430","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne halal kamaaii se aik khajoor ke barabar bhi khairat ki aur Allah tak halal kamaaii hi ki khairat pahunchti hai, to Allah usey apne daain hath se qabool kar leta hai aur khairat karne waley ke liye usey is tarah badhata rehta hai jaisey koi tum mein se apne bachchey ki parwarish karta hai, yahan tak ke wo pahaad barabar ho jati hai.'' aur Warqaa ne is hadis ko Abdullah-bin-Dinar se riwayat kya, unhon-ne Saeed bin Yasar se, unhon-ne Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se, usmein bhi ye fiqra hai ke Allah ki taraf wahi khairat chadhtii hai jo halal kamaaii mein se ho."
"7431","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dua pareshani ke waqt kartey they لا إله إلا الله العظيم الحليم ، Mina padhi. لا إله إلا الله رب العرش العظيم ، Mina padhi. لا إله إلا الله رب السموات ورب العرش الكريم''koii maabood Allah ke siwa nahi jo azeem hai aur burdbaar hai, koi maabood Allah ke siwa nahi jo arshe-azeem ka rab hai, koi maabood Allah ke siwa nahi jo aasmanon ka rab hai aur arshe-kareem ka rab hai."
"7432","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas kuchh sona bheja gaya to aap ne usey char aadmiyon mein taqseem kar diya aur mujh se Ishaq bin Nasar ne bayan kya, unse Abdur-Razzaq ne bayan kya, unhein Sufiyan ne khabar di, unhein unke walid ne, unhein ibne-abii-Nu'am ne aur unse Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne Yaman se kuchh sona Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bheja to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey Aqra-bin-Habis hanzalii, Uena bin Badri fazaarii, Alqama-bin-Ulaasa Aamiri aur Zaid al-taaii mein taqseem kar diya. is par Quraish aur Ansar ko ghussa aa gaya aur unhon-ne kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Najad ke raeeson ko to detey hain aur hamein chhod detey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main aik maslihat ke liye unka dil bahalaataa hun. phir aik shakhs jiski aankhen dhansii hui thin, peshani ubhrii hui thi, dadhi ghanii thi, donon kalley phooley huey they aur sar gathaa hua tha. us mardood ne kaha : aey Muhammad! Allah se dar. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar main bhi us (Allaah) ki nafarmani karunga to phir kon uski itaat karega? usne mujhey zameen par ameen banaya hai aur tum mujhey ameen nahi samajhtey. phir haaziriin mein se aik sahabi Khalid (Raziallahu anhu) ya umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne iske qatl ki ijazat chahi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana farmaya, phir jab wo janey laga to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us shakhs ki nasl se aisey log paida hongey jo Quran ke sirf lafz padhengey lekin Quran unke halaq se nichey nahi utrega, wo Islam se is tarah nikal kar phenk diye jaeinge jis tarah teer shikaarii janwar mein se paar nikal jata hai, wo ahale-Islaam ko (kaafir keh kar) qatl karein aur but paraston ko chhod dengey agar maine unka daur paya to unhein qaume-aad ki tarah neest w naabood kar doonga ."
"7433","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aayat ( والشمس تجري لمستقر لها (ke mutaalliq puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke iska mustaqar arsh ke nichey hai."
"7434","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein baithey they ke aap ne chaand ki taraf dekha, chaudhawiin raat ka chaand tha aur farmaya ke tum log apne rab ko isi tarah dekhogey jis tarah is chaand ko dekh rahe ho aur uske dekhney mein koi dhakkam-peil nahi hogi. to agar tumhen iski taqat ho ke suraj tuloo honey ke pahley aur suraj ghurub honey ke baad ki namazon mein sustii na ho to aisa kar lo."
"7435","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne rab ko saaf-saaf dekhogey."
"7436","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chaudahwiin raat ko hamarey paas tashrif laey aur farmaya ke tum apne rab ko qiyamat ke din is tarah dekhogey jis tarah is chaand ko dekh rahe ho. iske dekhney mein koi rukawat nahi hogi. khullam-khullaa dekhogey, be-takalluf, be-mashaqqat, be-zahmat."
"7437, 7438","Raportat de către 'Ata' bin Yazid Al-Laithi:\n\nPe autoritatea lui Abu Huraira: Oamenii au spus: „O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)! Vom vedea pe Domnul nostru\nÎn Înviere?\" Profetul (ﷺ) a spus: „Aveți vreo dificultate în a vedea luna într-o noapte de lună plină?\"\nEi au spus: „Nu, O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ).\" El a spus: „Aveți vreo dificultate în a vedea soarele când nu sunt nori?\"\nEi au spus: „Nu, O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ).\" El a spus: „Așa îl veți vedea, la fel. Allah va aduna toți oamenii\nÎn Înviere, și va spus: «Cine a adorat ceva (în lume) ar trebui să urmeze (acel lucru)», așa că, cine a adorat soarele\nva urmări soarele, și cine a adorat luna va urmări luna, și cine avea obiceiul să alte false zeități, va urmări acele zeități.\nȘi vor rămâne doar această națiune cu oamenii ei buni (sau ipocriții săi). (Sub-naratorul, Ibrahim, este în îndoială.)\nAllah va veni la ei și va spus: «Eu sunt Domnul vostru.\" Ei vor (Lega și) vor spus: „Vom rămâne aici până va veni\nDomnul nostru, căci când Domnul nostru va veni, Îl vom recunoaște.\" Așa că Allah va veni la ei în Aparența Sa pe care\no cunosc, și va spus: «Eu sunt Domnul vostru.\" Ei vor spus: „Tu ești Domnul nostru,\" și Îl vor urmări.\n\nApoi un pod va fi așezat peste Iad (Foc) și eu și urmașii mei vom fi primii care vor trece peste el și nimeni nu va vorbi\nîn acea Zi decât Apostolii. și invocația Apostolilor în acea Zi va fi: „O, Allah, salvează! Salvează!\" În Iad (sau peste Pod)\nvor fi cârligi ca spinii As-Sa'dan (plantă spinoasă). Ați văzut As-Sa'dan?\" Ei au răspuns: „Da, O, Mesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ)!\"\nEl a spus: „Așa că acele cârligi seamănă cu spinii As-Sa'dan, dar nimeni nu știu cât de mari sunt decât Allah. Acele cârligi\nvor îndepărta oamenii conform faptelor lor. Unii dintre oamenii vor rămâne în Iad (vor fi distrși) din cauza faptelor lor\n(rele), și unii vor fi tăiați sau rupți de cârligi (și vor cădea în Iad) și unii vor fi pedepsiți și apoi eliberați. Când Allah va\nchemai Judecățile Sale printre oamenii, El va lua pe cine vrea din Iad prin Mila Sa. El va porunci atunci îngerilor să scoată\ndin Foc pe toți cei care nu adorau decât Allah dintre aceia cărora Allah a voit să le fie milă și pe cei care au mărturisit (în lume)\ncă nimeni nu are dreptul de a fi adorat în afară de Allah. Îngerii îi vor recunoaște în Foc după semnele prosternății (de pe\nfruntile lor), căci Focul va mânca tot corpul uman cu excepția semnului cauzat de prosternare, după cum Allah a interzis\nFocului să mănânce semnul prosternății. Ei vor ieși din Focul (Iadului), arși complet și atunci apa vieții se va turna peste ei\nși vor crește sub ea ca o sămânță care vine în noroiul torenței.\n\nApoi Allah va termina judecățile printre oamenii, și va rămâne un bărbat cu fața spre Iad (Foc) și el va fi ultima persoană\ndintre oamenii Iadului care va intra în Paradis. El va spus: „O, Domnul meu! Te rog, întoarce-mi fața de la foc pentru că\nm-a rănit aerul său și căldura sa mă ars.\" Așa că el va invoca Allah în modul în care Allah va dori să-L invoce, și atunci\nAllah îi va spus: „Dacă îți acord asta, vei cere altceva?\" El va răspunde: „Nu, pe Puterea Ta (Onoare), nu Îți voi cere altceva.\"\nEl îi va da Domnului său orice promisiuni și legământuri cere Allah.\n\nAșa că Allah îi va întoarce fața de la Iad (Foc). Când el va fi cu fața spre Paradis și îl va vedea, va rămâne liniștit cât\ntimp Allah va dori să rămână liniștit, și atunci va spune: „O, Domnul meu! Adu-mă aproape de poarta Paradisului.\" Allah îi va spus:\n„Nu ți-ai dat promisiunile și legământele tale că nu ai cere niciodată nimic mai mult decât ce ți-a fost dat? Pe tine, O, fiul lui Adam!\nCât ești de viclean!\" El va spune: „O, Domnul meu,\" și va continua să-L invoce Allah până când El îi va spus: „Dacă îți dau ce ceri,\nvei cere altceva?\" El va răspunde: „Nu, pe Puterea Ta (Onoare), nu Îți voi cere altceva.\"\n\nAtunci el va da legământuri și promisiuni lui Allah și apoi Allah îl va aduce aproape de poarta Paradisului. Când el va stă la poarta\nParadisului, Paradisul va fi deschis și întins înaintea lui, și va vedea splendoarea și plăcerea lui, și atunci va rămâne liniștit\ncât timp Allah va dori să rămână liniștit, și atunci va spune: „O, Domnul meu! Admite-mă în Paradis.\" Allah va spus: „Nu ți-ai dat\nlegământurile și promisiunile tale că nu ai cere nimic mai mult decât ce ți-a fost dat?\" Allah va spus: „Pe tine, O, fiul lui Adam!\nCât ești de viclean!\"\n\nBărbatul va spune: „O, Domnul meu! Nu mă face cel mai nenorocit din creația Ta,\" și va continua să-L invoce Allah până când\nAllah va râde din cauza cuvintelor sale, și când Allah va râde din cauza lui, El îi va spus: „Intră în Paradis,\" și când va intra,\nAllah îi va spus: „Dorește orice.\" Așa că el va cere Domnului său, și va dori un număr mare de lucruri, căci Allah Însuși îl va\naminti să dorească anumite lucruri spunând: „(Dorește) cutare.\" Când nu mai este nimic de dorit, Allah va spus: „Acesta este pentru tine,\nși egalul lui (este pentru tine) de asemenea.\"\n\n'Ata' bin Yazid a adăugat: Abu Sa'id Al-Khudri care era prezent cu Abu Huraira, nu a negat nimic din cea ce a spus acesta din urmă,\ndar când Abu Huraira a spus că Allah a spus: „Acesta este pentru tine și egalul lui de asemenea,\" Abu Sa'id Al-Khudri a spus:\n„Și zece ori atât, O, Abu Huraira!\" Abu Huraira a spus: „Nu mi-am amintit, decât că a spus: «Acesta este pentru tine\nși egalul lui de asemenea.»\" Abu Sa'id Al-Khudri a spus atunci: „Mărturisesc că mi-am amintit pe Profet (ﷺ) spunând:\n«Acesta este pentru tine, și zece ori atât.»\" Abu Huraira a adăugat atunci: „Acel bărbat va fi ultima persoană a oamenilor\nParadisului care va intra în Paradis.\""
"7439","ham ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! kya ham qiyamat ke din apne rab ko dekhengey? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya tum ko suraj aur chaand dekhney mein kuchh takleef hoti hai jabke aasman bhi saaf ho? ham ne kaha ke nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke phir apne rab ke deedaar main tumhen koi takleef nahi pesh aaeygii jis tarah suraj aur chaand ko dekhney mein nahi pesh aatii. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik awaz dene wala awaz dega ke har qaum iske sath jaey jiski wo puja kya karti thi. chunanche saleeb ke pujaarii apni saleeb ke sath , buton ke pujaarii apne buton ke sath , tamam jhootey ma'boodon ke pujaarii apne jhootey ma'boodon ke sath chaley jaeinge aur sirf wo log baqi reh jaeinge jo khalis Allah ki ibadat karne waley they. unmein nek w bad donon qism ke musalmanon hongey aur ahle-kitab ke kuchh baqi bachi log bhi hongey. phir dozakh unke samney pesh ki jaeygi wo aisi chamakdaar hogi jaisey maidan ka ret hota hai. (jo door se pani malum hota hai) phir yahood se puchha jaeyga ke tum kis ki puja kartey they. wo kahengey ke ham Uzer ibnullaah ki puja kya kartey they. unhein jawab milega ke tum jhootey ho Allah ke na koi biwi hai aur na koi ladka . tum kya chahtey ho? wo kahengey ke ham pani peenaa chahtey hain ke hamein us se sairaab kya jaey. unse kaha jaeyga ke piyo wo us chamaktii ret ki taraf pani jaan kar chaleingey aur phir wo jahannam mein daal diye jaengey. phir nasara se kaha jaeyga ke tum kis ki puja kartey they? wo jawab dengey ke ham Masih ibnullaah ki puja kartey they. unse kaha jaeyga ke tum jhootey ho. Allah ke na biwi thi aur na koi bachcha, ab tum kya chahtey ho? wo kahengey ke ham chahtey hain ke pani se sairaab kiye jaaein. unse kaha jaeyga ke piyo (unko bhi us chamaktii ret ki taraf chalaayaa jaaeyga) aur unhein bhi jahannam mein daal diya jaeyga yahan tak ke wahi baqi reh jaeinge jo khalis Allah ki ibadat kartey they, nek w bad donon qism ke musalmaan, unse kaha jaeyga ke tum log kyon rukey huey ho jabke sab log ja chukey hain? wo kahengey ham duniya mein unse aisey waqt juda huey ke hamein unki duniyawi faaydon ke liye bahut zyada zarurat thi aur ham ne aik awaz dene waley ko suna hai ke har qaum iske sath ho jaey jiski wo ibadat karti thi aur ham apne rab ke muntazir hain. bayan kya ke phir Allah jabbaar unke samney is sura ke ilawa dusri sura mein aayega jis mein unhon-ne usey pehli martaba dekha hoga aur kahega ke main tumhara rab hoon! log kahengey ke to hi hamara rab hai aur us din anbiya ke siwa aur koi baat nahi karega. phir poochhega : kya tumhen uski koi nishani malum hai? wo kahengey ke) saaq . Mina ( pindlii , phir Allah Taala apni pindlii kholega aur har momin uske liye sajde mein gir jaeyga sirf wo log baqi reh jaeinge jo dikhawey aur shohrat ke liye usey sajda kartey they, wo bhi sajda karna chaahengey lekin unki peeth takhte ki tarah ho kar reh jaeygi. phir unhein pul par laya jaeyga ham ne puchha : ya Rasulullah ! pul kya cheez hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, wo aik phisalwaan girney ka maqam hai is par sansaniyaan hain, aankdey hain, chaudey chaudey kaantey hain, unke sar khamdaar Sadan ke kaanton ki tarah hain jo Najad ke mulk mein hotey hain. momin is par palak maarney ki tarah, bijli ki tarah, hawa ki tarah, tez raftaar ghodey aur sawari ki tarah guzar jaengey. unmein kuchh to sahi salamat nijat paaney waley hongey aur kuchh jahannam ki aag se jhulas kar bach nikalney waley hongey yahan tak ke aakhiri shakhs is par se ghisat'tey huey guzrega tum log aaj ke din apna haq leney ke liye jitna taqaza aur mutalba mujh se kartey ho us se zyada musalman log Allah se taqaza aur mutalba karengey aur jab wo dekhengey ke apne bhaiyon mein se unhein nijat mili hai to wo kahengey ke aey hamarey rab! hamarey bhai bhi hamarey sath Namaz padhtey they aur hamarey sath rozey rakhtey they aur hamarey sath doosrey ( nek ( aamaal kartey they ( unko bhi dozakh se nijat farma ( chunanche Allah Taala farmaeyga ke jao aur jiske dil mein aik ashrafii ke barabar bhi eman paogey usey dozakh se nikal lo aur Allah unke chehron ko dozakh par haram kar dega. chunanche wo aaeingey aur dekhengey ke kuchh ka to jahannam mein qadam aur aadhi pindlii jalii hui hai. chunanche jinhein wo pahchaanengey unhein dozakh se nikaalengey, phir wapas aaeingey aur Allah Taala unse farmaeyga ke jao aur jiske dil mein aadhi ashrafii ke barabar bhi eman ho usey bhi nikal laao. chunanche jinko wo pehchantey hongey unko nikaalengey. phir wo wapas aaeingey aur Allah Taala farmaeyga ke jao aur jiske dil mein zarra barabar eman ho usey bhi nikal laao. chunanche pahchaaney janey walon ko nikaalengey . abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par kaha ke agar tum meri tasdeeq nahi kartey to ye aayat padho (إن الله لا يظلم مثقال ذرة وإن تك حسنة يضاعفها) ''Allaah taala zarra barabar bhi kisi par zulm nahi kartaa.'' agar neki hai to usey badhata hai. phir anbiya aur momineen aur Farishtey shafaat karengey aur parwardigar ka irshad hoga ke ab khas meri shafaat baqi reh gaee hai. chunanche Allah Taala dozakh se aik muththii bhar lega aur aisey logon ko nikaalega jo koila ho gaey hongey. phir wo jannat ke sirey par aik nehar mein daal diye jaeinge jisey nahare-aab-hayaat kaha jata hai aur ye log iske kinarey se is tarah ubhrengey jis tarah sailaab ke kode-karkat se sabza ubhar aata hai. tum ne ye manzar kisi chattaan ke ya kisi darakht ke kinarey dekha hoga to jis par dhoop padtii rehti hai wo sabzaa bharta hai aur jis par saaya hota hai wo safaid ubharta hai. phir wo is tarah niklengey jaisey motii chamaktaa hai. iske baad unki gardanon par mehar kar di jaeyngi (ke ye Allah ke aazad karda ghulam hain) aur unhein jannat mein dakhil kya jaeyga ahle-jannat unhein ( عتقاء"
"7440","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''qiyaamat ke din mominon ko (garm maidan mein) rok diya jaeyga yahan tak ke uski wjah se wo ghamgeen ho jaeinge aur (salaah karke ( kahengey ke kash! koi hamarey rab se hamari shafaat karta ke hamein is haalat se nijat miltii . chunanche wo mil kar Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey aur kahengey ke aap insanon ke bap hain, Allah ne aapko apne hath se paida kya aur aapko jannat mein maqam ata kya, aapko sajda karne ka farishton ko hukm diya aur aapko har cheez ke naam sikhaaey. aap hamari shafaat apne rab ke huzoor mein karein taake hamein us haalat se nijat de. bayan kya ke Adam (Alaihissalam) kahengey ke main is laaiq nahi wo apni us ghalati ko yad karengey jo bawajud rokney ke darakht kha leney ki wjah se unse hui thi aur kahengey ke Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao kyonke wo pahley Nabi hain jinhein Allah Taala ne zameen walon ki taraf rasool bana kar bheja tha. chunanche log Nuh (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey to wo bhi ye farmaaengey ke main is laaiq nahi aur apni is ghalati ko yad karengey jo baghair ilm ke Allah rabbul-izzat se sawal karke (apne betey ki bakhshish ke liye) unhon-ne ki thi aur kahengey ke Ibrahim ke paas jao jo Allah ke khaleel hain. bayan kya ke ham sab log Ibrahim ke paas aaeingey to wo bhi yahi uzr karengey ke main us laaiq nahi aur wo un teen baton ko yad karengey jin mein aap ne bazahir ghalat bayaanii ki thi aur kahengey ke Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao . wo aisey bandey hain jinhein Allah Taala ne Taurait di aur unse baat ki aur unko nazdeek karke unse sargoshi ki. bayan kya ke phir log Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey to wo bhi kahengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun aur wo ghalati yad karengey jo aik shakhs ko qatl karke unhon-ne ki thi. (wo kahengey ( albatta Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao wo Allah ke bandey, uske rasool, Allah ki Rooh aur uska kalima hain. chunanche log Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey. wo farmaaengey ke main is laaiq nahi hun tum log Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jao . wo aisey bandey hain ke Allah ne unke agley pichhley tamam gunah maaf kar diye. chunanche log mere paas aaeingey aur main apne rab se uske dare-daulat yani arshe-muallaa par aaney ke liye ijazat chaahoonga. mujhey uski ijazat di jaeygi phir main Allah Taala ko dekhtey hi sajde mein gir padoonga aur Allah Taala mujhey jab tak chaahega usi haalat mein rehney dega. phir farmaeyga ke aey Muhammad ! sar uthao , kaho suna jaeyga, shafaat karo tumhari shafaat qabool ki jaeygi, jo maangogey diya jaeyga bayan kya ke phir main apna sar uthaaoonga aur apne rab ki hamd w sana karunga jo wo mujhey sikhaaey ga. bayan kya ke phir main shafaat karunga. chunanche mere liye had muqarrar ki jaeygi aur main iske mutabiq logon ko dozakh se nikal kar jannat mein dakhil karunga. Qatada ne bayan kya ke maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey huey suna ke phir main nikalunga aur jahannam se nikal kar jannat mein dakhil karunga. phir teesri martaba apne rab se uske dare-daulat ke liye ijazat chaahoonga aur mujhey uski ijazat di jaeygi. phir main Allah rabbul-izzat ko dekhtey hi uske liye sajde mein gir padoonga aur Allah Taala jab tak chaahega mujhey yun hi chhodey rakhega. phir farmaeyga : aey Muhammad! sar uthaao, kaho suna jaeyga shafaat karo qabool ki jaeygi, maango diya jaeyga aap ne bayan kya ke main apna sar uthaaoonga aur apne rab ki aisi hamd w sana karunga jo wo mujhey sikhaaeyga, bayan kya ke phir shafaat karunga aur mere liye had muqarrar kar di jaaeygi aur main iske mutabiq jahannam se logon ko nikal kar jannat mein dakhil karunga. Qatada ne bayan kya ke maine Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko ye kehtey suna ke phir main logon ko nikalunga aur unhein jahannam se nikal kar jannat mein dakhil karunga, yahan tak ke jahannam mein sirf wahi log baqi reh jaeinge jinhein Quran ne rok rakha hoga yani unhein hamesha hi usmein rehna hoga (yani kuffaar aur mushrekeen) phir aap ne ye aayat tilawat ki) عسى أن يبعثك ربك مقاما"
"7441","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Ansar ko bula bheja aur unhein aik derey mein jama kya aur unse kaha ke sabr karo yahan tak ke tum Allah aur uske rasool se aa kar milo, main hauz par hoonga."
"7442","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ke waqt tahajjud ki Namaz mein ye dua kartey they (اللهم ربنا لك الحمد، Mina أنت قيم السموات والأرض، Mina ولك الحمد أنت رب السموات والأرض ومن فيهن، Mina ولك الحمد أنت نور السموات والأرض ومن فيهن، Mina أنت الحق، Mina وقولك الحق، Mina ووعدك الحق، Mina ولقاؤك الحق، Mina والجنة حق، Mina والنار حق، Mina والساعة حق، Mina اللهم لك أسلمت، Mina padhi. وبك آمنت، Mina وعليك توكلت، Mina وإليك خاصمت، Mina وبك حاكمت، Mina فاغفر لي ما قدمت وما أخرت، Mina وأسررت وأعلنت، Mina وما أنت أعلم به مني، Mina لا إله إلا أنت) ''aey Allaah! aey hamarey rab! hamd terey hi liye hai, to aasman w zameen ka thamney wala hai aur un sab ka jo unmein hain aur terey hi liye hamd hai, to aasman w zameen ka noor hai aur un sab ka jo unmein hain. to sachcha hai, tera qaul sachchaa, tera wada sachchaa, teri mulaqat sachchii hai, jannat sach hai, dozakh sach hai, qiyamat sach hai. aey Allaah! main terey samney jhukaa, tujh par eman laayaa, tujh par bharosa kya, terey paas apne jhagdey ley gaya aur teri hi madad se muqaabla kya, to to mujhey maaf kar de, mere wo gunah bhi jo main pahley kar chuka hun aur wo bhi jo baad mein karunga aur wo bhi jo maine posheeda taur par kiye aur wo bhi jo zahir taur par kya aur wo bhi jin main to mujh se zyada janta hai. terey siwa aur koi maabood nahi. abu-Adbullah imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke Qais-bin-Sad aur abu-Zubair ne Taaus ke hawale se ( qiyam ( bayan kya aur Mujahid ne ("
"7443","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein koi aisa nahi hoga jis se uska rab kalam na karey, iske aur bandey ke darmyan koi tarjuman na hoga aur na koi hijaab hoga jo usey chhipaaey rakhey.''"
"7444","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''2 jannatein aisi hongi jo khud aur is mein Sara saman chandi ka hoga aur 2 jannatein aisi hongi jo khud aur uska Sara saman soney ka hoga aur jannate-adn mein qaum aur Allah ke deedaar ke darmyan sirf badai ki chadar rukawat hogi jo Allah rabbul-izzat ke munh par padi hogii.''"
"7445","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi musalman ka maal jhooti qism kha kar mar liya to wo Allah se is haal mein milega ke wo is par ghazabnaak hoga.'' Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tasdeeq ke taur par Quran Majeed ki us aayat ki tilawat ki (إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا أولئك لا خلاق لهم في الآخرة wla يكلمهم الله)'' bila shubah jo log Allah ke ahad aur uski qasmon ko thodi poonjii ke badley bechtey hain yahi wo log hain jinka aakhirat mein koi hissey nahi aur Allah unse baat nahi karega.'' aakhir aayat tak."
"7446","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' teen aadmi aisey hain jin se Allah Taala qiyamat ke din baat nahi karega aur na unki taraf rehmat se dekhega . aik wo jisne kisi saman ke mutaalliq qism khaaii ke usey us ne itney mein khareedaa hai, halanke wo jhoota hai. doosra wo shakhs jisne Asr ke baad jhooti qism isliye khaaii ke kisi musalman ka maal nahaq mar ley aur tesraa wo shakhs jisne zarurat se faaltu pani maangney waley ko nahi diya to Allah Taala qiyamat ke din us se kahega ke jis tarah tu ney us zarurat se zaayeda, faaltu cheez se doosrey ko rokaa jisey terey hathon ne banaya bhi nahi tha, main bhi tujhey apna Fazal nahi doonga ."
"7447","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' zamana apni aslii puraanii shakl par ghoom kar aa gaya hai jis par Allah Taala ne zameen w aasman ko paida kya tha. saal baara mahiney ka hota hai jin mein char mahiney hurmat waley mahiney hain. teen musalsal yani Zi-Qaada , Zil-Hijja aur Muharram aur rajab Muzar jo jumaadiul-aakhir aur Shoban ke darmyan mein aata hai. phir aap ne puchha ke ye kon sa mahina hai? ham ne kaha ke Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. aap khamosh ho gaey aur ham ne samjha ke aap iska koi aur naam rakhengey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya ye Zil-Hijja nahi hai? ham ne kaha kyon nahi. phir farmaya ye kon sa Shahar hai? ham ne kaha Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai phir aap khamosh ho gaey aur ham ne samjha ke aap iska koi aur naam rakhengey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya ye paak Shahar Makka nahi hai? ham ne arz kya kyon nahi. phir farmaya ye kon sa din hai? ham ne arz kya Allah aur uske rasool ko zyada ilm hai. phir aap khamosh ho gaey ham ne samjha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iska koi aur naam rakhengey lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kya ye yaumun-nahar (qurbaanii ka din) nahi hai? ham ne kaha kyon nahi phir farmaya ke phir tumhara khoon aur tumharey amwaal Muhammad ne bayan kya ke mujhey khayal hai ke ye bhi kaha ke aur tumhari izzat tum par isi tarah haram hain jaisey tumharey is din ka haram hona tumharey is Shahar aur is mahiney mein hai aur an-qareeb tum apne rab se milogey aur wo tumharey aamaal ke mutaalliq tum se sawal karega . aagah ho jao ke mere baad gumrah na ho jana ke aik doosrey ko qatl karne lago. aagah ho jaao! jo maujood hain wo ghair haaziron ko meri ye baat pahuncha dein. shayad koi jisey baat pahunchai gaee ho wo yahan sunney waley se zyada mehfooz rakhney wala ho. chunanche Muhammad-bin Sirin jab iska zikr kartey to kehtey ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sach farmaya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, haan kya maine pahuncha diya? haan! kya maine pahuncha diya?"
"7448","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki aik sahibzadi ( Zenab (Raziallahu anha) (ka ladka jaan nikalney ke aalim mein tha to unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bula bhejaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein kahlaayaa ke Allah hi ka wo hai jo wo leta hai aur wo bhi jisey wo deta hai aur sab ke liye aik muddat muqarrar hai, to sabr karo aur usey sawab ka kaam samjho . lekin unhon-ne phir dobara bula bheja aur qism dilai . chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey aur main bhi aap ke sath chala . Muaaz-bin-Jabal, Ubai-bin-Kab aur Ubada-bin-Samit (Raziallahu anhu) bhi sath they. jab ham sahibzadi ke ghar mein dakhil huey to logon ne bachchey ko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko god mein de diya. us waqt bachche ka saans ukhad raha tha. aisa malum hota tha jaisa puraanii mashk. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ye dekh kar ro diye to Sad-bin-Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya, aap rotey hain! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah apne bandon mein raham karne walon par hi raham khata hai."
"7449","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat w dozakh ne apne rab ke huzoor mein jhagdaa kya. jannat ne kaha : aey rab! kya haal hai ke mujh mein kamzor aur girey padey log hi dakhil hongey aur dozakh ne kaha ke mujh main to daakhile ke liye mutakabbiron ko khas kar diya gaya hai. is par Allah Taala ne jannat se kaha ke to meri rehmat hai aur jahannam se kaha ke to mera azab hai. terey zariey mein jisey chahta hun usmein mubtala karta hun aur tum mein se har aik ki bhartii honey wali hai. kaha ke jahan tak jannat ka talluq hai to Allah apni makhlooq mein kisi par zulm nahi karega aur dozakh ki is tarah se ke Allah apni makhlooq mein se jis ko chaahega dozakh ke liye paida karega wo usmein dali jaeygi iske baad bhi dozakh kahegii aur kuchh makhlooq hai (main abhi khali hun) teen baar aisa hi hoga, aakhir parwardigar apna paon usmein rakh dega, us waqt wo bhar jaeygi, aik par aik ulat kar simat jaeygi, kehney lagegii bas bas-bas mein bhar gaee."
"7450","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' kuchh log un gunahon ki wjah se jo unhon-ne kiye hongey, aag se jhulas jaeinge ye unki saza hogi. phir Allah apni rehmat se unhein jannat mein dakhil karega aur unhein jahannami kaha jaeyga aur Hammam ne bayan kya, unse Qatada ne, unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi hadis bayan ki."
"7451","aik Yahudi aalim Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaey aur kaha : aey Muhammad! qiyamat ke din Allah Taala aasmanon ko aik ungli par, zameen ko aik ungli par, pahadon ko aik ungli par, darakht aur nehron ko aik ungli par aur tamam makhlooqat ko aik ungli par rakhega . phir apne hath se ishara karke kahega ke main hi badshah hun. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hans diye aur ye aayat padhii (وما قدروا الله حق قدره) (jo sura الزمر mein hai)."
"7452","aik raat maine Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar guzari us raat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unhiin ke paas they. mera maqsad raat main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Namaz dekhnaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne thodi der to apni ahliya ke sath baat cheet ki phir so gaey. jab raat ka aakhiri tehai hissey ya kuchh hissey baqi reh gaya to aap uth baithey aur aasman ki taraf dekh kar ye aayat padhii (إن في خلق السموات والأرض) ''bila shubah aasmanon aur zameen ki paidaaish mein aql rakhney walon ke liye nishaniyan hain ''phir uth kar aap ne wuzu kya aur miswak ki, phir gyara (11) rakatein padhin, phir Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne Namaz ke liye azan di aur aap ne 2 rakaat Namaz padhi, phir bahar aagey aur logon ko subah ki Namaz padhai."
"7453","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Allah Taala makhlooq ko paida kar chuka to arsh ke uper apne paas ye likha ke meri rehmat mere ghusse se aagey badh gaee hai."
"7454","ham se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan farmaya jo sachchon ke sachey hain ke insan ka nutfa maa ke pet mein chalis (40) din aur raaton tak jama rehta hai phir wo khoon ki phutkii bin jata hai, phir wo gosht ka lothdaa ho jata hai phir uske baad farishta bheja jata hai aur usey char chizon ka hukm hota hai. chunanche wo uski rozii, uski maut, uska amal aur ye ke wo bad-bakht hai ya nek bakht likh leta hai. phir usmein Rooh phoonktaa hai aur tum mein se aik shakhs jannat walon ke se amal karta hai aur jab iske aur jannat ke darmyan sirf aik hath ka farq reh jata hai to uski taqdeer ghalib aati hai aur wo dozakh walon ke amal karne lagta hai aur dozakh mein dakhil hota hai. isi tarah aik shakhs dozakh walon ke amal karta hai aur jab uske aur dozakh ke darmyan sirf aik baalisht ka fasla reh jata hai to taqdeer ghalib aati hai aur jannat walon ke kaam karne lagta hai, phir jannat mein dakhil hota hai."
"7455","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey Jibraaiil! aapko hamarey paas us se zyada aaney mein kya rukawat hai jitna aap aatey rahtey hain? is par ye aayat nazil hui ( وما نتنزل إلا بأمر ربك له ما بين أيدينا وما خلفنا ( ''aur ham nazil nahi hotey lekin aap ke rab ke hukm se, usi ka hai wo sab kuchh jo hamarey samney hai aur jo hamarey peechhey hai'' bayan kya ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko yahi jawab aayat mein utra ."
"7456","main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke aik khet mein ja raha tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik khajoor ki chhadi par teik laga letey they. phir aap yahudiyon ki aik jamat se guzrey to unmein se kuchh ne kuchh se kaha ke unse Rooh ke mutaalliq poochho aur kuchh ne kaha ke iske mutaalliq mat poochho. aakhir unhon-ne puchha to aap chhadi par tek laga kar khadey ho gaey aur main aap ke peechhey tha. maine samajh liya ke aap par wahi nazil ho rahi hai. chunanche aap ne ye aayat padhii ( ويسألونك an (an) الروح قل الروح من أمر ربي وما أوتيتم من العلم إلا قليلا ( ''aur log aap se Rooh ke mutaalliq poochhtey hain, keh dijiye ke Rooh mere rab ke Amr ("
"7457","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jis shakhs ne Allah ke raaste mein jihad kya aur uske liye nikalney ka maqsad uske rastey mein jihad aur uske kalam ki tasdeeq ke siwa aur kuchh nahi tha to Allah uska zaamin hai ke usey jannat mein dakhil karey (agar wo Shahid ho gaya) ya sawab aur maale-ghanimat ke sath usey wahin wapas lautaaey jahan se wo aaya tha.''"
"7458","aik shakhs Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha ke koi shakhs hamiiyat ki wjah se ladtaa hai, koi bahaadurii ki wjah se ladtaa hai aur koi dikhawey ke liye ladtaa hai. to unmein se kon Allah ke rastey mein hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo isliye ladtaa hai ke Allah ka kalima hi buland rahe."
"7459","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein se aik giroh dusron par ghalib rahega, yahan tak ke) أمر"
"7460","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke meri ummat mein se aik giroh hamesha Quran w hadis par qaaim rahega, usey jhutlaaney waley aur mukhalifon koi nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakengey, yahan tak ke) أمر الله ( (qiyamat ( aa jaeygi aur wo usi haal mein hongey. is par Maalik-bin-Yukhaamir ne kaha ke maine Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, wo kehtey they ke ye giroh Sham (Syria) mein hoga. is par Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ye Malik (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey hain ke Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha tha ke ye giroh Sham (Syria) mein hoga."
"7461","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Musailma ke paas rukey, wo apne haamiyon ke sath Madina mein aaya tha aur us se farmaya ke agar to mujh se ye lakdi ka tukda bhi maangey to main ye bhi tujh ko nahi de sakta aur tumharey barey mein Allah ne jo hukm de rakha hai to us se aagey nahi badh sakta aur agar tu ney Islam se peeth pherii to Allah tujhey halaak kar dega."
"7462","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Madina ke aik khet mein chal raha tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne hath ki chhadi ka sahara letey jatey they, phir ham yahudiyon ki aik jamat ke paas se guzrey to un logon ne aapas mein kaha ke unse Rooh ke barey mein poochho . kuchh yahudiyon ne mashwara diya ke na poochho, kahin koi aisi baat na kahein jiska (unki zaban se sunnaa) tum pasand na karo. lekin kuchh ne israar kya ke nahin! ham poochhengey. chunanche unmein se aik ne uth kar kaha : aey abul-Qaasim! Rooh kya cheez hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par khamosh ho gaey. maine samajh liya ke aap par wahi nazil ho rahi hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye aayat padhii ( ويسألونك an (an) الروح قل الروح من أمر ربي وما أوتوا من العلم إلا"
"7463","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne Allah ke rastey mein jihad kya aur apne ghar se sirf is gharaz se nikla ke khalis Allah ke rastey mein jihad karey aur uske kalime tauheed ki tasdeeq karey to Allah Taala uski zamaanat ley leta hai ke usey jannat mein dakhil karega ya phir sawab aur ghaneemat ke sath iske ghar wapas karega.''"
"7464","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jab tum dua karo to azm ke sath karo aur koi dua mein ye na kahey ke agar to chahey to falan cheez mujhey ata kar, kyonke Allah se koi zabardastii karne wala nahi.''"
"7465","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unke aur Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar raat mein tashrif laey aur unse kaha kya tum log Namaz tahajjud nahi padhtey . Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! hamari jaanein Allah ke hath mein hain, jab wo hamein uthana chaahega utha dega. jab maine ye baat kahi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wapas chaley gaey aur mujhey koi jawab nahi diya. albatta maine aapko wapas jatey waqt ye kehtey suna. aap apni raan par hath mar kar ye farma rahe they ( وكان الإنسان أكثر شىء"
"7466","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momin ki misal khet ke narm paudey ki si hai ke jidhar hawa chaltii hai to uske pattey udhar jhuk jatey hain aur jab hawa ruk jati hai to pattey bhi barabar ho jatey hain. isi tarah momin aazmaaishon mein bachaya jata hai lekin kaafir ki misal shamshaad ke sakht darakht jaisi hai ke aik haalat par khada rehta hai yahan tak ke Allah jab chahta hai usey ukhaad deta hai.''"
"7467","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, aap member par khadey farma rahe they ke tumhara zamana guzishta ummaton ke muqable mein aisa hai jaisey Asr se suraj doobney tak ka waqt hota hai. Taurait walon ko Taurait di gaee aur unhon-ne is par amal kya, yahan tak ke din aadha ho gaya. phir wo aajiz ho gaey to unhein uske badley mein aik qirat diya gaya. phir Injeel walon ko Injeel di gaee to unhon-ne is par Asr ki Namaz ke waqt tak amal kya aur phir wo amal se aajiz aagey to unhein bhi eik-eik qirat diya gaya. phir tumhen Quran diya gaya aur tum ne is par suraj doobney tak amal kya aur tumhen iske badley mein 2-2 qirat diye gaey. Taurait walon ne is par kaha ke aey hamarey rab! ye log musalman sabse kam kaam karne waley aur sabse zyada ajr paaney waley hain. Allah Taala ne is par farmaya ke kya maine tumhen ajr dene mein koi naa-insaafii ki hai? wo boley ke nahin! to Allah Taala farmaya ke ye to mera Fazal hai, main jis par chahta hun karta hun."
"7468","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aik jamat ke sath bait ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tum se is baat par bait leta hun ke tum Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik nahi thahraaogey, fuzool-kharchii nahi karogey, zina nahi karogey, apni aulad ko qatl nahi karogey aur man-ghadat bohtan kisi par nahi lagaaogey aur nek kaamon mein meri nafarmani nahi karogey. to tum mein se jo koi is ahad ko pura karega uska ajr Allah par hai aur jisne kahin khata ki aur usey duniya mein hi pakad liya gaya to ye had uske liye kaffara aur paakii bin jaeygi aur jiski Allah ne parda poshii ki to phir Allah par hai jisey chahey azab de aur jisey chahey uska gunah bakhsh de."
"7469","Allah ke Nabi Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ki sath (60) beeviyan thin to unhon-ne kaha ke aaj raat main tamam beeviyon ke paas jaaunga aur har biwi haamla hogi aur phir aisa bachcha janegi jo shehsawaar hoga aur Allah ke rastey mein ladega. chunanche wo apni tamam beeviyon ke paas gaey. lekin sirf aik biwi ke yahan bachcha paida hua aur wo bhi adhooraa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar Sulaiman (Alaihissalam) ne inshaAllah keh diya hota to phir har biwi haamla hoti aur shehsawaar jannati jo Allah ke rastey mein jihad karta."
"7470","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik dehati ki iyaadat ke liye tashrif le gaey aur us se kaha ke koi muzaayqa nahi ye (beemaarii) tumharey liye paakii ka zaria'a hai, is par usne kaha ke janab ye wo bukhar hai jo aik buddhe par josh mar raha hai aur usey qabr tak pahuncha ke rahega , Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir yoonhii hoga."
"7471","jab sab log soey aur Namaz qaza ho gaee to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah tumhari ruhon ko jab chahta hai rok deta hai aur jab chahta hai chhod deta hai, to tum apni zarooraton se farigh ho kar wuzu karo, aakhir jab suraj poori tarah tuloo ho gaya aur khub din nikal aaya to aap khadey huey aur Namaz padhi."
"7472","aik musalman aur aik Yahudi ne aapas mein jhagdaa kya. musalman ne kaha ke us zaat ki qism jisne Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko tamam duniya mein chun liya aur Yahudi ne kaha ke us zaat ki qism jisne Musa (Alaihissalam) ko tamam duniya mein chun liya is par musalman ne hath uthaya aur Yahudi ko tamaancha mar diya. Yahudi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne apna aur musalman ka mamla aap se zikr kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey Musa (Alaihissalam) par tarjeeh na do, tamam log qiyamat ke din pahlaa Saur phoonkney par behosh kar diye jaengey. phir doosra Saur phoonkney par main sabse pahley bedaar hunga lekin main dekhunga ke Musa (Alaihissalam) arsh ka aik kinara pakdey huey hain, ab mujhey malum nahi ke kya wo unmein they jinhein behosh kya gaya tha aur mujh se pahley hi unhein hosh aa gaya ya unhein Allah Taala ne ussey alag kar diya tha."
"7473","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' dajjal Madina tak aayega lekin dekhega ke farishta uski hifazat kar rahe hain to na to dajjal us se qareeb ho sakega aur na taaoon, agar Allah ne chaahaa.''"
"7474","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har Nabi ki aik dua qabool hoti hai to main chahta hun agar Allah ne chaha ke apni dua qiyamat ke din apni ummat ki shafaat ke liye mehfooz rakhoon .''"
"7475","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main soyaa hua tha ke maine apne aapko aik kuwein par dekha. phir maine jitna Allah Taala ne chaha usmein se pani nikala . iske baad Abu-Bakar bin abi qahaafa (Raziallahu anhu) ne dol ley liya aur unhon-ne bhi aik 2 dol pani nikala albatta unke kheenchney mein kamzori thi aur Allah unhein maaf kare. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey ley liya aur wo unke hath mein aik bada dol bin gaya. maine kisi qawii aur bahaadur ko is tarah dol par dol nikaaltey nahi dekha, yahan tak ke logon ne unke charon taraf maweshiyon ke liye baadein bana lein. ''"
"7476","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas koi maangney wala aata ya koi zarurat mand aata to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmatey ke uski sifarish karo taake tumhen bhi sawab miley, Allah apne rasool ki zaban par wahi jari karta hai jo chahta hai."
"7477","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''koii shakhs is tarah dua na karey ke aey Allah ! agar to chahey to meri maghfirat kar, agar to chahey to mujh par raham kar, agar to chahey to mujhey rozii de, balke pukhtagi ke sath sawal karna chahiye kyonke Allah jo chahta hai karta hai koi is par jabr karne wala nahi. ''"
"7478","wo aur Hur-bin-Qais bin-haseen fazaarii, Musa (Alaihissalam) ke sathi ke barey mein ikhtilaf kar rahe they ke kya wo khizr (Alaihissalam) hi they. itney mein Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ka udhar se guzar hua aur Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein bulaya aur unse kaha ke main aur mera ye sathi us barey mein shak mein hain ke Musa (Alaihissalam) ke wo sahib kon they jin se mulaqat ke liye Musa (Alaihissalam) ne rasta puchha tha. kya aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se us silsile mein koi hadis suni hai unhon-ne kaha ke haan. maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Musa (Alaihissalam) Bani-Israeel ke aik majme' mein they ke aik shakhs ne aa kar puchha kya aap kisi aisey shakhs ko jantey hain jo aap se zyada ilm rakhta ho? Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha ke nahi. chunanche aap par wahi nazil hui ke kyon nahi hamara banda khizr hai. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne unse mulaqat ka rasta malum kya aur Allah Taala ne uske liye machhli ko nishan qarar diya aur aap se kaha gaya ke jab tum machhli ko gum paogey to lot jana ke wahin unse mulaqat hogi. chunanche Musa (Alaihissalam) machhli ka nishan dariya mein dhoondney lagey aur aap ke sathi ne aapko bataya ke aapko malum hai. jab ham ne chattaan par dera daala tha to wahin mein machhli bhool gaya aur mujhey shaitan ne usey bhulaa diya. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha ke ye jagah wahi hai jiski talash mein ham sargardaan hain to wo donon apne qadmon ke nishaanon par wapas lautey aur unhon-ne khizr (Alaihissalam) ko pa liya un hi donon ka ye qissa hai jo Allah ne bayan farmaya,"
"7479","aap ne (hijjatul-wadaa ke mauqe par) farmaya ke ham kal insha-Allah khaif, banu- kinaana mein qiyam karengey jahan aik zamane mein kuffaar Makka ne kufr hi par qaaim rehney ki aapas mein qismein khaaein thin aap ki murad wadi Muhassab se thi."
"7480","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Taaif walon ko gher liya, usko fateh nahi kya. aakhir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya kal Allah ne chaha to ham Madina ko lot chalengey, is par musalman boley waah ham fateh kiye baghair lot jaaein, aap ne farmaya ke aisa hai to phir kal sawerey ladai shuru karo, subah ko musalman ladney lagey lekin (qila' fateh nahi hua) musalman zakhmi huey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke subah ko Allah ne chaha to ham Madina lot chalengey, is par musalman khush huey, musalmanon ka ye haal dekh kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraaey."
"7481","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Allah Taala aasman mein koi faisla karta hai to Farishtey uske farman ke aagey aajizii ka izhar karne ke liye apne bazu maartey hain (aur unse aisi awaz nikalti hai) jaisey patthar par zanjeer maari gaee ho. Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne kaha Sufiyan ke siwa doosrey rawiyon ne is hadis mein bajaey (safwaan) ke) فاصفوان ( riwayat kya hai aur Abu-Sufiyan ne ( Safwan ( riwayat kya hai donon ke mana aik hi hain yani chiknaa saaf patthar aur ibne-aamir ne ( فزع ( padha hai, yani jab unke dilon ko faraghat hasil ho jati hai. matlab wahi hai ke dar jata raha hai phir wo hukm farishton mein aata hai aur jab unke dilon se khof door ho jata hai to wo poochhtey hain ke tumharey rab ne kya kahaa? jawab detey hain ke haq , Allah wo buland w azeem hai."
"7482","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala kisi baat ko itna mutwajjeh ho kar nahi sunta jitna Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka Quran padhna mutwajjeh ho kar sunta hai jo khush aawaazi se usko padhta hai. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke aik sathi ne kaha is hadis main ( يتغنى"
"7483","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmaeyga, aey Adam ! wo kahengey ( لبيك وسعديك . Mina ( phir buland awaz se nidaa dega ke Allah tumhen hukm deta hai ke apni nasl mein se dozakh ka lashkar nikal .''"
"7484","jis qadr mujhey Khadija (Raziallahu anha) par ghairat aati thi aur kisi aurat par nahi aati thi aur unke rab ne hukm diya tha ke unhein jannat mein aik ghar ki bashaarat de dein."
"7485","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jab Allah Taala kisi bande se mohabbat karta hai to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ko awaz deta hai ke Allah falan se mohabbat karta hai tum bhi us se mohabbat karo. chunanche Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) bhi us se mohabbat kartey hain. phir wo aasman mein awaz detey hain ke Allah falan se mohabbat karta hai tum bhi us se mohabbat karo chunanche aasman waaley bhi us se mohabbat karne lagtey hain aur is tarah poori zameen mein bhi usey maqbooliyat hasil ho jati hai.''"
"7486","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tumhaarey paas raat aur din ke Farishtey ek ke baad ek aatey hain aur Asr aur fajr ki Namaz mein 2 waqt ke Farishtey ikatthey hotey hain. phir jab wo Farishtey uper jatey hain jinhoney raat tumharey sath guzari hai to Allah Taala unse poochhta hai halanke wo bandon ke haal ka sabse zyada jaanney wala hai ke tum ne mere bandon ko kis haal mein chhodaa? wo jawab detey hain ke ham ne unhein is haal mein chhoda ke wo Namaz padh rahe they aur jab ham unke paas gaey jab bhi wo Namaz padh rahe they.''"
"7487","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''mere paas Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aaey aur mujhey bashaarat di ke jo shakhs us haal mein mareyga ke wo Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik nahi thahraataa hoga to wo jannat mein jaeyga maine puchha bhaley hi usne chori aur zina bhi kya ho? farmaya ke bhaley hi us ne chori aur zina kya ho.''"
"7488","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey fulaan! jab tum apne bistar par jao to ye dua karo (اللهم أسلمت نفسي إليك، Mina ووجهت وجهي إليك وفوضت أمري إليك، Mina وألجأت ظهري إليك، Mina رغبة ورهبة إليك، Mina لا ملجأ wla منجا منك إلا إليك، Mina آمنت بكتابك الذي أنزلت، Mina وبنبيك الذي أرسلت) ''aey Allaah! maine apni jaan terey sipurd kar di aur apna rukh teri taraf mod diya aur apna mamla terey sipurd kar diya aur teri panah li, teri taraf raghbat ki wjah se aur tujh se dar kar. terey siwa koi panah aur nijat ki jagah nahi, main teri kitab par eman laya jo to ne nazil ki aur terey Nabi par eman laya jo to ne bhejey. pas agar tum aaj raat mar gaey to fitrat par marogey aur subah ko zinda uthey to sawab milega.\""
"7489","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khandaq ki jang ke din farmaya ''aey Allah ! kitab Quran ke nazil karne waale, jald hisab leney waale, un dushman jamaton ko shikast de aur unke paon dagmagaa de. ''Humaidii ne usey yun riwayat kya ke ham se Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Ismail bin abi Khalid ne bayan kya aur unhon-ne Abdullaah-bin-abi-Aufii (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, kaha maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna."
"7490","ye us waqt nazil hui jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein chhup kar ibadat kya kartey they. jab aap Namaz mein awaz buland kartey to mushrekeen suntey aur Quran Majeed aur uske nazil karne waley Allah ko aur uske laney waley Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ko gali detey (aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bhi) usi liye Allah Taala ne farmaya ( wla تجهر بصلاتك wla تخافت بها (ke '' apni Namaz mein na awaz buland karo aur na bilkul aahista yani awaz itni buland bhi na karke mushrekeen sun lein aur itni aahista bhi na karke aap ke sathi bhi na sun sakein balke unke darmyan ka rasta ikhtiyar kar.'' matlab ye hai ke itni awaz se padh ke terey ashaab sun lein aur Quran seekh lein, us se zyada chilla kar na padh."
"7491","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke ibne-Aadam mujhey takleef pahunchata hai, zamane ko bura bhala kehta hai, halanke main hi zamane ka paida karne wala hun, mere hi hath mein tamam kaam hain, main jis tarah chahta ho raat aur din ko phertaa rehta hoon.''"
"7492","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Shaan wala Allah farmata hai ke roza khalis mere liye hota hai aur main hi iska badla deta hun. banda apni shahwat, khaanaa-peenaa meri raza ke liye chhorta hai aur roza gunahon se bachney ki dhaal hai aur roze-daar ke liye do khushiyaan hain. aik khushi us waqt jab wo iftaar karta hai aur aik khushi us waqt jab wo apne rab se milta hai aur roze-daar ke munh ki boo, Allah ke nazdeek mushk anbar ki khushbu se zyada pakeeza hai.''"
"7493","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Ayyoob (Alaihissalam) kapdey utaar kar naha rahe they ke soney ki tiiddiiyoun ka aik dal un par aa kar gira aur aap unhein kapdey mein sametney lagey. unke rab ne unhein pukara ke aey Ayyoob! kya maine tujhey maaldaar bana kar in tiiddiiyoun se be-parwaa nahi kar diya hai. unhon-ne arz kya ke kyon nahi beshak tu ney mujh ko be-parwaa maaldaar kya hai magar terey Fazal aur karam aur rehmat se bhi main kahin be-parwaa ho sakta hoon.''"
"7494","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''hamaaraa rab tabarak w taala har raat aasmaani duniya par aata hai. us waqt jab raat ka aakhiri tehai hissey baqi reh jata hai aur kehta hai ke mujhey kon bulata hai ke main usey jawab dun. mujh se kon mangta hai ke main usey ataa' karun. mujh se kon maghfirat talab karta hai main uski maghfirat karoon?''"
"7495, 7496","Raportat de către Abu Huraira:\n\nMesagerul lui Allah (ﷺ) a spus: „Noi (musulmanii) suntem ultimii (care au venit) dar vom fi primii În Înviere.\"\nNaratorii acestui Hadith au spus: Allah a spus (omului): „Cheltuiește (la caritate), și atunci îți voi compensa (generos).\""
"7497","(Jibraaiil (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : ya Rasulullah !) ye Khadija (Raziallahu anha) jo aap ke paas bartan mein khana ya pani lekar aati hain unhein unke rab ki taraf se salam kahey aur unhein khauldaar moutii ke aik mahal ki jannat mein khushkhabri sunaaiye jis mein na shor hoga aur na koi takleef hogi."
"7498","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke jannat mein, maine apne nek bandon ke liye wo cheezein taiyaar kar rakhi hain jinhein na aankhon ne dekha, na kanon ne suna aur na kisi insan ke dil mein unka khayal guzraa.''"
"7499","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat mein tahajjud padhney uthtey to kehtey (اللهم لك الحمد أنت نور السموات والأرض، Mina ولك الحمد أنت قيم السموات والأرض، Mina ولك الحمد أنت رب السموات والأرض، Mina ومن فيهن أنت الحق، Mina ووعدك الحق وقولك الحق، Mina ولقاؤك الحق، Mina والجنة حق، Mina والنار حق، Mina والنبيون حق، Mina والساعة حق، Mina اللهم لك أسلمت، Mina وبك آمنت، Mina وعليك توكلت، Mina وإليك أنبت، Mina وبك خاصمت، Mina وإليك حاكمت، Mina فاغفر لي ما قدمت وما أخرت، Mina وما أسررت وما أعلنت، Mina أنت إلهي، Mina لا إله إلا أنت) ''hamd terey hi liye hai ke to aasman aur zameen ka noor hai. hamd terey hi liye hai ke to aasman aur zameen ka thamney wala hai. hamd terey hi liye hai ke to aasman aur zameen ka aur jo kuchh usmein hai sab ka rab hai. to sach hai, tera wada sachcha hai aur tera qaul sachcha hai, teri mulaqat sachchii hai, jannat sach hai aur dozakh sach hai. sarey anbiya sachey hain aur qiyamat sach hai. aey Allah ! main terey samney hi jhukaa, tujh par eman laya. tujh par bharosa kya, teri hi taraf rujoo kya, terey hi samney apna jhagdaa pesh karta aur tujh hi se apna faisla chahta hun. isliye to meri maghfirat kar de agley pichhley tamam gunahon ki jo maine chipa kar kiye aur jo zahir kiye. to hi mera maabood hai, terey siwa aur koi maabood nahi.''"
"7500","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke barey mein jab tohmat lagaaney walon ne un par tohmat lagai thi aur Allah ne us se unhein barii qarar diya tha. un sab ne bayan kya aur har aik ne mujh se Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki bayan ki hui baat ka aik hissey bayan kya. Ummul-Momenin ne kaha : Allah ki qism ! mujhey ye khayal nahi tha ke Allah Taala meri paakii bayan karne ke liye wahi nazil karega jiski tilawat hogi. mere dil mein mera darja us se bahut kam tha ke Allah mere barey mein (Qur'aan Majeed mein) wahi nazil karega jiski tilawat hogi. albatta mujhey ummeed thi ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) koi khuwab dekhengey jiske zariey Allah meri Bar'at (Tauba) kar dega. lekin Allah Taala ne ye aayatein (إن الذين جاءوا"
"7501","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya : Allah Taala ka irshad giraamii hai : ''aey farishton ! jab mera banda kisi burai ka irada karey to jab tak wo is par amal karey to phir uske barabar gunah likho aur agar wo uske mutabiq amal karey to phir uske barabar gunah likho. agar wo mere khof se us burai ko tark kar de to uske liye aik neki likho. aur agar koi banda neki karna chahey to uske liye iraadey hi par aik neki likh do aur agar is par amal kar ley to das guna se saat (7) sou guna tak neki likho.''"
"7502","ham se Ismaaeel-bin-abdullaah ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha mujh se Sulaimaan-bin-Bilaal ne bayan kya, unse Muaawiya-bin-abii-muzarrid  ne bayan kya aur unse Saeed-bin-yasaar ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne makhlooq paida ki aur jab us se farigh ho gaya to riiham khada huaa, Allah ne farmaya ke thahar jaa. usne kaha ke ye qata' rahami (nataa todnaa) se teri panah maangney ka maqam hai. Allah Taala ne farmaya kya tum is par razi nahi ke main nataa ko jodney waley se apne raham ka nataa jodoon aur nataa ko kaatney walon se juda ho jaun. usne kaha ke zaroor, mere rab! Allah Taala ne farmaya ke phir yahi tera maqam hai. phir Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne (sura Muhammad ki) ye aayat padhi ( فهل عسيتم إن توليتم أن تفسدوا في الأرض وتقطعوا"
"7503","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamane mein barish hui to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala farmata hai mere kuchh bandey subah, kaafir ho kar kartey hain aur kuchh bandey subah, momin ho kar kartey hain."
"7504","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke jab mera banda mujh se mulaqat pasand karta hai to main bhi us se mulaqat pasand karta hun aur jab wo mujh se mulaqat na-pasand karta hai to main bhi na-pasand karta hoon.''"
"7505","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala farmata hai ke main apne bandey ke guman ke sath hun jo wo mere mutaalliq rakhta hai.''"
"7506","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''eik shakhs ne jisne (banii-Israaeel mein se) koi nek kaam kabhi nahi kya tha. wasiiyat ki ke jab wo mar jaey to usey jalaa daalein aur uski aadhi raakh khushkii mein aur aadhi dariya mein bikher dein kyonke Allah ki qism agar Allah ne mujh par qaabu pa liya to aisa azab mujh ko dega jo duniya ke kisi shakhs ko bhi wo nahi dega. phir Allah ne samandar ko hukm diya aur us ne tamam raakh jama kar di jo iske andar thi. phir us ne khushkii ko hukm diya aur us ne bhi apni tamam raakh jama kar di jo iske andar thi. phir Allah Taala ne us se puchha tu ney aisa kyon kya tha? us ne arz kya aey rab! terey khof se maine aisa kya aur to sabse zyada jaanney wala hai. isliye Allah Taala ne usko bakhsh diyaa.''"
"7507","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aik bandey ne bahut gunah kiye aur kaha : aey mere rab ! main tera hi gunahgaar banda hun to mujhey bakhsh de. Allah rabbul-izzat ne farmaya : mera banda janta hai ke uska koi rab zaroor hai jo gunah maaf karta hai aur gunah ki wjah se saza bhi deta hai maine apne bandey ko bakhsh diya phir banda ruka raha jitna Allah ne chaha aur phir us ne gunah kya aur arz kya : aey mere rab ! maine dobara gunah kar liya, usey bhi bakhsh de. Allah Taala ne farmaya : mera banda janta hai ke uska rab zaroor hai jo gunah maaf karta hai aur uske badley mein saza bhi deta hai, maine apne bandey ko bakhsh diya. phir jab tak Allah ne chaha banda gunah se ruka raha aur phir us ne gunah kya aur Allah ke huzoor mein arz kya : aey mere rab! maine gunah phir kar liya hai to mujhey bakhsh de. Allah Taala ne farmaya mera banda janta hai ke uska aik rab zaroor hai jo gunah maaf karta warna uski wjah se saza bhi deta hai maine apne bandey ko bakhsh diya. teen martaba , isliye ab jo chahey amal kare."
"7508","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pichhli ummaton mein se aik shakhs ka zikr kya. iske mutaalliq Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik kalima farmaya yani Allah ne usey maal aur aulad sab kuchh diya tha. jab iske marney ka waqt qareeb aaya to usne apne ladkon se puchha ke main tumharey liye kaisa bap Sabit hua. unhon-ne kaha ke behtreen baap, is par usne kaha ke lekin tumharey bap ne Allah ke yahan koi neki nahi bheji hai aur agar kahin Allah ne mujhey pakad liya to sakht azab karega to dekho jab main mar jaun to mujhey jalaa dena. yahan tak ke jab main koila ho jaun to usey khub pees lena aur jis din tez aandhii aaey usmein meri ye raakh uda dena. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is par us ne apne beton se pukhta wada liya aur Allah ki qism ke uske ladkon ne aisa hi kya. jalaa kar raakh kar daalaa, phir unhon-ne uski raakh ko tez hawa ke din uda diya. phir Allah Taala ne (كن) ka lafz farmaya ke ho ja to wo fauran aik mard bin gaya jo khada hua tha. Allah Taala ne farmaya, aey mere bandey ! tujhey kis baat ne is par aamada kya ke tu ney ye kaam karaya. usne kaha ke terey khof ne. bayan kya ke Allah Taala ne usko koi saza nahi di balke is par raham kya. phir maine ye baat abu-Usman-nahdii se bayan ki to unhon-ne kaha ke maine usey Sulaimaan-faarsii se suna, albatta unhon-ne ye lafz zyada kiye ke (أذروني في البحر) yani meri raakh ko dariya mein daal dena ya kuchh aisa hi bayan kya. ham se Moosaa-bin-Ismaaeel ne bayan kya, kaha ham se moa'tamir-bin-Sulaimaan ne bayan kya aur us ne (لم يبتئر) ke alfaz kahey aur khaleefa-bin-khayaat (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ke shekh) ne kaha ham se Motamir ne bayan kya phir yahi hadis naql ki. usmein (لم"
"7509","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ke din meri shafaat qabool ki jaeygi. main kahunga : aey rab! jiske dil mein raai ke daane ke barabar bhi eman ho usko bhi jannat mein dakhil farma de. aisey log jannat mein dakhil kar diye jaengey. main phir arz karunga : aey rab! jannat mein usey bhi dakhil kar de jiske dil mein maamooli sa bhi eman ho. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke maano main us waqt bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ungliyon ki taraf dekh raha hun."
"7510","Basra ke kuchh log hamarey paas jama ho gaey. phir ham Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas gaey aur apne sath Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhi le gaey taake wo hamarey liye shafaat ki hadis poochhein. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) apne mahal mein they aur jab ham pahunchey to wo chasht ki Namaz padh rahe they. ham ne mulaqat ki ijazat chahi aur hamein ijazat mil gaee. us waqt wo apne bistar par baithey they. ham ne Sabit se kaha tha ke hadis shafaat se pahley unse aur kuchh na poochhna . chunanche unhon-ne kaha : aey abu-Hamza ! ye aap ke bhai Basra se aaey hain aur aap se shafaat ki hadis poochhna chahtey hain. unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke qiyamat ka din jab aayega to log thaathein maartey huey samandar ki tarah zahir hongey. phir wo Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey aur unse kahengey ke hamari apne rab ke paas shafaat keejiye. wo kahengey ke main is qaabil nahi hun tum Ibrahim ke paas jao, wo Allah ke khaleel hain. log Ibrahim ke paas aaeingey wo bhi kahengey ke main is qaabil nahi hun, haan tum Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao ke wo Allah se sharf ham-kalaamii paaney waley hain. log Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey aur wo bhi kahengey ke main is qaabil nahi hun, albatta tum Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas jao ke wo Allah ki Rooh aur uska kalima hain. chunanche log Esa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey wo bhi kahengey ke main is qaabil nahi hun, haan tum Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas jao. log mere paas aaeingey aur main kahunga ke main shafaat ke liye hun aur phir main apne rab se ijazat chaahoonga aur mujhey ijazat di jaeygi aur Allah Taala ta'reefon ke alfaz mujhey ilhaam karega jinke zariey mein Allah ki hamd bayan karunga jo is waqt mujhey yad nahi hain. chunanche jab main ye ta'reefein bayan karunga Allah ke huzoor mein sajda karne wala ho jaaunga to mujh se kaha jaeyga : aey Muhammad ! apna sar uthao , jo kaho wo suna jaeyga, jo maangogey wo diya jaeyga, jo shafaat karogey qabool ki jaeygi. phir main kahunga : aey rab! meri ummat , meri ummat , kaha jaeyga ke jao aur un logon ko dozakh se nikal lo jinke dil mein zarra ya raai barabar bhi eman ho. chunanche main jaaunga aur aisa hi karunga . phir main lautoonga aur yahi ta'reefein phir karunga aur Allah ke liye sajde mein chala jaaunga mujh se kaha jaeyga apna sar uthao kaho, aap ki suni jaeygi, main kahunga : aey rab! meri ummat, meri ummat. Allah Taala farmaeyga : jao aur jiske dil mein aik raai ke daane ke kam se kam tar hisse ke barabar bhi eman ho usey bhi jahannam se nikaal lo. phir main jaaunga aur nikaalunga. phir jab ham Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas se nikley to maine apne kuchh sathiyon se kaha ke hamein imam Hasan Basri ke paas bhi chalnaa chaahiye, wo us waqt Abu-Khaleefa ke makan mein they aur unse wo hadis bayan karna chahiye jo Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne ham se bayan ki hai. chunanche ham unke paas aaey aur unhein salam kya. phir unhon-ne hamein ijazat di aur ham ne unse kaha : aey abu-Saeed! ham aap ke paas aap ke bhai Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan se aaey hain aur unhon-ne ham se jo shafaat ke mutaalliq hadis bayan ki, us jaisi hadis ham ne nahi suni, unhon-ne kaha ke bayan karo. ham ne unse hadis bayan ki jab us maqam tak pahunchey to unhon-ne kaha ke aur bayan karo, ham ne kaha ke us se zyada unhon-ne nahi bayan ki. unhon-ne kaha ke Anas (Raziallahu anhu) jab sihatmand they, bees saal ab se pahley to unhon-ne mujh se ye hadis bayan ki thi. mujhey malum nahi ke wo baqi bhool gaey ya isliye bayan karna na-pasand kya ke kahin log bharosa na kar baithein. ham ne kaha abu-Saeed! phir ham se wo hadis bayan keejiye. aap is par hansey aur farmaya : insan bada jald baaz paida kya gaya hai. maine iska zikr hi isliye kya hai ke tum se bayan karna chahta hun. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne mujh se isi tarah hadis bayan ki jis tarah tum se bayan ki (aur is mein ye lafz aur badhaatey ( Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir main chothi martaba lautoonga aur wahi ta'reefein karunga aur Allah ke liye sajde mein chala jaaunga. Allah farmaeyga : aey Muhammad! apna sar uthaao, jo kahogey suna jaeyga jo maango ke diya jaeyga jo shafaat karogey qabool ki jaeygi. mein kahunga : aey rab! mujhey unke barey mein bhi ijazat dijiye jinhoney la ilaaha-illallaah kaha hai. Allah Taala farmaeyga meri izzat, mere jalaal, meri kibriyaaii, meri badaai ki qism ! usmein se ( mein) unhein bhi nikalunga jinhoney kalima la ilaaha-illallaah kaha hai."
"7511","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jannat mein sabse baad mein dakhil honey wala aur dozakh se sabse baad mein nikalney wala wo shakhs hoga jo ghisat kar niklega, us se iska rab kahega jannat mein dakhil ho jaa, wo kahega mere rab! jannat to bilkul bhari hui hai, phir Allah Taala farmaeyga terey liye duniya ke das guna hai.''"
"7512","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''tum mein se har shakhs se tumhara rab is tarah baat karega ke tumharey aur uske darmyan koi tarjuman nahi hoga wo apne daain taraf dekhega aur usey apne aamaal ke siwa aur kuchh nazar nahi aayega aur wo apni baain taraf dekhega aur usey apne aamaal ke siwa kuchh nazar nahi aayega. phir apne samney dekhega to apne samney jahannam ke siwa aur koi cheez na dekhega. to jahannam se bacho chahe khajoor ke aik tukdey hi ke zariey ho sakey.'' Aamash ne bayan kya ke mujh se Amr-bin-Murra ne bayan kya, unse khaisma ne isi tarah aur is mein ye lafz zyada kiye ke (jahannam se bacho) chahe aik achi baat hi ke zariey ho."
"7513","ham se Usman bin abi Sheba ne bayan kya, unhon-ne kaha ham se Jarir ne bayan kya, unse Mansoor ne bayan kya, unse Ibrahim ne bayan kya, unse Ubeda ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke"
"7514","aik shakhs ne ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : sargoshi ke barey mein aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kis tarah suna hai? unhon-ne bayan kya ke tum mein se koi apne rab ke qareeb jaeyga yahan tak ke Allah Taala apna parda is par daal dega aur kahega tu ney ye ye amal kya tha? banda kahega ke haan. chunanche wo iska iqrar karega . phir Allah Taala farmaeyga ke maine duniya mein terey gunah par parda daala tha aur aaj bhi tujhey maaf karta hun."
"7515","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Adam (Alaihissalam) aur Musa (Alaihissalam) ne bahas ki, Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha ke aap Adam hain jinhoney apni nasl ko jannat se nikaalaa. Adam (Alaihissalam) ne kaha ke aap Musa hain jinhein Allah ne apne paigham aur kalam ke liye muntakhab kya aur phir bhi aap mujhey aik aisi baat ke liye malaamat kartey hain jo Allah ne meri paidaaish se pahley hi meri taqdeer mein likh di thi, chunanche Adam (Alaihissalam) Musa (Alaihissalam) par ghalib aaey."
"7516","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''emaan waley qiyamat ke din jama kiye jaeinge aur wo kahengey ke kash! koi hamari shafaat karta taake ham apni us haalat se nijat paatey, chunanche wo Adam (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaeingey aur kahengey ke aap Adam hain insanon ke pardaadaa. Allah ne aapko apne hath se paida kya, aapko sajda karne ka farishton ko hukm diya aur har cheez ke naam aapko sikhaaey to aap apne rab ke huzoor mein hamari shafaat karein, aap jawab dengey ke main is qaabil nahi hun aur aap apni ghalati unhein yad dilaaeingey jo aap se hui thi. ''"
"7517","unhon-ne wo waqia bayan kya jis raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko masjid Kaba se meraaj ke liye ley jaya gaya ke wahi aaney se pahley aap ke paas Farishtey aaey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjide-Haraam mein soey huey they. unmein se aik ne puchha ke wo kon hain? doosrey ne jawab diya ke wo unmein sabse behtar hain teesrey ne kaha ke unmein jo sabse behtar hain unhein ley lo. us raat ko bas itna hi waqia pesh aaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iske baad unhein nahi dekha. yahan tak ke wo dusri raat aaey jabke aap ka dil dekh raha tha aur aap ki aankhen so rahi thin. lekin dil nahi so raha tha. anbiya ka yahi haal hota hai. unki aankhen soti hain lekin unke dil nahi sotey . chunanche unhon-ne aap se baat nahi ki. balke aapko utha kar zamzam ke kuwein ke paas laey. yahan Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne aap ka kaam sanbhaalaa aur aap ke galey se dil ke nichey tak Sina chaak kya aur seeney aur pet ko paak karke zamzam ke pani se usey apne hath se dhoya yahan tak ke aap ka pet saaf ho gaya. phir aap ke paas soney ka tasht laya gaya jis mein soney ka aik bartan eman w hikmat se bharaa hua tha. us se aap ke seeney aur halaq ki ragon ko siyaa aur usey barabar kar diya. phir aapko lekar aasman duniya par chadhey aur uske darwazon mein se aik darwazey par dastak di. aasman walon ne unse puchha aap kon hain? unhon-ne kaha ke Jibraeel unhon-ne puchha aur aap ke sath kon hai? jawab diya ke mere sath Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hain. puchha : kya unhein bulaya gaya hai? jawab diya ke haan. aasman walon ne kaha khub achchhey aaey aur apne hi logon mein aaey ho. aasman waley us se khush huey. unmein se kisi ko malum nahi hota ke Allah Taala zameen mein kya karna chahta hai jab tak wo unhein bata na de. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aasmaane-duniyaa par Adam (Alaihissalam) ko paya. Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne aap se kaha ke ye aap ke buzurg tareen dada Adam hain aap unhein salam kijiye . Adam (Alaihissalam) ne salam ka jawab diya. kaha ke khub achchhey aaey aur apne hi logon mein aaey ho. Mubarak ho apne betey ko , aap kya hi achchhey betey hain. aap ne aasman duniya mein 2 nehrein dekhiin jo bah rahi thin. puchha aey Jibraeel ! ye nehrein kaisi hain? Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne jawab diya ke ye neel aur Furaat ka manba' (saurce) hai. phir aap aasman par aur chaley to dekha ke aik dusri nehar hai jiske uper motii aur zabarjad ka mahal hai. is par apna hath maara to wo mashk hai. puchha : Jibraeel ! ye kya hai? jawab diya ke ye kausar hai jisey Allah ne aap ke liye mehfooz rakha hai. phir aap doosrey aasman par chadhey . farishton ne yahan bhi wahi sawal kya jo pahley aasman par kya tha. kon hain? kaha : Jibraeel . puchha aap ke sath kon hain? kaha Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) . puchha kya unhein bulaya gaya hai? unhon-ne kaha ke haan. Farishtey boley unhein marhaba aur bashaarat ho. phir aapko lekar teesrey aasman par chadhey aur yahan bhi wahi sawal kya jo pahley aur doosrey aasman par kya tha. phir chauthey aasman par lekar chadhey aur yahan bhi wahi sawal kya. phir paanchwein aasman par aapko lekar chadhey aur yahan bhi wahi sawal kya phir chhatey aasman par aapko lekar chadhey aur yahan bhi wahi sawal kya. phir aapko lekar saatwen aasman par chadhey aur yahan bhi wahi sawal kya. har aasman par anbiya hain jinke naam aap ne liye. mujhey ye yad hai ke Idrees (Alaihissalam) doosrey aasman par, Harun (Alaihissalam) chauthey aasman par, aur doosrey Nabi paanchwein aasman par. jinke naam mujhey yad nahi aur Ibrahim chhatey aasman par aur Musa (Alaihissalam) saatwen aasman par. ye unhein Allah Taala ne sharfe-ham kalaamii ki wjah se fazeelat mili thi. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha : mere rab! mera khayal nahi tha ke kisi ko mujh se badhaya jaeyga phir Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) unhein lekar us se bhi uper gaey jiska ilm Allah ke siwa aur kisi ko nahi yahan tak ke aapko sidratul-muntahaa par lekar aaey aur rabbul-izzat Allah tabarak w taala se qareeb huey aur itney qareeb jaisey kamaan ke donon kinarey ya us se bhi qareeb . phir Allah ne aur dusri baton ke sath aap ki ummat par din aur raat mein pachaas namazon ki wahi ki. phir aap utrey aur jab Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas pahunchey to unhon-ne aapko rok liya aur puchha : aey Muhammad ! aap ke rab ne aap se kya ahad liya hai? farmaya ke mere rab ne mujh se din aur raat mein pachaas namazon ka ahad liya hai. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne farmaya ke aap ki ummat mein uski taqat nahi. wapas jaaiye aur apni aur apni ummat ki taraf se kami ki darkhaast keejiye. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ki taraf mutwajjeh huey aur unhon-ne bhi ishara kya ke yahan agar chaahein to behtar hai. chunanche aap phir unhein lekar Allah Taala ki bargah mein hazir huey aur apne maqam par khadey ho kar arz kya : aey rab! ham se kami kar de kyonke meri ummat iski taqat nahi rakhtii. chunanche Allah Taala ne das namazon ki kami kar di. phir aap Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas aaey to unhon-ne aapko rokaa. Musa (Alaihissalam) aapko isi tarah barabar Allah rabbul-izzat ke paas wapas kartey rahe. yahan tak ke panch namazein ho gaiin. panch namazon par bhi unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko rokaa aur kaha : aey Muhammad ! maine apni qaum Bani-Israeel ka tajriba is se kam par kya hai wo kamzor Sabit huey aur unhon-ne chhod diya. aap ki ummat to jism , dil , badan , nazar aur kaan har eitibaar se kamzor hai, aap wapas jaaiye aur Allah rabbul-izzat usmein bhi kami kar dega. har martaba Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ki taraf mutwajjeh hotey they taake unse mashwara lein aur Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) usey na-pasand nahi kartey they. jab wo aapko paanchwein martaba bhi le gaey to arz kya : aey mere rab! meri ummat jism, dil, nigaah aur band har haisiyat se kamzor hai, to ham se aur kami kar de. Allah Taala ne is par farmaya ke wo qaul mere yahan badla nahi jata jaisa ke maine tum par ummul-kitaab mein farz kya hai. aur farmaya ke har neki ka sawab das guna hai to ye ummul-kitaab mein pachaas namazein hain lekin tum par farz panch hi hain. chunanche aap Musa (Alaihissalam) ke paas wapas aaey aur unhon-ne puchha : kya hua? aap ne kaha ke ham se ye kami ki ke har neki ke badley das ka sawab milega. Musa (Alaihissalam) ne kaha ke maine Bani-Israeel ko us se kam par aazmaya hai aur unhon-ne chhod diya. to aap wapas jaaiye aur mazeed kami karaaiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par kaha : aey Moosaa, Allah ki qism ! mujhey apne rab se ab sharm aati hai kyonke baar-baar aa ja chuka hun. unhon-ne kaha ke phir Allah ka naam lekar utar jao. phir jab aap bedaar huey to masjide-Haraam mein they. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjide-Haraam hi mein they ke jaag uthey, jaag uthney se ye murad hai ke wo haalat meraaj ki jati rahi aur aap apni haalat mein aa gaey."
"7518","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala jannat walon se kahega : aey jannat waalo! wo bolengey hazir teri khidmat ke liye muste'ad, saari bhalai terey donon hathon mein hai. Allah Taala poochhega : kya tum khush ho? wo jawab dengey kyon nahi ham khush hongey, aey rab! aur tu ney hamein wo cheezein ata ki hain jo kisi makhlooq ko nahi ata kin. Allah Taala farmaeyga kya main tumhen us se afzal inaam na dun? jannati poochhengey : aey rab! us se afzal kya cheez ho sakti hai Allah Taala farmaeyga ke main apni khushi tum par utaartaa hun aur ab kabhi tum se naraz nahi hoonga.''"
"7519","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik din guftgu kar rahe they, us waqt aap ke paas aik badwi bhi tha ( farmaya (ke ahle-jannat mein se aik shakhs ne Allah Taala se kheti ki ijazat chahi to Allah Taala ne farmaya ke kya wo sab kuchh tumharey paas nahi hai jo tum chahtey ho? wo kahega ke zaroor lekin main chahta hun ke kheti karun. chunanche bahut jaldi wo beej daalega aur palak jhapakney tak iska ugnaa , barabar katnaa aur pahadon ki tarah ghalley ke anbaar lag jana ho jaeyga Allah Taala kahega : ibne-Aadam! usey ley-ley, terey pet ko koi cheez nahi bhar saktii. dehati ne kaha : ya Rasulullah! iska maza to qureshi ya Ansari hi uthaaeingey kyonke wahi kheti baadii waley hain, ham to kisaan hain nahi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye baat sun kar hansi aa gaee."
"7520","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kon sa gunah Allah ke yahan sabse bada hai? farmaya ye ke tum Allah ke sath kisi ko Sharik thehrao halanke usi ne tumhen paida kya hai. maine kaha ye to bahut bada gunah hai. maine arz kya : phir kon sa ? farmaya ye ke tum apne bachchey ko us khatre ki wjah se qatl kar do ke wo tumharey sath khaaeyga. maine arz kya ke phir kaun? farmaya ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo."
"7521","khaana Kaba ke paas 2 Saqafi aur aik qureshi ya (ye kaha ke) 2 qureshi aur aik Saqafi jama huey jinke pet ki charbi bahut thi ( taund badi thi) aur jin mein soojh bojh ki badi kami thi. unmein se aik ne kaha ke tumhara khayal hai ke Allah wo sab kuchh sunta hai jo ham kehtey hain. doosrey ne kaha ke jab ham zor se boltey hain to sunta hai lekin agar ham aahista boliin to nahi sunta . is par Allah ne ye aayat nazil ki) وما كنتم تستترون أن يشهد عليكم سمعكم wla أبصاركم wla"
"7522","tum ahle-kitab se unki kitaabon ke masayel ke barey mein kyonkar sawal kartey ho, tumharey paas khud Allah ki kitab maujood hai jo zamane ke eitibaar se bhi tum se sabse zyada qareeb hai, tum usey padhtey ho, wo khalis hai is mein koi milawat nahi."
"7523","aey musalmaanon! tum ahle-kitab se kisi mas'ale mein kyon poochhtey ho. tumhari kitab jo Allah Taala ne tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par nazil ki hai wo Allah ke yahan se bilkul taaza aai hai, khalis hai is mein koi milawat nahi hui aur Allah Taala ne khud tumhen bata diya hai ke ahle-kitab ne Allah ki kitaabon ko badal dala. wo hath se aik kitab likhtey aur dawa kartey ke ye Allah ki taraf se hai taake iske zariey se thodi poonjii hasil karein, tum ko jo Allah ne Quran w hadis ka ilm diya hai kya wo tum ko us se mana nahi karta ke tum Deen ki baatein ahle-kitab se poochho. Allah ki qism ! ham to unke kisi aadmi ko nahi dekhtey ke jo kuchh tumharey uper nazil hua hai iske mutaalliq wo tum se poochhtey hon."
"7524","( sura qiyaama mein) Allah Taala ka irshaad (لا تحرك به لسانك) ke mutaalliq ke wahi nazil hoti hai to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par iska bahut baar padta hai aur aap apne hont hilatey mujh se Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main tumhen hilaa ke dikhaataa hon jis tarah Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hilatey they. Saeed ne kaha ke jis tarah Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) hont hilaa kar dikhaaey they, main tumharey samney isi tarah hilata hun. chunanche unhon-ne apne hont hilaaey . (ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) is par Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki (لا تحرك به لسانك لتعجل به * إن علينا جمعه وقرآنه)  yaanii '' tumharey seeney mein Quran ka jama dena aur usko padha dena hamara kaam hai jab ham ( Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ki zaban par) usko padh chukein us waqt tum iske padhney ki pairwi karo.'' matlab ye hai ke Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ke padhtey waqt kaan laga kar suntey raho aur khamosh raho, ye hamara zimma hai ke ham tum se waisaa hi padhwaa dengey. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke is aayat ke utarney ke baad jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aatey ( Quran sunatey ( to aap kaan laga kar suntey . jab Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) chaley jatey to aap logon ko isi tarah padh kar suna detey jaisey Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ne aapko padh kar sunaya tha."
"7525","Allah Taala ke irshad ( wla تجهر بصلاتك wla تخافت بها (ke barey mein ke ye aayat jab nazil hui to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka mein chhup kar) aa'maale-Islaam ada kartey they) lekin jab apne sahaba ko Namaz padhatey to Quran Majeed buland awaz se padhtey , jab mushrekeen suntey to Quran Majeed ko , iske utaarney waley ko aur usey lekar aaney waley ko gali detey. chunanche Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke apni qirat mein awaz buland na karein ke mushrekeen sunein aur phir Quran ko gali dein aur na itna aahista hi padhein ke aap ke sahaba bhi na sun sakein balke unke darmyan ka rasta ikhtiyar karein."
"7526","aayat ( wla تجهر بصلاتك wla تخافت بها ( dua ke barey mein nazil hui, yani dua na bahut chilla kar maang na aahista balke darmyaana rasta ikhtiyar kar."
"7527","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jo khush aawaazi se Quran nahi padhta wo ham musalmanon ke tareeq par nahi hai.'' aur Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ke siwa doosrey logon ne us hadis mein itna zyada kya hai yani usko pukar kar na padhey ."
"7528","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' rashk sirf 2 aadmiyon par kya ja sakta hai, aik is par jisey Allah ne Quran ka ilm diya aur wo uski tilawat raat din karta hai to aik dekhney wala kehta hai ke kash! mujhey bhi usi jaisa Quran ka ilm hota to main bhi uski tarah tilawat karta rehta aur doosra wo shakhs hai jisey Allah ne maal diya aur wo usey uske haq mein kharch karta hai jisey dekhney wala kehta hai ke kash! mujhey bhi Allah itna maal deta to main bhi isi tarah kharch karta jaisey ye karta hai.''"
"7529","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' rashk ke qaabil to 2 hi aadmi hain. aik wo jisey Allah ne Quran diya aur wo uski tilawat raat din karta rehta hai aur doosra wo jisey Allah ne maal diya ho aur wo usey raat w din kharch karta raha. '' Ali-bin-Abdullaah ne kaha ke maine ye hadis Sufiyan-bin-Uena se kai baar suni ("
"7530","hamarey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein apne rab ke paighaamaat mein se ye paigham pahunchaya ke ham mein se jo (fee sabeelillaah ( qatl kya jaeyga wo jannat mein jaeyga"
"7531","agar koi tum se ye bayan karta hai ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi cheez chhipaaii, (aur dusri sanad) aur Muhammad-bin Yusuf fariyaabii ne bayan kya, kaha ham se abu-Aamir aqadii ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Shoba bin Hajjaj ne, unse Ismail bin abi Khalid ne, unse Shabi ne, unse Masruq ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke agar tum se koi ye bayan karta hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahi mein kuchh chipa liya to uski tasdeeq na karna (wo jhoota hai) kyonke Allah Taala khud farmata hai ( ya أيها الرسول بلغ ما أنزل إليك من ربك وإن لم تفعل فما بلغت"
"7532","aik sahib ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! kon sa gunah Allah ke nazdeek sabse bada hai? farmaya ke tum Allah ki ibadat mein kisi ko bhi saajhii banao halanke tumhen Allah ne paida kya hai. puchha phir kon sa ? farmaya ye ke tum apne bachchey ko is khof se mar dalo ke wo tumharey sath khaaeyga. puchha phir kon sa? farmaya ye ke tum apne padosi ki biwi se zina karo. chunanche Allah Taala ne (sura furqan mein) uski tasdeeq mein Quran nazil farmaayaa (والذين لا يدعون مع الله إلها آخر wla يقتلون النفس التي حرم الله إلا بالحق wla يزنون ومن يفعل ذلك) ''aur wo log jo Allah ke sath kisi doosrey ma'boode-baatil ko nahi pukaartey aur jo kisi aisey ki jaan nahi letey jisey Allah ne haram kya hai siwa haq ke aur jo zina nahi kartey aur jo koi aisa karega wo gunah se bhid jaaeyga.''"
"7533","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' pichhli ummaton ke muqable main tumhara wujood aisa hai jaisey Asr aur maghrib ke darmyan ka waqt, Taurait walon ko Taurait di gaee to unhon-ne is par amal kya yahan tak ke din aadha ho gaya aur wo aajiz ho gaey. phir unhein eik-eik qirat diya gaya. phir ahal Injeel ko Injeel di gaee aur unhon-ne is par amal kya yahan tak ke Asr ki Namaz ka waqt ho gaya, unhein bhi eik-eik qirat diya gaya. phir tumhen Quran diya gaya aur tum ne is par amal kya yahan tak ke maghrib ka waqt ho gaya, tumhen 2-2 qirat diye gaey, is par ahle-kitaab ne kaha ke ye ham se amal mein kam hain aur ajr mein zyada . Allah Taala ne farmaya kya maine tumhara haq dene mein koi zulm kya hai? unhon-ne jawab diya ke nahi. Allah Taala ne farmaya ke phir ye mera Fazal hai main jisey chaahoon dun."
"7534","aik shakhs ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha : kon sa amal sabse afzal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farmaya ke apne waqt par Namaz padhna aur waalidain ke sath nek mamla karnaa, phir Allah ke rastey mein jihad karna."
"7535","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas maal aaya aur aap ne usmein se kuchh logon ko diya aur kuchh ko nahi diya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko malum hua ke is par kuchh log naraz huey hain to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main aik shakhs ko deta hun aur doosrey ko nahi deta aur jisey nahi deta wo mujhey us se zyada azeez hota hai jisey deta hun. mein kuchh logon ko isliye deta hun ke unke dilon mein ghabraahat aur be chainii hai aur doosrey logon par aitimad karta hun ke Allah ne unke dilon ko be niyaazii aur bhalai ata farmai hai. unhein mein se Amr bin taghlab bhi hain. Amr (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us kalima ke muqaabla mein mujhey laal laal oont miltey to itni khushi na hoti ."
"7536","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne rab se riwayat kya ke Allah paak farmata hai ke jab banda mujh se aik baalisht qareeb hota hai to main aik hath us se qareeb hota hun aur jab banda mujh se aik hath qareeb hota hai to main us se 2 hath qareeb hota hun aur jab wo mere paas paidal chal kar aata hai to main daud kar aa jata hun."
"7537","aksar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke) Allah Taala farmata hai ke) jab banda mujh se aik baalisht qareeb hota hai to main us se aik hath qareeb ho jata hun aur jab wo aik hath qareeb aata hai to main us se 2 hath qareeb hota hun aur Motamir ne kaha ke maine apne walid se suna, unhon-ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se suna ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne rab azz-w-jall se riwayat kartey they."
"7538","unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne, Allah Taala se riwayat kartey hain ke parwardigar ne farmaya har gunah ka aik kaffara hai (jis se wo gunah maaf ho jata hai) aur roza khas mere liye hai aur main hi uski jazaa doonga aur roze-daar ke munh ki bo Allah ke nazdeek mushk ki khushbu se badh kar hai."
"7539","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne parwardigar se riwayat kya parwardigar ne farmaya ke kisi bandey ke liye munasib nahi ke ye kahey ke main Yoonus-bin-Matti (Alaihissalam) se behtar hun aur aap ne Yunus (Alaihissalam) ko unke bap ki taraf nisbat di."
"7540","maine fateh Makka ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke aap apni aik ontni par Sawar they aur sura fateh padh rahe they ya sura fateh mein se kuchh aayatein padh rahe they. unhon-ne bayan kya ke phir aap ne usmein tarjeea' ki. Shoba ne kaha ye hadis bayan karke Muawiya ne is tarah awaz dohra kar qirat ki jaisey Abdullah-bin Mughaffal kya kartey they aur Muawiya ne kaha agar mujh ko iska khayal na hota ke log tumharey paas jama ho kar hujoom karengey to main isi tarah awaz dohra kar qirat karta jis tarah Abdullah-bin Mughaffal ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki tarah awaz dohraney ko naql kya tha. Shoba ne kaha maine Muawiya se puchha ibne- Mughaffal kyon kar awaz dohraatey they? unhon-ne kaha aa teen-teen baar mad ke sath awaz dohraatey they."
"7541","Hiraql ne apne tarjuman ko bulaya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khat mangwaya aur usey padha . shuru Allah ke naam se jo bahut bahut hi zyada raham karne wala bada meharban hai. Allah ke bandey aur uske rasool Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki taraf se Hiraql ki taraf . phir ye aayat likhi thi (ya أهل الكتاب تعالوا إلى كلمة سواء بيننا"
"7542","ahle-kitab Taurait ko Ibranii mein padhtey aur musalmanon ke liye uski tafseer arabii mein kartey they. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum na ahle-kitab ki tasdeeq karo aur na usko jhutlaao, balke kaho ke ham Allah aur uski tamam nazil ki hui kitaabon par eman laaey."
"7543","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aik Yahudi mard aur aurat laey gaey, jinhoney zina kya tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahudiyon se puchha ke tum unke sath kya kartey ho? unhon-ne kaha ke ham unka munh kala karke unhein ruswa kartey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir Taurait lao aur uski tilawat karo agar tum sachey ho chunanche wo ( Taurait ( laey aur aik shakhs se jis par wo mut'ma'in they kaha ke aey Aawar ! padho . chunanche us ne padha aur jab iske aik maqam par pahuncha to is par apna hath rakh diya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apna hath uthao , jab us ne apna hath uthaya to usmein aayat rajm (sangsaar) bilkul waazeh taur par maujood thi, usne kaha : aey Muhammad ! un par rajm (sangsaar) ka hukm to waqei hai lekin ham usey aapas mein chhipaatey hain. chunanche donon rajm (sangsaar) kiye gaey, maine dekha ke mard aurat ko patthar se bachaney ke liye is par jhukaa padta tha."
"7544","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala kisi cheez ko itni tawajjoh se nahi sunta jitni tawajjoh se achi awaz se padhney par Nabi ke Quran Majeed ko sunta hai."
"7545","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki baat ke silsile mein jab tohmat lagaaney walon ne un par tohmat lagai thi aur un rawiyon mein se har aik ne waqia ka eik-eik hissey bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bataya ke phir main rotey-rotey apne bistar par let gaee aur mujhey yaqin tha ke jab main us tohmat se barii hun to Allah Taala meri Bara't (Tauba) karega, lekin Allah ki qism ! iska mujhey guman bhi na tha ke mere barey mein Quran ki aayatein nazil hongi jinki qiyamat tak tilawat ki jaeygi aur mere khayal mein meri haisiyat is se bahut kam thi ke Allah mere barey mein paak kalam nazil farmaai jiski tilawat ho aur Allah Taala ne (sura Noor ki) ye aayat nazil ki) إن الذين جاءوا"
"7546","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke aap isha ki Namaz main ( والتين والزيتون ( padh rahe they, maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada behtreen awaz se Quran padhtey huey kisi ko nahi suna."
"7547","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Makka Mukarrama mein chhup kar tableegh kartey they, to Quran buland awaz se padhtey, mushrekeen jab suntey to Quran ko bura bhala kehtey aur uske laney waley ko bura bhala kehtey. is par Allah Taala ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se farmaya ke '' apni Namaz mein na awaz buland karo aur na bahut past .''"
"7548","unhon-ne unse kaha mera khayal hai ke tum bakriyon ko aur jangal ko pasand kartey ho. to jab tum apni bakriyon mein ya jangal mein ho aur Namaz ke liye azan do to buland awaz ke sath do kyonke muazzan ki awaz jahan tak bhi pahunchegii aur usey jin w insan aur dusri jo cheezein bhi sunengii wo qiyamat ke din uski gawahi dengii. Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke maine is hadis ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna hai."
"7549","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt bhi Quran padhtey they jab aap ka sar Mubarak meri god mein hota aur main haalat haiz mein hoti ."
"7550","maine Hisham-bin-Hakeem (Raziallahu anhu) ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi mein sura furqan padhtey suna. maine dekha ke wo Quran Majeed bahut se aisey tariqon se padh rahe they jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein nahi padhaaey they. qareeb tha ke Namaz hi mein un par main halla kar dun lekin maine sabr se kaam liya aur jab unhon-ne salam phera to maine unki gardan main apni chadar ka phandaa laga diya aur unse kaha tumhen ye sura is tarah kis ne padhai jisey maine abhi tum se suna. unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey is tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne padhai hai. maine kaha tum jhootey ho, mujhey khud Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mukhtalif qirat sikhai hai jo tum padh rahe they. chunanche main unhein kheenchtaa hua Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ley gaya aur arz kya ke maine is shakhs ko sura furqan is tarah padhtey suna jo aap ne mujhey nahi sikhaaii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein chhod do. Hisham ! tum padh kar sunao. unhon-ne wahi qirat padhi jo main unse sun chuka tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke isi tarah ye sura nazil hui hai. aey umr ! ab tum padho ! maine us qirat ke mutabiq padha jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey sikhai thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke is tarah bhi nazil hui hai. ye Quran Arab ki saat (7) boliyon par utara gaya hai. to tumhen jis qirat mein sahoolat ho padho."
"7551","maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! phir amal karne waley kis liye amal kartey hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har shakhs ke liye us amal mein aasani paida kar di gaee hai jiske liye wo paida kya gaya hai."
"7552","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik janaaza mein they phir aap ne aik lakdi li aur us se zameen kuredney lagey. phir farmaya tum mein koi aisa nahi jiska thikana jahannam mein ya jannat mein likha na ja chuka ho. sahaba ne kaha : phir ham isi par bharosa na kar lein ? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har shakhs ke liye us amal mein aasani paida kar di gaee jiske liye wo paida kya gaya hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye aayat padhi ( فأما من أعطى"
"7553","Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala jab khilqat ka paida karna thehra chuka (ya jab khilqat paida kar chukaa) to usne arsh ke uper apne paas aik kitab likh kar rakhi usmein yun hai meri rehmat mere ghussey par ghalib hai ya mere ghussey se aagey badh chuki hai.''"
"7554","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne makhlooq ko paida karne se pahley aik tahreer likhi ke meri rehmat mere ghazab se badh kar hai, chunanche ye uske paas arsh ke uper likha hua hai."
"7555","is qabila jurm aur ash-ariyon mein mohabbat aur bhai chaara ka mamla tha. aik martaba ham abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas they ke unke paas khana laya gaya jis mein murghi ka gosht bhi tha. unke yahan aik bani taimillaah ka bhi shakhs tha. ghaaliban wo Arab ke ghulam logon mein se tha. abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey apne paas bulaya to usne kaha ke maine murghi ko gandagi khaatey dekha hai aur usi waqt se qism kha li ke iska gosht nahi khaaunga. abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, suno! main tum se iske mutaalliq aik hadis Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bayan karta hun. main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ash-ariyon ke kuchh afraad ko lekar hazir hua aur ham ne aap se sawari maangii. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ki qasam! main tumharey liye sawari ka intizam nahi kar sakta, na mere paas koi aisi cheez hai jisey main tumhen sawari ke liye dun. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas maale-ghanimat mein se kuchh oont aaey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamarey mutaalliq puchha ke Ash-ari log kahan hain? chunanche aap ne hamein panch umda oont dene ka hukm diya. ham unhein lekar chaley to ham ne apne amal ke mutaalliq sochaa ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qism khaaii thi ke hamein sawari ke liye koi janwar nahi dengey aur na aap ke paas koi aisa janwar hai jo hamein sawari ke liye dein. ham ne sochaa ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apni qism bhool gaey hain, Allah ki qasam! ham kabhi falaah nahi pa saktey. ham wapas Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas pahunchey aur aap se soorate-haal ke mutaalliq poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumhen ye sawari nahi de raha hun balke Allah de raha hai. Allah ki qasam! main agar koi qism kha leta hun aur phir iske khilaf mein dekhta hun to main wahi karta hun jis mein bhalai hoti hai aur qism ka kaffara de deta hun."
"7556","maine Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se puchha : to aap ne farmaya ke qabila abdul-Qais ka wafad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur unhon-ne kaha ke hamarey aur aap ke darmyan qabila muzr ke mushrekeen rukawat hain aur ham aap ke paas sirf hurmat waley mahinon mein hi aa saktey hain. isliye aap kuchh aisey jaame' ehkaam hamein bata dijiye ke agar ham un par amal karein to jannat mein jayen aur unki taraf un logon ko dawat dein jo hamarey peechhey hain. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke main tumhen char kaamon ka hukm deta hun aur char kaamon se roktaa hun. main tumhen eman billah ka hukm deta hun. tumhen malum hai ke eman billah kya hai? iski gawahi dena hai ke Allah ke siwa aur koi maabood nahi aur Namaz qaaim karna aur zakat dene aur ghaneemat mein se panchwan hissey dene ka hukm deta hun aur tumhen char kaamon se roktaa hon, ye ke kadu ki tonbii aur lakdi ke kuredey huey bartan aur roghanii bartanon aur sabz laakhii bartanon mein mat piyaa karo."
"7557","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''un tasweeron ko banaaney walon par qiyamat mein azab hoga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke tum ne jo banaya hai usey zinda bhi karke dikhaao.''"
"7558","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''un tasweeron ko banaaney walon par qiyamat mein azab hoga aur unse kaha jaeyga ke tum ne jo banaya hai usey zinda bhi karo.''"
"7559","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke izzat aur jalaal waaley Allah farmata hai ke us shakhs se badh kar had se tajaawuz karne wala aur kon hai jo meri makhlooq ki tarah makhlooq banata hai, zara wo chaney ka daana paida karke to dekhein ya gehun ka aik daana ya jau ka aik daana paida karke to dekhein."
"7560","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''us momin ki misal jo Quran padhta hai turanj ki si hai ke iska maza bhi achchha aur uski khushbu bhi umda hai aur wo momin jo nahi padhta khajoor ki tarah hai ke uska maza to achchha hai lekin usmein khushbu nahi aur us fasiq ki misal jo Quran padhta hai murda ki tarah hai ke uski khushbu to achi hai lekin iska maza kadwaa hai aur jo fasiq Quran nahi padhta uski misal indraayan ki si hai ke uska maza bhi kadwaa hai aur koi khushbu bhi nahi.''"
"7561","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke kuchh logon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaahinon ke mutaalliq sawal kya. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unki kisi baat ka eitibaar nahi. aik sahib ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! ye log kuchh aisi baatein bayan kartey hain jo sahi Sabit hoti hain. bayan kya ke is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye sahi baat wo hai jisey shaitan farishton se sun kar yad rakh leta hai aur phir usey murghi ke kat kat karne ki tarah ( kaahinon (ke kanon mein daal deta hai aur ye usmein so se zyada jhoot milaate hain."
"7562","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kuchh log mashriq ki taraf se niklengey aur Quran padhengey jo unke halaq se nichey nahi utreyga, ye log Deen se is tarah door phenk diye jaeinge jaisey teer phenk diya jata hai. phir ye log kabhi Deen mein nahi wapas aa saktey, yahan tak ke teer apni jagah ( khud ( wapas aa jaey, puchha gaya ke unki pehchan kya hogii? to farmaya ke unki alamat sar mundwana hogi.''"
"7563","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''2 kalimey aisey hain jo Allah tabarak w taala ko bahut hi pasand hain jo zaban par halkey hain aur qiyamat ke din aamaal ke taraazu mein bojhal aur baa-wazn hongey, wo kalimaat mubaraka ye hain ( sub'haanallaahi-w-bi-hamdihi, Mina sub'haanallaahil-azeem).''"
